# game/script.rpy:621
translate english s001_prologue_d4195d38:

    # "大明国，庆丰年间。"
    "In the Qingfeng years of the Great Ming Realm."

# game/script.rpy:623
translate english s001_prologue_9941f88b:

    # "这不是史书里的大明。"
    "This is not the Great Ming of the history books."

# game/script.rpy:625
translate english s001_prologue_0d758630:

    # "它西邻大迹国，北接大稀国，东临沧澜海，南望南渊海。"
    "To its west lies the Great Ji Realm; to its north, the Great Xi. The Canglan Sea borders the east, the Nanyuan Sea the south."

# game/script.rpy:627
translate english s001_prologue_4d9841a8:

    # "京城之东三百里，有凰龙府。"
    "Three hundred li east of the capital lies Huanglongfu Prefecture."

# game/script.rpy:631
translate english s001_prologue_3eeee19b:

    # "凰龙府北有雷云峰，峰顶常年云雷缭绕。"
    "North of Huanglongfu rises Leiyun Peak, its summit wreathed in cloud and thunder year-round."

# game/script.rpy:633
translate english s001_prologue_85e124cb:

    # "雷云峰山腰，坐落着北境道宗——风雷观。"
    "On its slopes stands the northern Daoist order known as Fenglei Abbey."

# game/script.rpy:635
translate english s001_prologue_153f4cb1:

    # "江湖表面平静，实则一强、两衡、三隐彼此制衡。"
    "The jianghu looks tranquil, but one great power, two counterweights, and three hidden sects keep one another in check."

# game/script.rpy:639
translate english s001_prologue_ba39a9a7:

    # "一强者，拱京府承天剑派。"
    "The great power is the Chengtian Sword Sect of Gongjing Prefecture."

# game/script.rpy:641
translate english s001_prologue_3dc22f3e:

    # "位于拱京府承天峰。"
    "It stands upon Chengtian Peak."

# game/script.rpy:643
translate english s001_prologue_50d56015:

    # "承天峰为大明第三高峰，峰顶原为承天观旧址，后来成为承天剑派立派之地。"
    "The third-highest peak in the Great Ming Realm, it was once home to Chengtian Abbey before becoming the sword sect's seat."

# game/script.rpy:645
translate english s001_prologue_205057e1:

    # "承天剑派控扼中原水陆要道，门下分舵遍布拱京府、碧溪府、西京府。"
    "The sect commands the central realm's roads and waterways, with branches across Gongjing, Bixi, and Xijing Prefectures."

# game/script.rpy:647
translate english s001_prologue_99309c05:

    # "在大明江湖诸派之中，它是实力最强、声望最高，也最不容旁人轻视的一派。"
    "Among the Great Ming's jianghu sects, none is stronger, more renowned, or less easily slighted."

# game/script.rpy:651
translate english s001_prologue_c1a20076:

    # "两衡者之一，北境风雷观"
    "One of the two counterweights: Fenglei Abbey of the northern frontier."

# game/script.rpy:653
translate english s001_prologue_66186266:

    # "雷云峰为凰龙府第一险峰，峰顶常年云雷缭绕，山势高峻，外山险道极多。"
    "Leiyun Peak is Huanglongfu's most perilous mountain: steep, storm-bound, and ringed with dangerous outer paths."

# game/script.rpy:655
translate english s001_prologue_047b379b:

    # "风雷观依雷云峰山势而建，分玄雷院、清阳院、栖霞院三院。"
    "Fenglei Abbey follows the contours of Leiyun Peak and is divided into the Xuanglei, Qingyang, and Qixia Courts."

# game/script.rpy:657
translate english s001_prologue_232b03dc:

    # "风雷观以雷法、符箓、护道术与丹道闻名北境。"
    "It is famed throughout the north for thunder arts, talismans, warding rites, and elixir craft."

# game/script.rpy:659
translate english s001_prologue_335fd897:

    # "在大明江湖诸派之中，它未必最强，却最神秘，也最少有人敢轻易上山试探。"
    "It may not be the strongest sect, but it is the most secretive—and few dare test its mountain."

# game/script.rpy:663
translate english s001_prologue_ac290497:

    # "两衡者之二，南境梧天禅院。"
    "The other counterweight is Wutian Chan Monastery in the south."

# game/script.rpy:665
translate english s001_prologue_4233ba92:

    # "位于苍梧府苍梧天柱。"
    "It lies on Cangwu Pillar in Cangwu Prefecture."

# game/script.rpy:667
translate english s001_prologue_555b9d64:

    # "苍梧天柱为大明第一高峰，山腰常年云海翻涌，梧天禅院便藏于云海之间。"
    "Cangwu Pillar is the realm's highest peak, and Wutian lies hidden amid the rolling sea of clouds upon its slopes."

# game/script.rpy:669
translate english s001_prologue_86009f5b:

    # "禅院与苍梧府苗寨、瑶寨相邻，弟子多懂南疆医术、解毒之法与山中秘术。"
    "Near the Miao and Yao villages of Cangwu, its disciples know southern healing, antidotes, and mountain secrets."

# game/script.rpy:671
translate english s001_prologue_dca44d00:

    # "梧天禅院以一道禅墙分男众区、女众区。"
    "A Chan wall divides the monastery's men's and women's quarters."

# game/script.rpy:673
translate english s001_prologue_3f8ae66a:

    # "男众区有慧能大师居所、罗汉堂与藏经楼；女众区有静月师太居所、观音堂与解毒坊。"
    "Master Huineng's residence, the Arhat Hall, and the scripture tower stand on one side; Abbess Jingyue's residence, Guanyin Hall, and the antidote workshop on the other."

# game/script.rpy:675
translate english s001_prologue_349d1704:

    # "解毒坊与茯苓医馆共享《南疆解毒谱》，因此禅院虽远在南疆，却与凰龙府医馆暗有往来。"
    "Its antidote workshop shares the Southern Border Antidote Compendium with Fuling Clinic, keeping quiet ties with Huanglongfu despite the distance."

# game/script.rpy:677
translate english s001_prologue_6cb34a31:

    # "慧能大师慈悲为怀，不喜争斗，但禅武修为深不可测。"
    "Master Huineng is compassionate and shuns conflict, though the depth of his Chan martial skill is unfathomable."

# game/script.rpy:679
translate english s001_prologue_828366c1:

    # "静月师太虽为女众，却是慧能大师的俗家弟子，未剃度，负责南疆苗寨义诊，也能自由出入男众区议事。"
    "Though she oversees the women's side, Abbess Jingyue is Master Huineng's lay disciple, not tonsured; she serves the southern villages and may enter the men's quarter for counsel."

# game/script.rpy:681
translate english s001_prologue_a40d2d07:

    # "在大明江湖诸派之中，梧天禅院不是最锋利的一派，却是最能救人，也最懂得如何让人活下去的一派。"
    "Wutian is not the sharpest of the jianghu sects, but none is better at saving lives—or teaching people how to keep living."

# game/script.rpy:686
translate english s001_prologue_630f49ed:

    # "三隐者之一，东海秘宗——沧海阁。"
    "One of the three hidden sects: Canghai Pavilion, secret order of the eastern sea."

# game/script.rpy:688
translate english s001_prologue_2857d6fb:

    # "其地理根基在东极府东极岛外海的浮槎岛。"
    "Its roots lie on Fucha Island, beyond Dongji Island in Dongji Prefecture."

# game/script.rpy:690
translate english s001_prologue_446458dc:

    # "浮槎岛随潮汐隐现，平日不见其形，唯有熟知海潮与星象之人，才能寻到入岛之路。"
    "Fucha Island appears and vanishes with the tides; only those versed in sea currents and stars can find a way there."

# game/script.rpy:692
translate english s001_prologue_1330bc95:

    # "沧海阁弟子多以渔民、船夫、海商身份行走江湖，明面低调，暗中布网。"
    "Its disciples travel as fishers, boatmen, and sea merchants—unassuming in public, quietly casting their nets in private."

# game/script.rpy:694
translate english s001_prologue_a1c86656:

    # "他们精通航海、潮汐、星象与奇门遁甲，既能在海上寻路，也能在人心之间设局。"
    "They master navigation, tides, stars, and hidden arts: able to find a course at sea and lay a snare in the human heart."

# game/script.rpy:696
translate english s001_prologue_c4834326:

    # "在大明江湖诸派之中，沧海阁不是最常现身的一派，却是最难追踪、最难看清来意的一派。"
    "Canghai Pavilion seldom shows itself, but no sect is harder to follow—or read."

# game/script.rpy:701
translate english s001_prologue_cbc44a74:

    # "三隐者之二，北漠万毒谷。"
    "The second hidden sect: Wandu Valley of the northern desert."

# game/script.rpy:703
translate english s001_prologue_ce21b6d2:

    # "位于飞沙府黄风沙海深处。"
    "It lies deep in the Yellowwind Sand Sea of Feisha Prefecture."

# game/script.rpy:705
translate english s001_prologue_eedecd6e:

    # "黄风沙海位于大明正北，常年风沙蔽日，寻常人入内，十有八九再难出来。"
    "The Yellowwind Sand Sea lies due north of the Great Ming Realm, where sandstorms blot out the sun and most who enter never return."

# game/script.rpy:707
translate english s001_prologue_2f36cc2d:

    # "万毒谷谷口藏在流沙漩涡之后，只有手持特制罗盘，才能在风沙与流沙之间辨出真正入口。"
    "Wandu Valley's gate hides beyond a whirlpool of shifting sand; only a special compass can mark the true entrance."

# game/script.rpy:709
translate english s001_prologue_75240d10:

    # "谷内挖有地下暗河，借暗河之水养活门人，也借它避开沙漠中最致命的缺水之困。"
    "Underground rivers sustain its people and spare them the desert's deadliest trial: thirst."

# game/script.rpy:711
translate english s001_prologue_796cea00:

    # "万毒谷弟子擅长在沙下埋设毒陷阱，外人往往还未看见谷门，便已经踏入杀局。"
    "Its disciples bury poisoned traps beneath the sand; outsiders often step into a killing ground before they ever see the gate."

# game/script.rpy:713
translate english s001_prologue_20b472e8:

    # "他们所用毒物多取自飞沙府本土：沙蝎、沙蛇、毒蜥蜴，甚至还有传闻中的沙漠食人花。"
    "Their poisons come largely from Feisha itself: sand scorpions, sand snakes, venomous lizards, and even the rumored desert man-eating flower."

# game/script.rpy:715
translate english s001_prologue_94252a2b:

    # "这些毒素多半慢发、难察，正如北漠风沙，看似平静，实则处处藏险。"
    "Most take hold slowly and unseen, like the northern sands: calm at a glance, perilous everywhere."

# game/script.rpy:717
translate english s001_prologue_660b200c:

    # "在大明江湖诸派之中，万毒谷不是最常现身的一派，却是最让人不愿招惹的一派。"
    "Wandu Valley is rarely seen, yet few in the jianghu would choose to provoke it."

# game/script.rpy:722
translate english s001_prologue_b30acbd6:

    # "三隐者之三，市井隐宗——衡云堂。"
    "The third hidden sect: Hengyun Hall, concealed among common folk."

# game/script.rpy:724
translate english s001_prologue_d94473b8:

    # "其地理根基在广阳府云衡山脚下的七侠镇。"
    "Its home is Qixia Town at the foot of Mount Yunheng in Guangyang Prefecture."

# game/script.rpy:726
translate english s001_prologue_e1a50c7f:

    # "与高山大派不同，衡云堂没有固定山门。"
    "Unlike the great mountain sects, Hengyun Hall has no fixed gate."

# game/script.rpy:728
translate english s001_prologue_c6f8d230:

    # "它的弟子多是市井百姓：铁匠、货郎、厨子、木匠、羊夫、药贩，甚至还有茶楼跑堂与街边小贩。"
    "Its disciples are townsfolk: smiths, peddlers, cooks, carpenters, shepherds, herb sellers, teahouse hands, and street vendors."

# game/script.rpy:730
translate english s001_prologue_4ba20c45:

    # "他们平日各做各的营生，看起来不过是镇上最寻常的人。"
    "By day they tend their trades, looking like the most ordinary people in town."

# game/script.rpy:732
translate english s001_prologue_adb239de:

    # "可一旦百姓受欺、街坊遭难，这些人便会从炉火、挑担、灶台与摊棚后站出来。"
    "But when people are wronged or neighbors fall into trouble, they step out from hearths, shoulder poles, cookfires, and market stalls."

# game/script.rpy:734
translate english s001_prologue_c1c08afa:

    # "衡云堂奉行藏于市井，守护百姓。"
    "Hengyun Hall lives hidden among the people, to protect the people."

# game/script.rpy:736
translate english s001_prologue_87f0e413:

    # "在大明江湖诸派之中，它不是最显赫的一派，却是最难被连根拔起的一派。"
    "It is not the grandest sect, but it is among the hardest to uproot."

# game/script.rpy:738
translate english s001_prologue_c5de2cc6:

    # "因为只要市井还在，衡云堂就还在。"
    "So long as ordinary town life endures, Hengyun Hall endures with it."

# game/script.rpy:743
translate english s001_prologue_64509a12:

    # "而近日，风雷观云清道长开炉炼制一枚丹药。"
    "Recently, Daoist Yunqing of Fenglei Abbey has kindled her furnace to refine an elixir."

# game/script.rpy:745
translate english s001_prologue_ab39c703:

    # "其名——长息定年丹。"
    "Its name: the Long-Breath Age-Settling Elixir."

# game/script.rpy:747
translate english s001_prologue_880fe39e:

    # "有人说，此丹能延续元息，暂缓衰败。"
    "Some say it preserves one's vital breath and delays decline."

# game/script.rpy:749
translate english s001_prologue_53d68b42:

    # "有人说，此丹能定住年岁，使人青春不老。"
    "Others say it fixes one's years and keeps youth from fading."

# game/script.rpy:751
translate english s001_prologue_35110be0:

    # "也有人说，这根本不是丹药，而是一场足以搅动江湖的局。"
    "Still others say it is no elixir at all, but a scheme fit to shake the jianghu."

# game/script.rpy:753
translate english s001_prologue_2c57e44d:

    # "云清道长，女，五十八岁，法名云清，因雷法与丹道修为深厚，尊号清玄真人。"
    "Daoist Yunqing is fifty-eight, a woman of the Dao whose religious name is Yunqing. Revered for her profound thunder arts and elixir craft, she bears the honorific True Person Qingxuan."

# game/script.rpy:755
translate english s001_prologue_7329263f:

    # "她性情刚烈，心怀苍生，年轻时曾游历西域，习得一身道家绝学。"
    "Strong-willed and devoted to the common people, she traveled the Western Regions in her youth and mastered formidable Daoist arts."

# game/script.rpy:757
translate english s001_prologue_9c20a605:

    # "风雷观弟子敬她、畏她，也相信她绝不会无故开炉。"
    "Fenglei Abbey's disciples respect and fear her, and trust that she would never kindle the furnace without cause."

# game/script.rpy:761
translate english s001_prologue_267c4222:

    # "于是，江湖豪杰、商旅富户、病人、骗子、看客，全都涌向凰龙府开庵镇。"
    "And so jianghu heroes, merchants and the wealthy, patients, swindlers, and sightseers all pour into Kaian Town of Huanglongfu Prefecture."

# game/script.rpy:766
translate english s001_prologue_0ec276f3:

    # "有人求丹。"
    "Some seek the elixir."

# game/script.rpy:768
translate english s001_prologue_4893d5cb:

    # "有人抢丹。"
    "Some mean to seize it."

# game/script.rpy:770
translate english s001_prologue_a76482ef:

    # "有人看热闹。"
    "Some have come for the spectacle."

# game/script.rpy:772
translate english s001_prologue_23ab49dc:

    # "也有人，还不知道自己会被卷进什么样的江湖。"
    "And some have no idea what kind of jianghu will sweep them along."

# game/script.rpy:774
translate english s001_prologue_c59e2de7:

    # "这一日，开庵镇南门先后来了两个人。"
    "That day, two people arrive one after the other at Kaian Town's south gate."

# game/script.rpy:776
translate english s001_prologue_a01a1ec2:

    # "一人步伐急促，像是被什么东西一路推着往前。"
    "One walks in haste, as though driven onward by something unseen."

# game/script.rpy:778
translate english s001_prologue_66b29167:

    # "一人步伐沉稳，像是早已决定自己要往哪里去。"
    "The other walks steadily, as though she has long decided where she is bound."

# game/script.rpy:780
translate english s001_prologue_39a00b91:

    # "人群、车马、叫卖声一同涌来。"
    "Crowds, carts, horses, and hawkers' cries surge together."

# game/script.rpy:782
translate english s001_prologue_f035c5ec:

    # "开庵镇，就这样把他们吞进了自己的烟火气里。"
    "And Kaian Town swallows them into the bustle of everyday life."

# game/script.rpy:797
translate english s002_choose_protagonist_40976136:

    # "开庵镇南门，永乐大街与通禅道交汇处。"
    "At Kaian Town's south gate, Yongle Street meets Tongchan Road."

# game/script.rpy:799
translate english s002_choose_protagonist_1e0da321:

    # "人潮正往镇中风云坪方向涌去。"
    "The crowd is streaming toward Fengyun Square at the heart of town."

# game/script.rpy:801
translate english s002_choose_protagonist_55c9d530:

    # "两名年轻人，也在此时来到开庵镇。"
    "At that very moment, two young travelers arrive in Kaian Town."

# game/script.rpy:807
translate english s002_choose_protagonist_2593057a:

    # "你要选择谁，作为第一章的主角？"
    "Whom will you choose as the protagonist of Chapter One?"

# game/script.rpy:817
translate english s002_choose_protagonist_81f2f708:

    # "王放。"
    "Wang Fang."

# game/script.rpy:819
translate english s002_choose_protagonist_ff96bafe:

    # "十八岁，热血，理想主义，憧憬成为大侠。"
    "Eighteen, hot-blooded, idealistic, and determined to become a true hero of the jianghu."

# game/script.rpy:821
translate english s002_choose_protagonist_8af34ebe:

    # "他听闻雷云峰风雷观开炉炼制长息定年丹，各路豪杰齐聚凰龙府，便觉得真正的江湖人就该去风雷云动之处。"
    "Hearing that Fenglei Abbey on Leiyun Peak was brewing the Long-Breath Age-Settling Elixir, drawing heroes from every road to Huanglongfu, he knew that was where a true jianghu wanderer belonged."

# game/script.rpy:823
translate english s002_choose_protagonist_012ab6bd:

    # "他带着三百文钱，一把不算名贵的刀，和一腔过分明亮的热血，踏入了开庵镇。"
    "With three hundred wen, an unremarkable blade, and more blazing hope than sense, he stepped into Kaian Town."

# game/script.rpy:827
translate english s002_choose_protagonist_e8e756f6:

    # wangfang "既然江湖来了，我总不能站在门外看。"
    wangfang "If the jianghu has come to my door, I can't just watch from outside."

# game/script.rpy:836
translate english s002_choose_protagonist_514e37b9:

    # "左婉。"
    "Zuo Wan."

# game/script.rpy:838
translate english s002_choose_protagonist_b7b77306:

    # "二十岁，活泼外向，擅长控制类武功，也懂一些草药和调息之法。"
    "Twenty, lively and outgoing; skilled in restraining arts, herbs, and the craft of steadying one's breath."

# game/script.rpy:840
translate english s002_choose_protagonist_67d6ab8f:

    # "她听闻长息定年丹牵涉气脉、草木灵材与定息之术，心中隐隐觉得此事不会只是求丹这么简单。"
    "The elixir's ties to qi channels, spiritual herbs, and breath-settling arts told her this could not be as simple as people begging for a pill."

# game/script.rpy:842
translate english s002_choose_protagonist_b5ffcfcb:

    # "她来到开庵镇，不为抢丹，只为看清这场风波到底会害多少人。"
    "She came to Kaian Town not to seize the elixir, but to learn how many people this storm might hurt."

# game/script.rpy:846
translate english s002_choose_protagonist_1580ccfd:

    # zuowan "药能救人，也能害人。要看谁炼，又要看谁抢。"
    zuowan "Medicine can save a life—or ruin one. It depends on who brews it, and who means to take it."

# game/script.rpy:848
translate english s002_choose_protagonist_8a6c1648:

    # "选择已完成。"
    "Your choice is made."

# game/script.rpy:851
translate english s002_choose_protagonist_1ae9834b:

    # "你将以王放的身份，进入开庵镇。"
    "You will enter Kaian Town as Wang Fang."

# game/script.rpy:853
translate english s002_choose_protagonist_22caa0d1:

    # "你将以左婉的身份，进入开庵镇。"
    "You will enter Kaian Town as Zuo Wan."

# game/script.rpy:866
translate english s003_hou_sanxian_d908d2bf:

    # "南门入镇后的永乐大街，人潮正往风云坪方向涌去。"
    "On Yongle Street beyond the south gate, the crowd flows toward Fengyun Square."

# game/script.rpy:868
translate english s003_hou_sanxian_8fec71b9:

    # "江湖客、商旅、马匹、摊贩挤在一处，空气里混着尘土、热汤、马汗和新鲜菜叶的味道。"
    "Jianghu wanderers, merchants, horses, and peddlers press together, and the air smells of dust, hot broth, horse sweat, and fresh greens."

# game/script.rpy:871
translate english s003_hou_sanxian_e304d4cc:

    # "王放刚站稳，还没来得及细看这座小镇，就听见墙边有人冲他吹了一声口哨。"
    "Wang Fang has barely found his footing or taken in the town when someone by the wall whistles at him."

# game/script.rpy:873
translate english s003_hou_sanxian_d2690e2c:

    # "左婉刚站稳，正打量着街边铺面，就听见墙边有人冲她轻轻咳了一声。"
    "Zuo Wan has barely found her footing and begun to study the shops when someone by the wall gives a soft cough."

# game/script.rpy:875
translate english s003_hou_sanxian_b107b9eb:

    # "墙边靠着一个少年。"
    "A young man is leaning against the wall."

# game/script.rpy:877
translate english s003_hou_sanxian_f7f5ca7d:

    # "他个子偏高，红色发带束着长发，腰间挂着一把木刀。"
    "He is rather tall, with long hair tied by a red ribbon and a wooden sword at his waist."

# game/script.rpy:879
translate english s003_hou_sanxian_9088b9f9:

    # "明明衣衫并不阔气，却偏要摆出几分江湖人的架势。"
    "His clothes are far from fine, yet he insists on carrying himself like a jianghu man."

# game/script.rpy:881
translate english s003_hou_sanxian_0c117cc0:

    # housanxian "这位朋友，看你像江湖中人。"
    housanxian "Friend, you look like someone from the jianghu."

# game/script.rpy:883
translate english s003_hou_sanxian_afff5388:

    # housanxian "初来开庵镇吧？"
    housanxian "First time in Kaian Town, is it?"

# game/script.rpy:886
translate english s003_hou_sanxian_b03b1a1c:

    # wangfang "你怎么知道？"
    wangfang "How did you know?"

# game/script.rpy:888
translate english s003_hou_sanxian_de1b54f7:

    # zuowan "这也看得出来？"
    zuowan "You can tell that just by looking?"

# game/script.rpy:890
translate english s003_hou_sanxian_a29950e1:

    # housanxian "这还不容易？本地人走路不看牌匾，外乡人走三步看两回。"
    housanxian "Easy enough. Locals don't look at every signboard; outsiders look twice every three steps."

# game/script.rpy:892
translate english s003_hou_sanxian_1ea0e35c:

    # housanxian "我叫侯三闲。风云坪、西街菜市、长风楼外墙根，哪儿我都熟。"
    housanxian "I'm Hou Sanxian. Fengyun Square, West Street Market, even the wall outside Changfeng House—I know them all."

# game/script.rpy:894
translate english s003_hou_sanxian_fd2e0c25:

    # housanxian "你要找路，问我。要听消息，也问我。"
    housanxian "Need directions? Ask me. Need news? Ask me that too."

# game/script.rpy:896
translate english s003_hou_sanxian_38251cfd:

    # "他说到这里，忽然压低声音，像要讲什么天大的秘密。"
    "Then he lowers his voice, as if he is about to reveal some earthshaking secret."

# game/script.rpy:898
translate english s003_hou_sanxian_c88ef1d1:

    # housanxian "不过江湖有江湖的规矩。"
    housanxian "But the jianghu has its rules."

# game/script.rpy:901
translate english s003_hou_sanxian_293a589b:

    # wangfang "什么规矩？"
    wangfang "What rule?"

# game/script.rpy:903
translate english s003_hou_sanxian_0d7f616c:

    # zuowan "你先说。"
    zuowan "Go on."

# game/script.rpy:905
translate english s003_hou_sanxian_ac2e8954:

    # housanxian "借我三文钱。"
    housanxian "Lend me three wen."

# game/script.rpy:907
translate english s003_hou_sanxian_577ba4d1:

    # "他说得理直气壮。"
    "He says it as though it were the most natural thing in the world."

# game/script.rpy:909
translate english s003_hou_sanxian_5a9cbe72:

    # housanxian "明日必还。"
    housanxian "I'll return it tomorrow. I swear it."

# game/script.rpy:911
translate english s003_hou_sanxian_954aad73:

    # "你看了看他。"
    "You look him over."

# game/script.rpy:913
translate english s003_hou_sanxian_085d6154:

    # "他眼神飘了一下，又立刻挺直腰杆，仿佛这不是借钱，而是在考验你的江湖气。"
    "His eyes dart away, then he quickly straightens up, as if this were not a request for money but a test of your jianghu spirit."

# game/script.rpy:922
translate english s003_hou_sanxian_1c648299:

    # "你取出三文钱，递给侯三闲。"
    "You take out three wen and hand them to Hou Sanxian."

# game/script.rpy:924
translate english s003_hou_sanxian_b712b6ad:

    # "侯三闲眼睛一亮，立刻接过，动作快得不像一个讲究江湖风度的人。"
    "Hou Sanxian's eyes light up. He snatches them with a speed unbefitting a man who cares so much for jianghu dignity."

# game/script.rpy:926
translate english s003_hou_sanxian_45bd1288:

    # housanxian "痛快！"
    housanxian "Splendid!"

# game/script.rpy:928
translate english s003_hou_sanxian_0093fd9d:

    # housanxian "我就说你有江湖气。"
    housanxian "I knew you had the spirit of the jianghu."

# game/script.rpy:930
translate english s003_hou_sanxian_1101097b:

    # housanxian "以后在开庵镇，有事报我侯三闲的名号。"
    housanxian "From now on, if you need anything in Kaian Town, give them the name Hou Sanxian."

# game/script.rpy:933
translate english s003_hou_sanxian_5dc8185b:

    # wangfang "报了有用吗？"
    wangfang "Will that help?"

# game/script.rpy:935
translate english s003_hou_sanxian_5383899e:

    # zuowan "你这名号，管用吗？"
    zuowan "Does that name carry any weight?"

# game/script.rpy:937
translate english s003_hou_sanxian_6836322f:

    # housanxian "看情况。"
    housanxian "That depends."

# game/script.rpy:939
translate english s003_hou_sanxian_54d6c585:

    # housanxian "大事不一定管用，小事多半能添点乱。"
    housanxian "It may not help with big matters. With small ones, it can usually stir up some trouble."

# game/script.rpy:945
translate english s003_hou_sanxian_7e636e26:

    # "你没有掏钱。"
    "You do not reach for your money."

# game/script.rpy:948
translate english s003_hou_sanxian_9615df81:

    # wangfang "我也初来乍到，钱不多。"
    wangfang "I've only just arrived myself. I don't have much money."

# game/script.rpy:950
translate english s003_hou_sanxian_efd5c63b:

    # zuowan "你这借法，听着不像明日必还。"
    zuowan "The way you ask, it doesn't sound as if tomorrow's repayment is certain."

# game/script.rpy:952
translate english s003_hou_sanxian_1b6a774e:

    # housanxian "啧。"
    housanxian "Tch."

# game/script.rpy:954
translate english s003_hou_sanxian_6cbc8865:

    # housanxian "江湖人也有手紧的时候。理解，理解。"
    housanxian "Even jianghu folk have lean times. I understand, I understand."

# game/script.rpy:956
translate english s003_hou_sanxian_fa22ff58:

    # "他说理解，脸上却写着一点不服。"
    "He says he understands, but his face betrays a touch of resentment."

# game/script.rpy:958
translate english s003_hou_sanxian_235afeab:

    # housanxian "不过不借也行。"
    housanxian "Still, you needn't lend it."

# game/script.rpy:960
translate english s003_hou_sanxian_53ae39c7:

    # housanxian "我侯三闲不是那种三文钱就翻脸的人。"
    housanxian "I, Hou Sanxian, am not the sort to turn on someone over three wen."

# game/script.rpy:962
translate english s003_hou_sanxian_1b588a73:

    # "他顿了顿。"
    "He pauses."

# game/script.rpy:964
translate english s003_hou_sanxian_15441cb0:

    # housanxian "五文可能会。"
    housanxian "Five wen, perhaps."

# game/script.rpy:972
translate english s003_hou_sanxian_0d59e8e3:

    # wangfang "钱可以借，不过你得替我跑一趟腿。"
    wangfang "I'll lend it, but you have to run an errand for me."

# game/script.rpy:974
translate english s003_hou_sanxian_eaa4c257:

    # zuowan "借钱可以。你拿消息和跑腿来抵。"
    zuowan "I can lend it. Pay me back with news and errands."

# game/script.rpy:976
translate english s003_hou_sanxian_01524f11:

    # housanxian "跑腿？"
    housanxian "Run errands?"

# game/script.rpy:978
translate english s003_hou_sanxian_e1cf0b64:

    # "侯三闲像是受了点羞辱，立刻拍了拍腰间的木刀。"
    "Looking mildly insulted, Hou Sanxian immediately pats the wooden sword at his waist."

# game/script.rpy:980
translate english s003_hou_sanxian_b8564edc:

    # housanxian "我侯三闲是干大事的人。"
    housanxian "I, Hou Sanxian, am a man meant for great things."

# game/script.rpy:982
translate english s003_hou_sanxian_6e5642f7:

    # "他停了停，又凑近一点。"
    "He pauses, then leans a little closer."

# game/script.rpy:984
translate english s003_hou_sanxian_75fbb06a:

    # housanxian "不过你先说跑哪儿。"
    housanxian "But tell me where I'd be running first."

# game/script.rpy:986
translate english s003_hou_sanxian_733906be:

    # housanxian "近的算江湖义气，远的得另加钱。"
    housanxian "For somewhere near, call it jianghu loyalty. For somewhere far, there is an extra fee."

# game/script.rpy:993
translate english s003_hou_sanxian_a73bab3b:

    # wangfang "钱的事先不急。你知道雷云峰的消息吗？"
    wangfang "Never mind the money for now. Do you know anything about Leiyun Peak?"

# game/script.rpy:995
translate english s003_hou_sanxian_6038d71a:

    # zuowan "三文钱先放一边。你知道风雷观开炉的事吗？"
    zuowan "Put the three wen aside. Do you know about Fenglei Abbey lighting its furnace?"

# game/script.rpy:997
translate english s003_hou_sanxian_8d2a9ba0:

    # "侯三闲脸上的嬉笑顿了一下。"
    "The playfulness on Hou Sanxian's face falters."

# game/script.rpy:999
translate english s003_hou_sanxian_837b8ef3:

    # housanxian "一来就问雷云峰？"
    housanxian "Asking about Leiyun Peak the moment you arrive?"

# game/script.rpy:1001
translate english s003_hou_sanxian_afe4c8a7:

    # housanxian "你不是普通看热闹的啊。"
    housanxian "You're no ordinary sightseer."

# game/script.rpy:1003
translate english s003_hou_sanxian_5b8422b9:

    # "他左右看了看，声音压低。"
    "He glances to either side and lowers his voice."

# game/script.rpy:1005
translate english s003_hou_sanxian_b5c4b374:

    # housanxian "最近镇上十个人里有八个都为那枚丹来的。"
    housanxian "These days, eight people in ten came to town for that elixir."

# game/script.rpy:1007
translate english s003_hou_sanxian_925e2d29:

    # housanxian "有人说它能长生，有人说它能续命，还有人说风雷观要借它收服江湖。"
    housanxian "Some say it grants long life, some that it prolongs a dying life, and some that Fenglei Abbey will use it to bring the jianghu to heel."

# game/script.rpy:1009
translate english s003_hou_sanxian_6471b211:

    # housanxian "你问我真假？"
    housanxian "You ask whether it's true?"

# game/script.rpy:1011
translate english s003_hou_sanxian_77f0d491:

    # housanxian "我只能说，假的传得快，真的没人敢大声讲。"
    housanxian "All I can say is: false tales travel fast, and no one dares speak the true ones aloud."

# game/script.rpy:1013
translate english s003_hou_sanxian_0cb3499d:

    # "不管刚才如何回应，侯三闲都没有离开。"
    "Whatever your answer, Hou Sanxian does not leave."

# game/script.rpy:1015
translate english s003_hou_sanxian_3c1f2e91:

    # "他拍了拍衣摆上的灰，忽然摆出一副带路人的模样。"
    "He dusts off his hem and suddenly takes on the air of a guide."

# game/script.rpy:1017
translate english s003_hou_sanxian_c26c92be:

    # housanxian "行了。你初来开庵镇，若没人带，走到天黑都分不清哪儿能吃饭，哪儿会挨宰。"
    housanxian "All right. You're new to Kaian Town; without a guide, you'll wander until dark and still not know where to eat or where you'll be overcharged."

# game/script.rpy:1020
translate english s003_hou_sanxian_3ce94bea:

    # housanxian "看在你有江湖气的份上，我带你简单转转。"
    housanxian "Since you've got jianghu spirit, I'll show you around a little."

# game/script.rpy:1022
translate english s003_hou_sanxian_2c1702a3:

    # housanxian "看在你虽然小气但还算坦诚的份上，我带你简单转转。"
    housanxian "Since you're stingy but at least honest, I'll show you around a little."

# game/script.rpy:1024
translate english s003_hou_sanxian_37230c72:

    # housanxian "看在咱们已经有跑腿交情的份上，我带你简单转转。"
    housanxian "Since we already have an errand-running acquaintance, I'll show you around a little."

# game/script.rpy:1026
translate english s003_hou_sanxian_fe221382:

    # housanxian "看在你一来就问雷云峰的份上，我带你简单转转。省得你被真消息假消息一起砸晕。"
    housanxian "Since Leiyun Peak was your first question, I'll show you around a little—before true rumors and false ones knock you flat together."

# game/script.rpy:1029
translate english s003_hou_sanxian_34dab6e0:

    # wangfang "你要带我去哪儿？"
    wangfang "Where are you taking me?"

# game/script.rpy:1031
translate english s003_hou_sanxian_ec907d66:

    # zuowan "先看哪里？"
    zuowan "Where do we look first?"

# game/script.rpy:1033
translate english s003_hou_sanxian_164d9f3e:

    # housanxian "先去西街菜市。"
    housanxian "West Street Market first."

# game/script.rpy:1035
translate english s003_hou_sanxian_5b05fda8:

    # housanxian "要认识一座镇，不能先看楼有多高，得先看菜卖多少钱。"
    housanxian "To know a town, don't start by looking at how tall its buildings are. Look at what its vegetables cost."

# game/script.rpy:1039
translate english s003_hou_sanxian_20a295e9:

    # "侯三闲转身走入人流。"
    "Hou Sanxian turns and heads into the crowd."

# game/script.rpy:1041
translate english s003_hou_sanxian_f2442a3e:

    # "你跟了上去。"
    "You follow him."

# game/script.rpy:1067
translate english s004_west_market_7024fd11:

    # "侯三闲带着你从南门附近转入西街菜市。"
    "Hou Sanxian leads you from the south gate into West Street Market."

# game/script.rpy:1069
translate english s004_west_market_9d639c71:

    # "才走几步，风云坪那边的人声便被菜市的喧闹盖了过去。"
    "Within a few steps, the market's clamor drowns out the voices from Fengyun Square."

# game/script.rpy:1071
translate english s004_west_market_4e24c7d7:

    # "这里有菜叶上的水珠，有鸡笼里的扑腾声，有鱼腥味，也有远处铁锤落下的叮当声。"
    "There are dewdrops on greens, flapping in chicken cages, the smell of fish, and the distant ring of hammers."

# game/script.rpy:1073
translate english s004_west_market_7a24d261:

    # housanxian "看见没？这才是开庵镇真正的脸。"
    housanxian "See? This is Kaian Town's true face."

# game/script.rpy:1076
translate english s004_west_market_eacf3c30:

    # wangfang "这里比我想的热闹多了。"
    wangfang "It's much livelier than I expected."

# game/script.rpy:1078
translate english s004_west_market_1b1d443c:

    # zuowan "菜市、铁铺、武馆都挤在一起，倒是有意思。"
    zuowan "Market, smithy, and martial hall all squeezed together. Interesting."

# game/script.rpy:1080
translate english s004_west_market_03aa036c:

    # housanxian "那当然。"
    housanxian "Of course it is."

# game/script.rpy:1082
translate english s004_west_market_f2364117:

    # housanxian "你要认识一座镇，不能先看楼有多高，得先看菜卖多少钱。"
    housanxian "To know a town, don't start by looking at how tall its buildings are. Look at what its vegetables cost."

# game/script.rpy:1084
translate english s004_west_market_9608f714:

    # "侯三闲说得一本正经，仿佛自己是开庵镇的正经向导。"
    "Hou Sanxian says this with a straight face, as if he were Kaian Town's most respectable guide."

# game/script.rpy:1086
translate english s004_west_market_4f964ace:

    # "菜摊边，一个卖青菜的大嫂正把一把青菜往筐里摔。"
    "At a vegetable stall, a market woman slaps a bundle of greens into a basket."

# game/script.rpy:1088
translate english s004_west_market_ead899e7:

    # "她一眼看见侯三闲，立刻叉腰。"
    "The moment she spots Hou Sanxian, she puts her hands on her hips."

# game/script.rpy:1090
translate english s004_west_market_e784cff8:

    # chendasao "侯三闲！你上回说替我搬菜，搬到一半人没了，菜筐还在地上！"
    chendasao "Hou Sanxian! Last time you promised to carry my vegetables, you vanished halfway through and left the basket on the ground!"

# game/script.rpy:1092
translate english s004_west_market_8c72a93c:

    # housanxian "陈大嫂，那叫江湖急事。"
    housanxian "Auntie Chen, that was an urgent matter of the jianghu."

# game/script.rpy:1094
translate english s004_west_market_c398e549:

    # chendasao "你哪天没有江湖急事？"
    chendasao "What day do you not have an urgent jianghu matter?"

# game/script.rpy:1096
translate english s004_west_market_ba4e94a5:

    # housanxian "这说明我江湖事多。"
    housanxian "It proves I have many jianghu affairs."

# game/script.rpy:1098
translate english s004_west_market_73c81a2b:

    # "陈大嫂瞪了他一眼，却也没真赶人。"
    "Auntie Chen glares at him, but does not truly chase him away."

# game/script.rpy:1100
translate english s004_west_market_851c75d2:

    # "再往前走，吴三娘的豆腐摊前围着几个买菜的妇人，何阿旺的南瓜堆得像一座小山，侯小满正蹲在葱蒜摊后头打瞌睡。"
    "Further on, women crowd Wu Sanniang's tofu stall; He Awang's pumpkins are piled like a small hill, and Hou Xiaoman dozes behind a stall of scallions and garlic."

# game/script.rpy:1102
translate english s004_west_market_4c4c1e30:

    # "侯三闲一边走，一边压低声音介绍。"
    "As he walks, Hou Sanxian introduces the place in a lowered voice."

# game/script.rpy:1104
translate english s004_west_market_40b19d55:

    # housanxian "菜摊是镇民的饭碗。"
    housanxian "Vegetable stalls are the townsfolk's livelihood."

# game/script.rpy:1106
translate english s004_west_market_5dc7d5ca:

    # housanxian "铸兵堂是江湖人的胆子。"
    housanxian "The arms forge is a jianghu person's courage."

# game/script.rpy:1108
translate english s004_west_market_378aedcc:

    # housanxian "火铸铺是百姓的锅铲。"
    housanxian "The ironworks are the common people's pots and spatulas."

# game/script.rpy:1110
translate english s004_west_market_505aa155:

    # housanxian "武馆是年轻人做梦的地方。"
    housanxian "The martial hall is where young people dream."

# game/script.rpy:1113
translate english s004_west_market_34527a1c:

    # wangfang "武馆？"
    wangfang "A martial hall?"

# game/script.rpy:1115
translate english s004_west_market_2f592385:

    # zuowan "你还知道武馆？"
    zuowan "You know about the martial hall too?"

# game/script.rpy:1117
translate english s004_west_market_fda965c2:

    # housanxian "我当然知道。"
    housanxian "Of course I do."

# game/script.rpy:1119
translate english s004_west_market_951c4894:

    # housanxian "赵启武馆主，拳头比菜市的秤砣还硬。"
    housanxian "Master Zhao Qi's fists are harder than the market's scale weights."

# game/script.rpy:1121
translate english s004_west_market_eb258d0e:

    # housanxian "不过我没去练过。"
    housanxian "Though I have never trained there."

# game/script.rpy:1124
translate english s004_west_market_7ebdb007:

    # wangfang "为什么？"
    wangfang "Why not?"

# game/script.rpy:1126
translate english s004_west_market_0a45111c:

    # zuowan "你不是想当江湖人吗？"
    zuowan "Don't you want to be a jianghu man?"

# game/script.rpy:1128
translate english s004_west_market_308a9ccc:

    # housanxian "练武要交钱。"
    housanxian "Martial training costs money."

# game/script.rpy:1130
translate english s004_west_market_9b707ced:

    # housanxian "我这种人，适合先从江湖气练起。"
    housanxian "A man like me is better off training his jianghu spirit first."

# game/script.rpy:1132
translate english s004_west_market_e473aa09:

    # "远处，铸兵堂传来打铁声。"
    "The sound of hammering comes from the arms forge in the distance."

# game/script.rpy:1134
translate english s004_west_market_e6f3bf10:

    # "一个膀大腰圆的铁匠抬头看了侯三闲一眼。"
    "A broad-shouldered blacksmith looks up at Hou Sanxian."

# game/script.rpy:1136
translate english s004_west_market_373d9fdb:

    # caotieshan "侯三闲，别在我门口骗外乡人。"
    caotieshan "Hou Sanxian, don't swindle outsiders at my door."

# game/script.rpy:1138
translate english s004_west_market_adcaec8e:

    # housanxian "曹师傅，我这是带路，不是骗人。"
    housanxian "Master Cao, I'm showing the way, not swindling anyone."

# game/script.rpy:1140
translate english s004_west_market_9e86c56a:

    # caotieshan "你带路和骗人，中间就差三文钱。"
    caotieshan "Between your guiding and swindling, there are only three wen."

# game/script.rpy:1142
translate english s004_west_market_e1e1383e:

    # "侯三闲立刻假装没听见，脚下走得更快。"
    "Hou Sanxian pretends not to hear and quickens his pace."

# game/script.rpy:1144
translate english s004_west_market_cbef2d65:

    # "你注意到，菜市之外再往西，街道渐渐变宽，隐约能看见兵营方向的旗影。"
    "Beyond the market to the west, the street gradually widens, and you can just make out banners in the direction of the barracks."

# game/script.rpy:1146
translate english s004_west_market_e05f2c2f:

    # housanxian "再往西，就是西郊兵营。"
    housanxian "Further west are the western barracks."

# game/script.rpy:1148
translate english s004_west_market_afc1369f:

    # housanxian "真惹了事，跑都跑不远。"
    housanxian "If you truly cause trouble, you won't get far running."

# game/script.rpy:1150
translate english s004_west_market_0c8d6116:

    # housanxian "所以你以后在菜市混，第一要识路，第二要识人，第三要识方大娘的锅铲。"
    housanxian "So if you make your way in the market, first know the roads, second know the people, and third know Auntie Fang's spatula."

# game/script.rpy:1153
translate english s004_west_market_f3440ee7:

    # wangfang "方大娘又是谁？"
    wangfang "And who is Auntie Fang?"

# game/script.rpy:1155
translate english s004_west_market_3dcc24db:

    # zuowan "方大娘听起来很厉害。"
    zuowan "Auntie Fang sounds formidable."

# game/script.rpy:1157
translate english s004_west_market_492de003:

    # housanxian "飞鸿驿站的厨娘。"
    housanxian "The cook at Feihong Post Station."

# game/script.rpy:1159
translate english s004_west_market_24e350ef:

    # housanxian "她骂人不算江湖武功，但胜似江湖武功。"
    housanxian "Her scolding is not a jianghu art, but it is better than one."

# game/script.rpy:1161
translate english s004_west_market_9531f3de:

    # "侯三闲带你从西街菜市东口出来。"
    "Hou Sanxian leads you out through the east entrance of West Street Market."

# game/script.rpy:1163
translate english s004_west_market_4dee5aba:

    # "身后的嘈杂声渐渐远了，前方的街道忽然安静许多。"
    "The noise behind you fades, and the street ahead suddenly grows much quieter."

# game/script.rpy:1165
translate english s004_west_market_fc1db213:

    # "树影后露出一片古旧屋檐。"
    "Beyond the tree shadows, old rooflines come into view."

# game/script.rpy:1167
translate english s004_west_market_e214fb5c:

    # housanxian "走，带你去银花庵。"
    housanxian "Come on. I'll take you to Yinhua Convent."

# game/script.rpy:1169
translate english s004_west_market_c3e781a5:

    # housanxian "开庵镇这个名字，就从那里来。"
    housanxian "Kaian Town takes its name from that place."

# game/script.rpy:1184
translate english s005_yinhua_an_9f21c0d6:

    # "穿过庵前衢后，西街菜市的烟火气像被风轻轻拂开。"
    "After you cross Convent-front Lane, the bustle of West Street Market seems gently brushed away by the wind."

# game/script.rpy:1186
translate english s005_yinhua_an_a5b38c65:

    # "前方树影深处，一座古旧尼庵静静立着。"
    "Deep in the shadows of the trees ahead stands an old convent, quiet and still."

# game/script.rpy:1188
translate english s005_yinhua_an_63797072:

    # "庵前有小茶舍，茶香淡淡。"
    "A small teahouse stands before it, with a faint scent of tea in the air."

# game/script.rpy:1190
translate english s005_yinhua_an_32509d6b:

    # "门边的石阶被岁月磨得发亮。"
    "The stone steps by the gate have been polished bright by the years."

# game/script.rpy:1192
translate english s005_yinhua_an_259e4128:

    # housanxian "这就是银花庵。"
    housanxian "This is Yinhua Convent."

# game/script.rpy:1194
translate english s005_yinhua_an_35c5ce46:

    # housanxian "开庵镇之所以叫开庵镇，就是因为这座庵。"
    housanxian "Kaian Town is called Kaian Town because of this convent."

# game/script.rpy:1197
translate english s005_yinhua_an_07c7b81d:

    # wangfang "一座庵，能让整座镇得名？"
    wangfang "A single convent gave the whole town its name?"

# game/script.rpy:1199
translate english s005_yinhua_an_f30c655a:

    # zuowan "看来这座庵来历不浅。"
    zuowan "Then this convent must have quite a history."

# game/script.rpy:1201
translate english s005_yinhua_an_c4dfc7d9:

    # housanxian "老人们说，银花庵冬日会起雾凇。"
    housanxian "The old folk say Yinhua Convent gathers rime in winter."

# game/script.rpy:1203
translate english s005_yinhua_an_cb7d3818:

    # housanxian "一夜过去，满树白花，远看像银子开了花。"
    housanxian "After one night, every tree is white with blossom, as if silver itself had flowered."

# game/script.rpy:1205
translate english s005_yinhua_an_eebc3349:

    # housanxian "还有人说，凰龙府的‘凰’字，也跟这里的旧传有关。"
    housanxian "Some even say the 'Huang' in Huanglongfu comes from an old legend of this place."

# game/script.rpy:1207
translate english s005_yinhua_an_a602551e:

    # "侯三闲说到这里，故意压低声音。"
    "Hou Sanxian deliberately lowers his voice."

# game/script.rpy:1209
translate english s005_yinhua_an_18e72a83:

    # housanxian "听说很久以前，这地方见过玄灵九羽凰。"
    housanxian "They say that long ago, this place saw the Nine-Feathered Mystic Phoenix."

# game/script.rpy:1212
translate english s005_yinhua_an_b300ac25:

    # wangfang "凤凰？"
    wangfang "A phoenix?"

# game/script.rpy:1214
translate english s005_yinhua_an_123fa2f6:

    # zuowan "玄灵九羽凰？"
    zuowan "The Nine-Feathered Mystic Phoenix?"

# game/script.rpy:1216
translate english s005_yinhua_an_b073c85c:

    # housanxian "我也没见过。"
    housanxian "I have not seen it either."

# game/script.rpy:1218
translate english s005_yinhua_an_c2a27b4e:

    # housanxian "我要是见过，现在就不是侯三闲了。"
    housanxian "If I had, I would not be Hou Sanxian now."

# game/script.rpy:1220
translate english s005_yinhua_an_d0cb7c53:

    # housanxian "至少也得叫侯九羽。"
    housanxian "At the very least, I'd be Hou Jiuyu."

# game/script.rpy:1222
translate english s005_yinhua_an_a7d726b5:

    # "你们刚走到庵门前，一个神情严肃的尼姑便从院中走了出来。"
    "Just as you reach the convent gate, a stern nun walks out from the courtyard."

# game/script.rpy:1224
translate english s005_yinhua_an_63b0cde7:

    # "她目光一扫，直接落在侯三闲身上。"
    "Her gaze sweeps across you and lands directly on Hou Sanxian."

# game/script.rpy:1226
translate english s005_yinhua_an_8d54554e:

    # jingting "侯三闲。"
    jingting "Hou Sanxian."

# game/script.rpy:1228
translate english s005_yinhua_an_309a2237:

    # "侯三闲立刻站直。"
    "Hou Sanxian immediately stands straight."

# game/script.rpy:1230
translate english s005_yinhua_an_ee74405c:

    # housanxian "静亭师太，许久不见，风采更胜从前。"
    housanxian "Abbess Jingting, it has been a long time. You are more impressive than ever."

# game/script.rpy:1232
translate english s005_yinhua_an_c9680e45:

    # jingting "前日你说来扫院。"
    jingting "The day before yesterday, you said you would come sweep the courtyard."

# game/script.rpy:1234
translate english s005_yinhua_an_3e042cb9:

    # housanxian "是有这么一段缘分。"
    housanxian "There was indeed such an understanding."

# game/script.rpy:1236
translate english s005_yinhua_an_ce5d7eaf:

    # jingting "扫帚还在，人不见了。"
    jingting "The broom remains. You did not."

# game/script.rpy:1238
translate english s005_yinhua_an_4d877013:

    # housanxian "那日我临时被江湖急事调走。"
    housanxian "That day, an urgent jianghu matter called me away."

# game/script.rpy:1240
translate english s005_yinhua_an_ad328057:

    # jingting "被谁调走？"
    jingting "Called you away by whom?"

# game/script.rpy:1242
translate english s005_yinhua_an_236dc94c:

    # housanxian "命运。"
    housanxian "Fate."

# game/script.rpy:1244
translate english s005_yinhua_an_b06a14c4:

    # "静亭看着他，没有说话。"
    "Jingting looks at him without speaking."

# game/script.rpy:1246
translate english s005_yinhua_an_6fe9a82e:

    # "侯三闲咳了一声，赶紧往旁边挪了半步。"
    "Hou Sanxian coughs and quickly edges half a step aside."

# game/script.rpy:1248
translate english s005_yinhua_an_3bfccef9:

    # housanxian "我今日只是带外乡朋友认认路，绝不添乱。"
    housanxian "Today I am only showing an out-of-town friend the way. I will cause no trouble."

# game/script.rpy:1250
translate english s005_yinhua_an_16aa3d85:

    # "静亭看了你一眼，神情依旧冷淡，却没有阻拦。"
    "Jingting gives you a cool glance but does not stop you."

# game/script.rpy:1252
translate english s005_yinhua_an_fc54d0ee:

    # "院内传来一阵轻轻的笑声。"
    "A ripple of soft laughter comes from within the courtyard."

# game/script.rpy:1254
translate english s005_yinhua_an_5325d178:

    # "远处，一位年长法师正坐在廊下，与一名年轻尼姑说话。"
    "In the distance, an elder Buddhist master sits under the corridor, speaking with a young nun."

# game/script.rpy:1256
translate english s005_yinhua_an_8e7017a2:

    # "年轻尼姑手里似乎还藏着半块桂花糕。"
    "The young nun seems to be hiding half an osmanthus cake in her hand."

# game/script.rpy:1258
translate english s005_yinhua_an_0fe4d3ae:

    # mingjingfashi "修行不是不许吃。"
    mingjingfashi "Cultivation does not forbid eating."

# game/script.rpy:1260
translate english s005_yinhua_an_e025c07b:

    # jingsong "师父英明。"
    jingsong "Master is wise."

# game/script.rpy:1262
translate english s005_yinhua_an_f6383938:

    # mingjingfashi "是吃了要记账。"
    mingjingfashi "But what you eat must be accounted for."

# game/script.rpy:1264
translate english s005_yinhua_an_e1174b8c:

    # jingsong "弟子记在心里了。"
    jingsong "I shall remember it in my heart."

# game/script.rpy:1266
translate english s005_yinhua_an_1cb470e4:

    # mingjingfashi "那你心里欠阿香三块桂花糕。"
    mingjingfashi "Then in your heart, you owe Axiang three osmanthus cakes."

# game/script.rpy:1268
translate english s005_yinhua_an_8145ffba:

    # "茶舍里的阿香探出头来。"
    "Axiang pokes her head out from the teahouse."

# game/script.rpy:1270
translate english s005_yinhua_an_470e7df1:

    # axiang "师父，已经四块了。"
    axiang "Master, it is already four."

# game/script.rpy:1272
translate english s005_yinhua_an_561c8ea4:

    # "静松立刻把手里的桂花糕藏得更深。"
    "Jingsong immediately hides the cake in her hand more carefully."

# game/script.rpy:1274
translate english s005_yinhua_an_1236a79a:

    # "侯三闲憋着笑。"
    "Hou Sanxian fights back a laugh."

# game/script.rpy:1276
translate english s005_yinhua_an_d42049cf:

    # housanxian "看见没？银花庵清静归清静，也不是没热闹。"
    housanxian "See? Yinhua Convent may be tranquil, but it is not without its liveliness."

# game/script.rpy:1278
translate english s005_yinhua_an_b3cf8d2c:

    # "你站在庵前，忽然觉得这座小镇不只是酒楼、菜市和江湖客。"
    "Standing before the convent, you suddenly feel this town is more than taverns, markets, and jianghu travelers."

# game/script.rpy:1280
translate english s005_yinhua_an_99769917:

    # "它还有旧传、钟声、雾凇、茶香，以及一些被人轻轻记住的小事。"
    "It also has old legends, bell chimes, rime, tea fragrance, and small matters people remember fondly."

# game/script.rpy:1282
translate english s005_yinhua_an_ac62c8d1:

    # "静亭又看了侯三闲一眼。"
    "Jingting gives Hou Sanxian another look."

# game/script.rpy:1284
translate english s005_yinhua_an_f54b2e94:

    # "侯三闲立刻后退。"
    "Hou Sanxian immediately steps back."

# game/script.rpy:1286
translate english s005_yinhua_an_8553c55b:

    # housanxian "走走走。再待下去，我怕她真让我扫院。"
    housanxian "Let's go, let's go. Stay any longer and I fear she will truly make me sweep the courtyard."

# game/script.rpy:1290
translate english s005_yinhua_an_11f2844b:

    # "你们离开银花庵，沿庵前衢向东，穿过永乐大街。"
    "You leave Yinhua Convent, follow Convent-front Lane east, and cross Yongle Street."

# game/script.rpy:1292
translate english s005_yinhua_an_8f8eada5:

    # "远处渐渐传来酒盏碰撞与人声喧哗。"
    "The clink of wine cups and a rising hubbub gradually reach you from afar."

# game/script.rpy:1294
translate english s005_yinhua_an_a230717d:

    # housanxian "前面就是长风楼。"
    housanxian "Changfeng House is up ahead."

# game/script.rpy:1307
translate english s006_changfeng_lou_1c4f31a9:

    # "越往长风衢走，人声越盛。"
    "The farther you go along Changfeng Lane, the louder the voices grow."

# game/script.rpy:1309
translate english s006_changfeng_lou_07aa7af0:

    # "还未到长风楼门口，你便听见楼上传来酒盏碰撞声、马夫喊价声，以及江湖客争座的声音。"
    "Before reaching Changfeng House, you hear wine cups clinking above, grooms shouting prices, and jianghu guests quarreling over seats."

# game/script.rpy:1311
translate english s006_changfeng_lou_44473236:

    # "长风楼高挂灯笼，门前车马不断。"
    "Lanterns hang high at Changfeng House, and carts and horses never cease before its door."

# game/script.rpy:1313
translate english s006_changfeng_lou_e217ee7c:

    # "不远处，青云楼的招牌也很惹眼，像是不服气似的与长风楼遥遥相对。"
    "Not far away, the sign of Qingyun House is just as conspicuous, facing Changfeng House as if unwilling to yield."

# game/script.rpy:1317
translate english s006_changfeng_lou_873017b9:

    # housanxian "长风楼，开庵镇最大的酒楼之一。"
    housanxian "Changfeng House—one of Kaian Town's largest taverns."

# game/script.rpy:1319
translate english s006_changfeng_lou_d470cd76:

    # housanxian "青云楼，长风楼最不服气的对头。"
    housanxian "Qingyun House—Changfeng House's most unwilling rival."

# game/script.rpy:1321
translate english s006_changfeng_lou_adc921ff:

    # housanxian "平日里两家抢客，今日两家抢江湖客。"
    housanxian "Usually they compete for customers. Today they compete for jianghu customers."

# game/script.rpy:1324
translate english s006_changfeng_lou_1c475461:

    # wangfang "这么多人，都是为长息定年丹来的？"
    wangfang "All these people came for the Long-Breath Age-Settling Elixir?"

# game/script.rpy:1326
translate english s006_changfeng_lou_760e9076:

    # zuowan "看来长息定年丹的消息，已经把镇子搅起来了。"
    zuowan "The news of the Long-Breath Age-Settling Elixir has already stirred the whole town."

# game/script.rpy:1328
translate english s006_changfeng_lou_81a6b4eb:

    # housanxian "可不是嘛。"
    housanxian "You can say that again."

# game/script.rpy:1330
translate english s006_changfeng_lou_4db92775:

    # housanxian "有人来求丹，有人来抢丹，有人来卖假消息。"
    housanxian "Some came to beg for the elixir, some to seize it, and some to sell false news."

# game/script.rpy:1332
translate english s006_changfeng_lou_cfe9e34b:

    # housanxian "还有人纯粹来喝酒，顺便假装自己知道内幕。"
    housanxian "Others came just to drink, and pretend they know the inside story."

# game/script.rpy:1334
translate english s006_changfeng_lou_c3238948:

    # "长风楼门前，一名掌柜模样的中年人正满面笑容地迎客。"
    "At Changfeng House's entrance, a smiling middle-aged man who looks like the proprietor welcomes guests."

# game/script.rpy:1336
translate english s006_changfeng_lou_94e1a61d:

    # "他的笑看起来热情，眼神却一直扫着人群。"
    "His smile is warm, but his eyes never stop searching the crowd."

# game/script.rpy:1338
translate english s006_changfeng_lou_39a34826:

    # housanxian "那位就是辛万和，辛掌柜。"
    housanxian "That is Xin Wanhe, Manager Xin."

# game/script.rpy:1340
translate english s006_changfeng_lou_da105959:

    # housanxian "别看他笑得像谁都是贵客，其实谁有钱、谁没钱、谁会闹事，他一眼就能看出来。"
    housanxian "He smiles as if everyone were an honored guest, but one glance tells him who has money, who does not, and who will make trouble."

# game/script.rpy:1342
translate english s006_changfeng_lou_5a6a955e:

    # "辛万和正与一名华服客人低声交谈。"
    "Xin Wanhe is speaking quietly with a richly dressed guest."

# game/script.rpy:1344
translate english s006_changfeng_lou_cb367551:

    # "那人衣料讲究，腰间有一枚温润玉佩，身后还跟着两个沉默随从。"
    "The man's cloth is fine, a polished jade pendant hangs at his waist, and two silent attendants follow behind him."

# game/script.rpy:1346
translate english s006_changfeng_lou_f69012a9:

    # "侯三闲立刻压低声音。"
    "Hou Sanxian immediately lowers his voice."

# game/script.rpy:1348
translate english s006_changfeng_lou_ab85fab1:

    # housanxian "大人物。"
    housanxian "A great personage."

# game/script.rpy:1351
translate english s006_changfeng_lou_17edcffe:

    # wangfang "你认识？"
    wangfang "You know him?"

# game/script.rpy:1353
translate english s006_changfeng_lou_09670afe:

    # zuowan "是谁？"
    zuowan "Who is he?"

# game/script.rpy:1355
translate english s006_changfeng_lou_e90a2a79:

    # housanxian "大人物的名字，岂是随便说的？"
    housanxian "Is a great person's name something to speak carelessly?"

# game/script.rpy:1358
translate english s006_changfeng_lou_3036422c:

    # wangfang "所以你不认识。"
    wangfang "So you do not know him."

# game/script.rpy:1360
translate english s006_changfeng_lou_2ef1c97f:

    # zuowan "所以你不知道。"
    zuowan "So you do not know."

# game/script.rpy:1362
translate english s006_changfeng_lou_143049be:

    # housanxian "江湖上，有些不知道，叫留白。"
    housanxian "In the jianghu, some things we do not know are called leaving room for mystery."

# game/script.rpy:1364
translate english s006_changfeng_lou_da33a243:

    # "这时，辛万和看见侯三闲，笑容不变，声音却抬高了一点。"
    "Then Xin Wanhe notices Hou Sanxian. His smile remains, but his voice rises a little."

# game/script.rpy:1366
translate english s006_changfeng_lou_1fbc3c1c:

    # xinwanhe "侯三闲，别在门口扰客。"
    xinwanhe "Hou Sanxian, do not disturb the guests at my door."

# game/script.rpy:1368
translate english s006_changfeng_lou_24237c86:

    # housanxian "辛掌柜，这话就外道了。"
    housanxian "Manager Xin, that is a cold thing to say."

# game/script.rpy:1370
translate english s006_changfeng_lou_21ec2b61:

    # housanxian "我这是替长风楼招待外乡贵客。"
    housanxian "I am welcoming out-of-town honored guests for Changfeng House."

# game/script.rpy:1372
translate english s006_changfeng_lou_0591441d:

    # xinwanhe "那贵客付钱，你别赊账。"
    xinwanhe "Then let those honored guests pay. Do not put it on credit."

# game/script.rpy:1374
translate english s006_changfeng_lou_6a7431c3:

    # "侯三闲立刻转身。"
    "Hou Sanxian turns at once."

# game/script.rpy:1376
translate english s006_changfeng_lou_7157b84f:

    # housanxian "走。"
    housanxian "Let's go."

# game/script.rpy:1378
translate english s006_changfeng_lou_9b70efc6:

    # housanxian "长风楼这种地方，白天看门面，晚上听消息。"
    housanxian "At a place like Changfeng House, you look at the storefront by day and listen for news at night."

# game/script.rpy:1380
translate english s006_changfeng_lou_89c925bf:

    # housanxian "现在还早，晚些时候才热闹。"
    housanxian "It is still early. The real bustle comes later."

# game/script.rpy:1382
translate english s006_changfeng_lou_e73ac12e:

    # "你回头看了一眼长风楼。"
    "You glance back at Changfeng House."

# game/script.rpy:1384
translate english s006_changfeng_lou_e2075e75:

    # "楼内已经有人在谈雷云峰，有人说定年丹能锁住年岁，有人说那是风雷观放出的假消息。"
    "Inside, people are already talking about Leiyun Peak. Some say the elixir can hold back the years; others say Fenglei Abbey spread the tale itself."

# game/script.rpy:1386
translate english s006_changfeng_lou_cc712e30:

    # "这些话还只是零散传言。"
    "For now, these are only scattered rumors."

# game/script.rpy:1388
translate english s006_changfeng_lou_70450990:

    # "但你隐隐觉得，等夜色落下，它们会变成更大的风。"
    "But you sense that once night falls, they will swell into a stronger wind."

# game/script.rpy:1390
translate english s006_changfeng_lou_2e036cef:

    # "侯三闲带你继续往东。"
    "Hou Sanxian leads you farther east."

# game/script.rpy:1394
translate english s006_changfeng_lou_8aadf06f:

    # "穿过开庵街后，前方灯彩渐艳，人声也变得婉转。"
    "After crossing Kaian Street, the lantern colors ahead grow brighter and the voices softer."

# game/script.rpy:1396
translate english s006_changfeng_lou_079594c4:

    # housanxian "前面是绯红院。"
    housanxian "Feihong Courtyard is ahead."

# game/script.rpy:1409
translate english s007_feihong_yuan_7e5fe637:

    # "还未走近绯红院，先听见丝竹声、鼓点声和叫好声。"
    "Before you reach Feihong Courtyard, you hear strings and pipes, drumbeats, and cheers."

# game/script.rpy:1413
translate english s007_feihong_yuan_2e7e69f3:

    # "门前灯彩虽然还未点亮，但是颜色比长风楼还艳，几名跑堂和看客来来往往。"
    "Its lanterns have not yet been lit, but their colors are brighter than Changfeng House's, as servers and spectators come and go."

# game/script.rpy:1415
translate english s007_feihong_yuan_a44e946c:

    # "这里不像酒楼那样喧哗，却处处透着热闹。"
    "It is not as noisy as a tavern, yet liveliness fills every corner."

# game/script.rpy:1417
translate english s007_feihong_yuan_3adba1ea:

    # "有人听曲，有人看杂耍，有人只是在门前站一会儿，便像已经沾了几分风流气。"
    "Some listen to songs, some watch performers, and some merely linger outside long enough to seem touched by a little elegance."

# game/script.rpy:1419
translate english s007_feihong_yuan_953ce3f2:

    # "一名衣着鲜亮的中年女子站在门前招呼客人，声音又亮又圆。"
    "A brightly dressed middle-aged woman greets guests at the door, her voice clear and full."

# game/script.rpy:1421
translate english s007_feihong_yuan_627591f0:

    # zhangmama "诸位客官，里头有新曲，有武戏，有杂耍，今日不看，明日可就不是今日价了！"
    zhangmama "Honored guests! Inside we have new songs, martial plays, and variety acts. Miss them today, and tomorrow you will not get today's price!"

# game/script.rpy:1423
translate english s007_feihong_yuan_fd4f6314:

    # housanxian "张妈妈，张惜花。"
    housanxian "Madam Zhang—Zhang Xihua."

# game/script.rpy:1425
translate english s007_feihong_yuan_c78302bb:

    # housanxian "嗓门一开，能把风云坪的人都喊回头。"
    housanxian "When she raises her voice, she can make everyone at Fengyun Square turn around."

# game/script.rpy:1428
translate english s007_feihong_yuan_5b579bbf:

    # wangfang "这里是青楼？"
    wangfang "Is this a pleasure house?"

# game/script.rpy:1430
translate english s007_feihong_yuan_f75088da:

    # zuowan "这里就是绯红院？"
    zuowan "So this is Feihong Courtyard?"

# game/script.rpy:1432
translate english s007_feihong_yuan_bdc52436:

    # housanxian "别说得那么窄。"
    housanxian "Do not put it so narrowly."

# game/script.rpy:1434
translate english s007_feihong_yuan_beaad8ae:

    # housanxian "绯红院里有唱曲的，有说笑话的，有演武戏的，也有江湖客喝多了说漏嘴的。"
    housanxian "Feihong Courtyard has singers, storytellers, martial plays, and jianghu guests who drink too much and let secrets slip."

# game/script.rpy:1436
translate english s007_feihong_yuan_5a82bcee:

    # housanxian "看美人只是表面，听消息才是门道。"
    housanxian "Looking at beauties is only the surface. Listening for news is the real art."

# game/script.rpy:1438
translate english s007_feihong_yuan_2751656c:

    # "二楼窗前，一个女子以团扇掩面，只露出半张脸。"
    "At a second-floor window, a woman hides her face behind a round fan, showing only half of it."

# game/script.rpy:1440
translate english s007_feihong_yuan_4b9d094c:

    # "楼下有人抬头看，有人假装不看。"
    "Below, some look up while others pretend not to."

# game/script.rpy:1442
translate english s007_feihong_yuan_b8f85afb:

    # housanxian "那位是秀珠。"
    housanxian "That is Xiuzhu."

# game/script.rpy:1444
translate english s007_feihong_yuan_2aedceb0:

    # housanxian "听说原名赵芷薇。"
    housanxian "They say her birth name was Zhao Zhiwei."

# game/script.rpy:1446
translate english s007_feihong_yuan_c2895a19:

    # housanxian "她一开嗓，长风楼那边的酒都能少卖半壶。"
    housanxian "When she starts to sing, Changfeng House sells half a jug less wine."

# game/script.rpy:1449
translate english s007_feihong_yuan_1c89fb9e:

    # wangfang "你连这个都知道？"
    wangfang "You know even that?"

# game/script.rpy:1451
translate english s007_feihong_yuan_91d346f2:

    # zuowan "你倒是很熟。"
    zuowan "You seem very familiar with it."

# game/script.rpy:1453
translate english s007_feihong_yuan_254fc514:

    # housanxian "江湖消息，需多方采集。"
    housanxian "Jianghu news must be gathered from many quarters."

# game/script.rpy:1455
translate english s007_feihong_yuan_2229dada:

    # "张妈妈远远看见侯三闲，立刻笑着喊。"
    "Madam Zhang spots Hou Sanxian from afar and calls out with a smile."

# game/script.rpy:1457
translate english s007_feihong_yuan_5c58e2e5:

    # zhangmama "侯三闲，你上回说替我介绍三位贵客，贵客呢？"
    zhangmama "Hou Sanxian, last time you said you would introduce three honored guests. Where are they?"

# game/script.rpy:1459
translate english s007_feihong_yuan_e86d4ec3:

    # housanxian "贵客这不还在路上嘛。"
    housanxian "Those honored guests are still on the road."

# game/script.rpy:1461
translate english s007_feihong_yuan_d7c787d2:

    # housanxian "江湖路远，急不得。"
    housanxian "The roads of the jianghu are long; one cannot rush them."

# game/script.rpy:1463
translate english s007_feihong_yuan_cd2b3b08:

    # zhangmama "你这张嘴，迟早比我的灯笼还亮。"
    zhangmama "That mouth of yours will shine brighter than my lanterns one day."

# game/script.rpy:1465
translate english s007_feihong_yuan_1143fc3a:

    # "侯三闲赶紧拉着你往旁边走。"
    "Hou Sanxian quickly pulls you aside."

# game/script.rpy:1467
translate english s007_feihong_yuan_2244e085:

    # housanxian "快走。"
    housanxian "Quick, go."

# game/script.rpy:1469
translate english s007_feihong_yuan_18641c08:

    # housanxian "看久了怕被收钱。"
    housanxian "Look too long and they may charge us."

# game/script.rpy:1472
translate english s007_feihong_yuan_2a277205:

    # wangfang "我可是正经大侠，这种地方是不会随便来的。"
    wangfang "I am a proper hero. I would not come casually to a place like this."

# game/script.rpy:1474
translate english s007_feihong_yuan_0019b9fa:

    # zuowan "我可是正经侠女，这种地方是不会随便来的。"
    zuowan "I am a proper heroine. I would not come casually to a place like this."

# game/script.rpy:1476
translate english s007_feihong_yuan_87c19333:

    # housanxian "正经人都这么说。"
    housanxian "That is what all proper people say."

# game/script.rpy:1478
translate english s007_feihong_yuan_cabe9c0b:

    # "他笑了笑，指向前方开阔处。"
    "He smiles and points to an open space ahead."

# game/script.rpy:1480
translate english s007_feihong_yuan_dfd6bfce:

    # housanxian "走，我再带你去一个真正江湖人该看的地方。"
    housanxian "Come. I'll take you to a place a true jianghu person ought to see."

# game/script.rpy:1483
translate english s007_feihong_yuan_822f6158:

    # wangfang "哪里？"
    wangfang "Where?"

# game/script.rpy:1485
translate english s007_feihong_yuan_2c6b4952:

    # zuowan "什么地方？"
    zuowan "What place?"

# game/script.rpy:1487
translate english s007_feihong_yuan_27ed818f:

    # housanxian "风云坪。"
    housanxian "Fengyun Square."

# game/script.rpy:1489
translate english s007_feihong_yuan_7d43e8c6:

    # housanxian "开庵镇的心口子。"
    housanxian "The heart of Kaian Town."

# game/script.rpy:1491
translate english s007_feihong_yuan_c09228f0:

    # housanxian "人要出名，事要闹大，都得从那儿过。"
    housanxian "If someone wants fame or something wants to grow big, it must pass through there."

# game/script.rpy:1506
translate english s008_fengyun_ping_75eb5a8b:

    # "侯三闲带你来到风云坪。"
    "Hou Sanxian brings you to Fengyun Square."

# game/script.rpy:1508
translate english s008_fengyun_ping_95618d58:

    # "这里比前面几处都开阔。"
    "It is more open than any place you have seen so far."

# game/script.rpy:1510
translate english s008_fengyun_ping_ae7de828:

    # "地面被车马压得发亮，四面街道都像河流一样汇到这里。"
    "Carts and horses have worn the ground smooth, and streets from every side flow here like rivers."

# game/script.rpy:1512
translate english s008_fengyun_ping_77670f01:

    # "东侧是府衙、公署、巡捕司和监狱一带。"
    "To the east lie the prefectural yamen, government offices, the Patrol Bureau, and the prison."

# game/script.rpy:1514
translate english s008_fengyun_ping_26c93446:

    # "西侧从北往南，依次能看见飞鸿驿站、雷凌宫、茯苓医馆。"
    "On the west side, from north to south, stand Feihong Post Station, Leiling Palace, and Fuling Clinic."

# game/script.rpy:1516
translate english s008_fengyun_ping_8919e0d7:

    # "不远处还有保寿堂、正骨轩和孙记面摊。"
    "Nearby are also Baoshou Hall, the Bone-Setting House, and Sun's noodle stall."

# game/script.rpy:1518
translate english s008_fengyun_ping_3652272e:

    # housanxian "看见没？"
    housanxian "See that?"

# game/script.rpy:1520
translate english s008_fengyun_ping_ab9a7821:

    # housanxian "开庵镇要是一个人，风云坪就是心口。"
    housanxian "If Kaian Town were a person, Fengyun Square would be its heart."

# game/script.rpy:1522
translate english s008_fengyun_ping_1474a2bd:

    # "路过监狱外侧时，一名狱卒正抱着腰刀出来透气。"
    "As you pass the outside of the prison, a jailer comes out with his saber to get some air."

# game/script.rpy:1524
translate english s008_fengyun_ping_9c6f655a:

    # "他看见侯三闲，竟然熟络地喊了一声。"
    "On seeing Hou Sanxian, he calls out as if they are old acquaintances."

# game/script.rpy:1526
translate english s008_fengyun_ping_1798b59a:

    # baochangshan "三闲，又在给外乡人带路？"
    baochangshan "Sanxian, showing outsiders around again?"

# game/script.rpy:1528
translate english s008_fengyun_ping_0f480c47:

    # housanxian "包大哥，这叫接待江湖贵客。"
    housanxian "Brother Bao, this is called receiving honored guests of the jianghu."

# game/script.rpy:1530
translate english s008_fengyun_ping_b8a6699a:

    # "包长山笑骂。"
    "Bao Changshan laughs as he scolds him."

# game/script.rpy:1532
translate english s008_fengyun_ping_d9ec3d39:

    # baochangshan "你少把贵客带进牢里来就行。"
    baochangshan "Just do not bring your honored guests into the jail."

# game/script.rpy:1534
translate english s008_fengyun_ping_df7c237e:

    # "侯三闲立刻挺胸。"
    "Hou Sanxian puffs out his chest at once."

# game/script.rpy:1536
translate english s008_fengyun_ping_47d6f889:

    # housanxian "我侯三闲行走江湖，靠的就是一个稳字。"
    housanxian "I, Hou Sanxian, make my way through the jianghu on one word: steadiness."

# game/script.rpy:1538
translate english s008_fengyun_ping_f95b6a67:

    # baochangshan "你稳？你上回翻墙摔下来，在牢门口躺了半个时辰。"
    baochangshan "Steady? Last time you climbed a wall, fell, and lay outside the jail gate for half a shichen."

# game/script.rpy:1540
translate english s008_fengyun_ping_07ea9386:

    # housanxian "那是观测地形。"
    housanxian "I was surveying the terrain."

# game/script.rpy:1542
translate english s008_fengyun_ping_3c37d3b9:

    # "你第一次发现，侯三闲虽然像个混街少年，却确实认识不少镇上的人。"
    "For the first time, you realize that though Hou Sanxian looks like a street idler, he truly knows quite a few people in town."

# game/script.rpy:1544
translate english s008_fengyun_ping_3daad6ad:

    # "二人走过孙记面摊。"
    "The two of you pass Sun's noodle stall."

# game/script.rpy:1546
translate english s008_fengyun_ping_6da1e305:

    # "锅里热气腾腾，雪菜肉丝面的香味飘过来。"
    "Steam rises from the pot, carrying the fragrance of pork noodles with pickled greens."

# game/script.rpy:1548
translate english s008_fengyun_ping_259d73c4:

    # "侯三闲停了一下。"
    "Hou Sanxian pauses."

# game/script.rpy:1550
translate english s008_fengyun_ping_659dad7e:

    # housanxian "这家面，镇上一绝。"
    housanxian "These noodles are one of the town's finest."

# game/script.rpy:1552
translate english s008_fengyun_ping_778d1ad6:

    # housanxian "尤其是别人请的时候，格外好吃。"
    housanxian "They are especially good when someone else is paying."

# game/script.rpy:1554
translate english s008_fengyun_ping_f1151427:

    # "你装作没听懂。"
    "You pretend not to understand."

# game/script.rpy:1556
translate english s008_fengyun_ping_0b4f55de:

    # "侯三闲等了一会儿，发现没下文，只好悻悻摆手。"
    "Hou Sanxian waits a moment, finds no answer coming, and waves his hand in disappointment."

# game/script.rpy:1558
translate english s008_fengyun_ping_87c942e7:

    # housanxian "算了，今日江湖事忙。"
    housanxian "Never mind. Jianghu matters keep me busy today."

# game/script.rpy:1560
translate english s008_fengyun_ping_aa678218:

    # "他指了指西街方向。"
    "He points toward West Street."

# game/script.rpy:1562
translate english s008_fengyun_ping_99f4a173:

    # housanxian "以后要找我，就去西街菜市。"
    housanxian "If you need me later, go to West Street Market."

# game/script.rpy:1564
translate english s008_fengyun_ping_861c7457:

    # housanxian "别问摊主，问了他们也说我欠钱。"
    housanxian "Do not ask the stallkeepers. If you do, they will only say I owe them money."

# game/script.rpy:1566
translate english s008_fengyun_ping_ca4c09e0:

    # housanxian "你就说找侯三闲，他们骂两句就知道我在哪儿。"
    housanxian "Just say you seek Hou Sanxian. After cursing me twice, they will tell you where I am."

# game/script.rpy:1569
translate english s008_fengyun_ping_e8b3d716:

    # wangfang "听起来你人缘不错。"
    wangfang "It sounds as if you are well liked."

# game/script.rpy:1571
translate english s008_fengyun_ping_f5e1df78:

    # zuowan "听起来你欠得很广。"
    zuowan "It sounds as if you owe a great many people."

# game/script.rpy:1573
translate english s008_fengyun_ping_6909be99:

    # housanxian "江湖上，认识的人越多，误会越多。"
    housanxian "In the jianghu, the more people you know, the more misunderstandings you have."

# game/script.rpy:1575
translate english s008_fengyun_ping_a720a925:

    # "侯三闲挥挥手，转身混入人群。"
    "Hou Sanxian waves, turns, and disappears into the crowd."

# game/script.rpy:1577
translate english s008_fengyun_ping_6a9c1357:

    # "你独自穿过风云坪。"
    "You cross Fengyun Square alone."

# game/script.rpy:1579
translate english s008_fengyun_ping_5d83b2cf:

    # "飞鸿驿站门口最热闹。"
    "The entrance to Feihong Post Station is the liveliest place of all."

# game/script.rpy:1581
translate english s008_fengyun_ping_bd0d50fe:

    # "马匹、行李、商旅和江湖客挤在一起。"
    "Horses, luggage, merchants, and jianghu travelers are all pressed together."

# game/script.rpy:1583
translate english s008_fengyun_ping_ccd4f8bd:

    # "一个年轻女子正在门前招呼客人，嘴快手也快，一边登记，一边让人别堵门。"
    "A young woman works at the entrance, quick of speech and hand as she registers guests and keeps people from blocking the door."

# game/script.rpy:1585
translate english s008_fengyun_ping_5006997e:

    # "她应该就是驿站的人。"
    "She must work for the post station."

# game/script.rpy:1587
translate english s008_fengyun_ping_5856df2d:

    # "再往南，雷凌宫门前富丽堂皇。"
    "Farther south, Leiling Palace's entrance is richly splendid."

# game/script.rpy:1589
translate english s008_fengyun_ping_a627d55f:

    # "王家小厮小庆站在门口，有路人上前询问什么，他眼皮都不抬，只冷淡地回了一句。"
    "Xiaoqing, a Wang household servant, stands at the gate. When passersby ask him something, he does not even raise his eyes before giving a curt reply."

# game/script.rpy:1591
translate english s008_fengyun_ping_c3b736ab:

    # "雷凌宫的高墙在夕光里显得格外沉。"
    "Leiling Palace's high walls look especially oppressive in the evening light."

# game/script.rpy:1593
translate english s008_fengyun_ping_5a181685:

    # "茯苓医馆再往南些，门口药香淡淡。"
    "A little farther south is Fuling Clinic, its entrance faintly scented with herbs."

# game/script.rpy:1595
translate english s008_fengyun_ping_0e658567:

    # "在医馆南侧，还能看见一间药铺，门口挂着醒目的大招牌：保寿堂。"
    "South of the clinic stands an apothecary with a conspicuous sign: Baoshou Hall."

# game/script.rpy:1597
translate english s008_fengyun_ping_1a1778c1:

    # "招牌旁另悬一块小匾，字写得比正招牌还大——“金枪不倒丸”。"
    "Beside it hangs a smaller plaque whose writing is even larger: 'Golden Spear Unfailing Pills.'"

# game/script.rpy:1599
translate english s008_fengyun_ping_2d9cfd0b:

    # "路过的江湖客有人假装没看见，有人看了又回头。"
    "Some passing jianghu travelers pretend not to see it; others look, then turn back for another glance."

# game/script.rpy:1601
translate english s008_fengyun_ping_aedcbb62:

    # "相比保寿堂招牌的张扬，茯苓医馆显得安静许多。"
    "Compared to Baoshou Hall's bold sign, Fuling Clinic is much quieter."

# game/script.rpy:1603
translate english s008_fengyun_ping_6510beb7:

    # "医馆门口，一个年轻男子正坐在门边晒太阳，手里拨弄着一小捆草药。"
    "At the clinic entrance, a young man sits in the sun, sorting a small bundle of herbs in his hands."

# game/script.rpy:1605
translate english s008_fengyun_ping_7f48f952:

    # "风云坪人来人往。"
    "People come and go through Fengyun Square."

# game/script.rpy:1607
translate english s008_fengyun_ping_1dc703de:

    # "你忽然意识到，自己真的踏进了这座小镇的中心。"
    "You suddenly realize that you have truly stepped into the center of this town."

# game/script.rpy:1609
translate english s008_fengyun_ping_612f1cc6:

    # "相比雷凌宫的冷淡和医馆的安静，飞鸿驿站门口那个年轻女子看起来最容易开口。"
    "Compared with Leiling Palace's chill and the clinic's quiet, the young woman at Feihong Post Station seems easiest to approach."

# game/script.rpy:1611
translate english s008_fengyun_ping_815e2381:

    # "也许可以先向她打听打听开庵镇的规矩。"
    "Perhaps you can first ask her about Kaian Town's ways."

# game/script.rpy:1613
translate english s008_fengyun_ping_eaf6af00:

    # "你走向飞鸿驿站。"
    "You walk toward Feihong Post Station."

# game/script.rpy:1641
translate english s009_feihong_inn_1_eaf6af00:

    # "你走向飞鸿驿站。"
    "You walk toward Feihong Post Station."

# game/script.rpy:1643
translate english s009_feihong_inn_1_5f9a9aab:

    # "越靠近驿站，越能听见马蹄声、车轮声、伙计招呼声和客商催促声。"
    "The closer you come to the post station, the clearer the hoofbeats, cart wheels, servants' calls, and merchants' urgings become."

# game/script.rpy:1645
translate english s009_feihong_inn_1_aec74495:

    # "飞鸿驿站门口拴着几匹马，行李和货箱堆在一旁。"
    "Several horses are tethered outside Feihong Post Station, with luggage and cargo chests piled nearby."

# game/script.rpy:1647
translate english s009_feihong_inn_1_c1aa17dc:

    # "几个商旅正在争论房价，两个江湖客抱着刀靠在柱边，像是在等人，又像是在等事。"
    "Several merchants dispute room prices, while two jianghu travelers lean against a pillar with their weapons, seeming to wait for someone—or something."

# game/script.rpy:1649
translate english s009_feihong_inn_1_7dda3643:

    # "那个年轻女子正站在门前，一边接话，一边登记。"
    "The young woman stands by the door, answering people while taking registrations."

# game/script.rpy:1651
translate english s009_feihong_inn_1_ed4170e3:

    # "她约莫二十出头，眼神明亮，动作利落，嘴快得像能同时接住三个人的话。"
    "She is a little over twenty, bright-eyed and brisk, with a tongue quick enough to catch three people's words at once."

# game/script.rpy:1653
translate english s009_feihong_inn_1_5f372471:

    # "一个客商急道：“姑娘，我昨日就托人订了房！”"
    "A merchant says anxiously, \"Miss, I had someone reserve a room yesterday!\""

# game/script.rpy:1655
translate english s009_feihong_inn_1_3a14856a:

    # "年轻女子：“托谁订的？”"
    "The young woman asks, \"Whom did you ask to reserve it?\""

# game/script.rpy:1657
translate english s009_feihong_inn_1_371b9473:

    # keshang "一个姓刘的。"
    keshang "Someone named Liu."

# game/script.rpy:1659
translate english s009_feihong_inn_1_b7faa7bb:

    # "年轻女子：“开庵镇姓刘的能从南门排到北巷。你说清楚是哪位刘。”"
    "The young woman says, \"There are enough people named Liu in Kaian Town to line up from the south gate to North Lane. Tell me which Liu.\""

# game/script.rpy:1661
translate english s009_feihong_inn_1_48d61e25:

    # "另一个江湖客插话：“我只住一晚，有没有上房？”"
    "Another jianghu traveler cuts in. \"I only need one night. Do you have a superior room?\""

# game/script.rpy:1663
translate english s009_feihong_inn_1_0c5fdac4:

    # "年轻女子：“上房有，上房的钱也有。你有哪个？”"
    "The young woman replies, \"I have superior rooms, and I have superior-room prices. Which do you have?\""

# game/script.rpy:1665
translate english s009_feihong_inn_1_f6ad189c:

    # "那江湖客一时语塞。"
    "The jianghu traveler is left speechless."

# game/script.rpy:1667
translate english s009_feihong_inn_1_1ac85360:

    # "年轻女子转头看见你，立刻扬起笑。"
    "The young woman turns, sees you, and immediately smiles."

# game/script.rpy:1669
translate english s009_feihong_inn_1_93f0cf85:

    # weisaner "客官，住店、寄信、找人、托货，还是单纯迷路？"
    weisaner "Honored guest, are you lodging, sending a letter, seeking someone, entrusting cargo—or simply lost?"

# game/script.rpy:1672
translate english s009_feihong_inn_1_440c7a9b:

    # wangfang "我……先打听一下。"
    wangfang "I... would like to ask around first."

# game/script.rpy:1674
translate english s009_feihong_inn_1_4d890091:

    # zuowan "我先问问，不一定住。"
    zuowan "I will ask first. I may not be staying."

# game/script.rpy:1676
translate english s009_feihong_inn_1_096ecb69:

    # "魏三儿上下看了你一眼，笑意不减。"
    "Wei San'er looks you up and down without losing her smile."

# game/script.rpy:1678
translate english s009_feihong_inn_1_6c2a3cd8:

    # weisaner "外乡人？"
    weisaner "From out of town?"

# game/script.rpy:1681
translate english s009_feihong_inn_1_ff377a3a:

    # wangfang "这么明显？"
    wangfang "Is it that obvious?"

# game/script.rpy:1683
translate english s009_feihong_inn_1_7fa0a40d:

    # zuowan "你们开庵镇的人都这么会看人？"
    zuowan "Are all the people of Kaian Town so good at reading others?"

# game/script.rpy:1685
translate english s009_feihong_inn_1_038692df:

    # weisaner "这两日进镇的人，十个里有八个都说自己只是打听一下。"
    weisaner "Of the people entering town these past two days, eight out of ten say they are only asking around."

# game/script.rpy:1687
translate english s009_feihong_inn_1_8f61d512:

    # weisaner "最后不是住店，就是问路，要么就是问雷云峰。"
    weisaner "In the end, they either lodge here, ask directions, or ask about Leiyun Peak."

# game/script.rpy:1689
translate english s009_feihong_inn_1_38437903:

    # "她把手中的木牌翻了一下。"
    "She turns over the wooden tally in her hand."

# game/script.rpy:1691
translate english s009_feihong_inn_1_304eadc9:

    # weisaner "所以，你是哪一种？"
    weisaner "So which kind are you?"

# game/script.rpy:1694
translate english s009_feihong_inn_1_309a8bab:

    # wangfang "我听说风雷观要开炉炼丹，所以来看看。"
    wangfang "I heard Fenglei Abbey would fire its furnace to refine an elixir, so I came to see."

# game/script.rpy:1696
translate english s009_feihong_inn_1_0e75e002:

    # zuowan "我听说长息定年丹牵涉药材和气脉，所以来看看。"
    zuowan "I heard the Long-Breath Age-Settling Elixir involves herbs and vital channels, so I came to see."

# game/script.rpy:1698
translate english s009_feihong_inn_1_3608c59b:

    # "魏三儿一点也不惊讶。"
    "Wei San'er is not surprised in the least."

# game/script.rpy:1700
translate english s009_feihong_inn_1_e89825d7:

    # weisaner "果然是雷云峰。"
    weisaner "Leiyun Peak after all."

# game/script.rpy:1702
translate english s009_feihong_inn_1_cd243c33:

    # weisaner "这几天，开口不是丹，就是山。再这么下去，我都能替说书人开场了。"
    weisaner "These days, every mouth speaks either of the elixir or the mountain. At this rate I could open for a storyteller."

# game/script.rpy:1705
translate english s009_feihong_inn_1_bde291be:

    # wangfang "那你知道长息定年丹到底是什么吗？"
    wangfang "Then do you know what the Long-Breath Age-Settling Elixir truly is?"

# game/script.rpy:1707
translate english s009_feihong_inn_1_0b4da321:

    # zuowan "那你听到的说法里，哪一种最可信？"
    zuowan "Of the accounts you have heard, which seems most credible?"

# game/script.rpy:1709
translate english s009_feihong_inn_1_dea2af90:

    # "魏三儿歪头想了想。"
    "Wei San'er tilts her head and thinks."

# game/script.rpy:1711
translate english s009_feihong_inn_1_bb4663ca:

    # weisaner "我听过三个版本。"
    weisaner "I have heard three versions."

# game/script.rpy:1713
translate english s009_feihong_inn_1_4f289406:

    # weisaner "第一，吃了能长生。"
    weisaner "First, eat it and gain long life."

# game/script.rpy:1715
translate english s009_feihong_inn_1_6ec056e6:

    # weisaner "第二，吃了能年轻三十岁。"
    weisaner "Second, eat it and become thirty years younger."

# game/script.rpy:1717
translate english s009_feihong_inn_1_8e5b4cf5:

    # weisaner "第三，吃了会立刻死，但死得很体面。"
    weisaner "Third, eat it and die at once—but very respectably."

# game/script.rpy:1719
translate english s009_feihong_inn_1_40e826a8:

    # "她摊手。"
    "She spreads her hands."

# game/script.rpy:1721
translate english s009_feihong_inn_1_3db2ff2b:

    # weisaner "你要问我哪个是真的，我只能说，第三个听起来最便宜。"
    weisaner "If you ask which is true, I can only say the third sounds cheapest."

# game/script.rpy:1724
translate english s009_feihong_inn_1_16fb4982:

    # wangfang "这么大的事，驿站里没人知道真相？"
    wangfang "With such a major matter, no one at the post station knows the truth?"

# game/script.rpy:1726
translate english s009_feihong_inn_1_523cc892:

    # zuowan "驿站人来人往，应该听过不少消息吧。"
    zuowan "People pass through this post station constantly. You must hear a great deal of news."

# game/script.rpy:1728
translate english s009_feihong_inn_1_1f7d8f86:

    # weisaner "消息是多。"
    weisaner "There is plenty of news."

# game/script.rpy:1730
translate english s009_feihong_inn_1_ac4089aa:

    # weisaner "可消息这种东西，在门口听见是一种，进了大堂又是一种，喝了酒之后还能变第三种。"
    weisaner "But news is one thing when heard at the door, another in the hall, and a third after people have drunk wine."

# game/script.rpy:1732
translate english s009_feihong_inn_1_0526372a:

    # weisaner "真想问清楚，得找更会记事的人。"
    weisaner "If you truly want clear answers, find someone better at keeping records."

# game/script.rpy:1734
translate english s009_feihong_inn_1_63af978e:

    # "她正要继续说，身后忽然有人喊。"
    "As she is about to continue, someone suddenly shouts behind her."

# game/script.rpy:1736
translate english s009_feihong_inn_1_d4f84db2:

    # keshang "姑娘！我的货箱谁搬错了？"
    keshang "Miss! Who carried off my cargo chest by mistake?"

# game/script.rpy:1738
translate english s009_feihong_inn_1_9f1ba98a:

    # "另一个声音跟着响起。"
    "Another voice follows at once."

# game/script.rpy:1740
translate english s009_feihong_inn_1_09eaf3a3:

    # jianghuke "我的马呢？刚才还在那儿！"
    jianghuke "Where is my horse? It was there just now!"

# game/script.rpy:1742
translate english s009_feihong_inn_1_a887d0ac:

    # "魏三儿立刻转身。"
    "Wei San'er turns immediately."

# game/script.rpy:1744
translate english s009_feihong_inn_1_38be0fc0:

    # weisaner "货箱写名，马不写名，你们都敢放门口，胆子可真大！"
    weisaner "A cargo chest has a name written on it; a horse does not. You dared leave both at the door? You are certainly bold!"

# game/script.rpy:1746
translate english s009_feihong_inn_1_6ee14ca4:

    # "她回头看你一眼。"
    "She glances back at you."

# game/script.rpy:1748
translate english s009_feihong_inn_1_8026670e:

    # weisaner "你若只是打听，就进去看看。桌前那位方驿丞，比我会记事。"
    weisaner "If you are only asking around, go in and look. The Station Clerk Fang at the desk keeps better records than I do."

# game/script.rpy:1750
translate english s009_feihong_inn_1_247e5808:

    # weisaner "不过别挡路。挡路在驿站不算罪，但很容易挨骂。"
    weisaner "But do not block the way. It is not a crime at a post station, but it is an easy way to be scolded."

# game/script.rpy:1752
translate english s009_feihong_inn_1_eb77e6a0:

    # "说完，她又被人群叫走。"
    "With that, the crowd calls her away again."

# game/script.rpy:1754
translate english s009_feihong_inn_1_512ea4c9:

    # "你见她太忙，便自行走进飞鸿驿站。"
    "Seeing that she is too busy, you enter Feihong Post Station on your own."

# game/script.rpy:1769
translate english s010_feihong_inn_2_437e69e8:

    # "你走进飞鸿驿站前厅。"
    "You enter the front hall of Feihong Post Station."

# game/script.rpy:1771
translate english s010_feihong_inn_2_eebb96b6:

    # "驿站内部比门口更热闹。"
    "Inside, the post station is even livelier than its entrance."

# game/script.rpy:1773
translate english s010_feihong_inn_2_4a5aecc6:

    # "正中是接待前厅，靠墙挂着房牌、路牌和信牌。"
    "The reception hall lies at the center, with room markers, route signs, and mail boards hung along the walls."

# game/script.rpy:1775
translate english s010_feihong_inn_2_ea355331:

    # "一侧有供客商暂坐的长桌，另一侧堆着行李箱笼。"
    "Long tables for merchants stand on one side, while luggage chests and baskets are stacked on the other."

# game/script.rpy:1777
translate english s010_feihong_inn_2_defdd69b:

    # "往后能看见通往客房和后院的走廊，后院方向隐隐传来马嘶声和水桶碰撞声。"
    "Behind it, a corridor leads to the guest rooms and rear courtyard, where faint whinnies and clattering buckets can be heard."

# game/script.rpy:1779
translate english s010_feihong_inn_2_76301cff:

    # "厨房那边冒着热气，一个中年妇人正隔着半扇门骂人。"
    "Steam rises from the kitchen, where a middle-aged woman is scolding someone through a half-open door."

# game/script.rpy:1781
translate english s010_feihong_inn_2_896010f8:

    # fangdaniang "谁把空碗摞到菜盆旁边的？这是驿站，不是猪圈！"
    fangdaniang "Who piled empty bowls beside the vegetable basin? This is a post station, not a pigsty!"

# game/script.rpy:1783
translate english s010_feihong_inn_2_d1d05082:

    # "有人小声回：“方大娘，我这就拿走。”"
    "Someone answers softly, \"Auntie Fang, I will take them away at once.\""

# game/script.rpy:1785
translate english s010_feihong_inn_2_bbef568b:

    # fangdaniang "拿走还要我教？你长手是为了吃饭，不是为了摆着好看！"
    fangdaniang "Do I have to teach you to take them away? You have hands to work with, not to display!"

# game/script.rpy:1787
translate english s010_feihong_inn_2_7492a877:

    # "前厅另一边，一个身形高大的男子正在与客商交谈。"
    "On the other side of the hall, a tall man is speaking with a merchant."

# game/script.rpy:1789
translate english s010_feihong_inn_2_1ec82ecb:

    # "那人声音不高，却让急得冒汗的客商慢慢安静下来。"
    "His voice is not loud, yet the sweating merchant gradually calms."

# game/script.rpy:1791
translate english s010_feihong_inn_2_1c8bb872:

    # lutiankuo "货走北路，明日午前不能发。风大，马慢，催也无用。"
    lutiankuo "The cargo is taking the north road. It cannot depart before noon tomorrow. The wind is strong, the horses are slow, and urging will change nothing."

# game/script.rpy:1793
translate english s010_feihong_inn_2_334235b6:

    # keshang "可我这批货急。"
    keshang "But this shipment is urgent."

# game/script.rpy:1795
translate english s010_feihong_inn_2_d2653386:

    # lutiankuo "急货更不能走错路。"
    lutiankuo "Urgent cargo has even less room to take the wrong road."

# game/script.rpy:1797
translate english s010_feihong_inn_2_a5f066a5:

    # "再往门外看，马厩方向有个年轻马夫正给马添草料。"
    "Outside, a young groom is adding fodder to the horses by the stables."

# game/script.rpy:1799
translate english s010_feihong_inn_2_9122470c:

    # zhouerdan "你们人抢房，马也抢槽。今日谁都不容易。"
    zhouerdan "You people fight over rooms, and the horses fight over troughs. No one has it easy today."

# game/script.rpy:1801
translate english s010_feihong_inn_2_4c92a053:

    # "前厅文书桌后，一名男子正在低头写字。"
    "Behind the hall's writing desk, a man bends over his work."

# game/script.rpy:1803
translate english s010_feihong_inn_2_f845d4c7:

    # "他三十多岁，衣着干净，神情温和，却有一种不容易被打乱的安静。"
    "In his thirties, he is neatly dressed and mild of expression, with a calm that is not easily disturbed."

# game/script.rpy:1805
translate english s010_feihong_inn_2_15696028:

    # "桌上摊着账册、房簿、信单和几枚木印。"
    "Account books, room registers, mail slips, and several wooden seals lie spread across the desk."

# game/script.rpy:1807
translate english s010_feihong_inn_2_29b8c989:

    # "他抬头看了你一眼。"
    "He looks up at you."

# game/script.rpy:1809
translate english s010_feihong_inn_2_0c5c39b1:

    # fangheming "客官有事？"
    fangheming "What can I do for you, honored guest?"

# game/script.rpy:1812
translate english s010_feihong_inn_2_3905048b:

    # wangfang "方驿丞？魏三儿姑娘说，若想打听事，可以来问你。"
    wangfang "Station Clerk Fang? Miss Wei San'er said that if I wanted to ask about something, I could come to you."

# game/script.rpy:1814
translate english s010_feihong_inn_2_eefd12a5:

    # zuowan "方驿丞？门口那位姑娘说，你比她更会记事。"
    zuowan "Station Clerk Fang? The young woman at the door said you keep better track of things than she does."

# game/script.rpy:1816
translate english s010_feihong_inn_2_df8da372:

    # "方鹤鸣放下笔。"
    "Fang Heming sets down his brush."

# game/script.rpy:1818
translate english s010_feihong_inn_2_0588851d:

    # fangheming "魏三儿说话，十句里有七句能听，三句要过水。"
    fangheming "Of ten things Wei San'er says, seven may be trusted and three should be rinsed clean first."

# game/script.rpy:1820
translate english s010_feihong_inn_2_b84e4552:

    # fangheming "你想问什么？"
    fangheming "What would you ask?"

# game/script.rpy:1823
translate english s010_feihong_inn_2_73a511c9:

    # wangfang "长息定年丹。"
    wangfang "The Long-Breath Age-Settling Elixir."

# game/script.rpy:1825
translate english s010_feihong_inn_2_d458e65c:

    # zuowan "风雷观的长息定年丹。"
    zuowan "Fenglei Abbey's Long-Breath Age-Settling Elixir."

# game/script.rpy:1827
translate english s010_feihong_inn_2_0dcdfdf9:

    # "方鹤鸣神色没有太大变化，只将桌上的一张信单压平。"
    "Fang Heming's expression hardly changes; he merely smooths a mail slip on the desk."

# game/script.rpy:1829
translate english s010_feihong_inn_2_2761c5b7:

    # fangheming "这几日问这件事的人太多。"
    fangheming "Too many people have asked about that these past days."

# game/script.rpy:1831
translate english s010_feihong_inn_2_91f56484:

    # fangheming "我能告诉你的不多。"
    fangheming "There is not much I can tell you."

# game/script.rpy:1833
translate english s010_feihong_inn_2_eb39c8e7:

    # fangheming "风雷观确实在开炉。雷云峰上确实比往日戒严。各地来人也确实比往年多。"
    fangheming "Fenglei Abbey has indeed fired its furnace. Leiyun Peak is indeed more heavily guarded than usual. And more people than in past years have come from every region."

# game/script.rpy:1836
translate english s010_feihong_inn_2_fa4adcc5:

    # wangfang "那丹药真的能长生吗？"
    wangfang "Can that elixir truly grant long life?"

# game/script.rpy:1838
translate english s010_feihong_inn_2_c5a911c6:

    # zuowan "那丹药真有传言中那么玄？"
    zuowan "Is that elixir truly as miraculous as the rumors claim?"

# game/script.rpy:1840
translate english s010_feihong_inn_2_a954cc53:

    # fangheming "驿站记路，不记仙方。"
    fangheming "A post station keeps track of roads, not immortal formulas."

# game/script.rpy:1842
translate english s010_feihong_inn_2_b16cc86b:

    # fangheming "我只知道，凡是被人传得太满的东西，最后往往装不下真相。"
    fangheming "I only know that when a tale is filled too full by others, it often leaves no room for the truth."

# game/script.rpy:1844
translate english s010_feihong_inn_2_f9bcb767:

    # "他看向前厅。"
    "He looks toward the front hall."

# game/script.rpy:1846
translate english s010_feihong_inn_2_f1eaf967:

    # "有客商在催房，有江湖客在打听山路，有马夫跑来跑去。"
    "Merchants press for rooms, jianghu travelers ask about mountain roads, and grooms hurry back and forth."

# game/script.rpy:1848
translate english s010_feihong_inn_2_003f140c:

    # fangheming "你若真想知道丹药的来龙去脉，可以去茯苓医馆问问。"
    fangheming "If you truly wish to know the elixir's origins, ask at Fuling Clinic."

# game/script.rpy:1850
translate english s010_feihong_inn_2_e924c73f:

    # fangheming "医馆与风雷观常有药材往来，周药师比我们更懂药理。"
    fangheming "The clinic often exchanges medicinal materials with Fenglei Abbey; Apothecary Zhou understands their properties better than we do."

# game/script.rpy:1852
translate english s010_feihong_inn_2_583e0ec6:

    # "他顿了顿，又补一句。"
    "He pauses, then adds,"

# game/script.rpy:1854
translate english s010_feihong_inn_2_dce59597:

    # fangheming "不过，懂药理不代表能把所有话都告诉你。"
    fangheming "But knowing medicine does not mean he can tell you everything."

# game/script.rpy:1857
translate english s010_feihong_inn_2_53761fcc:

    # wangfang "多谢方驿丞。"
    wangfang "Thank you, Station Clerk Fang."

# game/script.rpy:1859
translate english s010_feihong_inn_2_490ae55c:

    # zuowan "明白。多谢。"
    zuowan "I understand. Thank you."

# game/script.rpy:1861
translate english s010_feihong_inn_2_d1ae8aa4:

    # "方鹤鸣点了点头，重新拿起笔。"
    "Fang Heming nods and takes up his brush again."

# game/script.rpy:1863
translate english s010_feihong_inn_2_815ddc57:

    # "你转身准备离开前厅。"
    "You turn to leave the front hall."

# game/script.rpy:1865
translate english s010_feihong_inn_2_b2ad2421:

    # "临走前，你看见角落里有个少年抱着扫帚靠在柱边打瞌睡。"
    "Before leaving, you notice a boy in the corner dozing against a pillar with a broom in his arms."

# game/script.rpy:1867
translate english s010_feihong_inn_2_65b885ee:

    # "他年纪不大，睡得很香，扫帚倒是抱得很紧。"
    "He is young and sleeping soundly, though he holds the broom tightly."

# game/script.rpy:1869
translate english s010_feihong_inn_2_2199e501:

    # "方大娘的声音忽然从厨房传来。"
    "Auntie Fang's voice suddenly carries from the kitchen."

# game/script.rpy:1871
translate english s010_feihong_inn_2_41f5c16b:

    # fangdaniang "罗阿枣！你再抱着扫帚睡，我就把你和扫帚一起立到门口招客！"
    fangdaniang "Luo Azhao! If you sleep holding that broom again, I will stand you and the broom together at the door to welcome guests!"

# game/script.rpy:1873
translate english s010_feihong_inn_2_5f95be61:

    # "少年猛地惊醒。"
    "The boy jerks awake."

# game/script.rpy:1875
translate english s010_feihong_inn_2_c3b11240:

    # luoazao "我没睡，我在听地声。"
    luoazao "I was not sleeping. I was listening to the sounds of the ground."

# game/script.rpy:1877
translate english s010_feihong_inn_2_655f27f9:

    # fangdaniang "你再听，地都嫌你烦。"
    fangdaniang "Listen any longer and the ground itself will be tired of you."

# game/script.rpy:1879
translate english s010_feihong_inn_2_a63bebfd:

    # "前厅里有人笑出声。"
    "Someone in the hall laughs aloud."

# game/script.rpy:1881
translate english s010_feihong_inn_2_44825670:

    # "你也笑了笑，离开飞鸿驿站"
    "You smile as well and leave Feihong Post Station."

# game/script.rpy:1885
translate english s010_feihong_inn_2_3001214a:

    # "向南经过雷凌宫时，你看见白天那个冷淡的小厮小庆正满脸堆笑地与一名衣着华丽的年轻女子说话。"
    "Passing Leiling Palace to the south, you see the aloof servant Xiaoqing from earlier speaking with a broad smile to a richly dressed young woman."

# game/script.rpy:1887
translate english s010_feihong_inn_2_e08268b4:

    # "小庆躬身开门，态度与刚才对路人完全不同。"
    "Xiaoqing bows as he opens the gate, utterly unlike his manner toward passersby earlier."

# game/script.rpy:1889
translate english s010_feihong_inn_2_e8fc7afa:

    # "那女子衣料华贵，神情却并不张扬。"
    "Her clothing is luxurious, but her manner is not showy."

# game/script.rpy:1891
translate english s010_feihong_inn_2_f1de269d:

    # "她回头看了风云坪一眼，随后走进雷凌宫。"
    "She looks back once at Fengyun Square, then enters Leiling Palace."

# game/script.rpy:1893
translate english s010_feihong_inn_2_42d7cb31:

    # "你猜她大概是王家的贵客，或者王家小姐。"
    "You guess she is either an honored guest of the Wang household or a Wang family daughter."

# game/script.rpy:1895
translate english s010_feihong_inn_2_11e6e9ae:

    # "再往南些，茯苓医馆的药香从门口飘来。"
    "Farther south, the scent of herbs drifts from the entrance of Fuling Clinic."

# game/script.rpy:1897
translate english s010_feihong_inn_2_7fe9bcf1:

    # "你想起方鹤鸣的话，决定进去看看。"
    "Remembering Fang Heming's words, you decide to go in."

# game/script.rpy:1912
translate english s011_fuling_clinic_1_2e65f014:

    # "你走进茯苓医馆。"
    "You enter Fuling Clinic."

# game/script.rpy:1914
translate english s011_fuling_clinic_1_55e18644:

    # "与飞鸿驿站的喧闹不同，医馆里安静许多。"
    "Unlike Feihong Post Station's noise, the clinic is much quieter."

# game/script.rpy:1916
translate english s011_fuling_clinic_1_e55a9e94:

    # "但这种安静不是空。"
    "But this quiet is not emptiness."

# game/script.rpy:1918
translate english s011_fuling_clinic_1_72739697:

    # "前厅一侧是诊桌，另一侧是药柜。药柜高而密，抽屉上贴着细小标签。"
    "On one side of the front hall is a consultation desk; on the other are tall, dense medicine cabinets, their drawers marked by small labels."

# game/script.rpy:1920
translate english s011_fuling_clinic_1_8c177095:

    # "梁上悬着几束晒干的草药，角落里有小药炉正冒着淡淡白气。"
    "Bundles of dried herbs hang from the beams, and a small medicine furnace in the corner breathes a faint white vapor."

# game/script.rpy:1922
translate english s011_fuling_clinic_1_60b5447c:

    # "空气中有草药、炭火和旧木头混在一起的味道。"
    "The air carries a mingled scent of herbs, charcoal, and old wood."

# game/script.rpy:1924
translate english s011_fuling_clinic_1_aba05e76:

    # "有病人坐在长凳上等诊，有人捂着胳膊，有人低声咳嗽。"
    "Patients wait on benches: some cradle injured arms, others cough softly."

# game/script.rpy:1926
translate english s011_fuling_clinic_1_adcd7ef6:

    # "你刚进门，便看见一名年轻药师正在药柜前整理药材。"
    "As soon as you enter, you see a young apothecary sorting materials before the medicine cabinets."

# game/script.rpy:1928
translate english s011_fuling_clinic_1_52d12480:

    # "他身形清瘦，眼神灵动，手里捏着一片草叶，像是在和那片草叶争论。"
    "He is lean and lively-eyed, holding a blade of grass as though debating with it."

# game/script.rpy:1930
translate english s011_fuling_clinic_1_6bca08d5:

    # zhouqingliu "你这叶脉长得不对。"
    zhouqingliu "Your leaf veins have grown wrong."

# game/script.rpy:1932
translate english s011_fuling_clinic_1_f25e8c72:

    # "旁边一名病人愣住。"
    "A patient beside him freezes."

# game/script.rpy:1934
translate english s011_fuling_clinic_1_02af7360:

    # bingren "大夫，是我不对，还是叶子不对？"
    bingren "Healer, is something wrong with me or with the leaf?"

# game/script.rpy:1936
translate english s011_fuling_clinic_1_c22e5650:

    # zhouqingliu "暂时是叶子。你等会儿再说。"
    zhouqingliu "For the moment, it is the leaf. Wait your turn."

# game/script.rpy:1938
translate english s011_fuling_clinic_1_c0793800:

    # "他转头看见你，目光在你身上一扫。"
    "He turns, sees you, and lets his gaze sweep over you."

# game/script.rpy:1940
translate english s011_fuling_clinic_1_16b0cf32:

    # zhouqingliu "外乡人。"
    zhouqingliu "Outsiders."

# game/script.rpy:1943
translate english s011_fuling_clinic_1_3d155f9d:

    # wangfang "又看出来了？"
    wangfang "You can tell again?"

# game/script.rpy:1945
translate english s011_fuling_clinic_1_ddb28511:

    # zuowan "你们开庵镇的人，似乎都很会认外乡人。"
    zuowan "People in Kaian Town all seem very good at spotting outsiders."

# game/script.rpy:1947
translate english s011_fuling_clinic_1_9f03fdde:

    # zhouqingliu "本地人进医馆，先看病人。"
    zhouqingliu "Locals enter a clinic and look at the patients first."

# game/script.rpy:1949
translate english s011_fuling_clinic_1_301a4002:

    # zhouqingliu "外乡人进医馆，先看药柜。"
    zhouqingliu "Outsiders enter a clinic and look at the medicine cabinets first."

# game/script.rpy:1951
translate english s011_fuling_clinic_1_c30491b0:

    # zhouqingliu "你刚才看了药柜三眼，看了诊桌一眼，看了我半眼。"
    zhouqingliu "You looked at the cabinets three times, the consultation desk once, and me half a time."

# game/script.rpy:1954
translate english s011_fuling_clinic_1_ada0d015:

    # wangfang "我只是想问问长息定年丹。"
    wangfang "I only want to ask about the Long-Breath Age-Settling Elixir."

# game/script.rpy:1956
translate english s011_fuling_clinic_1_c10b9c60:

    # zuowan "我想问问长息定年丹的事。"
    zuowan "I want to ask about the Long-Breath Age-Settling Elixir."

# game/script.rpy:1958
translate english s011_fuling_clinic_1_cb875519:

    # "周青柳把手里的草叶放下。"
    "Zhou Qingliu sets down the blade of grass."

# game/script.rpy:1960
translate english s011_fuling_clinic_1_df519e09:

    # zhouqingliu "果然。"
    zhouqingliu "As expected."

# game/script.rpy:1962
translate english s011_fuling_clinic_1_dbe2eb54:

    # zhouqingliu "这几日来医馆问丹的人，比来看风寒的人还多。"
    zhouqingliu "These past days, more people have come to the clinic asking about the elixir than seeking treatment for colds."

# game/script.rpy:1964
translate english s011_fuling_clinic_1_8a469b04:

    # zhouqingliu "可惜丹药不能治好奇心。"
    zhouqingliu "Pity an elixir cannot cure curiosity."

# game/script.rpy:1967
translate english s011_fuling_clinic_1_59cb5086:

    # wangfang "那它能治什么？"
    wangfang "Then what can it cure?"

# game/script.rpy:1969
translate english s011_fuling_clinic_1_cf867297:

    # zuowan "它到底是药，还是江湖传言？"
    zuowan "Is it truly medicine, or merely a jianghu rumor?"

# game/script.rpy:1971
translate english s011_fuling_clinic_1_57a305c5:

    # "周青柳看了你一会儿。"
    "Zhou Qingliu studies you for a moment."

# game/script.rpy:1973
translate english s011_fuling_clinic_1_7762749c:

    # "他没有像魏三儿那样开玩笑，也没有像方鹤鸣那样避开话头。"
    "He neither jokes as Wei San'er did nor turns aside from the question as Fang Heming did."

# game/script.rpy:1975
translate english s011_fuling_clinic_1_e56efa15:

    # zhouqingliu "长息定年丹，不是长生丹。"
    zhouqingliu "The Long-Breath Age-Settling Elixir is not an immortality elixir."

# game/script.rpy:1977
translate english s011_fuling_clinic_1_caf9dc89:

    # zhouqingliu "至少从药理上，不可能让一个人永远不老不死。"
    zhouqingliu "At least by the principles of medicine, it cannot make a person forever ageless and deathless."

# game/script.rpy:1979
translate english s011_fuling_clinic_1_0db28109:

    # zhouqingliu "它更像是把一个人正在散掉的元息暂时收住，把衰败的气血稳在某个阶段。"
    zhouqingliu "It is more like temporarily gathering a person's dispersing vital breath and holding their fading blood and qi at a given stage."

# game/script.rpy:1981
translate english s011_fuling_clinic_1_108073e7:

    # zhouqingliu "若用来救人，或许能拖回一条命。"
    zhouqingliu "Used to save someone, it may perhaps pull a life back from the brink."

# game/script.rpy:1983
translate english s011_fuling_clinic_1_23b2339a:

    # zhouqingliu "若用来贪生，恐怕会拖出别的祸。"
    zhouqingliu "Used in a greedy fear of death, it may draw out other calamities."

# game/script.rpy:1986
translate english s011_fuling_clinic_1_9a1a108c:

    # wangfang "你知道得这么清楚，医馆参与炼丹了？"
    wangfang "You know so much about it. Did the clinic take part in refining the elixir?"

# game/script.rpy:1988
translate english s011_fuling_clinic_1_9d25812a:

    # zuowan "茯苓医馆是不是给风雷观供过药材？"
    zuowan "Has Fuling Clinic supplied medicinal materials to Fenglei Abbey?"

# game/script.rpy:1990
translate english s011_fuling_clinic_1_de75bdc8:

    # "周青柳没有立刻回答。"
    "Zhou Qingliu does not answer at once."

# game/script.rpy:1992
translate english s011_fuling_clinic_1_a9c09d21:

    # "他从药柜里抽出一个小屉，又慢慢推回去。"
    "He pulls a small drawer from a medicine cabinet, then slowly pushes it back."

# game/script.rpy:1994
translate english s011_fuling_clinic_1_a13964e9:

    # zhouqingliu "医馆与风雷观素有药材往来。"
    zhouqingliu "The clinic has long exchanged medicinal materials with Fenglei Abbey."

# game/script.rpy:1996
translate english s011_fuling_clinic_1_c6bf370d:

    # zhouqingliu "送药，不等于知方。"
    zhouqingliu "Delivering ingredients does not mean knowing the formula."

# game/script.rpy:1998
translate english s011_fuling_clinic_1_85863f50:

    # zhouqingliu "知方，也不等于知道掌炉人真正想炼什么。"
    zhouqingliu "And knowing the formula does not mean knowing what the one tending the furnace truly wishes to refine."

# game/script.rpy:2000
translate english s011_fuling_clinic_1_a5ebcefa:

    # "这句话让医馆里的药香忽然显得更深。"
    "His words make the scent of herbs in the clinic seem suddenly deeper."

# game/script.rpy:2004
translate english s011_fuling_clinic_1_05f08b65:

    # "你记住了：长息定年丹并非简单的长生丹。"
    "You remember: the Long-Breath Age-Settling Elixir is no simple immortality elixir."

# game/script.rpy:2006
translate english s011_fuling_clinic_1_4b94894c:

    # "它牵涉元息、气血、衰败与定息。"
    "It concerns vital breath, blood and qi, decline, and the settling of breath."

# game/script.rpy:2008
translate english s011_fuling_clinic_1_e2b4f25a:

    # "正在这时，门外传来一阵急促的脚步声。"
    "Just then, hurried footsteps sound outside."

# game/script.rpy:2012
translate english s011_fuling_clinic_1_86a572fa:

    # "一个年轻男子抱着半捆草药跑进来。"
    "A young man rushes in carrying half a bundle of herbs."

# game/script.rpy:2014
translate english s011_fuling_clinic_1_5c570d50:

    # "年轻男子：“师父！后院那筐雷纹草是不是你让我晒的？”"
    "The young man says, \"Master! Was that basket of thunder-veined grass in the rear courtyard the one you told me to dry?\""

# game/script.rpy:2016
translate english s011_fuling_clinic_1_3d29d6d2:

    # "周青柳闭了闭眼。"
    "Zhou Qingliu closes his eyes briefly."

# game/script.rpy:2018
translate english s011_fuling_clinic_1_a35523f1:

    # zhouqingliu "我让你阴干。"
    zhouqingliu "I told you to dry it in the shade."

# game/script.rpy:2020
translate english s011_fuling_clinic_1_bf345ec9:

    # "年轻男子：“我晒得很阴。”"
    "The young man says, \"I dried it very shadily.\""

# game/script.rpy:2022
translate english s011_fuling_clinic_1_0003a8a9:

    # zhouqingliu "它在太阳底下。"
    zhouqingliu "It is under the sun."

# game/script.rpy:2024
translate english s011_fuling_clinic_1_1c4cf753:

    # "年轻男子：“但我给它撑了半把伞。”"
    "The young man says, \"But I held half an umbrella over it.\""

# game/script.rpy:2026
translate english s011_fuling_clinic_1_6703bdf9:

    # zhouqingliu "沈云。"
    zhouqingliu "Shen Yun."

# game/script.rpy:2028
translate english s011_fuling_clinic_1_5ecd6231:

    # "年轻男子：“在。”"
    "The young man says, \"Here.\""

# game/script.rpy:2030
translate english s011_fuling_clinic_1_69e2f819:

    # zhouqingliu "你去把另外半把伞也撑上。"
    zhouqingliu "Go and hold the other half of the umbrella over it as well."

# game/script.rpy:2032
translate english s011_fuling_clinic_1_4f6553ab:

    # shenyun "哦。"
    shenyun "Oh."

# game/script.rpy:2034
translate english s011_fuling_clinic_1_04a97692:

    # "沈云这才注意到你。"
    "Only then does Shen Yun notice you."

# game/script.rpy:2036
translate english s011_fuling_clinic_1_b04b618d:

    # shenyun "咦，外乡人？"
    shenyun "Oh? Outsiders?"

# game/script.rpy:2038
translate english s011_fuling_clinic_1_a3eeb5e7:

    # zhouqingliu "今日第三个。"
    zhouqingliu "The third today."

# game/script.rpy:2040
translate english s011_fuling_clinic_1_b8d5b0fc:

    # shenyun "问丹的？"
    shenyun "Here to ask about the elixir?"

# game/script.rpy:2042
translate english s011_fuling_clinic_1_a3eeb5e7_1:

    # zhouqingliu "今日第三个。"
    zhouqingliu "The third today."

# game/script.rpy:2044
translate english s011_fuling_clinic_1_687e0b28:

    # "沈云看向你，笑得很自然。"
    "Shen Yun looks at you with an easy smile."

# game/script.rpy:2046
translate english s011_fuling_clinic_1_c52ee87d:

    # shenyun "那你问对人了，也问错人了。"
    shenyun "Then you have asked the right person—and the wrong one."

# game/script.rpy:2049
translate english s011_fuling_clinic_1_4ffdb174:

    # wangfang "什么意思？"
    wangfang "What do you mean?"

# game/script.rpy:2051
translate english s011_fuling_clinic_1_47a2d6ee:

    # zuowan "怎么说？"
    zuowan "How so?"

# game/script.rpy:2053
translate english s011_fuling_clinic_1_995a9ee4:

    # shenyun "问我师父，他会说药理。"
    shenyun "Ask my master, and he will speak of medicinal principles."

# game/script.rpy:2055
translate english s011_fuling_clinic_1_54030ec4:

    # shenyun "问徐掌柜，她会说人心。"
    shenyun "Ask Manager Xu, and she will speak of people's hearts."

# game/script.rpy:2057
translate english s011_fuling_clinic_1_a7441302:

    # "周青柳看了他一眼。"
    "Zhou Qingliu gives him a look."

# game/script.rpy:2059
translate english s011_fuling_clinic_1_4792c7f2:

    # zhouqingliu "你先去救那半筐草。"
    zhouqingliu "Go save that half-basket of herbs first."

# game/script.rpy:2061
translate english s011_fuling_clinic_1_fee6b21a:

    # "沈云立刻抱着草药往后院跑。"
    "Shen Yun immediately runs to the rear courtyard with the herbs."

# game/script.rpy:2063
translate english s011_fuling_clinic_1_d401b008:

    # "周青柳向你略一点头。"
    "Zhou Qingliu gives you a slight nod."

# game/script.rpy:2065
translate english s011_fuling_clinic_1_0540b364:

    # zhouqingliu "若还有疑问，日后再问。"
    zhouqingliu "If you have more questions, ask another day."

# game/script.rpy:2067
translate english s011_fuling_clinic_1_ad127400:

    # zhouqingliu "今日医馆不算闲。"
    zhouqingliu "The clinic is not exactly idle today."

# game/script.rpy:2069
translate english s011_fuling_clinic_1_932efc27:

    # "你知道自己不好继续打扰，便退到一旁，准备在医馆里简单看看。"
    "Knowing you should not disturb him further, you step aside to look around the clinic."

# game/script.rpy:2084
translate english s012_fuling_clinic_2_c39d0b44:

    # "你在医馆前厅慢慢走了一圈。"
    "You slowly make a circuit of the clinic's front hall."

# game/script.rpy:2086
translate english s012_fuling_clinic_2_6b6ebd41:

    # "这里不像飞鸿驿站那样每个人都在大声说话。"
    "This place is unlike Feihong Post Station, where everyone speaks loudly."

# game/script.rpy:2088
translate english s012_fuling_clinic_2_8a97f5c1:

    # "可只要细看，就会发现每个人都在忙。"
    "But a closer look shows that everyone is busy."

# game/script.rpy:2090
translate english s012_fuling_clinic_2_9a9dae5e:

    # "诊室帘后，一个女人的声音传出来，冷而利。"
    "From behind a consultation-room curtain comes a woman's cold, sharp voice."

# game/script.rpy:2092
translate english s012_fuling_clinic_2_6953abca:

    # chensumei "我说过七日忌酒。"
    chensumei "I said no wine for seven days."

# game/script.rpy:2094
translate english s012_fuling_clinic_2_e1dfe190:

    # bingren "陈大夫，我就喝了一小口。"
    bingren "Healer Chen, I only took one small sip."

# game/script.rpy:2096
translate english s012_fuling_clinic_2_277994ca:

    # chensumei "你的脉象不像一小口。"
    chensumei "Your pulse does not feel like one small sip."

# game/script.rpy:2098
translate english s012_fuling_clinic_2_b7e9b98c:

    # bingren "那是因为杯子大。"
    bingren "That is because the cup was large."

# game/script.rpy:2100
translate english s012_fuling_clinic_2_a3016e41:

    # chensumei "你再顶嘴，我就按十日治。"
    chensumei "Talk back again and I shall prescribe ten days."

# game/script.rpy:2102
translate english s012_fuling_clinic_2_e94e932e:

    # "帘外几个病人立刻坐直了些。"
    "Several patients outside the curtain immediately sit a little straighter."

# game/script.rpy:2104
translate english s012_fuling_clinic_2_ede073a6:

    # "药柜旁，一个年轻学徒正抱着书，一边看一边走。"
    "Beside the medicine cabinets, a young apprentice walks while reading a book."

# game/script.rpy:2106
translate english s012_fuling_clinic_2_319e285d:

    # "他看得太认真，差点撞到药柜。"
    "He is reading so intently that he nearly walks into a cabinet."

# game/script.rpy:2108
translate english s012_fuling_clinic_2_c61fd8b2:

    # shenxingchen "对不起。"
    shenxingchen "My apologies."

# game/script.rpy:2110
translate english s012_fuling_clinic_2_d127551d:

    # "药柜当然没有回答。"
    "The medicine cabinet does not answer, of course."

# game/script.rpy:2112
translate english s012_fuling_clinic_2_5a9dba84:

    # "他却认真地向药柜点了点头，又继续看书。"
    "Yet he earnestly nods to it and continues reading."

# game/script.rpy:2114
translate english s012_fuling_clinic_2_e0bc1cfe:

    # "窗边有一名女子正在饮茶。"
    "A woman drinks tea by the window."

# game/script.rpy:2116
translate english s012_fuling_clinic_2_55bb9b70:

    # "她衣着利落，神情沉稳，杯子还没放下，目光已经扫过前厅每一个角落。"
    "Her clothing is neat and her manner composed; before setting down her cup, her gaze has already swept every corner of the hall."

# game/script.rpy:2118
translate english s012_fuling_clinic_2_f507e4df:

    # "有病人家属想挤到前面，她只抬了一下眼。"
    "When a patient's family member tries to push forward, she merely lifts her eyes."

# game/script.rpy:2120
translate english s012_fuling_clinic_2_26f09bcb:

    # chengmingzhu "排队。"
    chengmingzhu "Queue."

# game/script.rpy:2122
translate english s012_fuling_clinic_2_d507cc7e:

    # "那人立刻退了回去。"
    "The person immediately steps back."

# game/script.rpy:2124
translate english s012_fuling_clinic_2_5d38e90d:

    # "后门阴影里，站着一个沉默的男人。"
    "A silent man stands in the shadows by the rear door."

# game/script.rpy:2126
translate english s012_fuling_clinic_2_d0bb7a9d:

    # "他手中握着刀，衣着朴素，几乎不出声。"
    "He grips a blade, wears plain clothes, and hardly makes a sound."

# game/script.rpy:2128
translate english s012_fuling_clinic_2_cf317e06:

    # "可你一眼便觉得，他不像普通护院。"
    "Yet at a glance, you know he is no ordinary guard."

# game/script.rpy:2130
translate english s012_fuling_clinic_2_457a95b2:

    # "他似乎注意到你在看他。"
    "He seems to notice you looking at him."

# game/script.rpy:2132
translate english s012_fuling_clinic_2_86562ef0:

    # "李默抬眼。"
    "Li Mo raises his eyes."

# game/script.rpy:2134
translate english s012_fuling_clinic_2_a9ef852f:

    # "你立刻移开目光。"
    "You immediately look away."

# game/script.rpy:2136
translate english s012_fuling_clinic_2_818a758a:

    # "片刻后，沈云从后院回来，手里已经没有那半筐草药。"
    "Soon after, Shen Yun returns from the rear courtyard, no longer carrying the half-basket of herbs."

# game/script.rpy:2138
translate english s012_fuling_clinic_2_6d67b335:

    # shenyun "救回来了。"
    shenyun "Saved them."

# game/script.rpy:2140
translate english s012_fuling_clinic_2_6983b45b:

    # zhouqingliu "草救回来了？"
    zhouqingliu "The herbs are saved?"

# game/script.rpy:2142
translate english s012_fuling_clinic_2_ab9d95e8:

    # shenyun "伞救回来了。草还要看命。"
    shenyun "The umbrella is saved. The herbs' fate is still uncertain."

# game/script.rpy:2144
translate english s012_fuling_clinic_2_78de0195:

    # zhouqingliu "你离药材远一点，就是它们最大的命。"
    zhouqingliu "Their greatest good fortune would be for you to stay farther from medicinal materials."

# game/script.rpy:2146
translate english s012_fuling_clinic_2_0962bc07:

    # "沈云笑了一下，似乎一点也不介意。"
    "Shen Yun smiles, seemingly not offended at all."

# game/script.rpy:2148
translate english s012_fuling_clinic_2_f57e0fac:

    # "他看见你还在医馆，便凑近一些。"
    "Seeing you are still in the clinic, he comes a little closer."

# game/script.rpy:2150
translate english s012_fuling_clinic_2_c02a8648:

    # shenyun "你还没走啊？"
    shenyun "You have not left yet?"

# game/script.rpy:2153
translate english s012_fuling_clinic_2_8d691994:

    # wangfang "我只是看看。医馆和驿站很不一样。"
    wangfang "I am only looking around. The clinic is very different from the post station."

# game/script.rpy:2155
translate english s012_fuling_clinic_2_4ea43263:

    # zuowan "这里比我想的更忙。"
    zuowan "It is busier here than I expected."

# game/script.rpy:2157
translate english s012_fuling_clinic_2_488cf294:

    # shenyun "那当然。"
    shenyun "Of course it is."

# game/script.rpy:2159
translate english s012_fuling_clinic_2_3ee6c59e:

    # shenyun "驿站是人没地方去，医馆是人没办法了才来。"
    shenyun "People come to a post station when they have nowhere to go; they come to a clinic when they have no other way."

# game/script.rpy:2161
translate english s012_fuling_clinic_2_d480b728:

    # "他这话说得轻，却不轻浮。"
    "He says it lightly, but not carelessly."

# game/script.rpy:2163
translate english s012_fuling_clinic_2_c27295f3:

    # "你正想再问些什么，诊室帘后忽然传来陈素梅的声音。"
    "Just as you are about to ask more, Chen Sumei's voice suddenly comes from behind the consultation curtain."

# game/script.rpy:2165
translate english s012_fuling_clinic_2_ee70d790:

    # chensumei "沈云。"
    chensumei "Shen Yun."

# game/script.rpy:2167
translate english s012_fuling_clinic_2_96420a22:

    # "沈云立刻站直。"
    "Shen Yun immediately stands straight."

# game/script.rpy:2169
translate english s012_fuling_clinic_2_33fd8f79:

    # shenyun "在！"
    shenyun "Here!"

# game/script.rpy:2171
translate english s012_fuling_clinic_2_61175df5:

    # chensumei "去后院拿干净布巾。不要拿晒药那块。"
    chensumei "Fetch clean cloths from the rear courtyard. Do not take the ones for drying herbs."

# game/script.rpy:2173
translate english s012_fuling_clinic_2_20085109:

    # shenyun "知道！"
    shenyun "Understood!"

# game/script.rpy:2175
translate english s012_fuling_clinic_2_7901d943:

    # "他冲你摆摆手。"
    "He waves to you."

# game/script.rpy:2177
translate english s012_fuling_clinic_2_862654c7:

    # shenyun "你若还在镇上，回头再聊。"
    shenyun "If you are still in town later, we can talk again."

# game/script.rpy:2179
translate english s012_fuling_clinic_2_09c333bb:

    # "说完，他又跑向后院。"
    "With that, he runs toward the rear courtyard again."

# game/script.rpy:2181
translate english s012_fuling_clinic_2_9971ca67:

    # "你向周青柳道谢，准备离开医馆。"
    "You thank Zhou Qingliu and prepare to leave the clinic."

# game/script.rpy:2183
translate english s012_fuling_clinic_2_74158c1d:

    # "临走前，你再次看见李默站在后门阴影里。"
    "Before you leave, you again see Li Mo standing in the rear door's shadows."

# game/script.rpy:2185
translate english s012_fuling_clinic_2_3391c5ef:

    # "他没有拦你，也没有说话。"
    "He neither stops you nor speaks."

# game/script.rpy:2187
translate english s012_fuling_clinic_2_cd7dc56d:

    # "但你莫名觉得，只要有人想从后门闯进医馆，第一步就会被他看见。"
    "But you feel that if anyone tried to force their way into the clinic through the back door, he would see their first step."

# game/script.rpy:2189
translate english s012_fuling_clinic_2_ac5892ff:

    # "你走出茯苓医馆，回到风云坪。"
    "You leave Fuling Clinic and return to Fengyun Square."

# game/script.rpy:2193
translate english s012_fuling_clinic_2_0fdef7d0:

    # "夕阳渐低，风云坪上的人影被拉得很长。"
    "The sun sinks lower, stretching long shadows across Fengyun Square."

# game/script.rpy:2195
translate english s012_fuling_clinic_2_d8abd3af:

    # "你在镇中闲逛了一阵，看见形形色色的镇民、江湖人士和商铺招牌。"
    "You wander the town a while, seeing all kinds of townsfolk, jianghu people, and shop signs."

# game/script.rpy:2197
translate english s012_fuling_clinic_2_cc885f05:

    # "等到天色慢慢暗下来，你忽然意识到一个很现实的问题。"
    "As the sky gradually darkens, a very practical problem suddenly occurs to you."

# game/script.rpy:2199
translate english s012_fuling_clinic_2_df38a5db:

    # "今晚，你还没有住处。"
    "You have nowhere to stay tonight."

# game/script.rpy:2201
translate english s012_fuling_clinic_2_33a8af33:

    # "飞鸿驿站人来人往，或许还能问问魏三儿有没有空房。"
    "Feihong Post Station is full of comings and goings; perhaps Wei San'er still has a vacant room."

# game/script.rpy:2203
translate english s012_fuling_clinic_2_4260a7c4:

    # "你转身，向飞鸿驿站走去。"
    "You turn and head for Feihong Post Station."

# game/script.rpy:2217
translate english s013_guo_luping_invite_108f93ec:

    # "夕色渐深，风云坪上的人声却没有立刻散去。"
    "Dusk deepens, but the voices at Fengyun Square do not fade at once."

# game/script.rpy:2219
translate english s013_guo_luping_invite_33021181:

    # "长风楼方向已经点起灯，飞鸿驿站门口仍有人牵马、搬箱、问房。"
    "Lamps are already lit toward Changfeng House, while people still lead horses, carry chests, and ask for rooms outside Feihong Post Station."

# game/script.rpy:2221
translate english s013_guo_luping_invite_ad83de40:

    # "你走回飞鸿驿站门前。"
    "You return to the entrance of Feihong Post Station."

# game/script.rpy:2225
translate english s013_guo_luping_invite_c0101689:

    # "魏三儿正把一块写着“满”的木牌挂到门边。"
    "Wei San'er is hanging a wooden sign marked \"Full\" beside the door."

# game/script.rpy:2227
translate english s013_guo_luping_invite_79f19787:

    # "她一转头，看见你又回来了。"
    "When she turns, she sees you have returned."

# game/script.rpy:2229
translate english s013_guo_luping_invite_304b8e6c:

    # weisaner "哟，又是你。"
    weisaner "Oh, you again."

# game/script.rpy:2232
translate english s013_guo_luping_invite_16c16e7a:

    # wangfang "我想问问，还有没有空房？"
    wangfang "I want to ask whether there are any vacant rooms."

# game/script.rpy:2234
translate english s013_guo_luping_invite_867f62bf:

    # zuowan "我想问问，今晚还有房吗？"
    zuowan "May I ask whether you have a room for tonight?"

# game/script.rpy:2236
translate english s013_guo_luping_invite_5748e012:

    # "魏三儿看了看那块木牌，又看了看你。"
    "Wei San'er looks at the sign, then at you."

# game/script.rpy:2238
translate english s013_guo_luping_invite_8cfd3ce2:

    # weisaner "你问得很有勇气。"
    weisaner "That is a brave question."

# game/script.rpy:2240
translate english s013_guo_luping_invite_90367187:

    # weisaner "但勇气不能变出房。"
    weisaner "But bravery cannot conjure a room."

# game/script.rpy:2243
translate english s013_guo_luping_invite_f8cedc61:

    # wangfang "一点位置都没有？柴房也行。"
    wangfang "Not even a little space? A woodshed would do."

# game/script.rpy:2245
translate english s013_guo_luping_invite_07fea71e:

    # zuowan "临时歇脚的地方也没有？"
    zuowan "Not even somewhere to rest for the night?"

# game/script.rpy:2247
translate english s013_guo_luping_invite_0d9e1597:

    # "魏三儿摊手。"
    "Wei San'er spreads her hands."

# game/script.rpy:2249
translate english s013_guo_luping_invite_3227e6de:

    # weisaner "前头客房满了，通铺满了，连马夫铺都快住人了。"
    weisaner "The guest rooms are full, the shared bunks are full, and even the grooms' quarters are nearly occupied."

# game/script.rpy:2251
translate english s013_guo_luping_invite_cde14bff:

    # "她顿了顿，目光落在你身上。"
    "She pauses, her gaze settling on you."

# game/script.rpy:2253
translate english s013_guo_luping_invite_87cf1f8c:

    # weisaner "你身上还有多少钱？"
    weisaner "How much money do you still have?"

# game/script.rpy:2256
translate english s013_guo_luping_invite_22a407a5:

    # wangfang "不多。"
    wangfang "Not much."

# game/script.rpy:2258
translate english s013_guo_luping_invite_4686f3e5:

    # zuowan "够吃几顿，不够长期住店。"
    zuowan "Enough for a few meals, not enough to lodge for long."

# game/script.rpy:2260
translate english s013_guo_luping_invite_38fb4686:

    # "魏三儿笑了一下。"
    "Wei San'er smiles."

# game/script.rpy:2262
translate english s013_guo_luping_invite_83d964c9:

    # weisaner "那你倒是诚实。"
    weisaner "At least you are honest."

# game/script.rpy:2265
translate english s013_guo_luping_invite_6e55c04b:

    # wangfang "驿站招帮工吗？我可以跑腿，搬东西，送信也行。"
    wangfang "Does the post station hire hands? I can run errands, carry things, or deliver letters."

# game/script.rpy:2267
translate english s013_guo_luping_invite_4274ada8:

    # zuowan "如果驿站缺人，我可以帮忙。跑腿、传话、照看行李，都可以。"
    zuowan "If the post station needs help, I can assist. I can run errands, carry messages, or watch luggage."

# game/script.rpy:2269
translate english s013_guo_luping_invite_bac0a091:

    # "魏三儿没有立刻回答。"
    "Wei San'er does not answer immediately."

# game/script.rpy:2271
translate english s013_guo_luping_invite_6497a64a:

    # "她朝前厅里看了一眼。"
    "She glances into the front hall."

# game/script.rpy:2273
translate english s013_guo_luping_invite_23783fb4:

    # weisaner "这我可说了不算。"
    weisaner "That is not mine to decide."

# game/script.rpy:2275
translate english s013_guo_luping_invite_ef088d42:

    # weisaner "你等一下。"
    weisaner "Wait here."

# game/script.rpy:2277
translate english s013_guo_luping_invite_878b94fb:

    # "她转身进了驿站。"
    "She turns and enters the post station."

# game/script.rpy:2279
translate english s013_guo_luping_invite_77ad40cb:

    # "你站在门外，听见里面仍旧忙乱。"
    "You stand outside, hearing the continued bustle within."

# game/script.rpy:2281
translate english s013_guo_luping_invite_4984a5f3:

    # "有人催饭，有人问马，有人和方大娘争论一碗汤到底算不算免费。"
    "Someone presses for food, someone asks after a horse, and someone argues with Auntie Fang over whether a bowl of soup is free."

# game/script.rpy:2289
translate english s013_guo_luping_invite_a23891ac:

    # "没过多久，魏三儿从里面出来。"
    "Before long, Wei San'er comes back out."

# game/script.rpy:2291
translate english s013_guo_luping_invite_db22bf76:

    # "她身后跟着一名中年男子。"
    "A middle-aged man follows behind her."

# game/script.rpy:2293
translate english s013_guo_luping_invite_37a43aa7:

    # "那人四十多岁，衣着不华贵，却很整洁。眉眼温和，神情沉稳，像是站在那里便能让驿站稍微安静一点。"
    "He is in his forties, plainly but very neatly dressed. Gentle-eyed and composed, he seems able to quiet the post station merely by standing there."

# game/script.rpy:2295
translate english s013_guo_luping_invite_adc3a68b:

    # weisaner "郭总管，就是这位。"
    weisaner "Manager Guo, this is the one."

# game/script.rpy:2297
translate english s013_guo_luping_invite_10a5a389:

    # "郭路平看向你。"
    "Guo Luping looks at you."

# game/script.rpy:2299
translate english s013_guo_luping_invite_07a0b9a3:

    # "那一瞬间，你忽然觉得他不是在看一个临时求住处的外乡人。"
    "In that instant, you feel he is not looking at an outsider merely seeking a place to stay."

# game/script.rpy:2301
translate english s013_guo_luping_invite_0acd175a:

    # "他像是在确认什么。"
    "He seems to be confirming something."

# game/script.rpy:2303
translate english s013_guo_luping_invite_20f1bcc7:

    # "像是你来得有些突然，又像是你来得并不意外。"
    "As though your arrival were both sudden and not unexpected."

# game/script.rpy:2305
translate english s013_guo_luping_invite_719c1fec:

    # guoluping "你是为雷云峰来的？"
    guoluping "You came for Leiyun Peak?"

# game/script.rpy:2308
translate english s013_guo_luping_invite_95b3d4f4:

    # wangfang "是。听说风雷观开炉炼丹，各路江湖人都来了。"
    wangfang "Yes. I heard Fenglei Abbey fired its furnace to refine an elixir, and jianghu people came from every direction."

# game/script.rpy:2310
translate english s013_guo_luping_invite_a401fdfa:

    # zuowan "是。长息定年丹牵涉药理与气脉，我想亲眼看看。"
    zuowan "Yes. The Long-Breath Age-Settling Elixir concerns medicinal principles and vital channels; I wanted to see for myself."

# game/script.rpy:2312
translate english s013_guo_luping_invite_219bb471:

    # "郭路平轻轻点头。"
    "Guo Luping gives a slight nod."

# game/script.rpy:2314
translate english s013_guo_luping_invite_c14426fe:

    # guoluping "最近为雷云峰而来的人很多。"
    guoluping "Many have come for Leiyun Peak lately."

# game/script.rpy:2316
translate english s013_guo_luping_invite_150247cd:

    # guoluping "但愿意先问有没有活干的人，不多。"
    guoluping "But few first ask whether there is work to be done."

# game/script.rpy:2318
translate english s013_guo_luping_invite_4d95f435:

    # "魏三儿在旁边补了一句。"
    "Wei San'er adds from beside him,"

# game/script.rpy:2320
translate english s013_guo_luping_invite_a0b61ebb:

    # weisaner "大多一开口就问上房，下一句问能不能赊账。"
    weisaner "Most ask for a superior room with their first breath, then ask for credit with their second."

# game/script.rpy:2322
translate english s013_guo_luping_invite_78cfffda:

    # "郭路平看了她一眼，魏三儿立刻闭嘴，眼睛却还在笑。"
    "Guo Luping looks at her. Wei San'er immediately falls silent, though her eyes are still smiling."

# game/script.rpy:2324
translate english s013_guo_luping_invite_530177ed:

    # "郭路平重新看向你。"
    "Guo Luping turns his gaze back to you."

# game/script.rpy:2326
translate english s013_guo_luping_invite_a9fc159c:

    # guoluping "前头客房满了。后头夹廊小院还有间北耳房，原是给信差歇脚的。"
    guoluping "The front guest rooms are full. In the small courtyard off the passage behind us, there is a north side room once used by couriers to rest."

# game/script.rpy:2328
translate english s013_guo_luping_invite_2a29f0df:

    # guoluping "你若不嫌窄，可以先住那儿。"
    guoluping "If you do not mind its narrowness, you may stay there for now."

# game/script.rpy:2330
translate english s013_guo_luping_invite_551971df:

    # guoluping "白日帮魏三儿跑腿，夜里别乱摸医馆的门。"
    guoluping "Help Wei San'er run errands by day, and do not meddle with the clinic's door at night."

# game/script.rpy:2333
translate english s013_guo_luping_invite_88050d2e:

    # wangfang "北耳房？在驿站后头？"
    wangfang "The north side room? Behind the post station?"

# game/script.rpy:2335
translate english s013_guo_luping_invite_b2446c70:

    # zuowan "夹廊小院？就是驿站和医馆之间的那处地方？"
    zuowan "The passage courtyard? The place between the post station and the clinic?"

# game/script.rpy:2337
translate english s013_guo_luping_invite_8571b048:

    # guoluping "北接飞鸿驿站，南通茯苓医馆。"
    guoluping "It joins Feihong Post Station to the north and Fuling Clinic to the south."

# game/script.rpy:2339
translate english s013_guo_luping_invite_34b71b92:

    # guoluping "那地方不是正经客房，也不对外放客。"
    guoluping "It is not a proper guest room, and it is not let to the public."

# game/script.rpy:2341
translate english s013_guo_luping_invite_2b326de9:

    # guoluping "住在那里，不算享福。哪边有事，哪边都可能喊你。"
    guoluping "Living there is no comfort. If either side needs something, either side may call for you."

# game/script.rpy:2343
translate english s013_guo_luping_invite_17de1c4e:

    # weisaner "简单说，就是睡得近，跑得快。"
    weisaner "Put simply: sleep close, run fast."

# game/script.rpy:2345
translate english s013_guo_luping_invite_2c5a3985:

    # guoluping "也可以这么说。"
    guoluping "That is one way to put it."

# game/script.rpy:2347
translate english s013_guo_luping_invite_4154bcba:

    # "你心里一动。"
    "Something stirs in your heart."

# game/script.rpy:2349
translate english s013_guo_luping_invite_010ea468:

    # "能有一个住处当然很好。"
    "Having somewhere to stay would certainly be welcome."

# game/script.rpy:2351
translate english s013_guo_luping_invite_53ae53c2:

    # "但你今日刚入镇，只在驿站与医馆各走了一圈。"
    "But you only entered town today and have visited the post station and clinic just once each."

# game/script.rpy:2353
translate english s013_guo_luping_invite_20d5bcc8:

    # "飞鸿驿站热闹、机灵、消息多，可茯苓医馆似乎也与长息定年丹更近。"
    "Feihong Post Station is lively, shrewd, and rich in news, but Fuling Clinic seems closer to the Long-Breath Age-Settling Elixir as well."

# game/script.rpy:2355
translate english s013_guo_luping_invite_1e79e30e:

    # "何况你还没问过医馆那边。"
    "Besides, you have not yet asked the clinic."

# game/script.rpy:2358
translate english s013_guo_luping_invite_c3cc4eb7:

    # wangfang "多谢郭总管。我能不能……再想想？"
    wangfang "Thank you, Manager Guo. May I... think it over a little longer?"

# game/script.rpy:2360
translate english s013_guo_luping_invite_fa3582b9:

    # zuowan "多谢郭总管。我想再考虑一下。"
    zuowan "Thank you, Manager Guo. I would like to consider it a little longer."

# game/script.rpy:2362
translate english s013_guo_luping_invite_b04d8ddd:

    # "郭路平并不意外。"
    "Guo Luping is not surprised."

# game/script.rpy:2364
translate english s013_guo_luping_invite_9a64ff07:

    # guoluping "可以。"
    guoluping "Certainly."

# game/script.rpy:2366
translate english s013_guo_luping_invite_65261bf0:

    # guoluping "今日天黑前给我答复。开庵镇夜里有宵禁，外乡人最好不要在街上乱走。"
    guoluping "Give me your answer before nightfall. Kaian Town has a curfew at night; outsiders would do well not to wander the streets."

# game/script.rpy:2368
translate english s013_guo_luping_invite_879901a2:

    # "魏三儿朝你摆了摆手。"
    "Wei San'er waves to you."

# game/script.rpy:2370
translate english s013_guo_luping_invite_eb02033b:

    # weisaner "想好了就回来。北耳房虽然窄，但至少不漏雨。"
    weisaner "Come back when you have decided. The north side room is narrow, but at least it does not leak in the rain."

# game/script.rpy:2372
translate english s013_guo_luping_invite_a4713401:

    # "她停了停。"
    "She pauses."

# game/script.rpy:2374
translate english s013_guo_luping_invite_c090e4c7:

    # weisaner "大概。"
    weisaner "Probably."

# game/script.rpy:2376
translate english s013_guo_luping_invite_1ff469e6:

    # "你离开飞鸿驿站门口。"
    "You leave the entrance of Feihong Post Station."

# game/script.rpy:2380
translate english s013_guo_luping_invite_abaff3f2:

    # "刚走到风云坪边，便听见身后有人喊你。"
    "Just as you reach the edge of Fengyun Square, someone calls after you."

# game/script.rpy:2382
translate english s013_guo_luping_invite_8cc346e5:

    # "回头一看，是白日在茯苓医馆见过的沈云。"
    "You turn to see Shen Yun, whom you met at Fuling Clinic during the day."

# game/script.rpy:2384
translate english s013_guo_luping_invite_4b0b48d0:

    # "沈云站在医馆门口，朝你招手。"
    "Shen Yun stands at the clinic entrance, waving you over."

# game/script.rpy:2386
translate english s013_guo_luping_invite_81d033a9:

    # shenyun "你还没找到住处吧？"
    shenyun "You have not found a place to stay yet, have you?"

# game/script.rpy:2400
translate english s014_xu_chunxiang_invite_81043940:

    # "你走向茯苓医馆。"
    "You walk toward Fuling Clinic."

# game/script.rpy:2402
translate english s014_xu_chunxiang_invite_6eadbc2d:

    # "此时医馆前厅比白日安静一些，但药炉仍在小火上煨着。"
    "The clinic's front hall is quieter than by day, but the medicine furnace still simmers over a low fire."

# game/script.rpy:2404
translate english s014_xu_chunxiang_invite_ac394a5b:

    # "沈云把你引到门边，压低声音。"
    "Shen Yun leads you to the doorway and lowers his voice."

# game/script.rpy:2406
translate english s014_xu_chunxiang_invite_a59bd7f1:

    # shenyun "我刚才听魏三儿说你在找住处。"
    shenyun "I just heard Wei San'er say you were looking for a place to stay."

# game/script.rpy:2409
translate english s014_xu_chunxiang_invite_e4ae87e2:

    # wangfang "她嘴这么快？"
    wangfang "Her mouth is that quick?"

# game/script.rpy:2411
translate english s014_xu_chunxiang_invite_ebc6440a:

    # zuowan "她消息传得倒快。"
    zuowan "Her news travels quickly."

# game/script.rpy:2413
translate english s014_xu_chunxiang_invite_39bce2e2:

    # shenyun "驿站和医馆隔得近，魏三儿声音又不小。"
    shenyun "The post station and clinic are close together, and Wei San'er's voice is not quiet."

# game/script.rpy:2415
translate english s014_xu_chunxiang_invite_59dd78ab:

    # "他笑了笑。"
    "He smiles."

# game/script.rpy:2417
translate english s014_xu_chunxiang_invite_a34df309:

    # shenyun "你先别急着谢我，我只是替徐掌柜叫你。"
    shenyun "Do not thank me yet. I only called you over for Manager Xu."

# game/script.rpy:2419
translate english s014_xu_chunxiang_invite_dd265465:

    # "话音刚落，诊桌旁的帘子被轻轻掀开。"
    "As he finishes, the curtain beside the consultation desk is gently lifted."

# game/script.rpy:2426
translate english s014_xu_chunxiang_invite_17677ff9:

    # "一名中年女子走了出来。"
    "A middle-aged woman steps out."

# game/script.rpy:2428
translate english s014_xu_chunxiang_invite_ec47ea5e:

    # "她约莫四十多岁，神情温和，却不是软弱的温和。"
    "She is around forty, gentle in manner but not weakly so."

# game/script.rpy:2430
translate english s014_xu_chunxiang_invite_a7cf368a:

    # "她看人时很稳，像是先看见你的疲惫，再看见你的来意。"
    "Her gaze is steady, as though she sees your weariness before she sees your purpose."

# game/script.rpy:2432
translate english s014_xu_chunxiang_invite_d7ca4240:

    # shenyun "徐掌柜，这就是白日来问定年丹的那位。"
    shenyun "Manager Xu, this is the one who came to ask about the Age-Settling Elixir today."

# game/script.rpy:2434
translate english s014_xu_chunxiang_invite_b9cb9649:

    # "徐春香看向你。"
    "Xu Chunxiang looks at you."

# game/script.rpy:2436
translate english s014_xu_chunxiang_invite_4a26771c:

    # xuchunxiang "周药师跟我提过你。"
    xuchunxiang "Apothecary Zhou mentioned you to me."

# game/script.rpy:2439
translate english s014_xu_chunxiang_invite_ef0c4a47:

    # wangfang "徐掌柜。"
    wangfang "Manager Xu."

# game/script.rpy:2441
translate english s014_xu_chunxiang_invite_d39e3d2d:

    # zuowan "徐掌柜。"
    zuowan "Manager Xu."

# game/script.rpy:2443
translate english s014_xu_chunxiang_invite_bce2e969:

    # xuchunxiang "你是外地来开庵镇看雷云峰热闹的？"
    xuchunxiang "You came from elsewhere to Kaian Town to see the excitement around Leiyun Peak?"

# game/script.rpy:2446
translate english s014_xu_chunxiang_invite_9747944d:

    # wangfang "一开始是想看看江湖热闹。"
    wangfang "At first, I wanted to see the excitement of the jianghu."

# game/script.rpy:2447
translate english s014_xu_chunxiang_invite_146bb2ac:

    # wangfang "但今日走了一圈，觉得这件事可能没那么简单。"
    wangfang "But after walking around today, I feel this may not be so simple."

# game/script.rpy:2449
translate english s014_xu_chunxiang_invite_810623bf:

    # zuowan "我想看清长息定年丹到底牵涉什么。"
    zuowan "I want to see clearly what the Long-Breath Age-Settling Elixir truly involves."

# game/script.rpy:2450
translate english s014_xu_chunxiang_invite_f3cd5b4d:

    # zuowan "今日听周药师说过之后，更觉得此事不只是传言。"
    zuowan "After hearing Apothecary Zhou today, I feel even more that this is not merely rumor."

# game/script.rpy:2452
translate english s014_xu_chunxiang_invite_da4f3043:

    # "徐春香点了点头。"
    "Xu Chunxiang nods."

# game/script.rpy:2454
translate english s014_xu_chunxiang_invite_e448b0f3:

    # xuchunxiang "知道事情不简单，还愿意承认自己初来乍到，这不坏。"
    xuchunxiang "Knowing the matter is not simple and still admitting you have only just arrived—that is not a bad thing."

# game/script.rpy:2456
translate english s014_xu_chunxiang_invite_2fffc5ca:

    # "沈云在旁边小声说："
    "Shen Yun says softly from beside you,"

# game/script.rpy:2458
translate english s014_xu_chunxiang_invite_34374e75:

    # shenyun "徐掌柜这句话，是夸人。"
    shenyun "That was Manager Xu praising you."

# game/script.rpy:2460
translate english s014_xu_chunxiang_invite_64c0d614:

    # "徐春香看了他一眼。"
    "Xu Chunxiang gives him a look."

# game/script.rpy:2462
translate english s014_xu_chunxiang_invite_96420a22:

    # "沈云立刻站直。"
    "Shen Yun immediately stands straight."

# game/script.rpy:2464
translate english s014_xu_chunxiang_invite_646ae2c1:

    # "徐春香重新看向你。"
    "Xu Chunxiang looks back to you."

# game/script.rpy:2466
translate english s014_xu_chunxiang_invite_56599f6a:

    # xuchunxiang "医馆不留闲人。"
    xuchunxiang "The clinic does not keep idle hands."

# game/script.rpy:2468
translate english s014_xu_chunxiang_invite_3018e1cd:

    # xuchunxiang "但今夜伤者多，药炉不能停，后院也缺人搭手。"
    xuchunxiang "But there are many injured tonight, the medicine furnace cannot stop, and the rear courtyard needs help as well."

# game/script.rpy:2470
translate english s014_xu_chunxiang_invite_96fb31a1:

    # xuchunxiang "夹廊小院南边有间南耳房，原是给采药人歇脚的。"
    xuchunxiang "On the south side of the passage courtyard is a south side room once used by herb gatherers to rest."

# game/script.rpy:2472
translate english s014_xu_chunxiang_invite_df4ce07f:

    # xuchunxiang "你若愿意帮忙煎药、搬药、传话，就先住下。"
    xuchunxiang "If you are willing to decoct medicine, carry herbs, and relay messages, you may stay there for now."

# game/script.rpy:2475
translate english s014_xu_chunxiang_invite_03938c99:

    # wangfang "我不懂医术。"
    wangfang "I do not know medicine."

# game/script.rpy:2477
translate english s014_xu_chunxiang_invite_f06847a1:

    # zuowan "我懂一些草药，但未必懂医馆规矩。"
    zuowan "I know something of herbs, but not necessarily the clinic's rules."

# game/script.rpy:2479
translate english s014_xu_chunxiang_invite_7f7e4966:

    # xuchunxiang "不懂医术，可以学着别添乱。"
    xuchunxiang "If you do not know medicine, learn at least not to make trouble."

# game/script.rpy:2481
translate english s014_xu_chunxiang_invite_bef9b430:

    # xuchunxiang "懂草药，也要先学规矩。"
    xuchunxiang "Even if you know herbs, you must first learn the rules."

# game/script.rpy:2483
translate english s014_xu_chunxiang_invite_84cbe0e3:

    # "她语气不重，却让人知道这不是客套。"
    "Her tone is not harsh, but it makes clear that this is not empty courtesy."

# game/script.rpy:2485
translate english s014_xu_chunxiang_invite_2cc6e9da:

    # xuchunxiang "医馆救人，不靠一腔热血，也不靠几句聪明话。"
    xuchunxiang "A clinic saves lives not through hot blood or a few clever words."

# game/script.rpy:2487
translate english s014_xu_chunxiang_invite_1e982925:

    # xuchunxiang "真想留下，先从把药端稳开始。"
    xuchunxiang "If you truly wish to stay, begin by carrying medicine steadily."

# game/script.rpy:2489
translate english s014_xu_chunxiang_invite_91c55477:

    # "沈云在旁边接话。"
    "Shen Yun chimes in from beside you."

# game/script.rpy:2491
translate english s014_xu_chunxiang_invite_5ce1737e:

    # shenyun "南耳房比北耳房安静一点。"
    shenyun "The south side room is a little quieter than the north one."

# game/script.rpy:2493
translate english s014_xu_chunxiang_invite_29747cdc:

    # "他想了想，又补一句。"
    "He thinks, then adds,"

# game/script.rpy:2495
translate english s014_xu_chunxiang_invite_dba85988:

    # shenyun "不过半夜有人敲门叫药的时候，也安静不到哪儿去。"
    shenyun "Though it is not very quiet when someone knocks at midnight calling for medicine."

# game/script.rpy:2497
translate english s014_xu_chunxiang_invite_336142e6:

    # "你看向医馆后方。"
    "You look toward the rear of the clinic."

# game/script.rpy:2499
translate english s014_xu_chunxiang_invite_300af2df:

    # "那里有淡淡药香，有人低声咳嗽，也有人在帘后收拾针具。"
    "There is a faint scent of herbs, someone coughing softly, and someone putting away needles behind a curtain."

# game/script.rpy:2501
translate english s014_xu_chunxiang_invite_4c1503a6:

    # "与飞鸿驿站相比，茯苓医馆少了些热闹，却多了一种让人不敢轻浮的安定。"
    "Compared with Feihong Post Station, Fuling Clinic has less bustle but a steadiness that makes one reluctant to be frivolous."

# game/script.rpy:2503
translate english s014_xu_chunxiang_invite_856a4782:

    # "徐春香没有催你。"
    "Xu Chunxiang does not press you."

# game/script.rpy:2505
translate english s014_xu_chunxiang_invite_c5f8c334:

    # xuchunxiang "驿站那边，郭路平应该也给了你话。"
    xuchunxiang "Guo Luping at the post station must have made you an offer as well."

# game/script.rpy:2507
translate english s014_xu_chunxiang_invite_9255c4ae:

    # "你一怔。"
    "You are taken aback."

# game/script.rpy:2509
translate english s014_xu_chunxiang_invite_ea0acbd3:

    # xuchunxiang "飞鸿驿站与茯苓医馆门挨着门。开庵镇这么小，话传得比药香还快。"
    xuchunxiang "Feihong Post Station and Fuling Clinic stand door to door. In a town as small as Kaian, words travel faster than the scent of herbs."

# game/script.rpy:2511
translate english s014_xu_chunxiang_invite_8f7cc23d:

    # "她淡淡一笑。"
    "She smiles faintly."

# game/script.rpy:2513
translate english s014_xu_chunxiang_invite_c428a103:

    # xuchunxiang "你不用急着答应我，也不用急着答应他。"
    xuchunxiang "You need not hurry to answer me, nor need you hurry to answer him."

# game/script.rpy:2515
translate english s014_xu_chunxiang_invite_33db631f:

    # xuchunxiang "天黑前想清楚就好。"
    xuchunxiang "It is enough to decide before nightfall."

# game/script.rpy:2518
translate english s014_xu_chunxiang_invite_7793d8f1:

    # wangfang "多谢徐掌柜。我会认真想。"
    wangfang "Thank you, Manager Xu. I will consider it carefully."

# game/script.rpy:2520
translate english s014_xu_chunxiang_invite_e9cd98a1:

    # zuowan "多谢徐掌柜。我会想清楚。"
    zuowan "Thank you, Manager Xu. I will think it through."

# game/script.rpy:2522
translate english s014_xu_chunxiang_invite_44c93855:

    # "徐春香点头。"
    "Xu Chunxiang nods."

# game/script.rpy:2526
translate english s014_xu_chunxiang_invite_e39a599f:

    # "沈云送你到门口。"
    "Shen Yun sees you to the door."

# game/script.rpy:2528
translate english s014_xu_chunxiang_invite_5427ff8c:

    # shenyun "你若选医馆，我以后带你认药。"
    shenyun "If you choose the clinic, I will teach you the herbs later."

# game/script.rpy:2530
translate english s014_xu_chunxiang_invite_b347fc85:

    # shenyun "不过有些药我也认不全，到时我们一起挨骂。"
    shenyun "Though I do not recognize every medicine myself, so perhaps we will be scolded together."

# game/script.rpy:2532
translate english s014_xu_chunxiang_invite_9254d8b9:

    # "你忍不住笑了一下。"
    "You cannot help smiling."

# game/script.rpy:2534
translate english s014_xu_chunxiang_invite_56523ba8:

    # "走出茯苓医馆时，天色已经更暗。"
    "When you leave Fuling Clinic, the sky is darker still."

# game/script.rpy:2538
translate english s014_xu_chunxiang_invite_052cf27a:

    # "飞鸿驿站的灯亮了，茯苓医馆的药炉也亮着。"
    "The lamps of Feihong Post Station are lit, and Fuling Clinic's medicine furnace is glowing too."

# game/script.rpy:2540
translate english s014_xu_chunxiang_invite_19403893:

    # "两处灯火一北一南，都照向夹廊小院。"
    "The lights to the north and south both shine toward the passage courtyard."

# game/script.rpy:2542
translate english s014_xu_chunxiang_invite_88b9bc46:

    # "你站在永乐大街边，忽然觉得自己不能再拖。"
    "Standing beside Yongle Street, you suddenly feel you cannot delay any longer."

# game/script.rpy:2544
translate english s014_xu_chunxiang_invite_26be40f6:

    # "今晚必须有一个落脚处。"
    "Tonight, you must find somewhere to stay."

# game/script.rpy:2557
translate english s015_choose_base_place_764b7e1d:

    # "暮色中的永乐大街，比白日安静了一些。"
    "Yongle Street is quieter at dusk than it was by day."

# game/script.rpy:2559
translate english s015_choose_base_place_2f254d66:

    # "风云坪上仍有人来往，但远处已经传来巡捕催人收摊的声音。"
    "People still pass through Fengyun Square, but in the distance patrol officers are already calling for stalls to close."

# game/script.rpy:2561
translate english s015_choose_base_place_00fb1e36:

    # "你站在街边，心里反复想着今日见过的人。"
    "You stand by the street, turning over in your mind the people you met today."

# game/script.rpy:2563
translate english s015_choose_base_place_2d24fc0a:

    # "飞鸿驿站。"
    "Feihong Post Station."

# game/script.rpy:2565
translate english s015_choose_base_place_b3cfd4d0:

    # "魏三儿嘴快机灵，郭路平稳重识人。"
    "Wei San'er is quick-witted and quick-tongued; Guo Luping is steady and reads people well."

# game/script.rpy:2567
translate english s015_choose_base_place_eaa7cff9:

    # "驿站人来人往，消息最多，也最像江湖入口。"
    "People come and go at the post station. It holds the most news, and feels most like an entrance to the jianghu."

# game/script.rpy:2569
translate english s015_choose_base_place_c7bbebf5:

    # "若留在那里，白日跑腿、传信、接待客人，或许能最快认识开庵镇的江湖人。"
    "If you stay there, running errands, carrying messages, and receiving guests by day may be the fastest way to know Kaian Town's jianghu people."

# game/script.rpy:2571
translate english s015_choose_base_place_4bd01dec:

    # "茯苓医馆。"
    "Fuling Clinic."

# game/script.rpy:2573
translate english s015_choose_base_place_5ad4e1bf:

    # "周青柳懂药理，沈云活泼亲切，徐春香温和却有原则。"
    "Zhou Qingliu understands medicine, Shen Yun is lively and kind, and Xu Chunxiang is gentle but principled."

# game/script.rpy:2575
translate english s015_choose_base_place_5cc53208:

    # "医馆与风雷观有药材往来，或许更接近长息定年丹真正的秘密。"
    "The clinic exchanges medicinal materials with Fenglei Abbey and may be closer to the Long-Breath Age-Settling Elixir's true secret."

# game/script.rpy:2577
translate english s015_choose_base_place_084987d1:

    # "若留在那里，煎药、搬药、看诊、救人，每一步都不能马虎。"
    "If you stay there, decocting medicine, carrying herbs, treating patients, and saving lives leave no room for carelessness."

# game/script.rpy:2579
translate english s015_choose_base_place_f52391a4:

    # "你忽然意识到，这不只是今晚睡在哪里。"
    "You suddenly realize this is not merely about where you sleep tonight."

# game/script.rpy:2581
translate english s015_choose_base_place_debd32bf:

    # "这是你来到开庵镇后的第一个选择。"
    "It is your first choice after coming to Kaian Town."

# game/script.rpy:2593
translate english s015_choose_base_place_45a43640:

    # "你最终转身，走向飞鸿驿站。"
    "In the end, you turn toward Feihong Post Station."

# game/script.rpy:2595
translate english s015_choose_base_place_ae249c94:

    # "魏三儿正在门口收拾木牌，看见你回来，像是早猜到了，却故意挑眉。"
    "Wei San'er is gathering wooden markers at the door. Seeing you return, she seems to have guessed it already but arches a brow on purpose."

# game/script.rpy:2597
translate english s015_choose_base_place_05531b15:

    # weisaner "想好了？"
    weisaner "Made up your mind?"

# game/script.rpy:2600
translate english s015_choose_base_place_f154b67a:

    # wangfang "想好了。我想先留在驿站。"
    wangfang "I have. I want to stay at the post station first."

# game/script.rpy:2602
translate english s015_choose_base_place_45737c60:

    # zuowan "想好了。我先留在飞鸿驿站。"
    zuowan "I have. I will stay at Feihong Post Station for now."

# game/script.rpy:2604
translate english s015_choose_base_place_78b30bf0:

    # "魏三儿点头。"
    "Wei San'er nods."

# game/script.rpy:2606
translate english s015_choose_base_place_f446f449:

    # weisaner "那就跟我来。"
    weisaner "Then follow me."

# game/script.rpy:2608
translate english s015_choose_base_place_09d6f1fd:

    # "你跟着她进了驿站，穿过前厅，绕到后方。"
    "You follow her into the post station, through the front hall, and around to the rear."

# game/script.rpy:2610
translate english s015_choose_base_place_00f51eb6:

    # "柜台后，郭路平抬头看了你一眼。"
    "Behind the counter, Guo Luping looks up at you."

# game/script.rpy:2612
translate english s015_choose_base_place_ab573223:

    # "他没有多问，只说了一句："
    "He asks no more, saying only,"

# game/script.rpy:2614
translate english s015_choose_base_place_bb93f65c:

    # guoluping "先住下。驿站看人，不看他说过什么，看他明日怎么做。"
    guoluping "Stay first. A post station judges people not by what they have said, but by what they do tomorrow."

# game/script.rpy:2616
translate english s015_choose_base_place_2edc0ff8:

    # "魏三儿立刻接话。"
    "Wei San'er immediately adds,"

# game/script.rpy:2618
translate english s015_choose_base_place_a52d61b2:

    # weisaner "听见没？明早别睡过头，不然我也救不了你。"
    weisaner "Hear that? Do not oversleep tomorrow morning, or even I cannot save you."

# game/script.rpy:2622
translate english s015_choose_base_place_7c99b1e7:

    # "她带你来到夹廊小院。"
    "She brings you to the passage courtyard."

# game/script.rpy:2624
translate english s015_choose_base_place_30e677f6:

    # "小院不大，北接飞鸿驿站，南通茯苓医馆，东侧有一扇面向风云坪的屏风门，西侧则是雷凌宫的高墙。"
    "The courtyard is small: Feihong Post Station lies to the north and Fuling Clinic to the south; a screen gate faces Fengyun Square to the east, and Leiling Palace's high wall stands to the west."

# game/script.rpy:2626
translate english s015_choose_base_place_45e0b535:

    # "院中摆着一张旧木大桌，桌边有几只不成套的凳子。"
    "An old wooden table stands in the courtyard, with several mismatched stools around it."

# game/script.rpy:2628
translate english s015_choose_base_place_6b6019e6:

    # "魏三儿指了指北边一间小耳房。"
    "Wei San'er points to a small north side room."

# game/script.rpy:2630
translate english s015_choose_base_place_9074252e:

    # weisaner "北耳房，今晚归你。"
    weisaner "The north side room is yours tonight."

# game/script.rpy:2632
translate english s015_choose_base_place_86ecb6eb:

    # weisaner "铺盖旧了点，窗子紧了点，夜里若听见马叫、人喊、方大娘骂人，都正常。"
    weisaner "The bedding is a little old and the window a little tight. If you hear horses, shouting, or Auntie Fang scolding at night, that is normal."

# game/script.rpy:2635
translate english s015_choose_base_place_abde0e89:

    # wangfang "供饭吗？"
    wangfang "Is food provided?"

# game/script.rpy:2637
translate english s015_choose_base_place_2af9c53e:

    # zuowan "吃饭怎么算？"
    zuowan "How are meals arranged?"

# game/script.rpy:2639
translate english s015_choose_base_place_06bab006:

    # "魏三儿笑了。"
    "Wei San'er smiles."

# game/script.rpy:2641
translate english s015_choose_base_place_24ce7a23:

    # weisaner "郭总管吩咐过，试住三日，饭照给。"
    weisaner "Manager Guo ordered a three-day trial stay, with meals included."

# game/script.rpy:2643
translate english s015_choose_base_place_ffed86dd:

    # weisaner "但不是白吃。明日开始，哪边喊你，你就搭把手。"
    weisaner "But you will not eat for nothing. Starting tomorrow, lend a hand whenever either side calls."

# game/script.rpy:2645
translate english s015_choose_base_place_e68e6696:

    # "她指了指南侧医馆门。"
    "She points to the clinic door on the south side."

# game/script.rpy:2647
translate english s015_choose_base_place_61fdf57b:

    # weisaner "还有一条规矩。住在夹廊小院的人，别把驿站和医馆分得太清。"
    weisaner "There is one more rule. People in the passage courtyard should not draw too sharp a line between the post station and the clinic."

# game/script.rpy:2649
translate english s015_choose_base_place_f846e55b:

    # weisaner "哪边急，先帮哪边。"
    weisaner "Help whichever side is urgent first."

# game/script.rpy:2651
translate english s015_choose_base_place_c922eedd:

    # "你点了点头。"
    "You nod."

# game/script.rpy:2653
translate english s015_choose_base_place_c7bc82e0:

    # "夜色落下，你终于有了在开庵镇的第一张床。"
    "Night falls, and at last you have your first bed in Kaian Town."

# game/script.rpy:2663
translate english s015_choose_base_place_ca8b841a:

    # "你最终转身，走向茯苓医馆。"
    "In the end, you turn toward Fuling Clinic."

# game/script.rpy:2665
translate english s015_choose_base_place_d93a9fc6:

    # "沈云正在门口收草药，看见你回来，先是一愣，随即笑了。"
    "Shen Yun is gathering herbs by the door. Seeing you return, he pauses in surprise, then smiles."

# game/script.rpy:2667
translate english s015_choose_base_place_037e6054:

    # shenyun "想好了？"
    shenyun "Made up your mind?"

# game/script.rpy:2670
translate english s015_choose_base_place_a88c1989:

    # wangfang "想好了。我想先留在医馆。"
    wangfang "I have. I want to stay at the clinic first."

# game/script.rpy:2672
translate english s015_choose_base_place_cfa3d157:

    # zuowan "想好了。我先留在茯苓医馆。"
    zuowan "I have. I will stay at Fuling Clinic for now."

# game/script.rpy:2674
translate english s015_choose_base_place_32233464:

    # "沈云把手里的草药往筐里一放。"
    "Shen Yun drops the herbs in his hands into a basket."

# game/script.rpy:2676
translate english s015_choose_base_place_cafe1b95:

    # shenyun "那就跟我来。"
    shenyun "Then follow me."

# game/script.rpy:2678
translate english s015_choose_base_place_8550069a:

    # "你跟着他进了医馆。"
    "You follow him into the clinic."

# game/script.rpy:2680
translate english s015_choose_base_place_4620f1d7:

    # "诊桌旁，徐春香正在收拾药方。"
    "Xu Chunxiang is putting away prescriptions beside the consultation desk."

# game/script.rpy:2682
translate english s015_choose_base_place_b9abe086:

    # "她抬眼看见你，没有多问，只温声说了一句："
    "She looks up and sees you. Without asking much, she says gently,"

# game/script.rpy:2684
translate english s015_choose_base_place_f526688b:

    # xuchunxiang "今晚先住下。人初到异乡，最怕夜里硬撑。明日能不能留下，看你愿不愿意好好做事。"
    xuchunxiang "Stay tonight. When one has just come to a strange place, the worst thing is to endure the night alone. Whether you can remain tomorrow depends on whether you are willing to work well."

# game/script.rpy:2686
translate english s015_choose_base_place_136f46ae:

    # "沈云压低声音。"
    "Shen Yun lowers his voice."

# game/script.rpy:2688
translate english s015_choose_base_place_1a9e17c7:

    # shenyun "徐掌柜这么说，就是准了。"
    shenyun "When Manager Xu says that, it means she approves."

# game/script.rpy:2692
translate english s015_choose_base_place_1a4f8aee:

    # "他带你从医馆侧门走入夹廊小院。"
    "He leads you through the clinic's side door into the passage courtyard."

# game/script.rpy:2694
translate english s015_choose_base_place_30e677f6_1:

    # "小院不大，北接飞鸿驿站，南通茯苓医馆，东侧有一扇面向风云坪的屏风门，西侧则是雷凌宫的高墙。"
    "The courtyard is small: Feihong Post Station lies to the north and Fuling Clinic to the south; a screen gate faces Fengyun Square to the east, and Leiling Palace's high wall stands to the west."

# game/script.rpy:2696
translate english s015_choose_base_place_45e0b535_1:

    # "院中摆着一张旧木大桌，桌边有几只不成套的凳子。"
    "An old wooden table stands in the courtyard, with several mismatched stools around it."

# game/script.rpy:2698
translate english s015_choose_base_place_b9880532:

    # "沈云指了指南边一间小耳房。"
    "Shen Yun points to a small south side room."

# game/script.rpy:2700
translate english s015_choose_base_place_5c0b7a72:

    # shenyun "南耳房，今晚归你。"
    shenyun "The south side room is yours tonight."

# game/script.rpy:2702
translate english s015_choose_base_place_62ff5de2:

    # shenyun "这里离药炉近，夜里有药香，也可能有病人喊疼。"
    shenyun "It is close to the medicine furnace. At night there will be herbal scents, and perhaps patients crying out in pain."

# game/script.rpy:2704
translate english s015_choose_base_place_e3550534:

    # "他想了想，又认真补充。"
    "He thinks, then adds in earnest,"

# game/script.rpy:2706
translate english s015_choose_base_place_7a4fcf6a:

    # shenyun "若你怕苦味，可以慢慢习惯。反正我习惯了三年，也没完全习惯。"
    shenyun "If you dislike bitter flavors, you can grow used to them slowly. I have had three years and still have not fully managed it."

# game/script.rpy:2709
translate english s015_choose_base_place_abde0e89_1:

    # wangfang "供饭吗？"
    wangfang "Is food provided?"

# game/script.rpy:2711
translate english s015_choose_base_place_2af9c53e_1:

    # zuowan "吃饭怎么算？"
    zuowan "How are meals arranged?"

# game/script.rpy:2713
translate english s015_choose_base_place_0ea74197:

    # "沈云笑了。"
    "Shen Yun smiles."

# game/script.rpy:2715
translate english s015_choose_base_place_93e6b0b1:

    # shenyun "徐掌柜吩咐过，试住三日，饭照给。"
    shenyun "Manager Xu ordered a three-day trial stay, with meals included."

# game/script.rpy:2717
translate english s015_choose_base_place_f904336d:

    # shenyun "不过不是白吃。明日开始，煎药、搬药、传话，哪样都可能轮到你。"
    shenyun "But you will not eat for nothing. From tomorrow on, you may be asked to decoct medicine, carry herbs, or relay messages."

# game/script.rpy:2719
translate english s015_choose_base_place_866b4a54:

    # "他又指了指北侧驿站后门。"
    "He points again toward the post station's rear door to the north."

# game/script.rpy:2721
translate english s015_choose_base_place_7e431f7f:

    # shenyun "还有个麻烦处。驿站那边一忙，喊声也能传过来。"
    shenyun "There is one troublesome part. When the post station is busy, you can hear the shouts from there."

# game/script.rpy:2723
translate english s015_choose_base_place_ac254209:

    # shenyun "徐掌柜说了，夹廊小院的人，哪边急就先帮哪边。"
    shenyun "Manager Xu said that people in the passage courtyard help whichever side is urgent first."

# game/script.rpy:2725
translate english s015_choose_base_place_c922eedd_1:

    # "你点了点头。"
    "You nod."

# game/script.rpy:2727
translate english s015_choose_base_place_c7bc82e0_1:

    # "夜色落下，你终于有了在开庵镇的第一张床。"
    "Night falls, and at last you have your first bed in Kaian Town."

# game/script.rpy:2729
translate english s015_choose_base_place_ba1bec83:

    # "这一夜，你睡在夹廊小院。"
    "That night, you sleep in the passage courtyard."

# game/script.rpy:2731
translate english s015_choose_base_place_6f43eaef:

    # "北边是驿站的锅铲声、脚步声、马嘶声。"
    "To the north are the post station's clattering spatulas, footsteps, and horse calls."

# game/script.rpy:2733
translate english s015_choose_base_place_e31a4c05:

    # "南边是医馆的药香、低语和药炉小火。"
    "To the south are the clinic's herbal scent, low voices, and low medicine furnace."

# game/script.rpy:2735
translate english s015_choose_base_place_b686c06b:

    # "你忽然觉得，自己像是睡在这座小镇的两条脉络之间。"
    "You suddenly feel as if you sleep between two veins of the town."

# game/script.rpy:2737
translate english s015_choose_base_place_a83d2f94:

    # "而这座小镇，也从今晚开始，轻轻把你拴住了。"
    "And from tonight onward, the town itself begins to bind you gently to it."

# game/script.rpy:2752
translate english s016_inn_overflow_ead8828c:

    # "这一夜，你睡得比想象中沉。"
    "That night, you sleep more deeply than you expected."

# game/script.rpy:2754
translate english s016_inn_overflow_c1ee359c:

    # "清晨醒来时，先听见规律的切菜声，又闻到药炉里淡淡的草药味。"
    "On waking at dawn, you first hear the regular chop of vegetables, then smell the faint herbs from the medicine furnace."

# game/script.rpy:2756
translate english s016_inn_overflow_4280072a:

    # "夹廊小院果然夹在飞鸿驿站和茯苓医馆之间。"
    "The passage courtyard truly lies between Feihong Post Station and Fuling Clinic."

# game/script.rpy:2758
translate english s016_inn_overflow_9eedd7c8:

    # "北边是锅铲、脚步、马嘶。"
    "To the north are spatulas, footsteps, and horse calls."

# game/script.rpy:2760
translate english s016_inn_overflow_c40e28f0:

    # "南边是药香、竹筛、水声。"
    "To the south are herbal scents, bamboo sieves, and running water."

# game/script.rpy:2763
translate english s016_inn_overflow_76e5af03:

    # "你从北耳房推门出来。"
    "You push open the door of the north side room."

# game/script.rpy:2765
translate english s016_inn_overflow_5acec22a:

    # "你从南耳房推门出来。"
    "You push open the door of the south side room."

# game/script.rpy:2767
translate english s016_inn_overflow_0b327d6f:

    # "院中那张旧木大桌还在，桌边几只凳子摆得歪歪斜斜。"
    "The old wooden table remains in the courtyard, with its stools set crookedly around it."

# game/script.rpy:2769
translate english s016_inn_overflow_0310d86d:

    # "你绕过屏风门，正对着风云坪伸了个懒腰。"
    "You go around the screen gate and stretch toward Fengyun Square."

# game/script.rpy:2771
translate english s016_inn_overflow_74cd2bc9:

    # "风云坪上已经有人来往，卖早点的摊子冒着热气，远处马车轮声滚过石面。"
    "People already pass through Fengyun Square, breakfast stalls steam, and cart wheels rumble across stone in the distance."

# game/script.rpy:2773
translate english s016_inn_overflow_a83e707a:

    # "还没等你真正清醒，飞鸿驿站方向忽然传来一阵吵嚷。"
    "Before you are fully awake, a sudden commotion rises from Feihong Post Station."

# game/script.rpy:2777
translate english s016_inn_overflow_22a94353:

    # "夹廊小院北门被人推开，魏三儿探出半个身子，头发都没来得及理顺。"
    "The north gate of the passage courtyard is pushed open, and Wei San'er leans out, her hair not even combed straight."

# game/script.rpy:2779
translate english s016_inn_overflow_5469adf2:

    # weisaner "醒了没有？醒了就来搭把手！驿站快被人住塌了！"
    weisaner "Are you awake? If so, come lend a hand! The post station is about to be lived into collapse!"

# game/script.rpy:2781
translate english s016_inn_overflow_faa7fbbc:

    # "话音未落，沈云也从医馆侧门探出来，手里还拿着半捆草药。"
    "Before she finishes, Shen Yun appears from the clinic's side door with half a bundle of herbs in hand."

# game/script.rpy:2783
translate english s016_inn_overflow_ddc9ce1a:

    # shenyun "你们驿站一大早又怎么了？"
    shenyun "What has your post station done again so early in the morning?"

# game/script.rpy:2785
translate english s016_inn_overflow_2abe4488:

    # weisaner "什么叫又？这是江湖大势！"
    weisaner "What do you mean, again? This is the great tide of the jianghu!"

# game/script.rpy:2787
translate english s016_inn_overflow_c2617626:

    # "沈云看了你一眼。"
    "Shen Yun looks at you."

# game/script.rpy:2789
translate english s016_inn_overflow_5a10d4c6:

    # shenyun "去吧。徐掌柜说了，夹廊小院的人，哪边急就先帮哪边。"
    shenyun "Go on. Manager Xu said people in the passage courtyard help whichever side is urgent first."

# game/script.rpy:2792
translate english s016_inn_overflow_3bd57dbf:

    # wangfang "好，我去看看能帮上什么忙。"
    wangfang "All right. I will see how I can help."

# game/script.rpy:2794
translate english s016_inn_overflow_f1444c32:

    # zuowan "好，我去看看。"
    zuowan "All right. I will take a look."

# game/script.rpy:2796
translate english s016_inn_overflow_9aa397f1:

    # "魏三儿一把招手。"
    "Wei San'er waves you over sharply."

# game/script.rpy:2798
translate english s016_inn_overflow_215350c9:

    # weisaner "能喘气就能帮忙，快来！"
    weisaner "If you can breathe, you can help. Hurry!"

# game/script.rpy:2802
translate english s016_inn_overflow_de9bcaed:

    # "你跟着魏三儿来到飞鸿驿站前厅。"
    "You follow Wei San'er to Feihong Post Station's front hall."

# game/script.rpy:2804
translate english s016_inn_overflow_38e4af19:

    # "前厅比昨日更乱。"
    "The front hall is more chaotic than yesterday."

# game/script.rpy:2806
translate english s016_inn_overflow_05c6bd61:

    # "门口挤着抱包袱的商旅、背刀的江湖客、牵马的马夫，还有几个自称某某门派弟子的年轻人。"
    "At the entrance crowd merchants clutching bundles, armed jianghu travelers, grooms leading horses, and several young people claiming to be disciples of various sects."

# game/script.rpy:2808
translate english s016_inn_overflow_805f2a4f:

    # "有人嚷着自己早订了房，有人说昨夜赶路冻了一宿，有人拍着柜台要求立刻安排。"
    "Some shout that they reserved rooms long ago, some say they froze while traveling all night, and some slap the counter demanding immediate arrangements."

# game/script.rpy:2810
translate english s016_inn_overflow_6ed09316:

    # "周二蛋站在门边，笑得脸都快僵了，还在跟住客解释。"
    "Zhou Erdan stands by the door, his smile nearly frozen as he continues explaining to guests."

# game/script.rpy:2812
translate english s016_inn_overflow_7a2e614a:

    # zhouerdan "马有马厩，人有客房，可现在的问题是，马比人听话，客房比马少。"
    zhouerdan "Horses have stables and people have rooms, but the problem is horses are more obedient than people, and there are fewer rooms than horses."

# game/script.rpy:2814
translate english s016_inn_overflow_a2b70b2a:

    # "方大娘从厨房端着一摞碗出来，边走边骂。"
    "Auntie Fang emerges from the kitchen carrying a stack of bowls and scolding as she walks."

# game/script.rpy:2816
translate english s016_inn_overflow_363add3b:

    # fangdaniang "喊什么喊？喊能喊出一张床来？先把粥喝了，饿着肚子吵架最没出息！"
    fangdaniang "What are you yelling for? Can yelling produce a bed? Drink your porridge first; arguing hungry is the most pitiful thing!"

# game/script.rpy:2818
translate english s016_inn_overflow_239dfb87:

    # "方鹤鸣坐在文书桌前，时而奋笔疾书，时而抬头看墙上的房牌木板。"
    "Fang Heming sits at the writing desk, sometimes writing furiously and sometimes looking up at the wall board of room markers."

# game/script.rpy:2820
translate english s016_inn_overflow_99b98903:

    # "木板上挂着一排小牌：上房、普通房、通铺、马夫铺、后院临歇。"
    "A row of small markers hangs on the board: superior rooms, ordinary rooms, shared bunks, grooms' quarters, and temporary rear-courtyard lodging."

# game/script.rpy:2822
translate english s016_inn_overflow_3b79237b:

    # "几乎都已经翻成了“满”。"
    "Nearly every one has been turned to \"Full.\""

# game/script.rpy:2824
translate english s016_inn_overflow_bdacfa64:

    # "郭路平正在门口拱手向众人解释，语气仍然稳。"
    "Guo Luping stands at the entrance with clasped hands, explaining to the crowd in his steady voice."

# game/script.rpy:2826
translate english s016_inn_overflow_f01d6c07:

    # guoluping "诸位稍安。飞鸿驿站能住多少人，账上有数，梁上也有数。再往里塞，今晚不是睡觉，是叠罗汉。"
    guoluping "Everyone, please be calm. The books know how many people Feihong Post Station can hold, and so do the beams. Pack in any more and tonight will be a human stack, not sleep."

# game/script.rpy:2828
translate english s016_inn_overflow_c62ff0c0:

    # "魏三儿把你往方鹤鸣面前一推。"
    "Wei San'er pushes you toward Fang Heming."

# game/script.rpy:2830
translate english s016_inn_overflow_65b18038:

    # weisaner "帮手我招来了！"
    weisaner "I brought help!"

# game/script.rpy:2832
translate english s016_inn_overflow_bfed98b7:

    # "方鹤鸣抬头看了你一眼，语气不急不慢。"
    "Fang Heming looks up at you, his tone unhurried."

# game/script.rpy:2834
translate english s016_inn_overflow_0b55e5cf:

    # fangheming "醒了？醒了就干活。饭给你留了，先别吃完，边吃边记。"
    fangheming "Awake? Then work. We saved you food; do not finish it at once. Eat while you keep records."

# game/script.rpy:2837
translate english s016_inn_overflow_9585d9da:

    # wangfang "记什么？"
    wangfang "Keep records of what?"

# game/script.rpy:2839
translate english s016_inn_overflow_7274701e:

    # zuowan "记什么？"
    zuowan "Record what?"

# game/script.rpy:2843
translate english s016_inn_overflow_adf35ea4:

    # "方鹤鸣把一摞小木牌推到你面前。"
    "Fang Heming pushes a stack of small wooden markers before you."

# game/script.rpy:2845
translate english s016_inn_overflow_c253bf93:

    # fangheming "三类人。"
    fangheming "Three kinds of people."

# game/script.rpy:2847
translate english s016_inn_overflow_71fe8df8:

    # fangheming "第一类，有老有小、有伤病的，优先安排通铺。"
    fangheming "First: the elderly, children, and the injured or ill. Put them in the shared bunks first."

# game/script.rpy:2849
translate english s016_inn_overflow_f962425b:

    # fangheming "第二类，有急信急货在身的，留下等总管调度。"
    fangheming "Second: those carrying urgent letters or cargo. Keep them here to await the manager's arrangements."

# game/script.rpy:2851
translate english s016_inn_overflow_20421db9:

    # fangheming "第三类，纯来看热闹又嗓门大的，请去长风楼、青云楼，或者让他们自己去风云坪看天。"
    fangheming "Third: those here only for spectacle and shouting loudly. Send them to Changfeng House, Qingyun House, or Fengyun Square to watch the sky themselves."

# game/script.rpy:2853
translate english s016_inn_overflow_cb769591:

    # "魏三儿在旁边补一句。"
    "Wei San'er adds from beside you,"

# game/script.rpy:2855
translate english s016_inn_overflow_775af79f:

    # weisaner "你就站这儿发牌。谁骂你，你就说方驿丞定的。谁还骂你，你就说郭总管定的。"
    weisaner "Stand here and hand out markers. If anyone curses you, say Station Clerk Fang decided it. If they keep cursing, say Manager Guo decided it."

# game/script.rpy:2857
translate english s016_inn_overflow_abb9b340:

    # "方鹤鸣淡淡道。"
    "Fang Heming says mildly,"

# game/script.rpy:2859
translate english s016_inn_overflow_70d87d50:

    # fangheming "谁若还骂，就说方大娘在厨房。"
    fangheming "If they still curse, say Auntie Fang is in the kitchen."

# game/script.rpy:2861
translate english s016_inn_overflow_b42eff01:

    # "魏三儿立刻点头。"
    "Wei San'er nods immediately."

# game/script.rpy:2863
translate english s016_inn_overflow_174ab5aa:

    # weisaner "这个最管用。"
    weisaner "That works best."

# game/script.rpy:2865
translate english s016_inn_overflow_1745056a:

    # "你接过木牌，开始帮忙分人。"
    "You take the markers and begin sorting people."

# game/script.rpy:2867
translate english s016_inn_overflow_3b1fc22e:

    # "一名年轻江湖客不满，说自己是承天剑派外门弟子，理应优先入住。"
    "A young jianghu traveler protests, claiming to be an outer disciple of the Chengtian Sword Sect who deserves priority lodging."

# game/script.rpy:2869
translate english s016_inn_overflow_d43b52a4:

    # "魏三儿刚要开口，罗阿枣忽然从柱子后面钻出来，抱着扫帚说："
    "Just as Wei San'er is about to speak, Luo Azhao appears from behind a pillar with his broom and says,"

# game/script.rpy:2871
translate english s016_inn_overflow_d135b542:

    # luoazao "他骗人。"
    luoazao "He is lying."

# game/script.rpy:2873
translate english s016_inn_overflow_0b467693:

    # "众人一愣。"
    "Everyone freezes."

# game/script.rpy:2875
translate english s016_inn_overflow_cf4d5300:

    # "郭路平看向他。"
    "Guo Luping looks at him."

# game/script.rpy:2877
translate english s016_inn_overflow_6f211325:

    # guoluping "阿枣，说清楚。"
    guoluping "Azao, explain clearly."

# game/script.rpy:2879
translate english s016_inn_overflow_887d3967:

    # "罗阿枣挠了挠头。"
    "Luo Azhao scratches his head."

# game/script.rpy:2881
translate english s016_inn_overflow_2e3cd2c9:

    # luoazao "我刚才扫地，看见他鞋底是西街菜市的泥，袖口还有梁氏关扑铺的骰子粉。"
    luoazao "While sweeping, I saw West Street Market mud on his soles and dice powder from Liang's gambling shop on his cuffs."

# game/script.rpy:2883
translate english s016_inn_overflow_2108473f:

    # luoazao "他说昨夜从雷云峰下来，可雷云峰山脚那边昨夜下过细雨，鞋上不该这么干。"
    luoazao "He says he came down from Leiyun Peak last night, but there was a light rain at its foot. His shoes should not be this dry."

# game/script.rpy:2885
translate english s016_inn_overflow_65531fe8:

    # "魏三儿眼睛一亮。"
    "Wei San'er's eyes light up."

# game/script.rpy:2887
translate english s016_inn_overflow_4aed2f57:

    # weisaner "好啊，阿枣，你偷懒偷出本事来了。"
    weisaner "Well now, Azao. You have turned idling into a skill."

# game/script.rpy:2889
translate english s016_inn_overflow_21311352:

    # "罗阿枣不服。"
    "Luo Azhao is unconvinced."

# game/script.rpy:2891
translate english s016_inn_overflow_64dc4501:

    # luoazao "我那叫低处观察。"
    luoazao "I call it observation from a low place."

# game/script.rpy:2893
translate english s016_inn_overflow_70c1284f:

    # "方鹤鸣看向那名年轻江湖客。"
    "Fang Heming looks to the young traveler."

# game/script.rpy:2895
translate english s016_inn_overflow_c449f701:

    # fangheming "承天剑派弟子入驿，需出示派牒。若没有，就按普通看客排。"
    fangheming "A Chengtian Sword Sect disciple entering the post station must show a sect credential. Without one, you join the ordinary sightseers."

# game/script.rpy:2897
translate english s016_inn_overflow_44ed5546:

    # "那人脸色尴尬，悻悻退到一边。"
    "The man's face colors, and he retreats to one side."

# game/script.rpy:2899
translate english s016_inn_overflow_37079619:

    # "这个小插曲让你第一次意识到：驿站不是谁嗓门大谁有理，这里有自己的规矩，也有自己识人的办法。"
    "This small incident makes you realize for the first time that at the post station, the loudest voice is not the most right. It has its own rules and its own way of judging people."

# game/script.rpy:2903
translate english s016_inn_overflow_977fb986:

    # "就在前厅稍微安静一点时，鲁天阔从外面快步回来。"
    "Just as the hall grows a little quieter, Lu Tiankuo returns at a quick pace from outside."

# game/script.rpy:2905
translate english s016_inn_overflow_03204902:

    # "他身上带着尘土，手里握着一只皮质信袋，额角有汗。"
    "Dust clings to him; he grips a leather dispatch pouch, and sweat beads at his temple."

# game/script.rpy:2907
translate english s016_inn_overflow_ec8fc4b6:

    # "他先把信袋放进柜中，转身就去找水喝。"
    "He puts the pouch in a cabinet before turning to find water."

# game/script.rpy:2909
translate english s016_inn_overflow_e6aaa5ca:

    # lutiankuo "官道上还有两队人往开庵镇来。"
    lutiankuo "Two more groups are coming to Kaian Town along the official road."

# game/script.rpy:2911
translate english s016_inn_overflow_41234827:

    # lutiankuo "一队自称给风雷观送药材，一队说是来求丹的富户家眷。最迟午后到。"
    lutiankuo "One says it is delivering medicinal materials to Fenglei Abbey; the other is the family of wealthy people seeking the elixir. They will arrive by afternoon at the latest."

# game/script.rpy:2913
translate english s016_inn_overflow_e595ffc3:

    # "魏三儿差点叫出来。"
    "Wei San'er nearly cries out."

# game/script.rpy:2915
translate english s016_inn_overflow_7503eaab:

    # weisaner "还来？他们是长在路上了吗？"
    weisaner "More? Do they grow on the road?"

# game/script.rpy:2917
translate english s016_inn_overflow_5713bde5:

    # "周二蛋在门外探头。"
    "Zhou Erdan pokes his head in from outside."

# game/script.rpy:2919
translate english s016_inn_overflow_638adc2f:

    # zhouerdan "马厩也满了。再来马，只能让它们自己商量谁睡外头。"
    zhouerdan "The stables are full too. Any more horses will have to decide among themselves who sleeps outside."

# game/script.rpy:2921
translate english s016_inn_overflow_b70fc39d:

    # "方大娘把一碗粥拍到你面前。"
    "Auntie Fang sets a bowl of porridge down before you with a slap."

# game/script.rpy:2923
translate english s016_inn_overflow_b6f2c11c:

    # fangdaniang "新来的，喝。别学他们光用嘴干活。"
    fangdaniang "Newcomer, drink. Do not be like them and work only with your mouth."

# game/script.rpy:2925
translate english s016_inn_overflow_cdbc7884:

    # "你端起粥，有些不好意思。"
    "You take the porridge, a little embarrassed."

# game/script.rpy:2927
translate english s016_inn_overflow_c4dd9978:

    # "自己明明昨夜才被收留，今日就站在驿站前厅发牌、分人、听人吵闹，好像已经被卷进了这座镇子的运转里。"
    "You were taken in only last night, yet today you stand in the post station handing out markers, sorting people, and hearing arguments, as if already drawn into the workings of the town."

# game/script.rpy:2930
translate english s016_inn_overflow_1e6c549d:

    # wangfang "若是实在住不下，我那间耳房……"
    wangfang "If there truly is no room, my side room..."

# game/script.rpy:2932
translate english s016_inn_overflow_4e15a382:

    # zuowan "若是实在住不下，我住的那间耳房……"
    zuowan "If there truly is no room, the side room where I am staying..."

# game/script.rpy:2934
translate english s016_inn_overflow_b49141c3:

    # "话还没说完，郭路平便打断了。"
    "Before you can finish, Guo Luping interrupts."

# game/script.rpy:2936
translate english s016_inn_overflow_e3a2a759:

    # guoluping "你安心住着。夹廊小院的耳房不对外放客。"
    guoluping "Stay at ease. The passage courtyard's side rooms are not let to outside guests."

# game/script.rpy:2938
translate english s016_inn_overflow_9255c4ae:

    # "你一怔。"
    "You pause."

# game/script.rpy:2940
translate english s016_inn_overflow_98010429:

    # "郭路平看了你一眼，语气依旧平稳。"
    "Guo Luping looks at you, his tone still steady."

# game/script.rpy:2942
translate english s016_inn_overflow_ce2b53d8:

    # guoluping "那地方北接驿站，南通医馆，夜里有事要有人听得见。"
    guoluping "That place joins the post station to the north and the clinic to the south. If trouble arises at night, someone must be able to hear it."

# game/script.rpy:2944
translate english s016_inn_overflow_30ae5b62:

    # guoluping "安排你住，不是给你占便宜，是看你能不能派上用场。"
    guoluping "We arranged your lodging not to give you an advantage, but to see whether you can be useful."

# game/script.rpy:2946
translate english s016_inn_overflow_0ce54e42:

    # "方鹤鸣补充。"
    "Fang Heming adds,"

# game/script.rpy:2948
translate english s016_inn_overflow_ebf3a4c0:

    # fangheming "换句话说，你不是客房客人，是试住帮工。"
    fangheming "In other words, you are not a guest-room guest but a trial helper."

# game/script.rpy:2950
translate english s016_inn_overflow_34004d0b:

    # "魏三儿笑道。"
    "Wei San'er says with a laugh,"

# game/script.rpy:2952
translate english s016_inn_overflow_ebce0aa8:

    # weisaner "听起来是不是没那么感动了？"
    weisaner "Does it sound less touching now?"

# game/script.rpy:2954
translate english s016_inn_overflow_7378b575:

    # "你却反而松了一口气。"
    "Instead, you feel relieved."

# game/script.rpy:2956
translate english s016_inn_overflow_9b32a5c8:

    # "郭路平最终出面定下安排。"
    "Guo Luping finally steps in to settle the arrangements."

# game/script.rpy:2958
translate english s016_inn_overflow_c890b430:

    # guoluping "今日起，飞鸿驿站不再收普通看热闹住客。"
    guoluping "From today, Feihong Post Station will no longer take ordinary sightseers as lodgers."

# game/script.rpy:2960
translate english s016_inn_overflow_26552540:

    # guoluping "已有伤病、急信、押货者优先。其余人，我已托辛掌柜在长风楼、青云楼、凰龙客栈各留了些位置。"
    guoluping "The injured and ill, those with urgent letters, and cargo escorts have priority. For everyone else, I have asked Manager Xin to reserve some places at Changfeng House, Qingyun House, and Huanglong Inn."

# game/script.rpy:2962
translate english s016_inn_overflow_a5999ba4:

    # "有人立刻问。"
    "Someone immediately asks,"

# game/script.rpy:2964
translate english s016_inn_overflow_878b34cd:

    # jianghuke "那价钱呢？"
    jianghuke "What about the price?"

# game/script.rpy:2966
translate english s016_inn_overflow_2d3f7174:

    # "郭路平微微一笑。"
    "Guo Luping smiles faintly."

# game/script.rpy:2968
translate english s016_inn_overflow_336d7a25:

    # guoluping "非常时期，住宿费自然不会像平日一样。嫌贵的，风云坪很宽。"
    guoluping "In extraordinary times, lodging rates will naturally not be as they are on ordinary days. Fengyun Square is wide for anyone who finds them too dear."

# game/script.rpy:2970
translate english s016_inn_overflow_ebf1cc03:

    # "众人一时哑然。"
    "For a moment, everyone falls silent."

# game/script.rpy:2972
translate english s016_inn_overflow_d0198b0d:

    # "方大娘从旁边补刀。"
    "Auntie Fang adds the final blow from beside them."

# game/script.rpy:2974
translate english s016_inn_overflow_a4603463:

    # fangdaniang "风云坪不要钱，就是夜里风大。"
    fangdaniang "Fengyun Square costs nothing, except the wind is strong at night."

# game/script.rpy:2976
translate english s016_inn_overflow_9ce363bf:

    # "魏三儿低声对你说："
    "Wei San'er says quietly to you,"

# game/script.rpy:2978
translate english s016_inn_overflow_3b1223f5:

    # weisaner "郭总管这叫把人往外送，还让人觉得自己占了便宜。"
    weisaner "Manager Guo sends people away and still makes them feel they have gained something."

# game/script.rpy:2980
translate english s016_inn_overflow_0825db48:

    # "方鹤鸣纠正。"
    "Fang Heming corrects her."

# game/script.rpy:2982
translate english s016_inn_overflow_def60c85:

    # fangheming "这叫分流。"
    fangheming "It is called diverting the flow."

# game/script.rpy:2984
translate english s016_inn_overflow_5bb4f56d:

    # zhouerdan "我觉得叫活命。"
    zhouerdan "I call it staying alive."

# game/script.rpy:2986
translate english s016_inn_overflow_35dbe1d1:

    # "鲁天阔喝完水，已经准备再出去一趟。"
    "Having finished his water, Lu Tiankuo is ready to go out again."

# game/script.rpy:2988
translate english s016_inn_overflow_a56aa66f:

    # "他看向郭路平。"
    "He looks to Guo Luping."

# game/script.rpy:2990
translate english s016_inn_overflow_6d1badbd:

    # lutiankuo "我去长风楼确认房数。"
    lutiankuo "I will go to Changfeng House to confirm the room count."

# game/script.rpy:2992
translate english s016_inn_overflow_a482d6ad:

    # "郭路平点头。"
    "Guo Luping nods."

# game/script.rpy:2994
translate english s016_inn_overflow_b35edccf:

    # guoluping "带上两张备用路引。若遇到闹事的，先讲理；讲不通，回来叫人。"
    guoluping "Take two spare travel passes. If you meet anyone making trouble, reason with them first; if reason fails, come back and call for help."

# game/script.rpy:2996
translate english s016_inn_overflow_6de729bf:

    # "鲁天阔只回了一个字。"
    "Lu Tiankuo answers with one word."

# game/script.rpy:2998
translate english s016_inn_overflow_a6a127ee:

    # lutiankuo "嗯。"
    lutiankuo "Mm."

# game/script.rpy:3000
translate english s016_inn_overflow_d115b9ba:

    # "到上午将尽，飞鸿驿站的乱局终于被压下去。"
    "By late morning, the chaos at Feihong Post Station is finally brought under control."

# game/script.rpy:3002
translate english s016_inn_overflow_395d532c:

    # "有人被安排去长风楼，有人留在通铺等候，有人被请去青云楼，有人虽不满，却也不敢再闹。"
    "Some are sent to Changfeng House, some wait in the shared bunks, some are directed to Qingyun House, and though displeased, no one dares make more trouble."

# game/script.rpy:3004
translate english s016_inn_overflow_596cc0d3:

    # "你在驿站前厅忙了大半个上午：发牌、传话、帮方鹤鸣核名单、替魏三儿把客人引到后院，又被方大娘塞了两次吃食。"
    "You spend most of the morning busy in the front hall: handing out markers, carrying messages, checking names with Fang Heming, leading guests to the rear courtyard for Wei San'er, and twice being pressed with food by Auntie Fang."

# game/script.rpy:3006
translate english s016_inn_overflow_bbf16eea:

    # "说不上亲近，却没有人把你当成纯粹的外人。"
    "You cannot call it closeness, yet no one treats you as a complete outsider."

# game/script.rpy:3008
translate english s016_inn_overflow_8cb95e0e:

    # "魏三儿把最后一块木牌挂回墙上，长出一口气。"
    "Wei San'er hangs the last wooden marker back on the wall and lets out a long breath."

# game/script.rpy:3010
translate english s016_inn_overflow_7cf77484:

    # weisaner "行了，驿站暂时没塌。"
    weisaner "There. The post station has not collapsed for the moment."

# game/script.rpy:3012
translate english s016_inn_overflow_61c8453f:

    # "方大娘从厨房探头。"
    "Auntie Fang pokes her head out from the kitchen."

# game/script.rpy:3014
translate english s016_inn_overflow_4d0c59d2:

    # fangdaniang "没塌也别闲着。谁去把药炉那边的空碗送回医馆？"
    fangdaniang "Collapsed or not, do not stand idle. Who will take the empty bowls by the medicine furnace back to the clinic?"

# game/script.rpy:3016
translate english s016_inn_overflow_0da6221c:

    # "沈云刚好从夹廊小院那头探出头来。"
    "At that moment, Shen Yun appears from the passage courtyard."

# game/script.rpy:3020
translate english s016_inn_overflow_0543120d:

    # shenyun "别送碗了，医馆这边好像要忙了。"
    shenyun "Forget the bowls. The clinic looks as if it is about to get busy."

# game/script.rpy:3022
translate english s016_inn_overflow_85b1ab09:

    # "你还没反应过来，远处风云坪上传来一阵急促脚步声。"
    "Before you can react, hurried footsteps sound from distant Fengyun Square."

# game/script.rpy:3024
translate english s016_inn_overflow_d673b645:

    # "一个人被抬着，从雷云峰方向送进了茯苓医馆。"
    "Someone is carried into Fuling Clinic from the direction of Leiyun Peak."

# game/script.rpy:3039
translate english s017_clinic_injured_2c3b0051:

    # "沈云脸色比刚才白了许多。"
    "Shen Yun's face is far paler than before."

# game/script.rpy:3041
translate english s017_clinic_injured_63d2190e:

    # shenyun "医馆这边出事了！有人从雷云峰方向被抬下来了！"
    shenyun "Something has happened at the clinic! Someone has been carried down from the direction of Leiyun Peak!"

# game/script.rpy:3043
translate english s017_clinic_injured_390c946d:

    # "魏三儿本来还在抱怨驿站客牌不够，听见这话，立刻收了笑。"
    "Wei San'er had been complaining about the shortage of guest markers, but at these words her smile vanishes."

# game/script.rpy:3045
translate english s017_clinic_injured_51dec56a:

    # weisaner "人还活着吗？"
    weisaner "Is the person alive?"

# game/script.rpy:3047
translate english s017_clinic_injured_dbaae75d:

    # shenyun "活着，但说胡话。"
    shenyun "Alive, but speaking nonsense."

# game/script.rpy:3049
translate english s017_clinic_injured_b0e15cac:

    # "方大娘从厨房门口探出头，手里还拿着汤勺。"
    "Auntie Fang pokes her head from the kitchen door, still holding a soup ladle."

# game/script.rpy:3051
translate english s017_clinic_injured_39b9ebaa:

    # fangdaniang "活着就别站这儿废话，赶紧去！"
    fangdaniang "If he is alive, stop standing here talking nonsense and go!"

# game/script.rpy:3053
translate english s017_clinic_injured_da4026af:

    # "你跟着沈云穿过夹廊小院，进了茯苓医馆。"
    "You follow Shen Yun through the passage courtyard into Fuling Clinic."

# game/script.rpy:3057
translate english s017_clinic_injured_83a4f724:

    # "医馆前厅已经变了样。"
    "The clinic's front hall has already changed completely."

# game/script.rpy:3059
translate english s017_clinic_injured_017f90b9:

    # "候诊的病人被程明珠安排到一侧，药柜前的竹筛被挪开，地上铺了一张临时担架。"
    "Cheng Mingzhu has moved waiting patients aside, shifted the bamboo sieves before the cabinets, and laid a makeshift stretcher on the floor."

# game/script.rpy:3061
translate english s017_clinic_injured_1c51a9ef:

    # "担架上躺着一个中年男人。"
    "A middle-aged man lies on the stretcher."

# game/script.rpy:3063
translate english s017_clinic_injured_7c9bb2ac:

    # "那人眼球微突，脸色青紫，额角和颈侧浮起青色血脉，像是有什么东西在皮下细细游走。"
    "His eyes bulge slightly and his complexion is blue-purple; blue veins rise at his temples and neck as if something were moving beneath his skin."

# game/script.rpy:3065
translate english s017_clinic_injured_df015c62:

    # "他嘴唇发干，喉咙里断断续续重复着一句话："
    "His lips are dry, and he repeats a phrase in broken fragments from his throat:"

# game/script.rpy:3067
translate english s017_clinic_injured_a3671def:

    # shangzhe "所闻非所见……所见非人间……奇哉……怪也……"
    shangzhe "What I heard was not what I saw... What I saw was not of this world... Strange... uncanny..."

# game/script.rpy:3069
translate english s017_clinic_injured_c3f39d26:

    # "你被眼前景象吓了一下，下意识停住脚步，不敢靠得太近。"
    "The sight startles you; instinctively, you stop and do not dare approach too closely."

# game/script.rpy:3071
translate english s017_clinic_injured_2fe35e3c:

    # "陈素梅背对着你，跪坐在伤者身前施针。"
    "Chen Sumei kneels before the injured man with her back to you, administering needles."

# game/script.rpy:3073
translate english s017_clinic_injured_a65d4758:

    # "她动作极稳，但肩背绷得很紧。即使看不见表情，也能感觉到她少见的疑惑和压力。"
    "Her movements are exceptionally steady, though her shoulders are taut. Even without seeing her face, you can sense her unusual uncertainty and strain."

# game/script.rpy:3075
translate english s017_clinic_injured_4aa34fbf:

    # "李默站在离病人不远的阴影处，手中握着刀，神情没有变化，只是目光始终停在伤者身上。"
    "Li Mo stands in shadow not far from the patient, a blade in hand. His expression does not change, but his gaze never leaves the injured man."

# game/script.rpy:3077
translate english s017_clinic_injured_34cd7a8b:

    # "陈素梅最后落下一针，缓缓吐出一口气。"
    "Chen Sumei places one final needle and slowly releases a breath."

# game/script.rpy:3079
translate english s017_clinic_injured_22309fb1:

    # "她起身时用袖口擦了擦额角的汗。"
    "As she rises, she wipes sweat from her temple with her sleeve."

# game/script.rpy:3081
translate english s017_clinic_injured_dad8f8a2:

    # "她声音很平。"
    "Her voice is level."

# game/script.rpy:3083
translate english s017_clinic_injured_6197b655:

    # chensumei "我暂时用针稳住了他的气脉。不是治好，只是让它别继续乱冲。"
    chensumei "For now, I have steadied his qi channels with needles. He is not cured; I have only kept them from surging wildly."

# game/script.rpy:3085
translate english s017_clinic_injured_428ef32a:

    # "周青柳立刻问。"
    "Zhou Qingliu asks at once."

# game/script.rpy:3087
translate english s017_clinic_injured_9ca46643:

    # zhouqingliu "毒？"
    zhouqingliu "Poison?"

# game/script.rpy:3089
translate english s017_clinic_injured_a2a389c4:

    # "陈素梅看了他一眼。"
    "Chen Sumei looks at him."

# game/script.rpy:3091
translate english s017_clinic_injured_bdab471b:

    # chensumei "不像。"
    chensumei "Does not seem so."

# game/script.rpy:3093
translate english s017_clinic_injured_73d498d7:

    # zhouqingliu "走火入魔？"
    zhouqingliu "Qi deviation?"

# game/script.rpy:3095
translate english s017_clinic_injured_f7a07509:

    # chensumei "也不像。"
    chensumei "Not that either."

# game/script.rpy:3097
translate english s017_clinic_injured_ac31c4ea:

    # "她停了一下，像是在极不情愿地承认一个不合逻辑的结论。"
    "She pauses, as though reluctantly admitting a conclusion that makes no sense."

# game/script.rpy:3099
translate english s017_clinic_injured_41f8e93b:

    # chensumei "更像是有人把一段不属于他的气，硬塞进了他身体里。"
    chensumei "It is more like someone forced a breath that does not belong to him into his body."

# game/script.rpy:3101
translate english s017_clinic_injured_345e0ed3:

    # "你听得背后一凉。"
    "A chill runs down your back."

# game/script.rpy:3103
translate english s017_clinic_injured_1bf3fe33:

    # "周青柳已经走到药柜前，一边开抽屉，一边快速报药名。"
    "Zhou Qingliu is already at the medicine cabinets, opening drawers as he rapidly names ingredients."

# game/script.rpy:3105
translate english s017_clinic_injured_0a4ec988:

    # zhouqingliu "沈云，取青竹管。星辰呢？让他找雷纹草旧样。"
    zhouqingliu "Shen Yun, fetch green bamboo tubes. Where is Xingchen? Have him find the old sample of thunder-veined grass."

# game/script.rpy:3107
translate english s017_clinic_injured_22ed92d2:

    # zhouqingliu "再拿三钱茯神，两钱远志，一分朱砂不要入药，先备着看反应。"
    zhouqingliu "Bring three qian of fushen and two qian of yuanzhi. Prepare one fen of cinnabar but do not add it to the medicine; we will watch his response first."

# game/script.rpy:3109
translate english s017_clinic_injured_e83d80bb:

    # "沈云立刻跑去帮忙。"
    "Shen Yun runs off to help at once."

# game/script.rpy:3111
translate english s017_clinic_injured_01967e88:

    # "程明珠站在前厅柜台后，目光一直盯着担架方向。"
    "Cheng Mingzhu stands behind the front counter, her gaze fixed on the stretcher."

# game/script.rpy:3113
translate english s017_clinic_injured_7fafcee7:

    # "她很快下令。"
    "She quickly gives orders."

# game/script.rpy:3115
translate english s017_clinic_injured_366aeac0:

    # chengmingzhu "前厅让开一半。普通问诊后移半个时辰。"
    chengmingzhu "Clear half the front hall. Move ordinary consultations back half a shichen."

# game/script.rpy:3117
translate english s017_clinic_injured_4c529cb9:

    # chengmingzhu "魏三儿，回驿站说一声，若还有人抬来，从夹廊小院进，别堵风云坪。"
    chengmingzhu "Wei San'er, tell the post station: if more people are carried here, bring them through the passage courtyard. Do not block Fengyun Square."

# game/script.rpy:3119
translate english s017_clinic_injured_be7f3654:

    # chengmingzhu "方大娘，热水留下，人先别围。"
    chengmingzhu "Auntie Fang, leave the hot water. Keep people from crowding around."

# game/script.rpy:3121
translate english s017_clinic_injured_8885ca3b:

    # "方大娘把手里的汤勺往腰间一别。"
    "Auntie Fang tucks the soup ladle into her waistband."

# game/script.rpy:3123
translate english s017_clinic_injured_74dd6cf7:

    # fangdaniang "行，我不看热闹。我烧水去。谁要是堵门，我顺手也给他烫醒。"
    fangdaniang "Fine, I will not watch the show. I am boiling water. Whoever blocks the door, I will scald awake while I am at it."

# game/script.rpy:3125
translate english s017_clinic_injured_d1e5e03f:

    # "魏三儿点头，但没有立刻走，眼睛还盯着伤者。"
    "Wei San'er nods but does not leave at once, her eyes still fixed on the patient."

# game/script.rpy:3127
translate english s017_clinic_injured_99fddcf9:

    # weisaner "他这脸色……不像普通病。"
    weisaner "That color in his face... it is no ordinary illness."

# game/script.rpy:3131
translate english s017_clinic_injured_67d36146:

    # "这时，送伤者来的两个年轻男子站在一旁，神色焦急。"
    "At this moment, the two young men who brought the injured man stand nearby, visibly anxious."

# game/script.rpy:3133
translate english s017_clinic_injured_eef9a619:

    # "高一点的男子向徐春香拱手，声音发颤。"
    "The taller man cups his hands to Xu Chunxiang, his voice shaking."

# game/script.rpy:3135
translate english s017_clinic_injured_585898f3:

    # gaoge_nanzi "大夫，这是我哥。您一定要救他。"
    gaoge_nanzi "Healer, this is my elder brother. You must save him."

# game/script.rpy:3137
translate english s017_clinic_injured_c88bb06a:

    # "徐春香没有急着答应，而是蹲下看了伤者三息，又把手搭在脉上两瞬。"
    "Xu Chunxiang does not rush to promise. She crouches to observe the patient for three breaths, then rests her fingers on his pulse for two moments."

# game/script.rpy:3139
translate english s017_clinic_injured_63e7f983:

    # "她眉头微微一动，但语气仍然稳。"
    "Her brow moves slightly, but her voice remains steady."

# game/script.rpy:3141
translate english s017_clinic_injured_293aa6f7:

    # xuchunxiang "他这个样子多久了？为什么会变成这样？"
    xuchunxiang "How long has he been like this? How did it happen?"

# game/script.rpy:3143
translate english s017_clinic_injured_3feb36e2:

    # "高个男子急忙说："
    "The taller man answers urgently,"

# game/script.rpy:3145
translate english s017_clinic_injured_eb2dbdf5:

    # gaoge_nanzi "我们从平原镇来，前日刚到开庵镇。"
    gaoge_nanzi "We came from Pingyuan Town and reached Kaian Town the day before yesterday."

# game/script.rpy:3147
translate english s017_clinic_injured_c185dee1:

    # gaoge_nanzi "我哥一路上都好好的，前天夜里还睡得安稳。"
    gaoge_nanzi "My brother was fine along the way and slept soundly the night before last."

# game/script.rpy:3149
translate english s017_clinic_injured_953a8c55:

    # gaoge_nanzi "哪成想昨日到了雷云峰山脚，他便开始说胡话。"
    gaoge_nanzi "Who would have thought that after reaching the foot of Leiyun Peak yesterday, he began speaking nonsense."

# game/script.rpy:3151
translate english s017_clinic_injured_9d16b988:

    # "矮个男子忍不住插话。"
    "The shorter man cannot help interrupting."

# game/script.rpy:3153
translate english s017_clinic_injured_97827fb3:

    # aige_nanzi "都怪那个死道姑！要不是她——"
    aige_nanzi "It is all that damned Daoist nun's fault! If not for her—"

# game/script.rpy:3155
translate english s017_clinic_injured_21d41f67:

    # "徐春香抬眼看他，声音不高，却让他立刻收住。"
    "Xu Chunxiang raises her eyes to him. Her voice is not loud, yet he stops immediately."

# game/script.rpy:3157
translate english s017_clinic_injured_8ec5a1b3:

    # xuchunxiang "人在医馆，说话先留三分。"
    xuchunxiang "In a clinic, leave three parts unsaid before you speak."

# game/script.rpy:3159
translate english s017_clinic_injured_8f6e21fc:

    # xuchunxiang "你既一路从碧溪府赶来凰龙府，若要救他，便把话说清楚。"
    xuchunxiang "Since you came all the way from Bixi Prefecture to Huanglongfu, if you want to save him, speak clearly."

# game/script.rpy:3161
translate english s017_clinic_injured_47db87e8:

    # xuchunxiang "若只想骂人，门在那边。"
    xuchunxiang "If you only want to curse, the door is there."

# game/script.rpy:3163
translate english s017_clinic_injured_134e3b58:

    # "高个男子连忙按住矮个男子的手。"
    "The taller man quickly restrains the shorter man's hand."

# game/script.rpy:3165
translate english s017_clinic_injured_2e6048c2:

    # gaoge_nanzi "三弟，别乱说。"
    gaoge_nanzi "Third Brother, do not speak carelessly."

# game/script.rpy:3167
translate english s017_clinic_injured_9b464bc0:

    # "矮个男子咬牙。"
    "The shorter man grits his teeth."

# game/script.rpy:3169
translate english s017_clinic_injured_570520f6:

    # aige_nanzi "她用拂尘往大哥头上一挥，大哥就成这样了！"
    aige_nanzi "She swept a fly-whisk over my elder brother's head, and he became like this!"

# game/script.rpy:3171
translate english s017_clinic_injured_0bd93e59:

    # "徐春香若有所思。"
    "Xu Chunxiang considers this."

# game/script.rpy:3173
translate english s017_clinic_injured_584e063a:

    # xuchunxiang "你们说的道姑，可知她道号？穿的是什么道袍？是否自称风雷观弟子？"
    xuchunxiang "Do you know this Daoist nun's name? What robe did she wear? Did she call herself a Fenglei Abbey disciple?"

# game/script.rpy:3175
translate english s017_clinic_injured_3c8ba5a1:

    # "高个男子摇头。"
    "The taller man shakes his head."

# game/script.rpy:3177
translate english s017_clinic_injured_ec0d7232:

    # gaoge_nanzi "我们不知道。她没说。"
    gaoge_nanzi "We do not know. She did not say."

# game/script.rpy:3179
translate english s017_clinic_injured_7f27a7bc:

    # "矮个男子还想争辩。"
    "The shorter man tries to argue again."

# game/script.rpy:3181
translate english s017_clinic_injured_ad59bf77:

    # aige_nanzi "她就是从山脚来的！不是风雷观的人，还能是谁？"
    aige_nanzi "She came from the mountain's foot! If she was not from Fenglei Abbey, who else could she be?"

# game/script.rpy:3183
translate english s017_clinic_injured_cf24dd38:

    # "周青柳这时从药柜旁转过身，语气带着一点锋利。"
    "Zhou Qingliu turns from the medicine cabinets, a slight edge in his voice."

# game/script.rpy:3185
translate english s017_clinic_injured_1e4e18ec:

    # zhouqingliu "我前几日刚从雷云峰送药回来。"
    zhouqingliu "I only returned from delivering medicine to Leiyun Peak a few days ago."

# game/script.rpy:3187
translate english s017_clinic_injured_d58a2237:

    # zhouqingliu "风雷观近日闭观炼丹，弟子不得随意下山。"
    zhouqingliu "Fenglei Abbey has closed itself to refine the elixir; its disciples may not casually descend the mountain."

# game/script.rpy:3189
translate english s017_clinic_injured_567d9345:

    # zhouqingliu "山上日常饮食、薪柴、药材，都是差人送上去的。"
    zhouqingliu "Daily food, firewood, and medicines are all sent up by hired people."

# game/script.rpy:3191
translate english s017_clinic_injured_e6e88e47:

    # zhouqingliu "你们若真遇见了‘道姑’，她未必是风雷观的人。"
    zhouqingliu "If you truly met a 'Daoist nun,' she may not have been from Fenglei Abbey."

# game/script.rpy:3193
translate english s017_clinic_injured_90f1e8d8:

    # "两个年轻男子脸色一变。"
    "Both young men change color."

# game/script.rpy:3195
translate english s017_clinic_injured_f2aea208:

    # "李默在旁边淡淡开口，声音不大。"
    "Li Mo speaks from beside them, his voice quiet."

# game/script.rpy:3197
translate english s017_clinic_injured_2f2a5654:

    # limo "他们隐瞒了路。"
    limo "They concealed their route."

# game/script.rpy:3199
translate english s017_clinic_injured_24b1c781:

    # "众人安静了一瞬。"
    "Everyone falls quiet for a moment."

# game/script.rpy:3201
translate english s017_clinic_injured_4353aa86:

    # "高个男子额角冒汗。"
    "Sweat beads at the taller man's temple."

# game/script.rpy:3203
translate english s017_clinic_injured_eb7fe58f:

    # gaoge_nanzi "我们……我们只是想从近路上山。"
    gaoge_nanzi "We... we only wanted to take a shortcut up the mountain."

# game/script.rpy:3205
translate english s017_clinic_injured_67d544c4:

    # gaoge_nanzi "听人说，正路这几日不通，山脚旁还有一条旧采药路。"
    gaoge_nanzi "We heard that the main road was closed these days, but there was an old herb-gatherers' trail by the mountain foot."

# game/script.rpy:3207
translate english s017_clinic_injured_7e2980cc:

    # "徐春香没有立刻责备，只说："
    "Xu Chunxiang does not rebuke them at once, saying only,"

# game/script.rpy:3209
translate english s017_clinic_injured_0535e72f:

    # xuchunxiang "救人要紧。话可以稍后再问，但最好别再藏。"
    xuchunxiang "Saving him comes first. Questions can wait, but you had better not hide anything more."

# game/script.rpy:3211
translate english s017_clinic_injured_240a4ac8:

    # xuchunxiang "你们藏一句，他就多险一分。"
    xuchunxiang "For every sentence you hide, his danger grows by one part."

# game/script.rpy:3213
translate english s017_clinic_injured_540ae5b4:

    # "她起身，对周青柳说："
    "She rises and tells Zhou Qingliu,"

# game/script.rpy:3215
translate english s017_clinic_injured_fef5e89d:

    # xuchunxiang "先按定息方稳住，不要猛攻毒。若是外气冲脉，药下重了反会激它。"
    xuchunxiang "First stabilize him with a breath-settling formula; do not attack poison fiercely. If external qi is striking his channels, too strong a dose will provoke it."

# game/script.rpy:3217
translate english s017_clinic_injured_6372611b:

    # "周青柳点头。"
    "Zhou Qingliu nods."

# game/script.rpy:3219
translate english s017_clinic_injured_f5bd0f31:

    # zhouqingliu "我试轻方。"
    zhouqingliu "I will try a mild formula."

# game/script.rpy:3221
translate english s017_clinic_injured_be64630f:

    # "陈素梅坐到一旁桌前，仍盯着伤者。"
    "Chen Sumei sits at a nearby table, still watching the patient."

# game/script.rpy:3223
translate english s017_clinic_injured_6cdd2837:

    # chensumei "我给你们半炷香。半炷香后若脉还乱，我要重下针。"
    chensumei "I give you half an incense stick's time. If his pulse is still in disorder then, I will needle him again."

# game/script.rpy:3225
translate english s017_clinic_injured_f4e8b84a:

    # chensumei "到时他疼，不要叫我轻些。"
    chensumei "When it hurts him, do not tell me to be gentle."

# game/script.rpy:3227
translate english s017_clinic_injured_0d773a67:

    # "矮个男子脸色更白。"
    "The shorter man's face grows still paler."

# game/script.rpy:3229
translate english s017_clinic_injured_b892cca5:

    # "徐春香听完那两名年轻男子的话，神色并没有太大变化。"
    "After hearing the two young men, Xu Chunxiang's expression barely changes."

# game/script.rpy:3231
translate english s017_clinic_injured_039fa156:

    # "她只问了一句："
    "She asks only one question:"

# game/script.rpy:3233
translate english s017_clinic_injured_ed16c8e5:

    # xuchunxiang "她的拂尘柄上，可有雷纹？"
    xuchunxiang "Did the handle of her fly-whisk bear a thunder pattern?"

# game/script.rpy:3235
translate english s017_clinic_injured_2eacdb02:

    # "高个男子迟疑。"
    "The taller man hesitates."

# game/script.rpy:3237
translate english s017_clinic_injured_4e95fe29:

    # "矮个男子咬牙道："
    "The shorter man says through clenched teeth,"

# game/script.rpy:3239
translate english s017_clinic_injured_f4c966ff:

    # aige_nanzi "有又如何？她把我大哥害成这样！"
    aige_nanzi "What if it did? She harmed my elder brother like this!"

# game/script.rpy:3241
translate english s017_clinic_injured_64c0d614:

    # "徐春香看了他一眼。"
    "Xu Chunxiang looks at him."

# game/script.rpy:3243
translate english s017_clinic_injured_ad3f3661:

    # xuchunxiang "若真是她，你大哥此刻还能躺在这里说胡话，已是她留了命。"
    xuchunxiang "If it truly was her, the fact that your brother can still lie here speaking nonsense means she spared his life."

# game/script.rpy:3245
translate english s017_clinic_injured_ed854efb:

    # "两人脸色同时变了。"
    "Both men change color at once."

# game/script.rpy:3247
translate english s017_clinic_injured_4cc84979:

    # "周青柳皱眉。"
    "Zhou Qingliu frowns."

# game/script.rpy:3249
translate english s017_clinic_injured_858a7780:

    # zhouqingliu "掌柜的，你是说……"
    zhouqingliu "Manager, you mean..."

# game/script.rpy:3251
translate english s017_clinic_injured_54f9bd08:

    # "徐春香没有接话，只转身看向陈素梅。"
    "Xu Chunxiang does not answer, only turns to Chen Sumei."

# game/script.rpy:3253
translate english s017_clinic_injured_d6667275:

    # "陈素梅坐在一旁，指尖还沾着针后的汗意，语气冷静。"
    "Chen Sumei sits nearby, her fingertips still damp from needling, her tone calm."

# game/script.rpy:3255
translate english s017_clinic_injured_c574a06a:

    # chensumei "外息入体，强行冲脉。有人以极强内力替他压了一次，否则他撑不到医馆。"
    chensumei "External qi entered his body and forced its way through his channels. Someone used extremely powerful inner force to suppress it once; otherwise, he would not have reached the clinic."

# game/script.rpy:3257
translate english s017_clinic_injured_44c93855:

    # "徐春香点头。"
    "Xu Chunxiang nods."

# game/script.rpy:3259
translate english s017_clinic_injured_80500435:

    # xuchunxiang "不是伤在拂尘，是伤在贪近丹炉。"
    xuchunxiang "The fly-whisk did not injure him. His greed to approach the elixir furnace did."

# game/script.rpy:3261
translate english s017_clinic_injured_eac7ba90:

    # "高个男子嘴唇发白。"
    "The taller man's lips go white."

# game/script.rpy:3263
translate english s017_clinic_injured_febb3c96:

    # gaoge_nanzi "我们……我们只是想看一眼。"
    gaoge_nanzi "We... we only wanted one look."

# game/script.rpy:3265
translate english s017_clinic_injured_9c9ec58c:

    # "李默在门边淡淡道："
    "Li Mo says quietly from the door,"

# game/script.rpy:3267
translate english s017_clinic_injured_e9d957b2:

    # limo "看一眼，用得着走小路？"
    limo "To take one look, did you need a back trail?"

# game/script.rpy:3269
translate english s017_clinic_injured_aec7dc13:

    # "没人再说话。"
    "No one speaks again."

# game/script.rpy:3271
translate english s017_clinic_injured_d988633f:

    # "徐春香没有发怒。"
    "Xu Chunxiang does not grow angry."

# game/script.rpy:3273
translate english s017_clinic_injured_96fbe620:

    # "她只是蹲下身，再次按住伤者的脉。"
    "She only crouches and takes the injured man's pulse again."

# game/script.rpy:3275
translate english s017_clinic_injured_19c0cf7b:

    # "伤者仍在喃喃。"
    "The injured man continues to mutter."

# game/script.rpy:3277
translate english s017_clinic_injured_a3671def_1:

    # shangzhe "所闻非所见……所见非人间……奇哉……怪也……"
    shangzhe "What I heard was not what I saw... What I saw was not of this world... Strange... uncanny..."

# game/script.rpy:3281
translate english s017_clinic_injured_f4b8319f:

    # "徐春香抬头。"
    "Xu Chunxiang looks up."

# game/script.rpy:3283
translate english s017_clinic_injured_7fe33c59:

    # xuchunxiang "星辰，跟我上药书房。取春华息脉匣。"
    xuchunxiang "Xingchen, come with me to the medicine study. Bring the Chunhua Breath-Channel Casket."

# game/script.rpy:3285
translate english s017_clinic_injured_30dea28a:

    # "沈星辰怔了一下。"
    "Shen Xingchen hesitates."

# game/script.rpy:3287
translate english s017_clinic_injured_22d4f424:

    # shenxingchen "要用《春华回春诀》？"
    shenxingchen "Will you use the Chunhua Life-Restoring Art?"

# game/script.rpy:3289
translate english s017_clinic_injured_c6ffc283:

    # xuchunxiang "只用‘息’与‘和’两段。"
    xuchunxiang "Only the 'Breath' and 'Harmony' sections."

# game/script.rpy:3291
translate english s017_clinic_injured_26a67b0b:

    # xuchunxiang "先把他的元息留住，再把不属于他的那股气慢慢化开。"
    xuchunxiang "First keep hold of his vital breath, then slowly disperse the qi that does not belong to him."

# game/script.rpy:3293
translate english s017_clinic_injured_adf948bf:

    # "周青柳立刻明白，转身去配药。"
    "Zhou Qingliu understands at once and turns to prepare medicine."

# game/script.rpy:3295
translate english s017_clinic_injured_e991039a:

    # zhouqingliu "我用轻方，不攻毒，只辅定息。"
    zhouqingliu "I will use a mild formula: no attack on poison, only support for settling the breath."

# game/script.rpy:3297
translate english s017_clinic_injured_104e054a:

    # "陈素梅重新坐回针位。"
    "Chen Sumei returns to her needle position."

# game/script.rpy:3299
translate english s017_clinic_injured_0cb7608a:

    # chensumei "半炷香内，他若再乱冲，我下第二轮针。你们别碰他，也别哭。"
    chensumei "If he surges wildly again within half an incense stick, I will use a second round of needles. Do not touch him, and do not cry."

# game/script.rpy:3301
translate english s017_clinic_injured_654b5927:

    # "程明珠已经开始分派人手。"
    "Cheng Mingzhu has already begun assigning people."

# game/script.rpy:3303
translate english s017_clinic_injured_87902498:

    # chengmingzhu "沈云，热水。"
    chengmingzhu "Shen Yun, hot water."

# game/script.rpy:3305
translate english s017_clinic_injured_4abee571:

    # chengmingzhu "你，去夹廊小院取干净布巾，再告诉驿站，医馆前厅今日不接闲人。"
    chengmingzhu "You, fetch clean cloths from the passage courtyard. Then tell the post station that the clinic's front hall will receive no idle visitors today."

# game/script.rpy:3307
translate english s017_clinic_injured_bae4953e:

    # chengmingzhu "魏三儿，你回去让郭总管留一条去雷云峰的信路。"
    chengmingzhu "Wei San'er, go back and have Manager Guo keep a message route open to Leiyun Peak."

# game/script.rpy:3309
translate english s017_clinic_injured_ad683b60:

    # "魏三儿脸色难得严肃。"
    "Wei San'er is unusually serious."

# game/script.rpy:3311
translate english s017_clinic_injured_39dbc905:

    # weisaner "明白。"
    weisaner "Understood."

# game/script.rpy:3313
translate english s017_clinic_injured_dda29ab3:

    # "你依言跑了一趟，把布巾和热水送到诊桌旁。"
    "You do as told, fetching cloths and hot water and delivering them beside the consultation desk."

# game/script.rpy:3315
translate english s017_clinic_injured_266abfd6:

    # "程明珠只点了点头，没有夸奖，却也没有再把你当外人。"
    "Cheng Mingzhu only nods, offering no praise, but she no longer treats you as an outsider."

# game/script.rpy:3319
translate english s017_clinic_injured_fc8288a6:

    # "片刻后，徐春香从二楼下来，手中多了一个紫檀小匣。"
    "A while later, Xu Chunxiang comes down from the second floor carrying a small rosewood casket."

# game/script.rpy:3321
translate english s017_clinic_injured_cb9d1a6f:

    # "她打开匣子，里面是银针、细瓶、一卷浅色绢帛，还有几枚温润如玉的药丸。"
    "She opens it. Inside are silver needles, small vials, a roll of pale silk, and several smooth jade-like pills."

# game/script.rpy:3323
translate english s017_clinic_injured_754000dc:

    # "她没有立刻喂药，而是先以两指按脉，闭目三息。"
    "She does not give medicine immediately. First she presses the pulse with two fingers and closes her eyes for three breaths."

# game/script.rpy:3325
translate english s017_clinic_injured_a966bd3a:

    # "前厅所有声音都低了下去。"
    "Every sound in the front hall lowers."

# game/script.rpy:3327
translate english s017_clinic_injured_cca8eee8:

    # "随后，徐春香以极轻的手法按在伤者胸口与腕脉之间。"
    "Then Xu Chunxiang uses an extremely light touch between the patient's chest and wrist pulse."

# game/script.rpy:3329
translate english s017_clinic_injured_c8f59148:

    # "她以“息诀”先定住伤者元息，再以“和诀”引那股外息从胸腹间缓缓散开，不让它再冲向头颈。"
    "With the Breath Art she first settles the patient's vital breath; with the Harmony Art she slowly draws the external qi apart through chest and abdomen, keeping it from surging toward his head and neck."

# game/script.rpy:3331
translate english s017_clinic_injured_a0cf400c:

    # "陈素梅在旁补针，周青柳递药，沈星辰捧匣，沈云端水，程明珠挡住围观的人。"
    "Chen Sumei adds needles, Zhou Qingliu passes medicine, Shen Xingchen holds the casket, Shen Yun brings water, and Cheng Mingzhu keeps onlookers away."

# game/script.rpy:3335
translate english s017_clinic_injured_70474713:

    # "过了许久，伤者喉咙里忽然发出一声极长的喘息。"
    "After a long while, the injured man suddenly lets out one long, ragged breath."

# game/script.rpy:3337
translate english s017_clinic_injured_775449f5:

    # "他颈侧青色血脉慢慢退下去，眼球也不再鼓得吓人。"
    "The blue veins at his neck slowly recede, and his eyes no longer bulge so frightfully."

# game/script.rpy:3339
translate english s017_clinic_injured_b928a807:

    # "脸色仍然灰败，却终于不再重复那句怪话。"
    "His face remains ashen, but at last he stops repeating that strange phrase."

# game/script.rpy:3341
translate english s017_clinic_injured_13a36240:

    # "高个男子扑上前半步。"
    "The taller man lunges half a step forward."

# game/script.rpy:3343
translate english s017_clinic_injured_00060a01:

    # gaoge_nanzi "大哥！"
    gaoge_nanzi "Elder Brother!"

# game/script.rpy:3345
translate english s017_clinic_injured_077250dd:

    # "陈素梅冷冷道："
    "Chen Sumei says coldly,"

# game/script.rpy:3347
translate english s017_clinic_injured_1deca952:

    # chensumei "再近一步，他刚稳住的气就白稳了。"
    chensumei "One step closer and all the qi I just steadied will have been steadied for nothing."

# game/script.rpy:3349
translate english s017_clinic_injured_610e1c83:

    # "高个男子立刻停住。"
    "The taller man stops at once."

# game/script.rpy:3351
translate english s017_clinic_injured_bfcf207c:

    # "徐春香收手，声音有些疲惫。"
    "Xu Chunxiang withdraws her hands, sounding somewhat weary."

# game/script.rpy:3353
translate english s017_clinic_injured_dfd3b3b5:

    # xuchunxiang "命暂时留下了。能不能醒，醒后还能不能像从前一样，要看今晚。"
    xuchunxiang "His life has been kept for now. Whether he wakes, and whether he can be as he was after waking, depends on tonight."

# game/script.rpy:3355
translate english s017_clinic_injured_1d42ad73:

    # "矮个男子低声道："
    "The shorter man says softly,"

# game/script.rpy:3357
translate english s017_clinic_injured_2ee82100:

    # aige_nanzi "那……那我们……"
    aige_nanzi "Then... then we..."

# game/script.rpy:3359
translate english s017_clinic_injured_e29b4bbb:

    # "徐春香看向他们。"
    "Xu Chunxiang looks at them."

# game/script.rpy:3361
translate english s017_clinic_injured_1e99c39b:

    # xuchunxiang "你们两个，今晚也留下。"
    xuchunxiang "You two will stay tonight as well."

# game/script.rpy:3363
translate english s017_clinic_injured_c073ac60:

    # "矮个男子一惊。"
    "The shorter man startles."

# game/script.rpy:3365
translate english s017_clinic_injured_8f608b10:

    # aige_nanzi "凭什么？"
    aige_nanzi "Why should we?"

# game/script.rpy:3367
translate english s017_clinic_injured_2bbd5cbe:

    # "李默的手按在刀柄上，终于开口。"
    "Li Mo places a hand on his sword hilt and finally speaks."

# game/script.rpy:3369
translate english s017_clinic_injured_0736f944:

    # limo "凭你们走过不该走的路，见过不该见的人，还说了不该说的谎。"
    limo "Because you walked a road you should not have walked, saw someone you should not have seen, and told lies you should not have told."

# game/script.rpy:3371
translate english s017_clinic_injured_3ac38605:

    # "徐春香语气依旧平和。"
    "Xu Chunxiang's tone remains calm."

# game/script.rpy:3373
translate english s017_clinic_injured_f73726ce:

    # xuchunxiang "医馆不审人，但医馆也不替人藏祸。"
    xuchunxiang "A clinic does not judge people, but neither does it hide danger for them."

# game/script.rpy:3375
translate english s017_clinic_injured_f208d979:

    # xuchunxiang "你们若真想救他，就把昨夜从哪条路上山、谁指的路、看见了什么，全告诉周药师。"
    xuchunxiang "If you truly want to save him, tell Apothecary Zhou everything: which road you took up the mountain last night, who showed it to you, and what you saw."

# game/script.rpy:3377
translate english s017_clinic_injured_ca802eee:

    # "高个男子低下头。"
    "The taller man lowers his head."

# game/script.rpy:3379
translate english s017_clinic_injured_fa9cb653:

    # gaoge_nanzi "我们说。"
    gaoge_nanzi "We will tell you."

# game/script.rpy:3381
translate english s017_clinic_injured_e510a986:

    # "徐春香转向周青柳。"
    "Xu Chunxiang turns to Zhou Qingliu."

# game/script.rpy:3383
translate english s017_clinic_injured_74e26775:

    # xuchunxiang "写医案。送风雷观。"
    xuchunxiang "Write a medical case report. Send it to Fenglei Abbey."

# game/script.rpy:3385
translate english s017_clinic_injured_ff690d0e:

    # "周青柳问："
    "Zhou Qingliu asks,"

# game/script.rpy:3387
translate english s017_clinic_injured_27f8e71a:

    # zhouqingliu "怎么写？"
    zhouqingliu "How should I write it?"

# game/script.rpy:3389
translate english s017_clinic_injured_d763bd47:

    # "徐春香看了一眼担架上的人。"
    "Xu Chunxiang looks at the man on the stretcher."

# game/script.rpy:3391
translate english s017_clinic_injured_7130e4d4:

    # xuchunxiang "写‘擅入外山者，外息冲脉，已暂留性命，请风雷观查山路’。"
    xuchunxiang "Write: 'One who trespassed upon the outer mountain suffered external qi striking the channels; life has been temporarily preserved. Request Fenglei Abbey investigate the mountain path.'"

# game/script.rpy:3393
translate english s017_clinic_injured_b37bb987:

    # "她顿了顿，又说："
    "She pauses, then says,"

# game/script.rpy:3395
translate english s017_clinic_injured_d4ddcf57:

    # xuchunxiang "别写求丹。求丹还有情可原，偷丹就不好听了。"
    xuchunxiang "Do not write that they sought the elixir. Seeking an elixir can be understood; stealing one does not sound so well."

# game/script.rpy:3397
translate english s017_clinic_injured_f068fea7:

    # "魏三儿从门边探头。"
    "Wei San'er peeks in from the door."

# game/script.rpy:3399
translate english s017_clinic_injured_527df986:

    # weisaner "那信让谁送？"
    weisaner "Who will carry the letter?"

# game/script.rpy:3401
translate english s017_clinic_injured_d3df4927:

    # "徐春香看向夹廊小院北侧。"
    "Xu Chunxiang looks toward the north side of the passage courtyard."

# game/script.rpy:3403
translate english s017_clinic_injured_45fd23ac:

    # xuchunxiang "郭路平会知道。"
    xuchunxiang "Guo Luping will know."

# game/script.rpy:3407
translate english s017_clinic_injured_3f9ab856:

    # "你站在一旁，看着医馆众人各自归位。"
    "You stand aside, watching everyone in the clinic return to their places."

# game/script.rpy:3409
translate english s017_clinic_injured_31611d55:

    # "徐春香救命，陈素梅控脉，周青柳写医案，程明珠管人，沈云跑腿，沈星辰捧着药匣，李默守住门口。"
    "Xu Chunxiang saves lives; Chen Sumei controls the pulse; Zhou Qingliu writes the case report; Cheng Mingzhu manages people; Shen Yun runs errands; Shen Xingchen carries the medicine casket; Li Mo guards the door."

# game/script.rpy:3411
translate english s017_clinic_injured_57939a6f:

    # "你忽然明白：茯苓医馆的安静，不是不问江湖，而是江湖到了门前，它先救人，再算账。"
    "You suddenly understand: Fuling Clinic's quiet does not mean it ignores the jianghu. When the jianghu comes to its door, it saves lives first and settles accounts afterward."

# game/script.rpy:3415
translate english s017_clinic_injured_3811aff6:

    # "傍晚时，伤者终于短暂醒了一次。"
    "At evening, the injured man finally wakes briefly."

# game/script.rpy:3417
translate english s017_clinic_injured_450eb0d6:

    # "他睁开眼，只说了一句话："
    "He opens his eyes and says only one thing:"

# game/script.rpy:3419
translate english s017_clinic_injured_ae123b3f:

    # shangzhe "不是丹炉……炉后还有人……"
    shangzhe "Not the elixir furnace... There is someone behind the furnace..."

# game/script.rpy:3421
translate english s017_clinic_injured_692ba51f:

    # "说完便又昏睡过去。"
    "With that, he falls unconscious again."

# game/script.rpy:3423
translate english s017_clinic_injured_2753b7f6:

    # "这句话很快传到了长风楼。"
    "These words quickly reach Changfeng House."

# game/script.rpy:3425
translate english s017_clinic_injured_9ce363bf:

    # "魏三儿低声对你说："
    "Wei San'er tells you quietly,"

# game/script.rpy:3427
translate english s017_clinic_injured_71df66f4:

    # weisaner "今晚长风楼肯定热闹。"
    weisaner "Changfeng House will surely be lively tonight."

# game/script.rpy:3429
translate english s017_clinic_injured_c45ece7f:

    # weisaner "有人会说风雷观藏了怪物，有人会说云清道长杀人灭口。"
    weisaner "Some will say Fenglei Abbey hides a monster; some will say Daoist Yunqing murdered to silence people."

# game/script.rpy:3431
translate english s017_clinic_injured_7f949337:

    # weisaner "去听听吧，假话传得快，真话有时候也藏在假话里。"
    weisaner "Go listen. False words travel fast, and sometimes truth hides among them."

# game/script.rpy:3433
translate english s017_clinic_injured_1b2176ad:

    # "沈云也说："
    "Shen Yun says as well,"

# game/script.rpy:3435
translate english s017_clinic_injured_94497062:

    # shenyun "去听听。若有人故意把这事传歪，医馆和风雷观都要麻烦。"
    shenyun "Go listen. If someone deliberately twists this story, both the clinic and Fenglei Abbey will have trouble."

# game/script.rpy:3437
translate english s017_clinic_injured_25fc04d7:

    # "你想起白日里的驿站住满、医馆伤者，还有那句“炉后还有人”，决定去长风楼看看。"
    "Remembering the full post station, the injured man at the clinic, and the words 'someone behind the furnace,' you decide to see Changfeng House."

# game/script.rpy:3439
translate english s017_clinic_injured_c3527bc2:

    # weisaner "快去快回。宵禁前一定回来。"
    weisaner "Go quickly and return quickly. Be back before curfew."

# game/script.rpy:3441
translate english s017_clinic_injured_f5dabefd:

    # weisaner "长风楼那地方，酒喝多了的人，说出来的话比梦还长。"
    weisaner "At Changfeng House, people who drink too much say things longer than dreams."

# game/script.rpy:3443
translate english s017_clinic_injured_dc974445:

    # "魏三儿本来不放心你一个人去，临走前嘱咐了你一句。"
    "Wei San'er is not quite at ease with you going alone and gives you one last warning before you leave."

# game/script.rpy:3445
translate english s017_clinic_injured_6a0f7fbe:

    # "你答应后，前往长风楼。"
    "After agreeing, you head for Changfeng House."

# game/script.rpy:3457
translate english s018_changfeng_rumors_9e416d44:

    # "傍晚时分，距离宵禁还有两个时辰。"
    "At dusk, two shichen remain before curfew."

# game/script.rpy:3459
translate english s018_changfeng_rumors_57f861c7:

    # "开庵镇正北一带，比白天更热闹。"
    "The northern part of Kaian Town is livelier than it was by day."

# game/script.rpy:3461
translate english s018_changfeng_rumors_9fc55eb5:

    # "长风楼、青云楼、凰龙客栈、清沐所的灯笼陆续亮起。"
    "Lanterns light one after another at Changfeng House, Qingyun House, Huanglong Inn, and Qingmu Bathhouse."

# game/script.rpy:3463
translate english s018_changfeng_rumors_ab68e87e:

    # "酒香、肉香、热水汽和马粪味混在一起，竟也成了江湖味道。"
    "The scent of wine and meat, hot steam, and horse dung mingle into a smell that somehow belongs to the jianghu."

# game/script.rpy:3465
translate english s018_changfeng_rumors_709bccdd:

    # "长风楼门口人来人往。"
    "People stream in and out of Changfeng House."

# game/script.rpy:3467
translate english s018_changfeng_rumors_630ada8a:

    # "楼上楼下坐满了江湖客。"
    "Jianghu travelers fill both floors."

# game/script.rpy:3469
translate english s018_changfeng_rumors_39408c15:

    # "有人带刀，有人背琴，有人一身富贵，有人满身尘土。"
    "Some carry swords, some bear qin, some are richly dressed, and some are covered in dust."

# game/script.rpy:3471
translate english s018_changfeng_rumors_1327c26e:

    # "白日里茯苓医馆抬进怪症伤者的事，已经像风一样传了过来。"
    "News of the strange patient carried into Fuling Clinic by day has already blown here like the wind."

# game/script.rpy:3475
translate english s018_changfeng_rumors_0e4f4f8e:

    # "辛万和正站在柜台后，脸上挂着笑，眼神却一直扫着全场。"
    "Xin Wanhe stands behind the counter smiling, though his eyes continually sweep the room."

# game/script.rpy:3477
translate english s018_changfeng_rumors_80a3eca9:

    # "长风楼今夜生意极好。"
    "Changfeng House is doing excellent business tonight."

# game/script.rpy:3479
translate english s018_changfeng_rumors_c0f6702e:

    # "但越是生意好，越容易出事。"
    "But the better the business, the easier it is for trouble to arise."

# game/script.rpy:3481
translate english s018_changfeng_rumors_358092b2:

    # "你刚进门，就听见有人拍桌。"
    "As soon as you enter, you hear someone slap a table."

# game/script.rpy:3485
translate english s018_changfeng_rumors_b90faee8:

    # jianghukejia "我亲耳听说了！风雷观丹炉里不是炼丹，是炼人！"
    jianghukejia "I heard it with my own ears! Fenglei Abbey's furnace is not refining elixirs—it is refining people!"

# game/script.rpy:3487
translate english s018_changfeng_rumors_85bd19dd:

    # "另一桌立刻有人反驳。"
    "Someone at another table immediately rebuts him."

# game/script.rpy:3489
translate english s018_changfeng_rumors_60e6ee74:

    # jianghukeyi "胡说！那丹是锁年岁的神丹，吃一颗能定住三十年容颜！"
    jianghukeyi "Nonsense! That elixir is a divine pill that fixes one's years; one can hold thirty years of beauty with a single pill!"

# game/script.rpy:3491
translate english s018_changfeng_rumors_466cff1d:

    # "又有人冷笑。"
    "Someone else gives a cold laugh."

# game/script.rpy:3493
translate english s018_changfeng_rumors_879ccdd5:

    # jianghukebing "若真是神丹，风雷观为何封山？我看是云清道长想借丹收服江湖！"
    jianghukebing "If it is truly divine, why has Fenglei Abbey closed the mountain? I say Daoist Yunqing wants to use it to subdue the jianghu!"

# game/script.rpy:3495
translate english s018_changfeng_rumors_0339b233:

    # "说书人坐在楼梯旁，本来正在说前朝旧案。"
    "A storyteller sits by the stairs, having been telling an old case from the previous dynasty."

# game/script.rpy:3497
translate english s018_changfeng_rumors_64158093:

    # "此刻见众人都在谈雷云峰，他便顺势改了话头。"
    "Seeing everyone speak of Leiyun Peak, he smoothly changes his subject."

# game/script.rpy:3499
translate english s018_changfeng_rumors_764aca99:

    # shuoshuren "诸位且听！"
    shuoshuren "Everyone, listen!"

# game/script.rpy:3501
translate english s018_changfeng_rumors_4fcf8277:

    # shuoshuren "今日茯苓医馆抬进一人，青筋如蛇，眼凸如鬼，口中只念八字——奇哉怪也，所见非人间！"
    shuoshuren "Today a man was carried into Fuling Clinic: veins like snakes, eyes bulging like a ghost's, repeating only eight words—strange and uncanny, what he saw was not of this world!"

# game/script.rpy:3503
translate english s018_changfeng_rumors_3866fee0:

    # "楼中一片哗然。"
    "An uproar rises through the hall."

# game/script.rpy:3505
translate english s018_changfeng_rumors_3fa3c613:

    # "你找了个角落坐下，听着传言越滚越大。"
    "You find a corner seat and listen as the rumors grow larger and larger."

# game/script.rpy:3507
translate english s018_changfeng_rumors_b1160e24:

    # "有人说，那人是被风雷观道姑打成这样的。"
    "Some say the man was beaten into this state by a Daoist nun of Fenglei Abbey."

# game/script.rpy:3509
translate english s018_changfeng_rumors_aa6d0a7d:

    # "有人说，不是打，是灭口，那人看见了不该看的东西。"
    "Some say it was not a beating but silencing, because the man saw what he should not have seen."

# game/script.rpy:3511
translate english s018_changfeng_rumors_1248f9dc:

    # "有人说，丹炉后头有怪物，专吃求丹人的元息。"
    "Some say there is a monster behind the furnace that feeds on the vital breath of those seeking elixirs."

# game/script.rpy:3513
translate english s018_changfeng_rumors_ac7fe2dd:

    # "还有人压低声音说，长息定年丹要用活人做引，否则怎么能定年。"
    "Others whisper that the Long-Breath Age-Settling Elixir needs living people as a catalyst—how else could it settle one's years?"

# game/script.rpy:3515
translate english s018_changfeng_rumors_6560a60c:

    # "你越听越觉得荒唐。"
    "The more you hear, the more absurd it seems."

# game/script.rpy:3517
translate english s018_changfeng_rumors_9dcdeddb:

    # "白日里你在医馆亲眼见到的情况，已经被传得面目全非。"
    "What you witnessed at the clinic today has already been twisted beyond recognition."

# game/script.rpy:3519
translate english s018_changfeng_rumors_dc1f7996:

    # "辛万和试图压住场面。"
    "Xin Wanhe tries to calm the room."

# game/script.rpy:3521
translate english s018_changfeng_rumors_7efb2f5d:

    # xinwanhe "诸位，喝酒归喝酒，话别说得太满。"
    xinwanhe "Everyone, drink if you wish, but do not make your claims too absolute."

# game/script.rpy:3523
translate english s018_changfeng_rumors_aef5a7dc:

    # xinwanhe "长风楼卖酒，不卖人命官司。"
    xinwanhe "Changfeng House sells wine, not lawsuits over lives."

# game/script.rpy:3525
translate english s018_changfeng_rumors_83a2f553:

    # "可酒客们反而更兴奋。"
    "The drinkers only grow more excited."

# game/script.rpy:3527
translate english s018_changfeng_rumors_ce9d2bea:

    # "说书人也趁势添油加醋。"
    "The storyteller takes the chance to add fuel to the fire."

# game/script.rpy:3529
translate english s018_changfeng_rumors_668a79ac:

    # shuoshuren "那伤者临昏前曾道：不是丹炉，炉后有人！"
    shuoshuren "Before collapsing, the injured man said: Not the furnace—there is someone behind the furnace!"

# game/script.rpy:3531
translate english s018_changfeng_rumors_9289e327:

    # shuoshuren "诸位想想，炉后若无人，何来此言？"
    shuoshuren "Think, everyone: if there were no one behind the furnace, why would he say so?"

# game/script.rpy:3533
translate english s018_changfeng_rumors_9cfaa4f8:

    # "你听到这里，终于忍不住站了起来。"
    "Hearing this, you finally cannot help standing."

# game/script.rpy:3536
translate english s018_changfeng_rumors_9fedf58f:

    # wangfang "我今日在茯苓医馆见过那名伤者。"
    wangfang "I saw that injured man at Fuling Clinic today."

# game/script.rpy:3538
translate english s018_changfeng_rumors_cf1dbf2a:

    # zuowan "我今日在茯苓医馆见过那名伤者。"
    zuowan "I saw that injured man at Fuling Clinic today."

# game/script.rpy:3540
translate english s018_changfeng_rumors_b3537d5e:

    # "大堂里安静了一瞬。"
    "The hall falls quiet for a moment."

# game/script.rpy:3542
translate english s018_changfeng_rumors_2657aff2:

    # "说书人立刻看向你。"
    "The storyteller immediately looks at you."

# game/script.rpy:3544
translate english s018_changfeng_rumors_a3e9a59a:

    # shuoshuren "这位少侠亲眼见过？"
    shuoshuren "This young hero saw him with his own eyes?"

# game/script.rpy:3547
translate english s018_changfeng_rumors_f4ffe421:

    # "说书人又眯眼看了看你，赶紧改口。"
    "The storyteller squints at you again and quickly corrects himself."

# game/script.rpy:3548
translate english s018_changfeng_rumors_7732a3de:

    # shuoshuren "这位侠女亲眼见过？"
    shuoshuren "This heroine saw him with her own eyes?"

# game/script.rpy:3550
translate english s018_changfeng_rumors_45c29d28:

    # shuoshuren "那可要说清楚了。"
    shuoshuren "Then you must speak clearly."

# game/script.rpy:3552
translate english s018_changfeng_rumors_99d97dd9:

    # "你把自己知道的部分说了出来。"
    "You tell them what you know."

# game/script.rpy:3554
translate english s018_changfeng_rumors_77d60b26:

    # "那人不是被风雷观无故加害。"
    "The man was not harmed without cause by Fenglei Abbey."

# game/script.rpy:3556
translate english s018_changfeng_rumors_eaa30ab9:

    # "他是擅闯雷云峰外山，靠近不该靠近的地方，导致外息冲脉。"
    "He trespassed upon Leiyun Peak's outer mountain and approached a forbidden place, causing external qi to strike his channels."

# game/script.rpy:3558
translate english s018_changfeng_rumors_e4db7df0:

    # "所谓道姑用拂尘伤人，更可能是在他撑不住时，以内力替他压住乱冲的气脉，保住了一条命。"
    "The supposed Daoist nun's fly-whisk attack was more likely her using inner force to suppress his wildly surging qi channels when he could no longer endure, preserving his life."

# game/script.rpy:3560
translate english s018_changfeng_rumors_39fb3c2d:

    # "茯苓医馆已经救下此人，也会写医案送往风雷观。"
    "Fuling Clinic has saved this man and will send a medical case report to Fenglei Abbey."

# game/script.rpy:3563
translate english s018_changfeng_rumors_1dd0377a:

    # wangfang "医馆先救人，风雷观也未必是害人者。"
    wangfang "The clinic saved a life first, and Fenglei Abbey may not be the one harming people."

# game/script.rpy:3564
translate english s018_changfeng_rumors_0171d67c:

    # wangfang "诸位若没亲眼看见，最好别把救命说成杀人。"
    wangfang "If you did not see it yourselves, do not turn saving a life into murder."

# game/script.rpy:3566
translate english s018_changfeng_rumors_1b946ea1:

    # zuowan "医馆先救人，风雷观也未必是害人者。"
    zuowan "The clinic saved a life first, and Fenglei Abbey may not be the one harming people."

# game/script.rpy:3567
translate english s018_changfeng_rumors_4abe398c:

    # zuowan "没亲眼看见的事，传得越满，越容易害人。"
    zuowan "The fuller an unseen story is spread, the more easily it harms people."

# game/script.rpy:3569
translate english s018_changfeng_rumors_3a870dc3:

    # "众人又安静了一瞬。"
    "The crowd falls silent again for a moment."

# game/script.rpy:3571
translate english s018_changfeng_rumors_56fba60c:

    # "可很快，一名江湖客冷笑。"
    "But soon, a jianghu traveler gives a cold laugh."

# game/script.rpy:3573
translate english s018_changfeng_rumors_b5216e39:

    # jianghukejia "你说你亲眼见过，我们便要信？"
    jianghukejia "You say you saw it with your own eyes, and we are meant to believe you?"

# game/script.rpy:3575
translate english s018_changfeng_rumors_164b9834:

    # "另一人接话。"
    "Another person follows up."

# game/script.rpy:3577
translate english s018_changfeng_rumors_c1e2ef54:

    # jianghukeyi "你既从医馆来，当然替医馆和风雷观说话。"
    jianghukeyi "You came from the clinic, so naturally you speak for the clinic and Fenglei Abbey."

# game/script.rpy:3579
translate english s018_changfeng_rumors_dac0dde7:

    # "还有人低声道："
    "Someone else says under his breath,"

# game/script.rpy:3581
translate english s018_changfeng_rumors_fe1fd13b:

    # jianghukebing "说不定这人就是风雷观派来压消息的。"
    jianghukebing "Perhaps this person was sent by Fenglei Abbey to suppress the news."

# game/script.rpy:3583
translate english s018_changfeng_rumors_78c4a30d:

    # "辛万和见势不妙，立刻出来圆场。"
    "Seeing the situation turn ill, Xin Wanhe immediately steps in to smooth things over."

# game/script.rpy:3585
translate english s018_changfeng_rumors_9f0db203:

    # xinwanhe "行了行了，长风楼里喝酒可以，审人不行。"
    xinwanhe "Enough, enough. You may drink in Changfeng House, but you may not put people on trial."

# game/script.rpy:3587
translate english s018_changfeng_rumors_8b8db9a9:

    # xinwanhe "谁再拍桌，今晚酒钱翻倍。"
    xinwanhe "Anyone who slaps a table again pays double for wine tonight."

# game/script.rpy:3589
translate english s018_changfeng_rumors_0e47cfb5:

    # "众人笑了几声，气氛暂时散开。"
    "A few people laugh, and the tension briefly disperses."

# game/script.rpy:3591
translate english s018_changfeng_rumors_1efd886b:

    # "但你已经意识到：自己说出的真相，并没有阻止谣言。"
    "But you have already realized that the truth you spoke did not stop the rumor."

# game/script.rpy:3593
translate english s018_changfeng_rumors_893b22b9:

    # "它只是让谣言又多了一个版本。"
    "It merely gave the rumor one more version."

# game/script.rpy:3595
translate english s018_changfeng_rumors_b3d32da4:

    # "说书人甚至低声念叨。"
    "The storyteller even murmurs,"

# game/script.rpy:3597
translate english s018_changfeng_rumors_16434e5b:

    # shuoshuren "医馆救命，风雷藏人，外息冲脉，炉后有人……"
    shuoshuren "The clinic saves a life, Fenglei hides someone, external qi strikes the channels, someone behind the furnace..."

# game/script.rpy:3599
translate english s018_changfeng_rumors_d1ef3728:

    # shuoshuren "好，好故事。"
    shuoshuren "Good. A fine story."

# game/script.rpy:3601
translate english s018_changfeng_rumors_0767ba38:

    # "你心里一沉。"
    "Your heart sinks."

# game/script.rpy:3603
translate english s018_changfeng_rumors_39bc3c45:

    # "你离开长风楼时，天色已经更暗。"
    "By the time you leave Changfeng House, the sky has grown darker."

# game/script.rpy:3605
translate english s018_changfeng_rumors_9ee057b4:

    # "楼里仍然热闹。"
    "The house remains lively."

# game/script.rpy:3607
translate english s018_changfeng_rumors_821d7ce3:

    # "传言并没有因为你的解释而停下。"
    "The rumors have not stopped because of your explanation."

# game/script.rpy:3609
translate english s018_changfeng_rumors_654130db:

    # "相反，你刚刚说过的话，已经被人改成了新的版本。"
    "Instead, the words you just spoke have already been made into a new version."

# game/script.rpy:3611
translate english s018_changfeng_rumors_9e61c70d:

    # "酒客甲：“听见没？医馆的人承认了，真有外息冲脉！”"
    "A drinker says, \"Did you hear? Someone from the clinic admitted it—external qi truly struck the channels!\""

# game/script.rpy:3613
translate english s018_changfeng_rumors_44152c80:

    # "酒客乙：“炉后有人是真的！”"
    "Another drinker says, \"It is true that someone is behind the furnace!\""

# game/script.rpy:3615
translate english s018_changfeng_rumors_87340f94:

    # "酒客丙：“风雷观要压消息！”"
    "A third drinker says, \"Fenglei Abbey wants to suppress the news!\""

# game/script.rpy:3619
translate english s018_changfeng_rumors_67c0fab8:

    # "你站在长风楼门外，心里有些发堵。"
    "You stand outside Changfeng House, feeling a tightness in your chest."

# game/script.rpy:3621
translate english s018_changfeng_rumors_a66d5f2c:

    # "这时，旁边巷口传来一个熟悉的声音。"
    "Then a familiar voice comes from the nearby alley mouth."

# game/script.rpy:3623
translate english s018_changfeng_rumors_5d249ad7:

    # housanxian "我本来想来听热闹，结果听见有人比我还能编。"
    housanxian "I came to hear the excitement, but instead heard people inventing things better than I can."

# game/script.rpy:3625
translate english s018_changfeng_rumors_1470b0d9:

    # "你转头，看见侯三闲蹲在墙根，嘴里叼着一根草，像是已经听了很久。"
    "You turn to see Hou Sanxian squatting by the wall with a blade of grass in his mouth, as if he has been listening for a long time."

# game/script.rpy:3628
translate english s018_changfeng_rumors_38301a36:

    # wangfang "你知道什么？"
    wangfang "What do you know?"

# game/script.rpy:3630
translate english s018_changfeng_rumors_fc50eb35:

    # zuowan "你知道什么？"
    zuowan "What do you know?"

# game/script.rpy:3632
translate english s018_changfeng_rumors_ea5c46b3:

    # "侯三闲收起嬉笑，朝西街方向看了一眼。"
    "Hou Sanxian loses his playful smile and glances toward West Street."

# game/script.rpy:3634
translate english s018_changfeng_rumors_3278134a:

    # housanxian "这里不是说话的地方。"
    housanxian "This is not the place to talk."

# game/script.rpy:3636
translate english s018_changfeng_rumors_73748ba8:

    # housanxian "你要真想知道谁把这事传歪了，明天一早去西街巷口找我。"
    housanxian "If you truly want to know who twisted this story, find me at the West Street alley mouth early tomorrow."

# game/script.rpy:3638
translate english s018_changfeng_rumors_4154bcba:

    # "你心里一动。"
    "Something stirs in your heart."

# game/script.rpy:3640
translate english s018_changfeng_rumors_f2bceebb:

    # "白日里医馆的伤者，夜里长风楼的谣言，似乎都指向同一个问题。"
    "The clinic's injured man by day and the rumors at Changfeng House by night seem to point to the same question."

# game/script.rpy:3642
translate english s018_changfeng_rumors_1017f84e:

    # "有人不想让真相按原样传出去。"
    "Someone does not want the truth to be told as it is."

# game/script.rpy:3644
translate english s018_changfeng_rumors_b98e7483:

    # "你和侯三闲在长风楼外分别。"
    "You part from Hou Sanxian outside Changfeng House."

# game/script.rpy:3646
translate english s018_changfeng_rumors_533c41f9:

    # "回去的路上，你忽然想到一个更现实的问题。"
    "On the way back, a more practical question suddenly occurs to you."

# game/script.rpy:3648
translate english s018_changfeng_rumors_65ecd2a3:

    # "如果明天一早要去西街巷口，自己该怎么向魏三儿或沈云请假？"
    "If you are to go to the West Street alley mouth tomorrow morning, how should you ask Wei San'er or Shen Yun for leave?"

# game/script.rpy:3650
translate english s018_changfeng_rumors_97a83b56:

    # "夜风从风云坪吹来，长风楼里的喧闹声渐渐远了。"
    "The night wind blows in from Fengyun Square, and the clamor of Changfeng House fades behind you."

# game/script.rpy:3652
translate english s018_changfeng_rumors_276e8475:

    # "你第一次意识到，在开庵镇住下，不只是有了一张床，也意味着每一天都要向这座小镇交代自己的去处。"
    "For the first time, you realize that living in Kaian Town means more than having a bed; it means accounting to the town each day for where you go."

# game/script.rpy:3667
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_0c8e021d:

    # "第二日清晨。"
    "The next morning."

# game/script.rpy:3669
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_3c55f8f4:

    # "你刚从夹廊小院出来，心里还在想着昨夜侯三闲说的那句话。"
    "You have just left the passage courtyard, still thinking about what Hou Sanxian said last night."

# game/script.rpy:3671
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_1c99cc53:

    # "明天一早，去西街巷口找我。"
    "Find me at the West Street alley mouth early tomorrow."

# game/script.rpy:3673
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_d11e262b:

    # "你还没想好怎么向魏三儿或沈云请假，方大娘已经从驿站厨房探出头来。"
    "Before deciding how to ask Wei San'er or Shen Yun for leave, you see Auntie Fang poke her head out from the post station kitchen."

# game/script.rpy:3675
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_9879e05c:

    # "她手里拿着一串铜钱。"
    "She holds a string of copper coins."

# game/script.rpy:3677
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_8bb75326:

    # fangdaniang "你不是要去菜市？"
    fangdaniang "Aren't you going to the market?"

# game/script.rpy:3679
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_dd0c8aaa:

    # fangdaniang "正好，别白走一趟。"
    fangdaniang "Good. Do not make the trip for nothing."

# game/script.rpy:3681
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_50b856c7:

    # fangdaniang "替我办两件事。"
    fangdaniang "Do two things for me."

# game/script.rpy:3685
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_30028c7e:

    # wangfang "早啊方大娘，我正想着怎么跟你们请个假呢。"
    wangfang "Good morning, Auntie Fang. I was just thinking how to ask you all for leave."

# game/script.rpy:3689
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_85d171f8:

    # zuowan "早啊方大娘，我正想着怎么跟你们请个假呢。"
    zuowan "Good morning, Auntie Fang. I was just thinking how to ask you all for leave."

# game/script.rpy:3691
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_7a56fa83:

    # "方大娘把二百文塞到你手里。"
    "Auntie Fang presses two hundred wen into your hand."

# game/script.rpy:3693
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_b5fbebcc:

    # fangdaniang "先去马具行找宋老六，问周二蛋订的马鞍好了没有。"
    fangdaniang "First go to the harness shop and ask Song Laoliu whether Zhou Erdan's ordered saddle is ready."

# game/script.rpy:3695
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_8476ccd6:

    # fangdaniang "再去南北杂货找范有成，买两只熏鸡回来。"
    fangdaniang "Then find Fan Youcheng at the North-South Grocery and buy two smoked chickens."

# game/script.rpy:3697
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_4096bee3:

    # fangdaniang "记住，方大娘要的，必须是新货。"
    fangdaniang "Remember, Auntie Fang wants only fresh goods."

# game/script.rpy:3699
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_7689ca10:

    # fangdaniang "他要敢拿昨日陈货糊弄你，我晚上拿锅铲去问候他。"
    fangdaniang "If he dares fob you off with yesterday's old stock, I will greet him with my spatula tonight."

# game/script.rpy:3701
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_cffec9da:

    # "这时，沈云从医馆侧门探出头，手里攥着二十文。"
    "Then Shen Yun appears from the clinic side door, holding twenty wen."

# game/script.rpy:3703
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_58de573e:

    # shenyun "你真去西街啊？"
    shenyun "You really are going to West Street?"

# game/script.rpy:3705
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_2563cf89:

    # shenyun "那帮我带点切糕。"
    shenyun "Then bring me some qiegao."

# game/script.rpy:3708
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_7dc0d569:

    # wangfang "你自己怎么不去？"
    wangfang "Why don't you go yourself?"

# game/script.rpy:3710
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_c476081a:

    # zuowan "你自己怎么不去？"
    zuowan "Why don't you go yourself?"

# game/script.rpy:3712
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_2ea7d4a3:

    # shenyun "我要洗药。"
    shenyun "I have to wash herbs."

# game/script.rpy:3714
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_0381bb78:

    # shenyun "徐掌柜说我昨日把药筛撞歪了，今天得补回来。"
    shenyun "Manager Xu said I knocked the herb sieve crooked yesterday, so I have to make up for it today."

# game/script.rpy:3716
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_1b7d66e0:

    # "他把二十文递过来，小声说："
    "He hands over the twenty wen and says quietly,"

# game/script.rpy:3718
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_e0c552b2:

    # shenyun "买老马家的切糕，马长顺那个摊子。"
    shenyun "Buy qiegao from Old Ma's stall—the one run by Ma Changshun."

# game/script.rpy:3720
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_acfea231:

    # shenyun "二十文，刚好两斤。"
    shenyun "Twenty wen gets exactly two jin."

# game/script.rpy:3722
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_6d0f3d15:

    # shenyun "你和星辰也吃一点，剩下的给我哦。"
    shenyun "You and Xingchen eat some too, then give me what remains."

# game/script.rpy:3724
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_ef1b33e1:

    # "你接过钱，忽然觉得自己虽然才住下没多久，却已经被驿站和医馆一起差遣了。"
    "Taking the money, you suddenly feel that though you have only just settled in, both the post station and clinic are already sending you on errands."

# game/script.rpy:3728
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_9e8438c5:

    # "于是，你带着方大娘的二百文和沈云的二十文，前往西街菜市。"
    "With Auntie Fang's two hundred wen and Shen Yun's twenty, you head for West Street Market."

# game/script.rpy:3730
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_651ec1e7:

    # "西街菜市清晨最热闹。"
    "West Street Market is at its liveliest in the morning."

# game/script.rpy:3732
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_c76b992c:

    # "菜叶上还带着水，鱼摊腥气未散，铸兵堂那边已经传来打铁声。"
    "Water still clings to vegetable leaves, the fish stalls have not lost their smell, and hammering already comes from the arms forge."

# game/script.rpy:3734
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_05439bf7:

    # "叫卖声、讲价声、骂人声混在一起。"
    "Cries of sale, bargaining, and scolding mix together."

# game/script.rpy:3738
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_9c85f1d4:

    # "你一进菜市，先看见老马切糕摊。"
    "On entering the market, you first see Old Ma's qiegao stall."

# game/script.rpy:3740
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_9c00ceab:

    # "切糕摊摊主马长顺正守着一只冒热气的大木甑。"
    "The stallholder, Ma Changshun, tends a large steaming wooden rice steamer."

# game/script.rpy:3742
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_4d2c4022:

    # "原来这里卖的切糕并不是那种一大坨硬邦邦的甜点。"
    "The qiegao sold here is not a single hard lump of sweet cake."

# game/script.rpy:3744
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_ec77277b:

    # "而是以糯米为主，点缀着大枣和黑枣，蒸得软糯热腾，倒更像一块块刚出甑的甜米糕。"
    "It is made chiefly of glutinous rice studded with red and black dates, steamed soft and hot like pieces of fresh sweet rice cake."

# game/script.rpy:3746
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_baff107d:

    # "马长顺掀开木盖时，白气一涌，枣香和糯米香立刻散开。"
    "When Ma Changshun lifts the wooden lid, white steam rushes out, bringing the scents of dates and glutinous rice."

# game/script.rpy:3748
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_088ae50e:

    # "你本想先买切糕，但又想到还要去找宋老六和买熏鸡，怕切糕放久了凉掉，便决定最后再买。"
    "You think to buy qiegao first, but remember that you must find Song Laoliu and buy smoked chicken. Fearing the cake will cool, you decide to buy it last."

# game/script.rpy:3752
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_ae515b96:

    # "你转身看见南北杂货。"
    "Turning, you see the North-South Grocery."

# game/script.rpy:3754
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_99cb0c41:

    # "南北杂货门口挂着腊肉、熏鸭、干辣椒和一排油纸包。"
    "Cured meat, smoked duck, dried chilies, and a row of oiled-paper parcels hang at its entrance."

# game/script.rpy:3756
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_1caea14b:

    # "掌柜范有成正站在柜后和客商说价。"
    "The proprietor Fan Youcheng stands behind the counter bargaining with a merchant."

# game/script.rpy:3758
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_f74d3e6b:

    # fanyoucheng "这价真不贵，客官。北边来的香料，路上风沙都比盐贵。"
    fanyoucheng "The price truly is not high, honored guest. Northern spices travel through sands that cost more than salt."

# game/script.rpy:3760
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_2a6f53f6:

    # "你上前。"
    "You step forward."

# game/script.rpy:3763
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_b8b5e92a:

    # wangfang "方大娘让我来买两只熏鸡。"
    wangfang "Auntie Fang sent me to buy two smoked chickens."

# game/script.rpy:3765
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_1b024417:

    # zuowan "方大娘让我来买两只熏鸡。"
    zuowan "Auntie Fang sent me to buy two smoked chickens."

# game/script.rpy:3767
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_3d7acea2:

    # "范有成脸上的笑停了一下。"
    "Fan Youcheng's smile pauses."

# game/script.rpy:3769
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_7fdab80f:

    # fanyoucheng "方大娘要的？"
    fanyoucheng "Auntie Fang wants them?"

# game/script.rpy:3771
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_6106edd7:

    # "你点头。"
    "You nod."

# game/script.rpy:3773
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_26748ea3:

    # "范有成立刻朝后头喊。"
    "Fan Youcheng immediately calls toward the back."

# game/script.rpy:3775
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_b195c04a:

    # fanyoucheng "小麻子！拿新做的，别拿昨日那两只！"
    fanyoucheng "Little Mazi! Bring the fresh ones, not yesterday's two!"

# game/script.rpy:3777
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_3df73bc8:

    # "后头传来小麻子的声音。"
    "Little Mazi's voice comes from behind."

# game/script.rpy:3779
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_3e7cec14:

    # xiaomazi "昨日那两只不也挺香……"
    xiaomazi "Weren't yesterday's two quite fragrant too...?"

# game/script.rpy:3781
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_e39bc180:

    # "范有成瞪过去。"
    "Fan Youcheng glares toward the back."

# game/script.rpy:3783
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_4d5b4d0e:

    # fanyoucheng "你香？你去跟方大娘说？"
    fanyoucheng "You think so? Go tell Auntie Fang that."

# game/script.rpy:3785
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_f24e18a1:

    # "小麻子立刻闭嘴，把两只熏鸡用油纸包好。"
    "Little Mazi immediately falls silent and wraps two smoked chickens in oiled paper."

# game/script.rpy:3787
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_3cd92d28:

    # "范有成把熏鸡放到你面前。"
    "Fan Youcheng sets the smoked chickens before you."

# game/script.rpy:3789
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_e720e06c:

    # fanyoucheng "一只六十文，两只一百二。"
    fanyoucheng "Sixty wen each, one hundred twenty for two."

# game/script.rpy:3791
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_4d81c26d:

    # fanyoucheng "你回去跟方大娘说，我这价格童叟无欺，她真人来了也是这个价。"
    fanyoucheng "Tell Auntie Fang that my prices are fair to old and young alike; even if she comes herself, this is the price."

# game/script.rpy:3793
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_13a3dc5d:

    # "你看了他一眼。"
    "You look at him."

# game/script.rpy:3795
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_50e7210d:

    # "范有成又补一句。"
    "Fan Youcheng adds,"

# game/script.rpy:3797
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_1f1ffff5:

    # fanyoucheng "当然，她真人来了，我可以多送一把干菇。"
    fanyoucheng "Of course, if she comes herself, I can add a handful of dried mushrooms."

# game/script.rpy:3799
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_3f795b65:

    # "你付了一百二十文，收好熏鸡。"
    "You pay one hundred twenty wen and put away the smoked chickens."

# game/script.rpy:3803
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_3b3697a2:

    # "接着，你去找宋老六。"
    "Next, you go to find Song Laoliu."

# game/script.rpy:3805
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_e41b525f:

    # "但你一时没认出马具行，先看见修理铺的招牌，便上前询问。"
    "But you do not recognize the harness shop at once. Seeing the repair shop's sign first, you approach to ask."

# game/script.rpy:3808
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_6507fe8b:

    # wangfang "请问哪位是老宋？我是飞鸿驿站派来问周二蛋订的马鞍好了没。"
    wangfang "Excuse me, which one is Old Song? Feihong Post Station sent me to ask whether Zhou Erdan's ordered saddle is ready."

# game/script.rpy:3810
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_6539b9f7:

    # zuowan "请问哪位是老宋？我是飞鸿驿站派来问周二蛋订的马鞍好了没。"
    zuowan "Excuse me, which one is Old Song? Feihong Post Station sent me to ask whether Zhou Erdan's ordered saddle is ready."

# game/script.rpy:3812
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_e75ef91b:

    # "修理匠刘山平正在修一盏旧灯，抬头看了你一眼。"
    "The repairman Liu Shanping is fixing an old lamp. He looks up at you."

# game/script.rpy:3814
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_e498799f:

    # liushanping "找错了。我这是修理铺。"
    liushanping "Wrong place. This is a repair shop."

# game/script.rpy:3816
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_f7d9fa3c:

    # liushanping "锅漏了、椅子断了、灯坏了、鞋底开了，都能找我。"
    liushanping "If a pot leaks, a chair breaks, a lamp fails, or a shoe sole comes loose, come to me."

# game/script.rpy:3818
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_6f04e4fe:

    # liushanping "马鞍坏了，也能修，但新马鞍不归我。"
    liushanping "I can repair a broken saddle too, but new saddles are not my business."

# game/script.rpy:3820
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_32aaa072:

    # "旁边的学徒刘小小探头。"
    "The apprentice Liu Xiaoxiao peeks out beside him."

# game/script.rpy:3822
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_a5126ade:

    # liuxiaoxiao "比送回马具行修便宜很多呢。"
    liuxiaoxiao "It is much cheaper than sending it back to the harness shop."

# game/script.rpy:3824
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_1ffcfd13:

    # liuxiaoxiao "怎么，旧马鞍是裂了，还是扣带断了？"
    liuxiaoxiao "What is wrong with the old saddle? Cracked leather or a broken strap?"

# game/script.rpy:3827
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_68168abf:

    # wangfang "我只是来问订的新马鞍。"
    wangfang "I only came to ask about an ordered new saddle."

# game/script.rpy:3829
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_167f5e7f:

    # zuowan "我只是来问订的新马鞍。"
    zuowan "I only came to ask about an ordered new saddle."

# game/script.rpy:3831
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_e8736a9e:

    # "刘小小有些失望。"
    "Liu Xiaoxiao looks a little disappointed."

# game/script.rpy:3833
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_da6cd9be:

    # liuxiaoxiao "哦，新货啊。"
    liuxiaoxiao "Oh, new goods."

# game/script.rpy:3835
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_2e51a379:

    # liuxiaoxiao "那你往前走，马具行在铸兵堂斜对面。看见门口挂鞍子的就是。"
    liuxiaoxiao "Then go ahead. The harness shop is diagonally across from the arms forge. It is the one with saddles hanging by the door."

# game/script.rpy:3837
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_3860d4f4:

    # "你道谢后离开。"
    "You thank them and leave."

# game/script.rpy:3841
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_c4fe1a8e:

    # "刚要往马具行走，忽然看见前方巷口的一段石阶上蹲着一群年轻人，其中就有侯三闲。"
    "Just as you set off for the harness shop, you see a group of young people crouching on stone steps at the alley mouth ahead, including Hou Sanxian."

# game/script.rpy:3843
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_bd78f399:

    # "这几个人各有各的懒散姿态。"
    "Each carries a different kind of languid pose."

# game/script.rpy:3845
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_8b4b033e:

    # "一个棕色麻衣、中等个子的男孩靠在竹筐边，眼睛半睁半闭，像是刚睡醒，又像是随时能再睡过去。"
    "A medium-height boy in brown hemp clothes leans by a bamboo basket, his eyes half open as if just awake—or ready to sleep again at any moment."

# game/script.rpy:3847
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_7a98fec7:

    # "一个穿浅绿色衣裙、看着很机灵的女孩站在一旁，正拿脚尖拨地上的小石子，嘴上嫌弃侯三闲挡道。"
    "A clever-looking girl in a pale green dress stands aside, nudging pebbles with her toe while complaining that Hou Sanxian blocks the way."

# game/script.rpy:3849
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_d6c365fa:

    # "一个小个子男孩穿着一身黑色旧衣，腰间挂着一个鼓鼓的大锦囊。"
    "A small boy in old black clothes has a bulging brocade pouch at his waist."

# game/script.rpy:3851
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_9e93f258:

    # "他手里转着一颗旧骰子，转两下便掉一次，掉了又若无其事地捡起来。"
    "He spins an old die in his hand. Every two turns it falls, and he picks it up again as if nothing happened."

# game/script.rpy:3853
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_dab2e681:

    # "一个漂亮高挑的女孩站在阴影里，淡蓝色衣裙洗得发旧却干净，双手缠着绑带，抱着胳膊看着众人，像是在看一群人犯傻。"
    "A tall, pretty girl stands in shadow, her faded pale-blue dress clean and her hands wrapped in bandages. Arms crossed, she watches the others as if they are a group of fools."

# game/script.rpy:3855
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_a69c089b:

    # "还有一个小个子女孩蹲在墙根，头上扎着几根小辫，穿着深靛色粗布衣衫。"
    "Another small girl crouches by the wall, with several braids and coarse dark-indigo clothes."

# game/script.rpy:3857
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_41c0006e:

    # "她正学着长风楼说书人的腔调，拖长声音道："
    "Imitating Changfeng House's storyteller, she draws out her voice:"

# game/script.rpy:3859
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_5902999e:

    # "小辫女孩：“所闻非所见——所见非人间——奇哉——怪也——”"
    "The braided girl says, \"What I heard was not what I saw—what I saw was not of this world—strange—uncanny—\""

# game/script.rpy:3861
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_30fcbd7b:

    # "浅绿色衣裙的女孩一脚踢过去。"
    "The girl in pale green kicks toward her."

# game/script.rpy:3863
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_2d9bf0ae:

    # "浅绿衣裙女孩：“你再学，晚上真做噩梦。”"
    "The pale-green girl says, \"Keep copying him and you will have nightmares tonight.\""

# game/script.rpy:3865
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_5a56a19b:

    # "侯三闲蹲在最中间，手里叼着一根草梗。"
    "Hou Sanxian squats in the middle with a grass stem in his mouth."

# game/script.rpy:3867
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_77035907:

    # "红色发带束着长发，腰间还挂着那把木刀。"
    "His long hair is tied by a red ribbon, and that wooden sword still hangs at his waist."

# game/script.rpy:3869
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_11669e55:

    # "他个子比旁边几人都高些，明明一身穷酸，却偏要摆出几分江湖人的架势，像是已经等了你很久。"
    "Taller than those beside him, he is plainly poor yet insists on a jianghu air, as if he has awaited you for a long time."

# game/script.rpy:3871
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_cd8b8d31:

    # "一见你来了，侯三闲立刻站起身，像终于等到了能显摆的人。"
    "At the sight of you, Hou Sanxian leaps up as if he has finally found someone to impress."

# game/script.rpy:3873
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_5498f496:

    # housanxian "来了？我跟你说，昨晚那谣言不是自己长腿跑到长风楼的。"
    housanxian "There you are. Let me tell you: last night's rumor did not grow legs and run to Changfeng House by itself."

# game/script.rpy:3875
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_0f055aa4:

    # "你却先举了举手里的熏鸡。"
    "Instead, you first raise the smoked chicken in your hand."

# game/script.rpy:3878
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_34033c87:

    # wangfang "我还得找马具行的老宋。周二蛋订的马鞍，方大娘让我来问。"
    wangfang "I still have to find Old Song at the harness shop. Auntie Fang asked me to inquire about Zhou Erdan's ordered saddle."

# game/script.rpy:3880
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_9e4c657a:

    # zuowan "我还得找马具行的老宋。周二蛋订的马鞍，方大娘让我来问。"
    zuowan "I still have to find Old Song at the harness shop. Auntie Fang asked me to inquire about Zhou Erdan's ordered saddle."

# game/script.rpy:3882
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_f6a6eace:

    # "侯三闲一愣。"
    "Hou Sanxian blinks."

# game/script.rpy:3884
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_43d5e8ec:

    # housanxian "你这人怎么这样？我这儿是江湖大事。"
    housanxian "How can you be like this? I have a great jianghu matter here."

# game/script.rpy:3887
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_680e78bc:

    # wangfang "方大娘那边也是大事。"
    wangfang "Auntie Fang's business is important too."

# game/script.rpy:3889
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_2f1d4093:

    # zuowan "方大娘那边也是大事。"
    zuowan "Auntie Fang's business is important too."

# game/script.rpy:3891
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_a3b8a72b:

    # "浅绿色衣裙的女孩坐在石阶上点头，接话道："
    "The pale-green girl sits on the steps, nods, and says,"

# game/script.rpy:3893
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_c009ed49:

    # "浅绿衣裙女孩：“这话没毛病。方大娘的事，比江湖事急。”"
    "The pale-green girl says, \"That is true. Auntie Fang's business is more urgent than jianghu business.\""

# game/script.rpy:3895
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_ec881755:

    # "侯三闲噎了一下，只好摆手。"
    "Hou Sanxian chokes on his words and can only wave a hand."

# game/script.rpy:3897
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_70d36e03:

    # housanxian "行行行，跟我走。老宋我认识。"
    housanxian "Fine, fine. Come with me. I know Old Song."

# game/script.rpy:3899
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_00d924a7:

    # "他转头向你介绍。"
    "He turns to introduce them."

# game/script.rpy:3901
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_b99d8bf1:

    # housanxian "这是罗小六，跑巷子的；这是马二花，嘴最毒的。"
    housanxian "This is Luo Xiaoliu, who runs the alleys; this is Ma Erhua, with the sharpest tongue."

# game/script.rpy:3903
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_facba7b2:

    # housanxian "这是梁阿坠，关扑铺门口长大的。"
    housanxian "This is Liang Azhui, raised at the door of a gambling shop."

# game/script.rpy:3905
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_250210dd:

    # housanxian "这是杜七娘，谁欠她一文都记得。"
    housanxian "This is Du Qiniang—she remembers anyone who owes her even one wen."

# game/script.rpy:3907
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_ab6e9e2e:

    # housanxian "这是钱四喜，最小，最吵。"
    housanxian "This is Qian Siyi, the youngest and noisiest."

# game/script.rpy:3909
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_fef869f3:

    # "小辫女孩立刻不服。"
    "The braided girl protests immediately."

# game/script.rpy:3911
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_50b4c876:

    # qiansixi "我哪是吵，我这是会学。"
    qiansixi "I am not noisy. I am good at imitation."

# game/script.rpy:3913
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_a1d4a7e4:

    # "你这才把几个人和名字对上。"
    "Only then do you match the people to their names."

# game/script.rpy:3915
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_c215962e:

    # "棕色麻衣、眼睛总像没睡醒的，是罗小六。"
    "The one in brown hemp with perpetually sleepy eyes is Luo Xiaoliu."

# game/script.rpy:3917
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_9aa36381:

    # "浅绿色衣裙、说话带刺的，是马二花。"
    "The one in pale green with barbed words is Ma Erhua."

# game/script.rpy:3919
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_590b30fc:

    # "黑衣小个子、腰间挂大锦囊的，是梁阿坠。"
    "The small one in black with a large brocade pouch is Liang Azhui."

# game/script.rpy:3921
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_f747289d:

    # "淡蓝色旧衣裙、双手缠着绑带的，是杜七娘。"
    "The one in a faded pale-blue dress with bandaged hands is Du Qiniang."

# game/script.rpy:3923
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_34ef5b18:

    # "深靛色粗布衣衫、扎着小辫子的，是钱四喜。"
    "The one in coarse dark-indigo clothes with braids is Qian Siyi."

# game/script.rpy:3926
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_7343f4e9:

    # wangfang "你们这三闲、四喜、小六、七娘的，谁是老大？"
    wangfang "Among you with names like Sanxian, Siyi, Xiaoliu, and Qiniang, who is the leader?"

# game/script.rpy:3928
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_57e9dd0a:

    # zuowan "你们这三闲、四喜、小六、七娘的，谁是老大？"
    zuowan "Among you with names like Sanxian, Siyi, Xiaoliu, and Qiniang, who is the leader?"

# game/script.rpy:3930
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_dfb2d707:

    # "几个人同时看向侯三闲。"
    "Everyone looks at Hou Sanxian at once."

# game/script.rpy:3932
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_df7c237e:

    # "侯三闲立刻挺胸。"
    "Hou Sanxian immediately puffs out his chest."

# game/script.rpy:3934
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_6277cb9e:

    # housanxian "这还用问？"
    housanxian "Need you ask?"

# game/script.rpy:3936
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_744f1a26:

    # "马二花冷笑。"
    "Ma Erhua laughs coldly."

# game/script.rpy:3938
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_5229893f:

    # maerhua "谁欠钱最多，谁就是老大。"
    maerhua "The one who owes the most money is the leader."

# game/script.rpy:3940
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_4ab566e3:

    # "罗小六慢吞吞补一句。"
    "Luo Xiaoliu slowly adds,"

# game/script.rpy:3942
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_1cf76f5e:

    # luoxiaoliu "那是他。"
    luoxiaoliu "That is him."

# game/script.rpy:3944
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_b3e0e9d3:

    # "侯三闲瞪他们。"
    "Hou Sanxian glares at them."

# game/script.rpy:3946
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_f932187a:

    # housanxian "你们懂什么？江湖人不叫欠钱，叫人情往来。"
    housanxian "What do you know? Jianghu people do not call it debt; they call it exchanges of favor."

# game/script.rpy:3948
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_8a913396:

    # "杜七娘淡淡道。"
    "Du Qiniang says mildly,"

# game/script.rpy:3950
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_e29e03aa:

    # duqiniang "人情会还，钱也要还。"
    duqiniang "Favors must be repaid, and so must money."

# game/script.rpy:3952
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_a5debed1:

    # "你第一次真正见到侯三闲的朋友们。"
    "For the first time, you truly meet Hou Sanxian's friends."

# game/script.rpy:3954
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_b2bde7b3:

    # "他们不像恶霸，也不像正经伙计，更不是帮派。"
    "They are neither bullies nor respectable workers, and certainly not a gang."

# game/script.rpy:3956
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_160966ac:

    # "只是一群在菜市墙根、关扑铺门口、杂货铺旁边混日子的年轻人。"
    "They are simply young people getting by beside market walls, gambling-shop doors, and grocery stores."

# game/script.rpy:3958
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_98471573:

    # "每个人都有自己的小聪明，也都有自己的窘迫。"
    "Each has their small cleverness and their own hardships."

# game/script.rpy:3960
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_398e8062:

    # "侯三闲说完“老宋我认识”，便往马具行方向走。"
    "After saying he knows Old Song, Hou Sanxian heads toward the harness shop."

# game/script.rpy:3962
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_028f3cdf:

    # "梁阿坠立刻跟了上来。"
    "Liang Azhui follows at once."

# game/script.rpy:3964
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_75ef9247:

    # "他把那颗旧骰子塞回腰间的大锦囊里，像是终于等到自己能派上用场。"
    "He puts the old die back into his large brocade pouch, as if he has finally found a chance to be useful."

# game/script.rpy:3966
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_23855280:

    # "杜七娘也跟了两步。"
    "Du Qiniang follows for two steps as well."

# game/script.rpy:3968
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_1dd6095d:

    # "她没有解释，只是看了侯三闲一眼，像是不放心他把话说得太满。"
    "She offers no explanation, only looks at Hou Sanxian as if she does not trust him not to overstate things."

# game/script.rpy:3970
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_3495cb41:

    # "罗小六刚要跟，马二花一把拽住他的袖子。"
    "As Luo Xiaoliu is about to follow, Ma Erhua grabs his sleeve."

# game/script.rpy:3972
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_a5bbfeb5:

    # maerhua "你留下。"
    maerhua "You stay."

# game/script.rpy:3974
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_c4af1551:

    # "罗小六慢吞吞地看她。"
    "Luo Xiaoliu slowly looks at her."

# game/script.rpy:3976
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_5637799e:

    # luoxiaoliu "为什么？"
    luoxiaoliu "Why?"

# game/script.rpy:3978
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_6b88dc27:

    # "马二花朝菜市另一头抬了抬下巴。"
    "Ma Erhua lifts her chin toward the far side of the market."

# game/script.rpy:3980
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_e58ae817:

    # maerhua "你不是认路最熟吗？盯着点巷口。"
    maerhua "Aren't you best at knowing the roads? Watch the alley mouth."

# game/script.rpy:3982
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_8427c7ae:

    # maerhua "要是刚才那个灰衣人白天又从西街冒出来，你比我们先看见。"
    maerhua "If that gray-clothed man from before appears from West Street again in daylight, you will spot him before we do."

# game/script.rpy:3984
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_337a9e5d:

    # "罗小六想了想，点头。"
    "Luo Xiaoliu thinks, then nods."

# game/script.rpy:3986
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_57aea2e4:

    # luoxiaoliu "哦。那我坐着看。"
    luoxiaoliu "Oh. Then I will watch sitting down."

# game/script.rpy:3988
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_e12fcad2:

    # "钱四喜也想跟上，已经迈出半步，却被马二花用一根手指戳回石阶。"
    "Qian Siyi also wants to follow and takes half a step, but Ma Erhua pokes her back onto the stone steps with one finger."

# game/script.rpy:3990
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_df1bc03b:

    # qiansixi "我也想听！"
    qiansixi "I want to hear too!"

# game/script.rpy:3992
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_16ec959b:

    # maerhua "你不许听。你听完一遍，整个西街都能听第二遍。"
    maerhua "You may not listen. Once you hear it, the whole of West Street hears it a second time."

# game/script.rpy:3994
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_8edf9c82:

    # "钱四喜不服气地鼓起脸。"
    "Qian Siyi puffs up her cheeks in protest."

# game/script.rpy:3996
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_cc6d9944:

    # qiansixi "我那叫会讲。"
    qiansixi "I call that being good at telling it."

# game/script.rpy:3998
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_a774af9c:

    # maerhua "所以你更不能去。"
    maerhua "That is why you especially cannot go."

# game/script.rpy:4000
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_d1af8d0d:

    # "于是罗小六靠回竹筐边，半睁着眼盯着巷口。"
    "So Luo Xiaoliu leans back by the bamboo basket, watching the alley mouth with half-open eyes."

# game/script.rpy:4002
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_59b0675b:

    # "钱四喜蹲在旁边扯草叶。"
    "Qian Siyi squats beside him, pulling at grass blades."

# game/script.rpy:4004
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_9d3cf061:

    # "马二花留在石阶上看着他们，也顺便留意菜市里来来往往的人。"
    "Ma Erhua stays on the steps to watch them and keep an eye on people passing through the market."

# game/script.rpy:4008
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_3b214ed7:

    # "跟着你往马具行方向走的，只剩侯三闲、梁阿坠和杜七娘。"
    "Only Hou Sanxian, Liang Azhui, and Du Qiniang go with you toward the harness shop."

# game/script.rpy:4011
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_b795b35f:

    # wangfang "你昨晚说，知道谁把事传歪了？"
    wangfang "You said last night that you knew who twisted the story?"

# game/script.rpy:4013
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_63e5a2d8:

    # zuowan "你昨晚说，知道谁把事传歪了？"
    zuowan "You said last night that you knew who twisted the story?"

# game/script.rpy:4015
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_4bb58a8f:

    # "侯三闲压低声音。"
    "Hou Sanxian lowers his voice."

# game/script.rpy:4017
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_3583a2da:

    # housanxian "我没看清是谁，但我知道那话不是从医馆传出来的。"
    housanxian "I did not see clearly who it was, but I know that story did not come from the clinic."

# game/script.rpy:4020
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_b03b1a1c:

    # wangfang "你怎么知道？"
    wangfang "How do you know?"

# game/script.rpy:4022
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_391530e4:

    # zuowan "你怎么知道？"
    zuowan "How do you know?"

# game/script.rpy:4024
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_c490d717:

    # housanxian "医馆的人说话没那么会添油加醋。"
    housanxian "Clinic people do not dress up words with that much extra oil and spice."

# game/script.rpy:4026
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_a66dfeb6:

    # housanxian "长风楼昨晚最早那句‘云清道长杀人灭口’，是一个灰衣江湖客先说的。"
    housanxian "The first person to say 'Daoist Yunqing killed to silence people' at Changfeng House last night was a gray-clothed jianghu traveler."

# game/script.rpy:4028
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_63fd25c8:

    # housanxian "他说完没多久，三张桌子都开始讲同一个版本。"
    housanxian "Not long after he spoke, three tables were telling the same version."

# game/script.rpy:4031
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_45d8ee62:

    # wangfang "灰衣江湖客？"
    wangfang "A gray-clothed jianghu traveler?"

# game/script.rpy:4033
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_69078e50:

    # zuowan "灰衣江湖客？"
    zuowan "A gray-clothed jianghu traveler?"

# game/script.rpy:4035
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_0c721f63:

    # "梁阿坠在旁边插嘴。"
    "Liang Azhui cuts in."

# game/script.rpy:4037
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_fd293902:

    # liangazhui "腰间挂着黑布袋，走路不响。"
    liangazhui "He had a black cloth pouch at his waist and made no sound when he walked."

# game/script.rpy:4039
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_c92ea424:

    # liangazhui "进长风楼没点菜，只点了一壶最便宜的酒。"
    liangazhui "At Changfeng House, he ordered no food—only the cheapest jug of wine."

# game/script.rpy:4042
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_9460ffd8:

    # wangfang "你昨晚也在？"
    wangfang "You were there last night too?"

# game/script.rpy:4044
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_6bc2413f:

    # zuowan "你昨晚也在？"
    zuowan "You were there last night too?"

# game/script.rpy:4046
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_4887ff3b:

    # "梁阿坠把骰子往袖里一藏。"
    "Liang Azhui hides the die in his sleeve."

# game/script.rpy:4048
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_bd64b7bf:

    # liangazhui "我在后巷。"
    liangazhui "I was in the back alley."

# game/script.rpy:4050
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_a38ac50d:

    # liangazhui "关扑铺散得晚，我顺路听了两句。"
    liangazhui "The gambling shop closed late, so I heard a few words while passing by."

# game/script.rpy:4052
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_757d6bee:

    # "杜七娘补充。"
    "Du Qiniang adds,"

# game/script.rpy:4054
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_bbcc0294:

    # duqiniang "我也在门口。"
    duqiniang "I was at the door too."

# game/script.rpy:4056
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_8cfa8a60:

    # duqiniang "那会儿楼里太吵，侯三闲和阿坠又只顾听话，我只能看人。"
    duqiniang "It was too noisy inside then, and Hou Sanxian and Azhui were busy listening to words, so I could only watch people."

# game/script.rpy:4058
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_2217ba10:

    # "侯三闲不服。"
    "Hou Sanxian protests."

# game/script.rpy:4060
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_dada3c5f:

    # housanxian "什么叫只顾听话？我那叫抓重点。"
    housanxian "What do you mean, busy listening to words? I was catching the important points."

# game/script.rpy:4062
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_147426cf:

    # duqiniang "所以你没看见他左手一直按着黑布袋。"
    duqiniang "Which is why you did not see that his left hand kept pressing on the black cloth pouch."

# game/script.rpy:4064
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_a73038e6:

    # "梁阿坠把旧骰子又摸出来，在指间转了一下。"
    "Liang Azhui takes out the old die again and rolls it once between his fingers."

# game/script.rpy:4066
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_efe09064:

    # liangazhui "那人坐的位置也怪。"
    liangazhui "Where he sat was strange too."

# game/script.rpy:4068
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_e7f47988:

    # liangazhui "不上二楼，不靠窗，不靠说书人，偏坐在能看见三张桌子的角落。"
    liangazhui "Not upstairs, not by a window, not near the storyteller—he sat in a corner that could see three tables."

# game/script.rpy:4070
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_77667eab:

    # liangazhui "说一句，三边都能听见。"
    liangazhui "Say one thing, and all three sides can hear it."

# game/script.rpy:4073
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_2fcaaa25:

    # wangfang "所以他是故意的？"
    wangfang "So he did it deliberately?"

# game/script.rpy:4075
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_6e45137a:

    # zuowan "所以他是故意的？"
    zuowan "So he did it deliberately?"

# game/script.rpy:4077
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_cb55df20:

    # housanxian "我不敢说故意。"
    housanxian "I dare not say it was deliberate."

# game/script.rpy:4079
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_488baedd:

    # housanxian "但他说完就走，走得比结账的人还快。"
    housanxian "But after speaking, he left faster than people paying their bill."

# game/script.rpy:4082
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_aafaf69c:

    # wangfang "那人后来去哪了？"
    wangfang "Where did he go afterward?"

# game/script.rpy:4084
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_8465452b:

    # zuowan "那人后来去哪了？"
    zuowan "Where did he go afterward?"

# game/script.rpy:4086
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_62052b47:

    # "侯三闲表情变得认真一点。"
    "Hou Sanxian grows a little more serious."

# game/script.rpy:4088
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_2107daba:

    # housanxian "这就是我要说的。"
    housanxian "That is what I mean to tell you."

# game/script.rpy:4090
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_7f5cbdb4:

    # housanxian "昨晚宵禁前，我在长风楼外墙根躲巡捕……不是，歇脚。"
    housanxian "Before curfew last night, I was by the outside wall of Changfeng House avoiding patrol officers... no, resting my feet."

# game/script.rpy:4092
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_af02cf18:

    # housanxian "看见那灰衣人从后巷走了，没往客栈，也没往南门，而是绕去了镇北小路。"
    housanxian "I saw that gray-clothed man leave through the back alley. He went neither to an inn nor the south gate, but circled toward the north-town path."

# game/script.rpy:4095
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_bca2a612:

    # wangfang "镇北小路？"
    wangfang "The north-town path?"

# game/script.rpy:4097
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_4f90b033:

    # zuowan "镇北小路？"
    zuowan "The north-town path?"

# game/script.rpy:4099
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_d3327cbb:

    # "侯三闲点头。"
    "Hou Sanxian nods."

# game/script.rpy:4101
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_070ffd11:

    # housanxian "不是上风雷观正路，是老采药人和砍柴人以前走的小路。"
    housanxian "Not the main road to Fenglei Abbey—the old path once used by herb gatherers and woodcutters."

# game/script.rpy:4103
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_6199fdd0:

    # housanxian "夜里没人走。"
    housanxian "No one uses it at night."

# game/script.rpy:4105
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_b42475d6:

    # housanxian "那人走得很熟。"
    housanxian "That man knew it well."

# game/script.rpy:4108
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_a9e39781:

    # wangfang "你确定？"
    wangfang "Are you sure?"

# game/script.rpy:4110
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_37239311:

    # zuowan "你确定？"
    zuowan "Are you sure?"

# game/script.rpy:4112
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_0aaae5f0:

    # "侯三闲嘴硬地说："
    "Hou Sanxian says stubbornly,"

# game/script.rpy:4114
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_4ad1a37e:

    # housanxian "我侯三闲别的不行，认人尾巴最行。"
    housanxian "I, Hou Sanxian, may not be good at much else, but I am best at recognizing a person's trail."

# game/script.rpy:4116
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_ff17c602:

    # "杜七娘淡淡道："
    "Du Qiniang says mildly,"

# game/script.rpy:4118
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_87495107:

    # duqiniang "他这点确实行。欠账的人从街头拐到街尾，他都能认出来。"
    duqiniang "That much is true. A debtor can turn from one end of the street to the other, and he will recognize them."

# game/script.rpy:4120
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_e3b1d985:

    # "梁阿坠小声补一句。"
    "Liang Azhui adds quietly,"

# game/script.rpy:4122
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_83939cea:

    # liangazhui "就是跟踪。"
    liangazhui "It is stalking."

# game/script.rpy:4124
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_6cac212e:

    # "侯三闲立刻纠正。"
    "Hou Sanxian immediately corrects him."

# game/script.rpy:4126
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_09009c7f:

    # housanxian "江湖上叫缀行。"
    housanxian "In the jianghu, it is called following a trail."

# game/script.rpy:4128
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_c6e919f2:

    # "几人走到一处摊棚阴影下，侯三闲的声音更低了些。"
    "The group reaches the shadow of a market awning, and Hou Sanxian lowers his voice further."

# game/script.rpy:4130
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_f7c5f14e:

    # housanxian "但这事我不去官府说。"
    housanxian "But I will not report this to the authorities."

# game/script.rpy:4132
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_198144c9:

    # "你看向他。"
    "You look at him."

# game/script.rpy:4134
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_0c580270:

    # "侯三闲抢先道："
    "Hou Sanxian quickly says,"

# game/script.rpy:4136
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_41d841c0:

    # housanxian "不是怕。我是……谨慎。"
    housanxian "It is not fear. I am... cautious."

# game/script.rpy:4138
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_bc7b793f:

    # "杜七娘看向你，语气平静，却比侯三闲的话更重。"
    "Du Qiniang looks at you. Her tone is calm, but her words carry more weight than Hou Sanxian's."

# game/script.rpy:4140
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_c8c8b1d0:

    # duqiniang "你别逼他去官府。"
    duqiniang "Do not force him to go to the authorities."

# game/script.rpy:4142
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_1710fb6a:

    # duqiniang "他真去了，第二天西街就没人敢跟他说话。"
    duqiniang "If he truly goes, no one in West Street will dare speak to him the next day."

# game/script.rpy:4144
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_af53c254:

    # "你一时没有接话。"
    "For a moment, you do not reply."

# game/script.rpy:4146
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_d3df4590:

    # "杜七娘继续说："
    "Du Qiniang continues,"

# game/script.rpy:4148
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_51736028:

    # duqiniang "我们这种人，知道一点风吹草动还能混饭吃。"
    duqiniang "People like us can make a living by knowing a little of every stirring wind."

# game/script.rpy:4150
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_60fae9f4:

    # duqiniang "可要是站到明处，给谁作证，指谁有罪，就不只是挨一顿打的事了。"
    duqiniang "But if we step into the open, testify for someone, or accuse someone of guilt, it becomes more than a matter of taking one beating."

# game/script.rpy:4152
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_fad75be2:

    # "梁阿坠低头拨弄骰子，声音很小。"
    "Liang Azhui lowers his head and fiddles with his die, speaking very softly."

# game/script.rpy:4154
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_4dec6229:

    # liangazhui "关扑铺那边有些人，最不喜欢别人认得太清。"
    liangazhui "Some people around the gambling shops most dislike being recognized too clearly."

# game/script.rpy:4156
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_75c7f08c:

    # "侯三闲强撑着笑了一下。"
    "Hou Sanxian forces a smile."

# game/script.rpy:4158
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_58bea43e:

    # housanxian "所以我只能告诉你。"
    housanxian "So I can only tell you."

# game/script.rpy:4160
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_16ec4468:

    # housanxian "你要说，就说你自己听来的，别把我名字带出去。"
    housanxian "If you speak of it, say you heard it yourself. Do not carry my name out with it."

# game/script.rpy:4162
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_d30a3d2a:

    # "你明白了。"
    "You understand."

# game/script.rpy:4164
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_b3e47aa1:

    # "侯三闲不是不想帮，而是他这种人一旦公开作证，就会惹上他承受不起的麻烦。"
    "Hou Sanxian does want to help, but if someone like him testifies publicly, he will draw trouble he cannot bear."

# game/script.rpy:4166
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_4ff21633:

    # "而这也正说明：西街的游街子们虽然不起眼，却常常比坐在酒楼里的人更早看见真相。"
    "And this shows why West Street's street youths, though unremarkable, often see the truth earlier than those sitting in taverns."

# game/script.rpy:4170
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_e5a2dc20:

    # "几人说话间，已经到了马具行。"
    "As you speak, you arrive at the harness shop."

# game/script.rpy:4172
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_3ec8cd9d:

    # "门口挂着鞍子、缰绳、马嚼子。"
    "Saddles, reins, and bits hang at the entrance."

# game/script.rpy:4174
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_c8179c98:

    # "宋老六正蹲在门口给一副马鞍上油。"
    "Song Laoliu crouches at the door, oiling a saddle."

# game/script.rpy:4176
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_f56b1477:

    # "侯三闲喊道："
    "Hou Sanxian calls out,"

# game/script.rpy:4178
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_7e4719c8:

    # housanxian "宋老六！驿站来问货！"
    housanxian "Song Laoliu! The post station has come to ask about goods!"

# game/script.rpy:4180
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_3f58ebb1:

    # "宋老六抬头。"
    "Song Laoliu looks up."

# game/script.rpy:4182
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_3b267160:

    # songlaoliu "你又代表驿站了？"
    songlaoliu "You are representing the post station again?"

# game/script.rpy:4185
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_077c7a65:

    # wangfang "我是替周二蛋来问，他订的马鞍好了没有。"
    wangfang "I am asking for Zhou Erdan whether his ordered saddle is ready."

# game/script.rpy:4187
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_7db6845f:

    # zuowan "我是替周二蛋来问，他订的马鞍好了没有。"
    zuowan "I am asking for Zhou Erdan whether his ordered saddle is ready."

# game/script.rpy:4189
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_979dac0a:

    # "宋老六擦了擦手。"
    "Song Laoliu wipes his hands."

# game/script.rpy:4191
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_3d9107cd:

    # songlaoliu "好了。"
    songlaoliu "It is ready."

# game/script.rpy:4193
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_f1334873:

    # songlaoliu "就是他要加的那层软垫费工。"
    songlaoliu "The extra padded layer he wanted took work."

# game/script.rpy:4195
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_9cdf4174:

    # songlaoliu "你回去告诉他，下午来取。若嫌慢，让他自己来缝。"
    songlaoliu "Tell him to come collect it this afternoon. If he thinks it slow, he can sew it himself."

# game/script.rpy:4197
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_12791cff:

    # "侯三闲立刻搭话。"
    "Hou Sanxian immediately chimes in."

# game/script.rpy:4199
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_96fa085f:

    # housanxian "周二蛋自己缝，马骑上去都得哭。"
    housanxian "If Zhou Erdan sews it himself, even the horse will cry when ridden."

# game/script.rpy:4201
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_f8739c2c:

    # "宋老六瞥他一眼。"
    "Song Laoliu gives him a sidelong glance."

# game/script.rpy:4203
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_1e162ff2:

    # songlaoliu "你要是再在我门口挡客，我先让你哭。"
    songlaoliu "If you block customers at my door again, I will make you cry first."

# game/script.rpy:4205
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_69ef7465:

    # "你下消息，向宋老六道谢。"
    "Having received the news, you thank Song Laoliu."

# game/script.rpy:4207
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_23b63608:

    # "你看了看日头，心想得快点回去告诉飞鸿驿站的人才行。"
    "You look at the sun and think you must return quickly to tell the people at Feihong Post Station."

# game/script.rpy:4209
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_5930f1f6:

    # "问完马鞍的事，你想起沈云交代的切糕。"
    "Once the saddle matter is settled, you remember Shen Yun's qiegao."

# game/script.rpy:4211
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_6fa969f2:

    # "侯三闲一听切糕，立刻指了指来路。"
    "At the mention of qiegao, Hou Sanxian immediately points back the way you came."

# game/script.rpy:4215
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_25f2f9cb:

    # housanxian "老马的摊子就在刚才那段石阶斜对面。"
    housanxian "Old Ma's stall is diagonally across from those stone steps we passed."

# game/script.rpy:4217
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_0c1436d2:

    # housanxian "你放心，他那糕热着呢，刀下去还冒气。"
    housanxian "Do not worry, his cakes are hot. Cut into one and steam still rises."

# game/script.rpy:4219
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_36b47c07:

    # "你跟着侯三闲、梁阿坠、杜七娘往回走。"
    "You head back with Hou Sanxian, Liang Azhui, and Du Qiniang."

# game/script.rpy:4221
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_96f316b2:

    # "刚回到巷口石阶附近，便看见马二花还坐在那里，罗小六靠着竹筐盯着巷口，钱四喜正无聊地用草叶编小环。"
    "Back near the alley steps, Ma Erhua still sits there, Luo Xiaoliu watches the alley mouth by the bamboo basket, and Qian Siyi idly weaves grass into small rings."

# game/script.rpy:4223
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_aaf7a135:

    # "钱四喜一见几人回来，立刻跳起来。"
    "The moment Qian Siyi sees you return, she jumps up."

# game/script.rpy:4225
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_dbe1533a:

    # qiansixi "说完啦？有热闹吗？"
    qiansixi "Finished talking? Was there anything exciting?"

# game/script.rpy:4227
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_a5206b04:

    # "马二花看她一眼。"
    "Ma Erhua looks at her."

# game/script.rpy:4229
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_2a8e5767:

    # maerhua "有热闹也不讲给你听。"
    maerhua "Even if there were, we would not tell you."

# game/script.rpy:4231
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_d09f71b2:

    # maerhua "你一张嘴，能把半句传成三回书。"
    maerhua "With one mouth, you can turn half a sentence into three chapters of a tale."

# game/script.rpy:4233
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_4a19011f:

    # "钱四喜不服气。"
    "Qian Siyi is unconvinced."

# game/script.rpy:4235
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_708594fe:

    # qiansixi "我那叫添彩。"
    qiansixi "I call it adding color."

# game/script.rpy:4237
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_6f904d00:

    # "你没有立刻接话，只看向斜对面的切糕摊。"
    "You do not answer at once, only look at the qiegao stall across the way."

# game/script.rpy:4239
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_4b4012ac:

    # "马长顺的切糕摊前还冒着白气。"
    "White steam still rises before Ma Changshun's qiegao stall."

# game/script.rpy:4241
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_598daeb8:

    # "木甑里铺着厚厚的糯米，枣子被蒸得发亮，黑枣嵌在米粒间，甜香混着热气往外散。"
    "Thick glutinous rice fills the wooden steamer, the dates gleam from steaming, and black dates nestle among the grains as sweet fragrance mingles with the heat."

# game/script.rpy:4243
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_c9d63580:

    # "马长顺用木刀沿着边缘切下一块，软糯的糕体微微塌下去，却仍然成形。"
    "Ma Changshun cuts a piece along the edge with a wooden knife. The soft cake sinks slightly but keeps its shape."

# game/script.rpy:4245
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_d8c1bc2a:

    # "你拿出沈云给的二十文。"
    "You take out the twenty wen Shen Yun gave you."

# game/script.rpy:4248
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_65a17fbf:

    # wangfang "马掌柜，切糕两斤。"
    wangfang "Manager Ma, two jin of qiegao."

# game/script.rpy:4250
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_a635892f:

    # zuowan "马掌柜，切糕两斤。"
    zuowan "Manager Ma, two jin of qiegao."

# game/script.rpy:4252
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_5a4b98db:

    # "马长顺把两斤热切糕用油纸细细包好，又在外头多垫了一层草纸，递给你。"
    "Ma Changshun carefully wraps two jin of hot qiegao in oiled paper, adds an outer layer of straw paper, and hands it to you."

# game/script.rpy:4254
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_f7f8067e:

    # machangshun "二十文，正好。"
    machangshun "Twenty wen, exactly."

# game/script.rpy:4256
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_83beca01:

    # machangshun "拿稳了，趁热吃最好。凉了也能吃，就是少一半香。"
    machangshun "Hold it steady. It is best eaten hot. It is still edible cold, only half as fragrant."

# game/script.rpy:4258
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_efd91756:

    # "你收好这包切糕，准备带回去给沈云和沈星辰。"
    "You put away the parcel of qiegao, ready to bring it back for Shen Yun and Shen Xingchen."

# game/script.rpy:4260
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_172d2e0f:

    # "钱四喜这才看明白，眼睛一下亮了。"
    "Only then does Qian Siyi understand, and her eyes light up."

# game/script.rpy:4262
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_9f9d8111:

    # qiansixi "原来是买切糕啊。"
    qiansixi "So you were buying qiegao."

# game/script.rpy:4264
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_1804dde9:

    # "侯三闲咳嗽一声，假装不在意，眼神却已经往木甑上飘了两回。"
    "Hou Sanxian coughs and pretends not to care, though his eyes have already drifted to the steamer twice."

# game/script.rpy:4266
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_0542f9e3:

    # "你想了想，又从自己的钱里添了三十文。"
    "You think for a moment, then add thirty wen of your own money."

# game/script.rpy:4269
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_787a3c6e:

    # wangfang "再来三斤。"
    wangfang "Three more jin."

# game/script.rpy:4271
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_177339df:

    # zuowan "再来三斤。"
    zuowan "Three more jin."

# game/script.rpy:4273
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_5ead3419:

    # "马长顺看了看你，又看了看旁边那群游街子，笑了一下，没有多问。"
    "Ma Changshun looks at you, then at the street youths beside you. He smiles without asking more."

# game/script.rpy:4275
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_07b732ee:

    # "他又切了三斤，用另一张油纸包好。"
    "He cuts another three jin and wraps them in a second sheet of oiled paper."

# game/script.rpy:4277
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_e991d650:

    # "你把新买的那包递给侯三闲他们。"
    "You offer the newly bought parcel to Hou Sanxian and the others."

# game/script.rpy:4279
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_48617246:

    # "侯三闲接过切糕，先愣了一下，然后故作潇洒。"
    "Hou Sanxian takes the qiegao, blinks, then puts on an air of ease."

# game/script.rpy:4281
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_eebcd311:

    # housanxian "这怎么好意思。"
    housanxian "How could I accept this?"

# game/script.rpy:4283
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_b90f0209:

    # "马二花已经接过去咬了一口。"
    "Ma Erhua has already taken a bite."

# game/script.rpy:4285
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_e8ebdb60:

    # maerhua "你不好意思可以不吃。"
    maerhua "If you are embarrassed, you need not eat."

# game/script.rpy:4287
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_153d5e8b:

    # "侯三闲立刻把切糕收回怀里。"
    "Hou Sanxian immediately tucks the qiegao against his chest."

# game/script.rpy:4289
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_9f48730a:

    # housanxian "我替江湖收下。"
    housanxian "I accept it on behalf of the jianghu."

# game/script.rpy:4291
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_c9109022:

    # "钱四喜吃得眼睛发亮。"
    "Qian Siyi eats with shining eyes."

# game/script.rpy:4293
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_45907d64:

    # qiansixi "甜的！"
    qiansixi "Sweet!"

# game/script.rpy:4295
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_8b8f25d8:

    # "罗小六慢吞吞地嚼了一口，点头。"
    "Luo Xiaoliu slowly chews a bite and nods."

# game/script.rpy:4297
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_3b25f2d1:

    # luoxiaoliu "比馒头有意思。"
    luoxiaoliu "More interesting than steamed buns."

# game/script.rpy:4299
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_04b3e9a9:

    # "梁阿坠把切糕掰成小块，像分赌注一样分给众人。"
    "Liang Azhui breaks the qiegao into small pieces and deals them out like wagers."

# game/script.rpy:4301
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_d94b6a8a:

    # liangazhui "一人一块，别抢。抢了就少了。"
    liangazhui "One piece each. Do not grab, or there will be less."

# game/script.rpy:4303
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_fc30b35c:

    # "杜七娘看了你一眼，没有立刻吃，只问："
    "Du Qiniang looks at you. Without eating at once, she asks,"

# game/script.rpy:4305
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_0900a9ea:

    # duqiniang "你自己还有钱吗？"
    duqiniang "Do you still have money yourself?"

# game/script.rpy:4308
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_2afc29ea:

    # wangfang "够回去交差。"
    wangfang "Enough to account for things when I return."

# game/script.rpy:4310
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_a38243ce:

    # zuowan "够回去交差。"
    zuowan "Enough to account for things when I return."

# game/script.rpy:4312
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_3a637d8d:

    # "马二花看着你，忽然说："
    "Ma Erhua looks at you and suddenly says,"

# game/script.rpy:4314
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_a47ac408:

    # maerhua "你这朋友，我交定了。"
    maerhua "I have decided to make a friend of you."

# game/script.rpy:4316
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_65887b0e:

    # "侯三闲立刻不满。"
    "Hou Sanxian is immediately displeased."

# game/script.rpy:4318
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_97ea175e:

    # housanxian "这是我先认识的。"
    housanxian "I knew this one first."

# game/script.rpy:4320
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_0d89a9dc:

    # "罗小六慢吞吞道："
    "Luo Xiaoliu says slowly,"

# game/script.rpy:4322
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_c4895493:

    # luoxiaoliu "你是借钱认识的。"
    luoxiaoliu "You met them by borrowing money."

# game/script.rpy:4324
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_7a6d1d10:

    # "众人笑起来。"
    "Everyone laughs."

# game/script.rpy:4326
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_275c96e7:

    # "你收好给沈云和沈星辰的那包切糕，又提起方大娘要的两只熏鸡。"
    "You secure the parcel for Shen Yun and Shen Xingchen, then lift Auntie Fang's two smoked chickens."

# game/script.rpy:4328
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_1f19fa16:

    # "侯三闲把嘴里的切糕咽下去，压低声音补了一句："
    "Hou Sanxian swallows his qiegao and adds in a low voice,"

# game/script.rpy:4330
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_a3bf3f0b:

    # housanxian "记住，灰衣人、黑布袋、镇北小路。"
    housanxian "Remember: gray-clothed man, black cloth pouch, north-town path."

# game/script.rpy:4332
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_f6d12f1b:

    # housanxian "别说是我说的。"
    housanxian "Do not say I told you."

# game/script.rpy:4334
translate english s019_hou_sanxian_message_d11eaaf0:

    # "你点头，带着熏鸡和切糕离开西街菜市。"
    "You nod and leave West Street Market with the smoked chickens and qiegao."

# game/script.rpy:4357
translate english s020_night_return_base_a8ace232:

    # "你回到飞鸿驿站时，天色已经暗下。"
    "By the time you return to Feihong Post Station, darkness has fallen."

# game/script.rpy:4359
translate english s020_night_return_base_e0a61c32:

    # "方大娘正在厨房门口等着，看见你手里提着油纸包，先问："
    "Auntie Fang waits at the kitchen door. Seeing the oiled-paper parcels in your hands, she asks first:"

# game/script.rpy:4361
translate english s020_night_return_base_f30cf5b8:

    # fangdaniang "熏鸡呢？"
    fangdaniang "Where are the smoked chickens?"

# game/script.rpy:4363
translate english s020_night_return_base_83c6cfd4:

    # "你把两只熏鸡递过去，又把剩下的八十文取出来。"
    "You hand over the two smoked chickens and take out the remaining eighty wen."

# game/script.rpy:4365
translate english s020_night_return_base_7a0cee0b:

    # "你：“两只熏鸡一百二十文，这是剩下的八十文。”"
    "You say, \"The two smoked chickens cost one hundred twenty wen. Here are the remaining eighty.\""

# game/script.rpy:4367
translate english s020_night_return_base_d0ccf7fc:

    # "你：“另外，周二蛋订的马鞍问到了。宋老六说下午已经做好，是加软垫的那副，让周二蛋自己去取。”"
    "You say, \"Also, I asked about Zhou Erdan's saddle. Song Laoliu says the padded one was finished this afternoon, and Zhou Erdan should collect it himself.\""

# game/script.rpy:4369
translate english s020_night_return_base_662f2490:

    # "方大娘接过熏鸡，掂了掂分量，满意地点头。"
    "Auntie Fang accepts the chickens, weighs them in her hand, and nods with satisfaction."

# game/script.rpy:4371
translate english s020_night_return_base_1419727c:

    # "她没有接那八十文，只看了你一眼。"
    "She does not take the eighty wen, only looks at you."

# game/script.rpy:4373
translate english s020_night_return_base_ef21e3b3:

    # fangdaniang "钱你先收着。"
    fangdaniang "Keep the money for now."

# game/script.rpy:4375
translate english s020_night_return_base_9255c4ae:

    # "你一怔。"
    "You pause."

# game/script.rpy:4377
translate english s020_night_return_base_8a4e3119:

    # "你：“这是您的钱。”"
    "You say, \"This is your money.\""

# game/script.rpy:4379
translate english s020_night_return_base_dae581e3:

    # "方大娘把手在围裙上擦了擦。"
    "Auntie Fang wipes her hands on her apron."

# game/script.rpy:4381
translate english s020_night_return_base_ee3ee589:

    # fangdaniang "让你跑腿，又让你打听消息，哪能一文不给？"
    fangdaniang "I had you run errands and gather news. How could I give you not a single wen?"

# game/script.rpy:4383
translate english s020_night_return_base_e036c17f:

    # fangdaniang "这不叫赏，也不叫施舍，叫跑腿钱。"
    fangdaniang "It is neither a reward nor charity. It is errand money."

# game/script.rpy:4385
translate english s020_night_return_base_fd932def:

    # fangdaniang "你既住在夹廊小院，就得知道：帮人做事，账要清，人情也要清。"
    fangdaniang "Since you live in the passage courtyard, learn this: when you help someone, the accounts must be clear, and so must the favors."

# game/script.rpy:4387
translate english s020_night_return_base_d63073d2:

    # "周二蛋正好从马厩方向探头。"
    "Zhou Erdan happens to poke his head out from the direction of the stables."

# game/script.rpy:4389
translate english s020_night_return_base_d5470582:

    # zhouerdan "我的马鞍好了？"
    zhouerdan "My saddle is ready?"

# game/script.rpy:4391
translate english s020_night_return_base_6106edd7:

    # "你点头。"
    "You nod."

# game/script.rpy:4393
translate english s020_night_return_base_c16287ee:

    # "周二蛋一拍大腿。"
    "Zhou Erdan slaps his thigh."

# game/script.rpy:4395
translate english s020_night_return_base_47e01044:

    # zhouerdan "太好了！我那旧鞍再用两天，马没疯，我先疯。"
    zhouerdan "Wonderful! If I use that old saddle two more days, I will go mad before the horse does."

# game/script.rpy:4397
translate english s020_night_return_base_2fa92cc6:

    # "方大娘却没有像平时那样继续斗嘴，而是压低声音。"
    "But Auntie Fang does not continue their usual banter. Instead, she lowers her voice."

# game/script.rpy:4403
translate english s020_night_return_base_b89773a3:

    # fangdaniang "先别嚷。跟我来。"
    fangdaniang "Do not shout yet. Follow me."

# game/script.rpy:4405
translate english s020_night_return_base_3fede2d0:

    # "你这才发现，驿站和医馆的气氛都不太对。"
    "Only then do you notice that neither the post station nor the clinic feels quite right."

# game/script.rpy:4407
translate english s020_night_return_base_e08e9d92:

    # "方大娘带你走进夹廊小院。"
    "Auntie Fang leads you into the passage courtyard."

# game/script.rpy:4409
translate english s020_night_return_base_c3187a38:

    # "这里北接飞鸿驿站后门，南通茯苓医馆侧门，西侧是雷凌宫东墙，东侧屏风门外便是风云坪。"
    "Here, the rear door of Feihong Post Station lies north, Fuling Clinic's side door south, Leiling Palace's east wall west, and Fengyun Square beyond the screen gate to the east."

# game/script.rpy:4411
translate english s020_night_return_base_158099a1:

    # "夹廊小院里，旧木大桌旁已经坐了不少人。"
    "Many people already sit around the old wooden table in the passage courtyard."

# game/script.rpy:4413
translate english s020_night_return_base_613f736f:

    # "方鹤鸣正展开一张驿道图。"
    "Fang Heming is unfolding a post-road map."

# game/script.rpy:4415
translate english s020_night_return_base_9ef87330:

    # "魏三儿抱着胳膊站在桌边，难得没有乱插话。"
    "Wei San'er stands with folded arms by the table, unusually without interrupting."

# game/script.rpy:4417
translate english s020_night_return_base_cbcc4e59:

    # "周二蛋跟进来后，也收了笑。"
    "After Zhou Erdan enters, his smile disappears too."

# game/script.rpy:4419
translate english s020_night_return_base_13ed631e:

    # "南侧医馆门边，徐春香、陈素梅、程明珠都在。"
    "Xu Chunxiang, Chen Sumei, and Cheng Mingzhu stand by the clinic door to the south."

# game/script.rpy:4421
translate english s020_night_return_base_2dced880:

    # "李默站在通往风云坪的屏风门旁，手按刀柄。"
    "Li Mo stands by the screen gate to Fengyun Square, one hand on his sword hilt."

# game/script.rpy:4423
translate english s020_night_return_base_ead586fc:

    # "沈星辰抱着药书坐在角落，脸色有些发白。"
    "Shen Xingchen sits in a corner holding a medicine book, his face a little pale."

# game/script.rpy:4425
translate english s020_night_return_base_a9d61c4d:

    # "你刚一进来，就感觉到：这里不是闲聊，是商议大事。"
    "The moment you enter, you feel it: this is no casual chat but a discussion of serious matters."

# game/script.rpy:4427
translate english s020_night_return_base_1402fbd2:

    # "方大娘把熏鸡放到桌边，却没人动。"
    "Auntie Fang sets the smoked chickens by the table, but no one moves for them."

# game/script.rpy:4429
translate english s020_night_return_base_0a238949:

    # "魏三儿先开口："
    "Wei San'er speaks first:"

# game/script.rpy:4431
translate english s020_night_return_base_cc94b5aa:

    # weisaner "你回来了？侯三闲怎么说？"
    weisaner "You are back? What did Hou Sanxian say?"

# game/script.rpy:4433
translate english s020_night_return_base_afab07b7:

    # "你把西街菜市的事讲了一遍。"
    "You recount what happened at West Street Market."

# game/script.rpy:4435
translate english s020_night_return_base_5618b79d:

    # "灰衣江湖客。"
    "A gray-clothed jianghu traveler."

# game/script.rpy:4437
translate english s020_night_return_base_3674af71:

    # "黑布袋。"
    "A black cloth pouch."

# game/script.rpy:4439
translate english s020_night_return_base_09043231:

    # "长风楼最早传歪的话。"
    "The first twisted tale at Changfeng House."

# game/script.rpy:4441
translate english s020_night_return_base_f9a2b8f7:

    # "宵禁前绕去镇北小路。"
    "A detour toward the north-town path before curfew."

# game/script.rpy:4443
translate english s020_night_return_base_e770bbca:

    # "你说完，夹廊小院一时安静。"
    "When you finish, the passage courtyard falls quiet."

# game/script.rpy:4445
translate english s020_night_return_base_6f615e30:

    # "李默看向郭路平方向空着的位置，低声道："
    "Li Mo looks toward Guo Luping's empty place and says quietly,"

# game/script.rpy:4447
translate english s020_night_return_base_7db26e7f:

    # limo "镇北小路，确实能绕到外山。"
    limo "The north-town path does indeed circle to the outer mountain."

# game/script.rpy:4449
translate english s020_night_return_base_b474dd19:

    # "程明珠眉头一紧。"
    "Cheng Mingzhu's brow tightens."

# game/script.rpy:4451
translate english s020_night_return_base_be217bed:

    # chengmingzhu "所以昨天的医馆伤者，不是唯一一批走小路的人。"
    chengmingzhu "So yesterday's clinic patient was not the only one to take that path."

# game/script.rpy:4453
translate english s020_night_return_base_077250dd:

    # "陈素梅冷冷道："
    "Chen Sumei says coldly,"

# game/script.rpy:4455
translate english s020_night_return_base_27aca5b2:

    # chensumei "也可能是同一条路把人引过去，再把谣言引回来。"
    chensumei "Or the same path led people there, then led rumors back."

# game/script.rpy:4457
translate english s020_night_return_base_7794cc1d:

    # "这时，徐春香缓缓说："
    "Then Xu Chunxiang speaks slowly:"

# game/script.rpy:4459
translate english s020_night_return_base_4e609ea9:

    # xuchunxiang "医馆这边也有消息。"
    xuchunxiang "The clinic has news as well."

# game/script.rpy:4461
translate english s020_night_return_base_c42f12bd:

    # xuchunxiang "今日下午，风雷观山门附近传下话来，承天剑派凌霄子已经到了。"
    xuchunxiang "This afternoon, word came down from near Fenglei Abbey's gate that Lingxiaozi of the Chengtian Sword Sect has arrived."

# game/script.rpy:4463
translate english s020_night_return_base_d40c845f:

    # "周二蛋吸了口气。"
    "Zhou Erdan draws a breath."

# game/script.rpy:4465
translate english s020_night_return_base_54eb24ff:

    # zhouerdan "承天剑派掌门亲自来了？"
    zhouerdan "The Chengtian Sword Sect's leader came in person?"

# game/script.rpy:4467
translate english s020_night_return_base_3439aa05:

    # "方鹤鸣抬头。"
    "Fang Heming looks up."

# game/script.rpy:4469
translate english s020_night_return_base_09944259:

    # fangheming "若只为看丹，不必掌门亲至。"
    fangheming "If it were only to see an elixir, the sect leader would not need to come in person."

# game/script.rpy:4471
translate english s020_night_return_base_268ff0ad:

    # "徐春香继续说："
    "Xu Chunxiang continues:"

# game/script.rpy:4473
translate english s020_night_return_base_de5e9437:

    # xuchunxiang "梧天禅院的惠能大师也到了。静月师太随行。"
    xuchunxiang "Master Huineng of Wutian Chan Monastery has also arrived, with Abbess Jingyue accompanying him."

# game/script.rpy:4475
translate english s020_night_return_base_1088f806:

    # "陈素梅听到“静月”二字，神色终于有了变化。"
    "At the name Jingyue, Chen Sumei's expression finally changes."

# game/script.rpy:4477
translate english s020_night_return_base_678dad55:

    # "沈星辰小声问："
    "Shen Xingchen asks softly,"

# game/script.rpy:4479
translate english s020_night_return_base_1d9953fe:

    # shenxingchen "是每年来医馆义诊、与您切磋针理的静月师太？"
    shenxingchen "The Abbess Jingyue who comes yearly to give free consultations and discuss needling principles with you?"

# game/script.rpy:4481
translate english s020_night_return_base_9dc8a851:

    # "陈素梅点头。"
    "Chen Sumei nods."

# game/script.rpy:4483
translate english s020_night_return_base_f5872137:

    # chensumei "是她。她不轻易离山。"
    chensumei "It is she. She does not leave her mountain easily."

# game/script.rpy:4485
translate english s020_night_return_base_990596de:

    # "魏三儿皱眉。"
    "Wei San'er frowns."

# game/script.rpy:4487
translate english s020_night_return_base_9446f67a:

    # weisaner "承天剑派、梧天禅院……这阵仗也太大了。"
    weisaner "The Chengtian Sword Sect and Wutian Chan Monastery... this is far too large a gathering."

# game/script.rpy:4489
translate english s020_night_return_base_9232ae1e:

    # "程明珠补了一句。"
    "Cheng Mingzhu adds,"

# game/script.rpy:4491
translate english s020_night_return_base_8f18eadf:

    # chengmingzhu "还有东海沧海阁的人。来的是凌沧海本人，还是阁中其他人，暂时不清楚。"
    chengmingzhu "There are people from Canghai Pavilion of the eastern sea as well. For now, it is unclear whether Ling Canghai himself came or someone else from the pavilion."

# game/script.rpy:4493
translate english s020_night_return_base_dbdbb02e:

    # "周二蛋忍不住问："
    "Zhou Erdan cannot help asking,"

# game/script.rpy:4495
translate english s020_night_return_base_0ef9def7:

    # zhouerdan "那衡云堂来人了吗？万毒谷的苏玉寒呢？"
    zhouerdan "Has Hengyun Hall sent anyone? What of Su Yuhan from Wandu Valley?"

# game/script.rpy:4497
translate english s020_night_return_base_05351f70:

    # "夹廊小院里没人立刻回答。"
    "No one in the passage courtyard answers at once."

# game/script.rpy:4499
translate english s020_night_return_base_5f075248:

    # "这种沉默比回答更让人不安。"
    "This silence is more unsettling than an answer."

# game/script.rpy:4501
translate english s020_night_return_base_51df1772:

    # "方鹤鸣看向徐春香。"
    "Fang Heming looks to Xu Chunxiang."

# game/script.rpy:4503
translate english s020_night_return_base_028d585a:

    # fangheming "一切皆由长息定年丹而起。春香，你可知其中关窍？"
    fangheming "Everything began with the Long-Breath Age-Settling Elixir. Chunxiang, do you know the key to it?"

# game/script.rpy:4505
translate english s020_night_return_base_a33b5ff6:

    # "徐春香沉吟片刻。"
    "Xu Chunxiang considers for a moment."

# game/script.rpy:4507
translate english s020_night_return_base_93a0e183:

    # xuchunxiang "说实话，我也不知道真正原由。"
    xuchunxiang "Truthfully, I do not know the true reason either."

# game/script.rpy:4509
translate english s020_night_return_base_3d504d2c:

    # xuchunxiang "风雷观炼丹，医馆确实供过几味药材，但我们供的是药，不是秘方。"
    xuchunxiang "Fenglei Abbey is refining an elixir, and the clinic did supply several medicinal materials. But we supplied ingredients, not a secret formula."

# game/script.rpy:4511
translate english s020_night_return_base_dbdbb02e_1:

    # "周二蛋忍不住问："
    "Zhou Erdan cannot help asking,"

# game/script.rpy:4513
translate english s020_night_return_base_ddfde1a1:

    # zhouerdan "什么药材？"
    zhouerdan "What medicinal materials?"

# game/script.rpy:4515
translate english s020_night_return_base_22e5a496:

    # "徐春香看了一眼沈星辰。"
    "Xu Chunxiang glances at Shen Xingchen."

# game/script.rpy:4517
translate english s020_night_return_base_82746497:

    # "沈星辰低声说："
    "Shen Xingchen says softly,"

# game/script.rpy:4519
translate english s020_night_return_base_6f624628:

    # shenxingchen "白霜茯苓、雷纹草、息风藤，还有一味……锁龄芝。"
    shenxingchen "White-Frost Fuling, thunder-veined grass, wind-settling vine, and one more... age-locking ganoderma."

# game/script.rpy:4521
translate english s020_night_return_base_b30a65bc:

    # "方大娘一听就皱眉。"
    "Auntie Fang frowns as soon as she hears it."

# game/script.rpy:4523
translate english s020_night_return_base_59e1b8a8:

    # fangdaniang "这名字听着就贵。"
    fangdaniang "That name sounds expensive."

# game/script.rpy:4525
translate english s020_night_return_base_44c93855:

    # "徐春香点头。"
    "Xu Chunxiang nods."

# game/script.rpy:4527
translate english s020_night_return_base_894e0594:

    # xuchunxiang "锁龄芝最难得。我与青柳平日都鲜少使用。"
    xuchunxiang "Age-locking ganoderma is the rarest. Qingliu and I seldom use it even in ordinary times."

# game/script.rpy:4529
translate english s020_night_return_base_9253e7e2:

    # xuchunxiang "它本身不是什么长生药，只是能在极短时间内稳住衰败的气血。"
    xuchunxiang "It is not itself an immortality medicine. It can only stabilize failing blood and qi for a very short time."

# game/script.rpy:4531
translate english s020_night_return_base_155e9d23:

    # xuchunxiang "若用得好，救人。若用得急，害人。"
    xuchunxiang "Used well, it saves people. Used rashly, it harms them."

# game/script.rpy:4533
translate english s020_night_return_base_fbfc58f5:

    # "陈素梅接话："
    "Chen Sumei says,"

# game/script.rpy:4535
translate english s020_night_return_base_ee912e85:

    # chensumei "昨日那个伤者，像是误纳了未定之息。"
    chensumei "Yesterday's injured man seemed to have mistakenly drawn in unsettled breath."

# game/script.rpy:4537
translate english s020_night_return_base_844610f7:

    # chensumei "若定年丹还没成，丹炉外泄的气本就不稳。"
    chensumei "If the Age-Settling Elixir has not yet formed, the qi leaking from the furnace would naturally be unstable."

# game/script.rpy:4539
translate english s020_night_return_base_6bfc34e8:

    # "方鹤鸣皱眉。"
    "Fang Heming frowns."

# game/script.rpy:4541
translate english s020_night_return_base_ae53cfb0:

    # fangheming "所以有人明知丹未成，仍在诱人靠近？"
    fangheming "So someone is luring people close even knowing the elixir is unfinished?"

# game/script.rpy:4543
translate english s020_night_return_base_3c0a4701:

    # "你想到侯三闲说的灰衣人，心里一沉。"
    "Thinking of the gray-clothed man Hou Sanxian mentioned, your heart sinks."

# game/script.rpy:4547
translate english s020_night_return_base_675c16f0:

    # "这时，夹廊小院北门被推开，郭路平走了进来。"
    "Then the north gate of the passage courtyard opens and Guo Luping enters."

# game/script.rpy:4549
translate english s020_night_return_base_78dc8a2b:

    # "他身上带着一点夜风，神情仍稳，却比平日更沉。"
    "He carries a trace of night wind. His expression remains steady, but more grave than usual."

# game/script.rpy:4551
translate english s020_night_return_base_62243c1d:

    # guoluping "不用太过慌。"
    guoluping "There is no need to panic too much."

# game/script.rpy:4553
translate english s020_night_return_base_0852e8a7:

    # guoluping "几大门派齐聚风雷观，未必是坏事。"
    guoluping "Several great sects gathering at Fenglei Abbey may not be a bad thing."

# game/script.rpy:4555
translate english s020_night_return_base_7c9f6f53:

    # guoluping "至少说明他们都还愿意坐到山上谈，而不是在镇里打。"
    guoluping "At least it means they are still willing to sit and talk on the mountain rather than fight in town."

# game/script.rpy:4557
translate english s020_night_return_base_c65899d4:

    # "魏三儿立刻问："
    "Wei San'er asks immediately,"

# game/script.rpy:4559
translate english s020_night_return_base_28f5fb9e:

    # weisaner "那要是谈不拢呢？"
    weisaner "What if they cannot come to terms?"

# game/script.rpy:4561
translate english s020_night_return_base_0849d7a7:

    # "郭路平看向众人。"
    "Guo Luping looks over everyone."

# game/script.rpy:4563
translate english s020_night_return_base_1e4c0218:

    # guoluping "所以我们不能掉以轻心。"
    guoluping "That is why we cannot let down our guard."

# game/script.rpy:4565
translate english s020_night_return_base_336100f8:

    # "他指了指风云坪方向。"
    "He points toward Fengyun Square."

# game/script.rpy:4567
translate english s020_night_return_base_816368dc:

    # guoluping "我已经去过雷凌宫。"
    guoluping "I have already been to Leiling Palace."

# game/script.rpy:4569
translate english s020_night_return_base_0fd5a8d0:

    # guoluping "王德久今日闭门不出，王家已经加了护院。"
    guoluping "Wang Dejiu has kept his doors closed today, and the Wang household has added more guards."

# game/script.rpy:4571
translate english s020_night_return_base_a84580a3:

    # guoluping "雷凌宫东墙就在夹廊西侧，咱们至少不用担心西边被人穿进来。"
    guoluping "Leiling Palace's east wall stands west of the passage courtyard, so at least we need not fear people slipping in from the west."

# game/script.rpy:4573
translate english s020_night_return_base_d454c71b:

    # guoluping "真正要守的，是面向风云坪的屏风门，还有驿站、医馆两头的门。"
    guoluping "What we truly need to guard are the screen gate facing Fengyun Square and the doors at both the post station and clinic."

# game/script.rpy:4575
translate english s020_night_return_base_0d0f4a75:

    # "魏三儿嘀咕："
    "Wei San'er mutters,"

# game/script.rpy:4577
translate english s020_night_return_base_a76dd54a:

    # weisaner "怪不得雷凌宫今天一天没开门。"
    weisaner "No wonder Leiling Palace did not open its doors all day."

# game/script.rpy:4579
translate english s020_night_return_base_f33eecf1:

    # guoluping "王家怕事，也有怕事的用处。"
    guoluping "The Wang family's fear of trouble has its uses."

# game/script.rpy:4581
translate english s020_night_return_base_d732ad6d:

    # guoluping "门关得紧，总比门开着添乱强。"
    guoluping "A tightly shut door is better than an open one inviting trouble."

# game/script.rpy:4583
translate english s020_night_return_base_120aad3f:

    # "程明珠开始接管调度。"
    "Cheng Mingzhu begins directing the arrangements."

# game/script.rpy:4585
translate english s020_night_return_base_880443ed:

    # chengmingzhu "从现在起，医馆前门半闭。"
    chengmingzhu "From now on, the clinic's front door stays half closed."

# game/script.rpy:4587
translate english s020_night_return_base_2be86774:

    # chengmingzhu "只接急症，且进来之前需要李默先确认安全。"
    chengmingzhu "We take only emergencies, and Li Mo must confirm their safety before entry."

# game/script.rpy:4589
translate english s020_night_return_base_b4660fa8:

    # chengmingzhu "普通问诊推到明日。药材库上锁。"
    chengmingzhu "Ordinary consultations wait until tomorrow. Lock the medicine storehouse."

# game/script.rpy:4591
translate english s020_night_return_base_381cd797:

    # chensumei "伤者那边我守前半夜。"
    chensumei "I will watch the patient for the first half of the night."

# game/script.rpy:4593
translate english s020_night_return_base_e636091e:

    # "沈星辰立刻说："
    "Shen Xingchen immediately says,"

# game/script.rpy:4595
translate english s020_night_return_base_ff0650be:

    # shenxingchen "我可以守药炉。"
    shenxingchen "I can watch the medicine furnace."

# game/script.rpy:4597
translate english s020_night_return_base_0f4fb2d8:

    # "陈素梅看他一眼。"
    "Chen Sumei looks at him."

# game/script.rpy:4599
translate english s020_night_return_base_7ed1c95c:

    # chensumei "你守可以，别把药书掉炉里。"
    chensumei "You may watch it. Just do not drop the medicine book into the furnace."

# game/script.rpy:4601
translate english s020_night_return_base_63aff822:

    # "方大娘把袖子一挽。"
    "Auntie Fang rolls up her sleeves."

# game/script.rpy:4603
translate english s020_night_return_base_424636da:

    # fangdaniang "这边我管饭。真要守夜，没饭先垮一半。"
    fangdaniang "I will handle food here. If we are truly keeping watch, half of us will collapse first without meals."

# game/script.rpy:4605
translate english s020_night_return_base_a1b795ef:

    # "周二蛋立刻举手。"
    "Zhou Erdan raises his hand at once."

# game/script.rpy:4607
translate english s020_night_return_base_16e9892a:

    # zhouerdan "我守马厩。马一乱，人更乱。"
    zhouerdan "I will watch the stables. If the horses panic, the people will panic worse."

# game/script.rpy:4609
translate english s020_night_return_base_652e763f:

    # "方鹤鸣铺开纸笔。"
    "Fang Heming lays out paper and brush."

# game/script.rpy:4611
translate english s020_night_return_base_84e01941:

    # fangheming "我列值夜表。"
    fangheming "I will draw up the night-watch roster."

# game/script.rpy:4613
translate english s020_night_return_base_a6db24dd:

    # fangheming "驿站、医馆、夹廊三处轮换。谁也不许凭热血乱跑。"
    fangheming "The post station, clinic, and passage courtyard will rotate. No one may run about recklessly on hot blood alone."

# game/script.rpy:4615
translate english s020_night_return_base_a52ad59e:

    # "魏三儿看向你。"
    "Wei San'er looks at you."

# game/script.rpy:4617
translate english s020_night_return_base_f998f37d:

    # weisaner "你也别想躲。夹廊小院的人，今晚最不清闲。"
    weisaner "Do not think of hiding either. People in the passage courtyard will be the busiest tonight."

# game/script.rpy:4619
translate english s020_night_return_base_9c38797d:

    # "程明珠转向你，语气很正式。"
    "Cheng Mingzhu turns to you, her tone very formal."

# game/script.rpy:4621
translate english s020_night_return_base_d00440af:

    # chengmingzhu "屏风后面向风云坪的门已经锁好。"
    chengmingzhu "The door behind the screen that faces Fengyun Square has been locked."

# game/script.rpy:4623
translate english s020_night_return_base_97503405:

    # chengmingzhu "无论外头有什么声响，不经我或郭总管允许，不许开。"
    chengmingzhu "Whatever sounds come from outside, do not open it without permission from me or Manager Guo."

# game/script.rpy:4625
translate english s020_night_return_base_fa4a9c7e:

    # "你：“好，我记住。”"
    "You say, \"All right. I will remember.\""

# game/script.rpy:4627
translate english s020_night_return_base_3499b43e:

    # "方鹤鸣写字的笔停了一下。"
    "Fang Heming's brush pauses over the page."

# game/script.rpy:4629
translate english s020_night_return_base_2dbdd981:

    # fangheming "还有一条，若有人来问医馆伤者的事，一律说‘人在救治，不便探问’。"
    fangheming "One more rule: if anyone asks about the clinic's injured man, say only, 'He is under treatment and cannot be questioned.'"

# game/script.rpy:4631
translate english s020_night_return_base_4796846e:

    # fangheming "不说丹，不说道姑，不说风雷观。"
    fangheming "Do not mention the elixir, the Daoist nun, or Fenglei Abbey."

# game/script.rpy:4633
translate english s020_night_return_base_35eeecf3:

    # weisaner "那如果有人非要问？"
    weisaner "What if someone insists on asking?"

# game/script.rpy:4635
translate english s020_night_return_base_c6b873b6:

    # "方大娘冷笑。"
    "Auntie Fang gives a cold laugh."

# game/script.rpy:4637
translate english s020_night_return_base_646b9263:

    # fangdaniang "就说方大娘在。"
    fangdaniang "Say Auntie Fang is here."

# game/script.rpy:4639
translate english s020_night_return_base_74becb29:

    # "众人紧张中终于有了一点笑意。"
    "At last, a little laughter rises amid everyone's tension."

# game/script.rpy:4641
translate english s020_night_return_base_d36bdfa4:

    # "众人正分派值夜时，夹廊小院北门忽然被猛地推开。"
    "As everyone assigns the night watch, the north gate of the passage courtyard is suddenly thrown open."

# game/script.rpy:4645
translate english s020_night_return_base_98c60f89:

    # "鲁天阔冲了进来。"
    "Lu Tiankuo rushes in."

# game/script.rpy:4647
translate english s020_night_return_base_0b794c27:

    # "他平时极少失态，可此刻额角全是汗，衣摆带着山路尘土，呼吸也乱了。"
    "He rarely loses composure, but now sweat covers his temple, mountain dust clings to his hem, and his breathing is ragged."

# game/script.rpy:4649
translate english s020_night_return_base_cb03c672:

    # "手里攥着一只被火燎过边角的信筒。"
    "He grips a message tube with fire-scorched edges."

# game/script.rpy:4651
translate english s020_night_return_base_c6c9c794:

    # "郭路平立刻站起。"
    "Guo Luping rises at once."

# game/script.rpy:4653
translate english s020_night_return_base_8d14845f:

    # guoluping "老鲁？"
    guoluping "Old Lu?"

# game/script.rpy:4655
translate english s020_night_return_base_db388505:

    # "鲁天阔看了一眼众人，声音低哑。"
    "Lu Tiankuo looks over everyone, his voice low and hoarse."

# game/script.rpy:4657
translate english s020_night_return_base_4077c117:

    # lutiankuo "糟了。"
    lutiankuo "This is bad."

# game/script.rpy:4659
translate english s020_night_return_base_40d2135e:

    # "魏三儿下意识问："
    "Wei San'er asks instinctively,"

# game/script.rpy:4661
translate english s020_night_return_base_09675eb1:

    # weisaner "风雷观怎么了？"
    weisaner "What happened to Fenglei Abbey?"

# game/script.rpy:4663
translate english s020_night_return_base_19731804:

    # "鲁天阔把信筒放到桌上，沉声道："
    "Lu Tiankuo sets the message tube on the table and says gravely,"

# game/script.rpy:4665
translate english s020_night_return_base_27b698e5:

    # lutiankuo "风雷观外山失守，丹房方向起火。"
    lutiankuo "Fenglei Abbey's outer mountain has fallen, and a fire has started near the elixir chamber."

# game/script.rpy:4667
translate english s020_night_return_base_7b0974cd:

    # lutiankuo "长息定年丹……不见了。"
    lutiankuo "The Long-Breath Age-Settling Elixir... is gone."

# game/script.rpy:4669
translate english s020_night_return_base_ee03db16:

    # "夹廊小院一瞬间静得只剩药炉的咕嘟声。"
    "In an instant, the passage courtyard is so quiet that only the medicine furnace's bubbling remains."

# game/script.rpy:4671
translate english s020_night_return_base_e0ee4b94:

    # "周二蛋手里的半碗水停在半空。"
    "Zhou Erdan's half-bowl of water stops in midair."

# game/script.rpy:4673
translate english s020_night_return_base_c73f6af7:

    # "方大娘脸上的笑意彻底没了。"
    "Every trace of a smile vanishes from Auntie Fang's face."

# game/script.rpy:4675
translate english s020_night_return_base_51db7611:

    # "方鹤鸣的笔尖停在纸上，墨晕开一团。"
    "Fang Heming's brush stops on the page, bleeding ink into a blot."

# game/script.rpy:4677
translate english s020_night_return_base_14db480a:

    # "徐春香闭了闭眼。"
    "Xu Chunxiang closes her eyes briefly."

# game/script.rpy:4679
translate english s020_night_return_base_15d306b9:

    # "程明珠立刻看向门锁。"
    "Cheng Mingzhu immediately looks to the door locks."

# game/script.rpy:4681
translate english s020_night_return_base_2f9a5178:

    # "李默拔刀半寸。"
    "Li Mo draws his blade half an inch."

# game/script.rpy:4683
translate english s020_night_return_base_5e77e3a3:

    # "魏三儿看向你，脸色发白。"
    "Wei San'er looks at you, her face pale."

# game/script.rpy:4685
translate english s020_night_return_base_9b79bbbb:

    # "沈星辰轻声说："
    "Shen Xingchen says softly,"

# game/script.rpy:4687
translate english s020_night_return_base_0650f7df:

    # shenxingchen "丹若离炉，炉外未定之息……还压得住吗？"
    shenxingchen "If the elixir has left the furnace, can the unsettled breath outside it... still be contained?"

# game/script.rpy:4689
translate english s020_night_return_base_b3cc1231:

    # "没有人回答。"
    "No one answers."

# game/script.rpy:4691
translate english s020_night_return_base_1ccdfac0:

    # "郭路平最先回神。"
    "Guo Luping is the first to recover."

# game/script.rpy:4693
translate english s020_night_return_base_f3dea17b:

    # guoluping "关门。灭外灯。夹廊小院今夜不散。"
    guoluping "Close the doors. Extinguish the outer lamps. The passage courtyard does not disperse tonight."

# game/script.rpy:4695
translate english s020_night_return_base_c54e30ef:

    # "徐春香接着说："
    "Xu Chunxiang follows:"

# game/script.rpy:4697
translate english s020_night_return_base_2ed46383:

    # xuchunxiang "医馆伤者不得移动。所有药匣上锁。"
    xuchunxiang "The clinic patient must not be moved. Lock every medicine casket."

# game/script.rpy:4699
translate english s020_night_return_base_b6fc94c6:

    # chengmingzhu "李默守屏风门。周二蛋回马厩。方鹤鸣列人。方大娘备热食。"
    chengmingzhu "Li Mo guards the screen gate. Zhou Erdan returns to the stables. Fang Heming lists personnel. Auntie Fang prepares hot food."

# game/script.rpy:4701
translate english s020_night_return_base_7f677852:

    # chengmingzhu "魏三儿，把驿站里能用的铺盖都拿来。"
    chengmingzhu "Wei San'er, bring every usable bedding roll from the post station."

# game/script.rpy:4703
translate english s020_night_return_base_f9c16540:

    # "魏三儿怔了一下。"
    "Wei San'er hesitates."

# game/script.rpy:4705
translate english s020_night_return_base_d620d799:

    # weisaner "拿铺盖？"
    weisaner "Bring bedding?"

# game/script.rpy:4707
translate english s020_night_return_base_23f72fd5:

    # "郭路平看了一眼众人。"
    "Guo Luping looks over the group."

# game/script.rpy:4709
translate english s020_night_return_base_6ba787cd:

    # guoluping "今晚所有人就近守着。"
    guoluping "Tonight, everyone keeps watch nearby."

# game/script.rpy:4711
translate english s020_night_return_base_e7f0cc4f:

    # guoluping "能坐就坐，能躺就躺，夹廊小院打地铺。"
    guoluping "Sit where you can, lie down where you can; we make floor beds in the passage courtyard."

# game/script.rpy:4713
translate english s020_night_return_base_cd948ee5:

    # "方大娘立刻回过神。"
    "Auntie Fang recovers at once."

# game/script.rpy:4715
translate english s020_night_return_base_71b44f3d:

    # fangdaniang "那还愣着？"
    fangdaniang "Then why are you standing there?"

# game/script.rpy:4717
translate english s020_night_return_base_5733e52e:

    # fangdaniang "冷地上躺一夜，没等江湖人打来，先把自己冻病了。"
    fangdaniang "Lie on cold ground all night and you will freeze yourself ill before any jianghu people come to fight."

# game/script.rpy:4721
translate english s020_night_return_base_7f5d0e7a:

    # "众人立刻动起来。"
    "Everyone moves at once."

# game/script.rpy:4723
translate english s020_night_return_base_87aeec42:

    # "驿站那边搬来旧铺盖、草席、长凳。"
    "Old bedding, straw mats, and benches are brought from the post station."

# game/script.rpy:4725
translate english s020_night_return_base_0a7aedaa:

    # "医馆那边送来药炉、热水、布巾和几只药枕。"
    "The clinic sends medicine furnaces, hot water, cloths, and several medicinal pillows."

# game/script.rpy:4727
translate english s020_night_return_base_d9f7963f:

    # "夹廊小院中间的旧木大桌被推到一旁。"
    "The old wooden table at the center of the passage courtyard is pushed aside."

# game/script.rpy:4729
translate english s020_night_return_base_0ad4c1d4:

    # "北耳房与南耳房门都半开着，屏风门上了两道闩。"
    "The north and south side-room doors are both half open, and the screen gate has two bolts."

# game/script.rpy:4731
translate english s020_night_return_base_531c0f44:

    # "你站在一旁，帮着搬铺盖、递热水、合上门窗。"
    "You stand nearby, helping carry bedding, pass hot water, and shut doors and windows."

# game/script.rpy:4733
translate english s020_night_return_base_9f5f653e:

    # "昨日这里还是一处临时落脚的小院。"
    "Yesterday, this was only a courtyard for temporary lodging."

# game/script.rpy:4735
translate english s020_night_return_base_49c437d2:

    # "今晚却变成了驿站与医馆共同守夜的堡垒。"
    "Tonight, it has become a fortress jointly watched by the post station and clinic."

# game/script.rpy:4737
translate english s020_night_return_base_f868671f:

    # "夜深后，众人或坐或躺，谁也没有真正睡着。"
    "Late at night, some sit and some lie down, but no one truly sleeps."

# game/script.rpy:4739
translate english s020_night_return_base_0ad4b751:

    # "风云坪外偶尔传来巡捕的脚步声。"
    "The footsteps of patrol officers occasionally come from beyond Fengyun Square."

# game/script.rpy:4741
translate english s020_night_return_base_f581f4cd:

    # "雷凌宫高墙后隐隐有护院低声交谈。"
    "Beyond Leiling Palace's high wall, guards can be faintly heard speaking in low voices."

# game/script.rpy:4743
translate english s020_night_return_base_ac73dfd6:

    # "医馆药炉小火未熄。"
    "The clinic's medicine furnace still burns low."

# game/script.rpy:4745
translate english s020_night_return_base_828b1e93:

    # "驿站马厩里传来不安的马嘶。"
    "Uneasy horse cries come from the post station stables."

# game/script.rpy:4747
translate english s020_night_return_base_4a7951a9:

    # "你躺在自己的耳房外，听见魏三儿小声问："
    "Lying outside your side room, you hear Wei San'er ask softly,"

# game/script.rpy:4749
translate english s020_night_return_base_cc695d1a:

    # weisaner "你说，明天会怎么样？"
    weisaner "What do you think will happen tomorrow?"

# game/script.rpy:4751
translate english s020_night_return_base_5f72a887:

    # "无人回答。"
    "No one answers."

# game/script.rpy:4753
translate english s020_night_return_base_1a468dd9:

    # "黑暗里，郭路平的声音低低响起："
    "In the darkness, Guo Luping's low voice sounds:"

# game/script.rpy:4755
translate english s020_night_return_base_eb3edc0c:

    # guoluping "先守过今晚。"
    guoluping "First, we get through tonight."

# game/script.rpy:4769
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_df9dc803:

    # "一夜无事。"
    "The night passes without incident."

# game/script.rpy:4771
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_fdac55b8:

    # "但夹廊小院里，没有人真正睡熟。"
    "But no one in the passage courtyard truly sleeps deeply."

# game/script.rpy:4773
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_f1e011f0:

    # "昨夜鲁天阔从雷云峰方向带回急信。"
    "Last night, Lu Tiankuo brought an urgent message from the direction of Leiyun Peak."

# game/script.rpy:4775
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_1a13ee5d:

    # "众人得知风雷观外山失守，西院栖霞院丹房起火，长息定年丹不见。"
    "Everyone learned that Fenglei Abbey's outer mountain had fallen, the elixir chamber of the west Qixia Court caught fire, and the Long-Breath Age-Settling Elixir was missing."

# game/script.rpy:4777
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_6381225b:

    # "郭路平与徐春香当即决定让驿站与医馆共同守夜。"
    "Guo Luping and Xu Chunxiang immediately decided that the post station and clinic would keep watch together."

# game/script.rpy:4779
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_5ec95593:

    # "夹廊小院中间的大桌被推到一旁，旧铺盖、草席和长凳铺了一地。"
    "The large table at the center of the passage courtyard has been pushed aside, while old bedding, straw mats, and benches cover the ground."

# game/script.rpy:4781
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_3ab50532:

    # "北耳房与南耳房的门半开着，屏风门上了两道闩。"
    "The north and south side-room doors stand half open, and the screen gate has two bolts."

# game/script.rpy:4783
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_ae0f488a:

    # "天快亮时，药炉还温着，桌上放着没喝完的茶。"
    "Near dawn, the medicine furnace is still warm, and unfinished tea sits on the table."

# game/script.rpy:4785
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_fc9d2963:

    # "魏三儿靠在长凳边打盹，手里还攥着昨夜没挂回去的客牌。"
    "Wei San'er dozes against a bench, still clutching a guest marker she did not hang back last night."

# game/script.rpy:4787
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_704f6676:

    # "周二蛋坐在院角，怀里抱着马鞍扣，脑袋一点一点地往下垂。"
    "Zhou Erdan sits in a courtyard corner with saddle buckles in his arms, his head dipping again and again."

# game/script.rpy:4789
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_0c51aea6:

    # "方鹤鸣伏在桌边，旁边是半张没写完的值夜表。"
    "Fang Heming sleeps bent over the table beside an unfinished night-watch roster."

# game/script.rpy:4791
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_cd27166a:

    # "方大娘睡得最浅，听见一点响动就会睁眼。"
    "Auntie Fang sleeps most lightly; the slightest sound makes her open her eyes."

# game/script.rpy:4793
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_d7f78f61:

    # "李默一夜没坐下，仍守在面向风云坪的屏风门旁。"
    "Li Mo has not sat all night and still guards the screen gate facing Fengyun Square."

# game/script.rpy:4795
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_f797d13b:

    # "沈星辰抱着药书靠在墙边，脸色比昨日更白。"
    "Shen Xingchen leans against the wall holding a medicine book, his face paler than yesterday."

# game/script.rpy:4797
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_2129d07f:

    # "你半梦半醒间，似乎还听见他低声念了一句："
    "Half asleep, you seem to hear him murmur,"

# game/script.rpy:4799
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_a3eac10c:

    # shenxingchen "丹被拿走了……那炉里没归处的气，会往哪里去？"
    shenxingchen "The elixir was taken... Where will the breath in that furnace, with nowhere to return, go?"

# game/script.rpy:4801
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_a15f57d2:

    # "陈素梅昨夜的话还留在众人心里。"
    "Chen Sumei's words from last night remain in everyone's mind."

# game/script.rpy:4803
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_033bf5e0:

    # chensumei "若只是残息，风雷观还能封。若它跟着丹走，就麻烦了。"
    chensumei "If it is only residual breath, Fenglei Abbey can still seal it. If it goes with the elixir, there will be trouble."

# game/script.rpy:4805
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_9bcec7a2:

    # "没人再接话。"
    "No one speaks further."

# game/script.rpy:4809
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_74711ff4:

    # "第一缕天光落进夹廊小院时，风云坪上传来一阵铜锣声。"
    "As the first daylight falls into the passage courtyard, a gong sounds from Fengyun Square."

# game/script.rpy:4811
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_0e696b9e:

    # xunbusi_chayi "风雷观封山令——"
    xunbusi_chayi "Fenglei Abbey's mountain-sealing order—"

# game/script.rpy:4813
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_8a76138c:

    # "夹廊小院里的人几乎同时醒来。"
    "People in the passage courtyard wake almost at once."

# game/script.rpy:4815
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_b16246eb:

    # "郭路平先起身，走到屏风门前。"
    "Guo Luping rises first and walks to the screen gate."

# game/script.rpy:4817
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_b1077854:

    # "李默确认外头无异状后，打开门闩。"
    "After Li Mo confirms there is nothing unusual outside, he opens the bolt."

# game/script.rpy:4819
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_951105ec:

    # "徐春香也从医馆侧门走出。"
    "Xu Chunxiang also steps out from the clinic's side door."

# game/script.rpy:4821
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_de4f5977:

    # "程明珠跟在她身后，神色清醒得像是一夜没睡。"
    "Cheng Mingzhu follows behind her, alert as if she had not slept all night."

# game/script.rpy:4823
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_be54b781:

    # "沈云从药炉那边探出头，手上还沾着水。"
    "Shen Yun peeks out from the medicine furnace, water still on his hands."

# game/script.rpy:4825
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_1ff1d29b:

    # "魏三儿揉了揉眼睛，立刻清醒过来。"
    "Wei San'er rubs her eyes and immediately wakes fully."

# game/script.rpy:4829
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_04f7e2a0:

    # "众人一同来到风云坪边。"
    "Everyone comes together to the edge of Fengyun Square."

# game/script.rpy:4831
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_5b1f6f83:

    # "风云坪中央的告示牌前已经围了不少人。"
    "A large crowd has already gathered before the notice board at Fengyun Square's center."

# game/script.rpy:4833
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_5135444d:

    # "巡捕司差役正在维持秩序。"
    "Patrol Bureau officers are maintaining order."

# game/script.rpy:4835
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_85875d7c:

    # "一名风雷观外门弟子站在告示牌旁，脸色苍白，袖口有灰痕，发冠也有些歪，显然是匆忙下山。"
    "An outer disciple of Fenglei Abbey stands beside the notice board, pale-faced, ash on his cuffs and his hair crown askew, clearly having hurried down the mountain."

# game/script.rpy:4837
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_d53dbd87:

    # "一纸封山令被贴在告示牌正中。"
    "A mountain-sealing order is posted at the center of the board."

# game/script.rpy:4839
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_7e8b29df:

    # "封山令上写着："
    "The order reads:"

# game/script.rpy:4841
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_99098774:

    # "风雷观封山三日。"
    "Fenglei Abbey seals the mountain for three days."

# game/script.rpy:4843
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_bf91d3eb:

    # "闲杂人等不得上山。"
    "Unauthorized persons may not ascend the mountain."

# game/script.rpy:4845
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_033ce438:

    # "擅闯者，后果自负。"
    "Trespassers bear the consequences themselves."

# game/script.rpy:4847
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_00af5c69:

    # "丹失之事，不许妄传。"
    "Do not spread unverified claims concerning the lost elixir."

# game/script.rpy:4849
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_64599559:

    # "风云坪上的人群一下子炸开。"
    "The crowd at Fengyun Square erupts at once."

# game/script.rpy:4851
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_1430250c:

    # "有人低声惊呼。"
    "Someone gasps softly."

# game/script.rpy:4853
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_0203e8df:

    # zhenmin "丹真丢了？"
    zhenmin "The elixir was truly stolen?"

# game/script.rpy:4855
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_03f8c21c:

    # "有人立刻转身往长风楼方向跑。"
    "Someone immediately turns and runs toward Changfeng House."

# game/script.rpy:4857
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_59975961:

    # "有人试图挤到前面看清楚，却被巡捕司差役拦住。"
    "Someone tries to push forward for a clearer look but is stopped by Patrol Bureau officers."

# game/script.rpy:4859
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_55c68faa:

    # xunbusi_chayi "退后！告示已张，私撕者拿下！"
    xunbusi_chayi "Step back! The notice has been posted. Anyone tearing it down will be arrested!"

# game/script.rpy:4861
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_b1edf0b7:

    # "魏三儿压低声音。"
    "Wei San'er lowers her voice."

# game/script.rpy:4863
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_f9c21f8c:

    # weisaner "丹失之事……他们竟然真写出来了？"
    weisaner "The lost elixir... They actually wrote it out?"

# game/script.rpy:4865
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_4b31a29a:

    # "方鹤鸣皱眉，看着告示上的字。"
    "Fang Heming frowns at the words on the notice."

# game/script.rpy:4867
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_ccb36ac3:

    # fangheming "写出来，说明瞒不住。不许妄传，说明已经传开了。"
    fangheming "Writing it means they cannot hide it. Banning rumors means it has already spread."

# game/script.rpy:4869
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_7ffc58a5:

    # "沈云小声问："
    "Shen Yun asks softly,"

# game/script.rpy:4871
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_c90be935:

    # shenyun "那昨日那个伤者呢？他两个弟弟呢？"
    shenyun "What about yesterday's injured man? What about his two younger brothers?"

# game/script.rpy:4873
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_54ba14f7:

    # "徐春香没有移开目光，只说："
    "Without taking her eyes away, Xu Chunxiang says only,"

# game/script.rpy:4875
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_0191b72a:

    # xuchunxiang "伤者留医馆。人醒稳之前，谁也不能带走。"
    xuchunxiang "The injured man remains at the clinic. Until he wakes and is stable, no one may take him away."

# game/script.rpy:4877
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_e7af0c5d:

    # "程明珠立刻接话。"
    "Cheng Mingzhu immediately adds,"

# game/script.rpy:4879
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_327383a1:

    # chengmingzhu "医馆今日只接急症。普通问诊延后。前门半闭，夹廊小院继续留通道。"
    chengmingzhu "The clinic takes emergencies only today. Ordinary consultations are postponed. The front door stays half closed, and the passage courtyard remains a route through."

# game/script.rpy:4881
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_98740cbe:

    # "郭路平没有说话。"
    "Guo Luping says nothing."

# game/script.rpy:4883
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_dbc52123:

    # "鲁天阔站在他身旁，脸色比昨夜更沉。"
    "Lu Tiankuo stands beside him, his face graver than last night."

# game/script.rpy:4885
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_37dc96c8:

    # "他盯着封山令末尾的印痕，手指微微收紧。"
    "He stares at the seal mark at the order's end, his fingers tightening slightly."

# game/script.rpy:4887
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_d62f5620:

    # "你注意到，郭路平、徐春香、鲁天阔、方鹤鸣的神情都有些不对。"
    "You notice that something is wrong in the expressions of Guo Luping, Xu Chunxiang, Lu Tiankuo, and Fang Heming."

# game/script.rpy:4889
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_362f708d:

    # "你问："
    "You ask:"

# game/script.rpy:4891
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_df82801d:

    # "你：“这封山令有什么问题吗？”"
    "You say, \"Is there something wrong with this mountain-sealing order?\""

# game/script.rpy:4893
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_f78564f8:

    # "鲁天阔声音很低。"
    "Lu Tiankuo's voice is very low."

# game/script.rpy:4895
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_db716c6c:

    # lutiankuo "印是真的。"
    lutiankuo "The seal is genuine."

# game/script.rpy:4897
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_3b27e024:

    # "魏三儿不解。"
    "Wei San'er does not understand."

# game/script.rpy:4899
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_a9b27a87:

    # weisaner "印是真的，那还有什么不对？"
    weisaner "If the seal is genuine, what is wrong?"

# game/script.rpy:4901
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_f3ddb4da:

    # "鲁天阔抬眼看着告示。"
    "Lu Tiankuo looks up at the notice."

# game/script.rpy:4903
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_efbcb3c4:

    # lutiankuo "这不是掌门印。"
    lutiankuo "It is not the sect leader's seal."

# game/script.rpy:4905
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_052f2b19:

    # "众人一静。"
    "Everyone falls silent."

# game/script.rpy:4907
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_fcdd3e18:

    # "徐春香也看向那枚印，神情沉了下来。"
    "Xu Chunxiang also looks at the seal, her expression darkening."

# game/script.rpy:4909
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_9ea55b67:

    # xuchunxiang "是玄雷院急令印。"
    xuchunxiang "It is the Xuanglei Court emergency-order seal."

# game/script.rpy:4911
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_4a150d25:

    # "方鹤鸣轻声解释："
    "Fang Heming explains softly:"

# game/script.rpy:4913
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_3b08f2e1:

    # fangheming "风雷观掌门云清道长的印，是‘清玄法印’。"
    fangheming "Daoist Yunqing, leader of Fenglei Abbey, uses the 'Qingxuan Dharma Seal.'"

# game/script.rpy:4915
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_42ea4b76:

    # fangheming "若是掌门亲令，封山令上该盖清玄法印。"
    fangheming "If this were the sect leader's personal order, it would bear the Qingxuan Dharma Seal."

# game/script.rpy:4917
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_ba9d9d91:

    # fangheming "可这张令上盖的是玄雷院副印，也就是玄雷院急令印。"
    fangheming "But this order bears the Xuanglei Court secondary seal: the Xuanglei Court emergency-order seal."

# game/script.rpy:4919
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_a5f9f264:

    # "你：“玄雷院副印，也能封山？”"
    "You say, \"Can the Xuanglei Court's secondary seal also close the mountain?\""

# game/script.rpy:4921
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_24097f24:

    # "方鹤鸣点头。"
    "Fang Heming nods."

# game/script.rpy:4923
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_da50c76d:

    # fangheming "能。"
    fangheming "It can."

# game/script.rpy:4925
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_2c201736:

    # fangheming "玄雷院是风雷观主院，掌门居所、藏经阁、议事堂都在玄雷院。"
    fangheming "Xuanglei Court is Fenglei Abbey's main court. The sect leader's residence, scripture pavilion, and council hall are all there."

# game/script.rpy:4927
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_c3b9e1b5:

    # fangheming "玄雷院急令印由掌印人保管，遇到紧急事务，可以代掌门传令。"
    fangheming "The keeper of the seal holds the Xuanglei Court emergency seal and may issue orders in the leader's stead in urgent affairs."

# game/script.rpy:4929
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_32154683:

    # fangheming "但它毕竟不是掌门印。"
    fangheming "But it is not the sect leader's seal."

# game/script.rpy:4931
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_3d17c3b1:

    # "沈星辰轻声问："
    "Shen Xingchen asks softly,"

# game/script.rpy:4933
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_01d5b72d:

    # shenxingchen "那云清道长呢？"
    shenxingchen "Then what of Daoist Yunqing?"

# game/script.rpy:4935
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_70330e84:

    # "没有人立刻回答。"
    "No one answers immediately."

# game/script.rpy:4937
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_4ccd4fde:

    # "鲁天阔看着封山令，声音更低了些。"
    "Lu Tiankuo looks at the mountain-sealing order, his voice lower still."

# game/script.rpy:4939
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_f669d2a7:

    # lutiankuo "玄雷院急令印由玄蘅真人保管。"
    lutiankuo "True Person Xuanheng keeps the Xuanglei Court emergency-order seal."

# game/script.rpy:4941
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_0f5b5f22:

    # lutiankuo "除非掌门不便亲令，否则不会轻易用。"
    lutiankuo "It is not used lightly unless the sect leader is unable to issue the order personally."

# game/script.rpy:4943
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_17cdbd26:

    # weisaner "掌门不便亲令……是什么意思？"
    weisaner "Unable to issue an order personally... what does that mean?"

# game/script.rpy:4945
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_47037207:

    # "方大娘皱眉。"
    "Auntie Fang frowns."

# game/script.rpy:4947
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_8bbbc9e9:

    # fangdaniang "还能是什么意思？要么人不在，要么人出事，要么有些话不能由她亲口说。"
    fangdaniang "What else can it mean? Either she is absent, something has happened to her, or there are words she cannot say herself."

# game/script.rpy:4949
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_9010b973:

    # "这话一出，众人都安静了一瞬。"
    "At those words, everyone falls silent for a moment."

# game/script.rpy:4951
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_0b8c8d11:

    # "风云坪上的百姓还在议论，可夹廊小院这边的人都听出了更深一层的意思。"
    "The people of Fengyun Square continue to talk, but those from the passage courtyard hear a deeper meaning."

# game/script.rpy:4955
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_c86723fc:

    # "风雷观不是普通门派。"
    "Fenglei Abbey is no ordinary sect."

# game/script.rpy:4957
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_2bb94bab:

    # "它在雷云峰山腰也并非寻常坐北朝南"
    "Its place on Leiyun Peak's slopes does not follow the usual north-facing southward orientation."

# game/script.rpy:4959
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_684e6ddc:

    # "而是依山势坐南朝北。"
    "Instead, it faces north from the south in accordance with the mountain's terrain."

# game/script.rpy:4961
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_bf85f4c2:

    # "山门朝向北麓官道，背靠南峰雷脉。"
    "Its mountain gate faces the official road at the northern foot, with the southern peak's thunder veins behind it."

# game/script.rpy:4963
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_7a082707:

    # "因此在风雷观内部辨位时，不完全以寻常东南西北称呼"
    "Thus, within Fenglei Abbey, directions are not identified entirely by the usual east, south, west, and north."

# game/script.rpy:4965
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_178bdeb1:

    # "而以'向阳侧''近霞侧''外山侧''内山侧'来区分。"
    "They are distinguished instead as the sunward side, the sunset side, the outer-mountain side, and the inner-mountain side."

# game/script.rpy:4967
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_4275cf97:

    # "雷云峰风雷观依山势分为三院。"
    "Fenglei Abbey on Leiyun Peak is divided by the terrain into three courts."

# game/script.rpy:4969
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_08c8281c:

    # "主院玄雷院居中偏上，是掌门云清道长居所、藏经阁、议事堂、公共练功场所在，也是全门派早晚课、讲道、议事、演武之地。"
    "The main Xuanglei Court sits high at the center. It holds sect leader Daoist Yunqing's residence, the scripture pavilion, the council hall, and shared training grounds, and is where the entire sect gathers for morning and evening lessons, sermons, councils, and martial demonstrations."

# game/script.rpy:4971
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_fb293047:

    # "男女道众皆在玄雷院参与公共事务。"
    "Daoists of all genders take part in shared affairs at Xuanglei Court."

# game/script.rpy:4973
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_b97126d9:

    # "东院清阳院位于山势向阳一侧，为男道众寮房、兵器库、巡山弟子整备处，负责巡山、护道、传信、兵器管理与外山防务。"
    "The east Qingyang Court stands on the sunward side. It contains the men's quarters, armory, and preparation area for mountain-patrol disciples, and is responsible for patrols, guarding the Dao, messages, weapons, and outer-mountain defense."

# game/script.rpy:4975
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_86dc6f93:

    # "鲁天阔早年便曾在清阳院随师修行，是清阳院院主玄岳真人门下的俗家弟子。"
    "In his early years, Lu Tiankuo trained under a master at Qingyang Court as the lay disciple of its head, True Person Xuanyue."

# game/script.rpy:4977
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_ffe41620:

    # "后来他入飞鸿驿站做信差队长，仍长期负责传递风雷观与梧天禅院之间的密信。"
    "Later he became the courier captain at Feihong Post Station and continued for years to carry confidential messages between Fenglei Abbey and Wutian Chan Monastery."

# game/script.rpy:4979
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_5866ff14:

    # "西院栖霞院位于山势近晚霞一侧，为女道众寮房、丹药房、药材库与炼丹炉所在，平日与茯苓医馆对接草药。"
    "The west Qixia Court lies on the side near the evening glow. It houses the women's quarters, elixir chamber, medicinal storehouse, and elixir furnace, and normally coordinates herbs with Fuling Clinic."

# game/script.rpy:4981
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_b30e8266:

    # "长息定年丹就是在栖霞院丹房炼制，昨夜起火的，也正是栖霞院丹药房。"
    "The Long-Breath Age-Settling Elixir was refined in Qixia Court's elixir chamber, which is precisely where the fire began last night."

# game/script.rpy:4983
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_ea318520:

    # "三兄弟所谓“山脚遇道姑”，根本不是普通迷路。"
    "The three brothers' supposed 'meeting a Daoist nun at the mountain foot' was not an ordinary case of getting lost."

# game/script.rpy:4985
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_aecad111:

    # "他们夜里摸到的，很可能是栖霞院外山禁线，甚至靠近了女道众寮房和丹药房所在区域。"
    "At night, they likely found the outer-mountain forbidden boundary of Qixia Court and may even have approached the areas of the women's quarters and elixir chamber."

# game/script.rpy:4987
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_1d249daa:

    # "擅闯西院、窥探丹房、靠近未收炉的丹息，这才引发了昨日那场怪症。"
    "Trespassing into the west court, peering into the elixir chamber, and approaching breath from an unsealed furnace caused yesterday's strange illness."

# game/script.rpy:4989
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_cf8ca891:

    # "而现在，封山令没有盖掌门印，却盖了玄雷院急令印。"
    "And now, the mountain-sealing order bears no sect leader's seal, but the Xuanglei Court emergency-order seal."

# game/script.rpy:4991
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_c43a6273:

    # "这说明风雷观内部，绝不只是“丢了一枚丹”那么简单。"
    "This means that within Fenglei Abbey, matters are not nearly as simple as 'losing one elixir.'"

# game/script.rpy:4993
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_404f6be4:

    # "李默一直没有说话，这时忽然看向封山令下方。"
    "Li Mo has said nothing all this time. Now he suddenly looks beneath the mountain-sealing order."

# game/script.rpy:4997
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_492ffbaf:

    # limo "还有一处。"
    limo "There is one more thing."

# game/script.rpy:4999
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_4decfbfe:

    # "众人顺着他的目光看去。"
    "Everyone follows his gaze."

# game/script.rpy:5001
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_ea2a233c:

    # "封山令右下角有一小片焦痕，像是纸张边缘曾被火燎过。"
    "At the lower right of the order is a small scorch mark, as if the paper's edge had been singed by fire."

# game/script.rpy:5003
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_b81cd003:

    # "焦痕不大，却很新。"
    "The mark is small but very fresh."

# game/script.rpy:5005
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_0fe3f418:

    # "焦痕旁边，还有一条极淡的雷纹，像是被某种气机烙在纸上，不像普通墨痕。"
    "Beside the scorch is an extremely faint thunder pattern, as if some force of qi branded it onto the paper rather than ordinary ink."

# game/script.rpy:5007
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_ba133b4b:

    # "鲁天阔低声说："
    "Lu Tiankuo says softly,"

# game/script.rpy:5009
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_24851fb3:

    # lutiankuo "这是玄雷院急令纸。"
    lutiankuo "This is Xuanglei Court emergency-order paper."

# game/script.rpy:5011
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_4c65221a:

    # lutiankuo "只有风雷观内院出事，才会用。"
    lutiankuo "It is used only when something happens in Fenglei Abbey's inner courts."

# game/script.rpy:5013
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_b7fe3896:

    # "周二蛋吸了一口气。"
    "Zhou Erdan draws a breath."

# game/script.rpy:5015
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_abba55af:

    # zhouerdan "所以昨晚不是外山小乱？"
    zhouerdan "So last night was not a small disturbance in the outer mountain?"

# game/script.rpy:5017
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_05f1768d:

    # "程明珠看着封山令，语气很冷静。"
    "Cheng Mingzhu looks at the order, her voice very calm."

# game/script.rpy:5019
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_0395896f:

    # chengmingzhu "外山失守，栖霞院丹房起火，定年丹不见。"
    chengmingzhu "The outer mountain fell, Qixia Court's elixir chamber caught fire, and the Age-Settling Elixir vanished."

# game/script.rpy:5021
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_c213c6a5:

    # chengmingzhu "现在又用玄雷院急令印封山。"
    chengmingzhu "Now the mountain is sealed with the Xuanglei Court emergency-order seal."

# game/script.rpy:5023
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_0036e208:

    # chengmingzhu "若这还叫小乱，那什么才叫大乱？"
    chengmingzhu "If this is still called a small disturbance, what would a great one be?"

# game/script.rpy:5025
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_2746947a:

    # "方大娘低声骂了一句。"
    "Auntie Fang curses under her breath."

# game/script.rpy:5027
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_8e5e9781:

    # fangdaniang "这丹真是要人命。"
    fangdaniang "This elixir truly takes lives."

# game/script.rpy:5029
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_15b1e7b1:

    # "徐春香看着风雷观外门弟子苍白的脸，忽然开口。"
    "Looking at the Fenglei Abbey outer disciple's pale face, Xu Chunxiang suddenly speaks."

# game/script.rpy:5031
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_03003e31:

    # xuchunxiang "你们掌门呢？"
    xuchunxiang "Where is your sect leader?"

# game/script.rpy:5033
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_3aadca06:

    # "那名外门弟子一僵，低头不答。"
    "The outer disciple stiffens and lowers his head without answering."

# game/script.rpy:5035
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_8cbd396e:

    # "鲁天阔上前一步。"
    "Lu Tiankuo takes a step forward."

# game/script.rpy:5037
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_8cc12764:

    # "他与风雷观有旧，那外门弟子认得他，下意识抬眼，却还是不敢多说。"
    "He has old ties with Fenglei Abbey. The outer disciple recognizes him and looks up instinctively, but still does not dare say much."

# game/script.rpy:5039
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_2787b2d4:

    # lutiankuo "清阳院玄岳真人可还在山门？"
    lutiankuo "Is True Person Xuanyue of Qingyang Court still at the mountain gate?"

# game/script.rpy:5041
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_5befd85f:

    # "外门弟子低声道："
    "The outer disciple says softly,"

# game/script.rpy:5043
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_74c1d937:

    # fengleiguan_dizi "玄岳真人守清阳院，清骁师兄封外山。"
    fengleiguan_dizi "True Person Xuanyue guards Qingyang Court. Senior Brother Qingxiao seals the outer mountain."

# game/script.rpy:5045
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_eaa99052:

    # fengleiguan_dizi "玄霜真人……在栖霞院。"
    fengleiguan_dizi "True Person Xuanshuang... is at Qixia Court."

# game/script.rpy:5047
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_80225bf1:

    # "徐春香追问："
    "Xu Chunxiang presses on:"

# game/script.rpy:5049
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_86f940da:

    # xuchunxiang "玄霜真人伤了？"
    xuchunxiang "True Person Xuanshuang is injured?"

# game/script.rpy:5051
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_76fd07f7:

    # "外门弟子脸色更白。"
    "The outer disciple turns still paler."

# game/script.rpy:5053
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_caf3f0b9:

    # "他没有回答，只低声说："
    "He does not answer, only says softly,"

# game/script.rpy:5055
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_41b12868:

    # fengleiguan_dizi "山上有令，不许多言。"
    fengleiguan_dizi "The mountain has ordered that no more be said."

# game/script.rpy:5057
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_498ec687:

    # "鲁天阔还要再问，郭路平抬手止住。"
    "Lu Tiankuo would ask more, but Guo Luping raises a hand to stop him."

# game/script.rpy:5059
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_a136b48b:

    # guoluping "让他回去。他只是传令的。"
    guoluping "Let him return. He is only carrying the order."

# game/script.rpy:5061
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_6bea0868:

    # "外门弟子如蒙大赦，向众人拱手，匆匆离开风云坪。"
    "As if pardoned, the outer disciple cups his hands to the group and hurriedly leaves Fengyun Square."

# game/script.rpy:5065
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_d9a514d3:

    # "魏三儿望着他的背影。"
    "Wei San'er watches his retreating back."

# game/script.rpy:5067
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_5be167ce:

    # weisaner "跑得比昨天那些求丹的还快。"
    weisaner "He runs faster than yesterday's elixir seekers."

# game/script.rpy:5069
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_f33a7721:

    # "方鹤鸣沉声道："
    "Fang Heming says gravely,"

# game/script.rpy:5071
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_528b56d7:

    # fangheming "怕，不一定是坏事。说明他知道自己不能说错话。"
    fangheming "Fear is not always bad. It means he knows he cannot say the wrong thing."

# game/script.rpy:5073
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_69966f65:

    # "徐春香转身看向郭路平。"
    "Xu Chunxiang turns to Guo Luping."

# game/script.rpy:5075
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_b9867e54:

    # xuchunxiang "夹廊小院不能散。"
    xuchunxiang "The passage courtyard cannot disperse."

# game/script.rpy:5077
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_a482d6ad:

    # "郭路平点头。"
    "Guo Luping nods."

# game/script.rpy:5079
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_94cf149b:

    # guoluping "从现在起，夹廊小院继续守。"
    guoluping "From now on, the passage courtyard stays under watch."

# game/script.rpy:5081
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_65d13363:

    # guoluping "驿站不接上山委托。医馆不放昨日伤者离开。"
    guoluping "The post station accepts no commissions to go up the mountain. The clinic will not let yesterday's injured man leave."

# game/script.rpy:5083
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_82071e5e:

    # guoluping "所有有关风雷观的消息，先过我们这里。"
    guoluping "All news concerning Fenglei Abbey comes through us first."

# game/script.rpy:5085
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_ca5f9266:

    # chengmingzhu "医馆前门半闭，急症从夹廊进。"
    chengmingzhu "The clinic's front door stays half closed; emergencies enter through the passage courtyard."

# game/script.rpy:5087
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_569fde93:

    # chengmingzhu "李默继续守屏风门。药材库上锁。"
    chengmingzhu "Li Mo continues guarding the screen gate. Lock the medicine storehouse."

# game/script.rpy:5089
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_df658648:

    # fangheming "驿站这边所有寄往雷云峰、风雷观、梧天禅院的信件单独登记。"
    fangheming "At the post station, register separately every letter addressed to Leiyun Peak, Fenglei Abbey, or Wutian Chan Monastery."

# game/script.rpy:5091
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_3e4da56e:

    # fangheming "未经郭总管过目，不许发出。"
    fangheming "None may be sent without Manager Guo's review."

# game/script.rpy:5093
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_eff2bda6:

    # zhouerdan "那马厩呢？昨日来镇上的马还没走呢。"
    zhouerdan "What about the stables? The horses that came to town yesterday have not left."

# game/script.rpy:5095
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_35ca227b:

    # guoluping "马厩继续收，但不许接上山客。"
    guoluping "The stables remain open, but we take no guests going up the mountain."

# game/script.rpy:5097
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_715bb4fa:

    # fangdaniang "饭照做。越乱越得吃。空着肚子守不住门。"
    fangdaniang "Keep making meals. The more chaos there is, the more people need to eat. You cannot guard a door on an empty stomach."

# game/script.rpy:5099
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_4ae2cc56:

    # "魏三儿看向你，挤出一点笑。"
    "Wei San'er looks at you and forces a small smile."

# game/script.rpy:5101
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_5c05e671:

    # weisaner "听见没？你以后想清闲，怕是不容易了。"
    weisaner "Hear that? I fear it will not be easy for you to have a quiet life from now on."

# game/script.rpy:5103
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_2cbf4988:

    # "你看着告示牌上的封山令，没有说话。"
    "You look at the mountain-sealing order on the notice board without speaking."

# game/script.rpy:5107
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_639984c6:

    # "昨日自己刚踏入开庵镇时，只知道雷云峰上要炼一枚长息定年丹。"
    "When you first entered Kaian Town yesterday, you knew only that a Long-Breath Age-Settling Elixir was being refined on Leiyun Peak."

# game/script.rpy:5109
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_3e589a2d:

    # "那时它还像一个遥远的江湖传闻。"
    "At that time, it seemed like a distant jianghu rumor."

# game/script.rpy:5111
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_bc2726c0:

    # "可现在，驿站住满了，医馆抬进怪症伤者，长风楼谣言四起，侯三闲看见灰衣人夜走镇北小路。"
    "But now the post station is full, a strange patient has been carried into the clinic, rumors rise at Changfeng House, and Hou Sanxian saw a gray-clothed man take the north-town path by night."

# game/script.rpy:5113
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_24c1b900:

    # "风雷观封山令贴到风云坪，连掌门印都没有出现。"
    "Fenglei Abbey's mountain-sealing order has been posted at Fengyun Square, without even the sect leader's seal."

# game/script.rpy:5115
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_c2515164:

    # "你忽然想起昨日伤者短暂醒来时说的那句话："
    "You suddenly remember what yesterday's injured man said when he briefly woke:"

# game/script.rpy:5117
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_ae123b3f:

    # shangzhe "不是丹炉……炉后还有人……"
    shangzhe "Not the elixir furnace... There is someone behind the furnace..."

# game/script.rpy:5119
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_e03e07a6:

    # "这句话与眼前这纸封山令，像两根线，在你心里轻轻拧到了一起。"
    "Those words and the mountain-sealing order before you twist together like two threads in your mind."

# game/script.rpy:5121
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_c03865d5:

    # "封山令贴出后，风云坪的人群久久不散。"
    "After the mountain-sealing order is posted, the crowd at Fengyun Square does not disperse for a long time."

# game/script.rpy:5123
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_2e3bfa8b:

    # "有人低声议论。"
    "Some speak in low voices."

# game/script.rpy:5125
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_b7bad1fa:

    # "有人偷偷记下内容。"
    "Some secretly copy down the contents."

# game/script.rpy:5127
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_47859eb5:

    # "有人转头往长风楼跑。"
    "Some turn and run toward Changfeng House."

# game/script.rpy:5129
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_99d4b7ad:

    # "有人往西街菜市跑。"
    "Some run toward West Street Market."

# game/script.rpy:5131
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_eb5ee208:

    # "有人想去雷云峰方向看看，却被巡捕喝退。"
    "Some try to head toward Leiyun Peak, but patrol officers shout them back."

# game/script.rpy:5133
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_9ae4039f:

    # "郭路平让魏三儿回驿站盯住来往客人。"
    "Guo Luping sends Wei San'er back to the post station to watch incoming and outgoing guests."

# game/script.rpy:5135
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_027a2ecb:

    # "徐春香让沈云回医馆看住昨日伤者。"
    "Xu Chunxiang sends Shen Yun back to the clinic to watch yesterday's injured man."

# game/script.rpy:5137
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_975cf9bc:

    # "程明珠重新排医馆值守。"
    "Cheng Mingzhu rearranges the clinic watch."

# game/script.rpy:5139
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_366f051b:

    # "方鹤鸣拿出新纸，准备写夹廊小院三日守则。"
    "Fang Heming takes out fresh paper to write three-day rules for the passage courtyard."

# game/script.rpy:5141
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_ebdcd143:

    # "李默仍站在屏风门旁，目光越过风云坪，看向雷云峰方向。"
    "Li Mo still stands by the screen gate, looking past Fengyun Square toward Leiyun Peak."

# game/script.rpy:5143
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_919ef51c:

    # "鲁天阔没有说话，只把昨夜那只被火燎过边角的信筒放在旧木大桌上。"
    "Lu Tiankuo says nothing, only placing last night's fire-scorched message tube on the old wooden table."

# game/script.rpy:5147
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_c541f065:

    # "众人准备各自散去时，沈星辰忽然蹲下，从封山令下方的地面捡起一点细小黑灰。"
    "As everyone prepares to go their separate ways, Shen Xingchen suddenly crouches and picks up a speck of fine black ash from the ground beneath the order."

# game/script.rpy:5149
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_112516da:

    # "他用指尖捻了捻，神色微变。"
    "He rubs it between his fingertips, and his expression changes slightly."

# game/script.rpy:5151
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_dcf82822:

    # "魏三儿问："
    "Wei San'er asks,"

# game/script.rpy:5153
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_069c6046:

    # weisaner "那是什么？"
    weisaner "What is that?"

# game/script.rpy:5155
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_3e625f67:

    # "沈星辰没有立刻回答。"
    "Shen Xingchen does not answer immediately."

# game/script.rpy:5157
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_4f9fc79f:

    # "他把那点黑灰放到鼻尖轻轻一嗅，眉头皱起。"
    "He brings the black ash to his nose and sniffs lightly, his brow furrowing."

# game/script.rpy:5159
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_29192b47:

    # "徐春香看向他。"
    "Xu Chunxiang looks at him."

# game/script.rpy:5161
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_b662dd78:

    # xuchunxiang "星辰？"
    xuchunxiang "Xingchen?"

# game/script.rpy:5163
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_82746497:

    # "沈星辰低声说："
    "Shen Xingchen says softly,"

# game/script.rpy:5165
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_79f277b3:

    # shenxingchen "不是纸灰。"
    shenxingchen "It is not paper ash."

# game/script.rpy:5167
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_ac6ce643:

    # "程明珠问："
    "Cheng Mingzhu asks,"

# game/script.rpy:5169
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_95b638ed:

    # chengmingzhu "不是纸灰，那是什么？"
    chengmingzhu "If it is not paper ash, what is it?"

# game/script.rpy:5171
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_e547c52f:

    # "沈星辰抬头，看向雷云峰方向。"
    "Shen Xingchen raises his head and looks toward Leiyun Peak."

# game/script.rpy:5173
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_b7a1b691:

    # shenxingchen "像是……丹灰。"
    shenxingchen "It looks like... elixir ash."

# game/script.rpy:5175
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_4851e93d:

    # "众人再次安静下来。"
    "Everyone falls silent again."

# game/script.rpy:5177
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_48f16273:

    # "鲁天阔脸色一变。"
    "Lu Tiankuo changes color."

# game/script.rpy:5179
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_659d2936:

    # lutiankuo "封山令是从山上带下来的。若上面沾着丹灰……"
    lutiankuo "The mountain-sealing order was brought down from the mountain. If it bears elixir ash..."

# game/script.rpy:5181
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_93754ae0:

    # "方鹤鸣接过话，声音压得很低。"
    "Fang Heming takes over, his voice very low."

# game/script.rpy:5183
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_5278d8a7:

    # fangheming "说明写令的人，离栖霞院丹房很近。"
    fangheming "It means the person who wrote the order was very close to Qixia Court's elixir chamber."

# game/script.rpy:5185
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_1904f8a7:

    # "郭路平看着那纸封山令，神情沉了下去。"
    "Guo Luping looks at the order, his expression growing grave."

# game/script.rpy:5187
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_c472d255:

    # "徐春香闭了闭眼，像是在压住某种不好的猜测。"
    "Xu Chunxiang closes her eyes briefly, as if suppressing an ill suspicion."

# game/script.rpy:5191
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_28571a02:

    # "远处雷云峰云层低压，天边传来一声闷雷。"
    "In the distance, clouds press low over Leiyun Peak, and a muffled thunderclap rolls across the horizon."

# game/script.rpy:5193
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_c0b06f01:

    # "你站在夹廊小院门边，第一次真正意识到：自己昨日只是来开庵镇看热闹。"
    "Standing at the passage courtyard gate, you truly realize for the first time that you came to Kaian Town yesterday only to see the excitement."

# game/script.rpy:5195
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_42cd2c5d:

    # "今日却已经被卷进了一个连六大门派都无法轻易收场的局。"
    "Yet today you have already been swept into a scheme that even the six great sects cannot easily bring to an end."

# game/script.rpy:5203
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_aff2e31b:

    # "后续内容仍在制作中。"
    "More content is still in development."

# game/script.rpy:5207
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_67314f51:

    # "《江湖小镇之凰龙府》目前还只是一个剧情试玩版。"
    "Jianghu Town: Huanglongfu is currently only a narrative demo."

# game/script.rpy:5209
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_9f37c9ab:

    # "但我想做的，不止是一段故事。"
    "But I want to make more than a single story."

# game/script.rpy:5211
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_28635a2b:

    # "我希望有一天，它能成为一座真正可以行走、探索、结识人物、追查线索的江湖小镇。"
    "I hope that one day it can become a true jianghu town to walk through, explore, meet people in, and pursue clues across."

# game/script.rpy:5213
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_5d9e2c72:

    # "如果你是 Unity 开发者、程序、美术、音乐、策划，或对这个世界感兴趣的合作伙伴，欢迎与我联系。"
    "If you are a Unity developer, programmer, artist, musician, designer, or a collaborator interested in this world, you are welcome to contact me."

# game/script.rpy:5220
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_0bd006e9:

    # "也可以通过这些平台找到我。"
    "You can also find me on these platforms."

# game/script.rpy:5222
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_986f1159:

    # "如果你是投资人，或愿意一起推动这个项目继续长大，也欢迎来聊。"
    "If you are an investor, or would like to help this project keep growing, you are welcome to talk with me."

# game/script.rpy:5224
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_bcb5ba6d:

    # "【第一章《雷云开炉》结束】"
    "[End of Chapter One: The Furnace Opens on Leiyun Peak]"

# game/script.rpy:5226
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_7a46be58:

    # "感谢试玩《江湖小镇之凰龙府》第一章。"
    "Thank you for playing Chapter One of Jianghu Town: Huanglongfu."

# game/script.rpy:5228
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_d1472a23:

    # "作者：王子期 Gabriel"
    "Creator: Wang Ziqi Gabriel"

# game/script.rpy:5230
