    "WeChat: h1052588030"

# game/script.rpy:5232
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_7ad1a91c:

    # "邮箱：1052588030@qq.com"
    "Email: 1052588030@qq.com"

# game/script.rpy:5234
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_d7354b0e:

    # "若诸位愿意留下几句话，可以告诉我：最喜欢谁，最想查哪条线索，又在哪里看得不明白。"
    "If you would like to leave a few words, tell me whom you liked most, which clue you most want to investigate, and what you found unclear."

# game/script.rpy:5236
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_8f0ebf83:

    # "诸位可在小红书、抖音、B站搜索：江湖小镇之凰龙府。"
    "You can search for Jianghu Town: Huanglongfu on Xiaohongshu, Douyin, and Bilibili."

# game/script.rpy:5238
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_317f1868:

    # "我会在那里继续更新大明国、凰龙府、开庵镇的世界观、人物、剧情与试玩进度。"
    "I will continue updating the worldbuilding, characters, story, and demo progress of the Great Ming Realm, Huanglongfu, and Kaian Town there."

# game/script.rpy:5240
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_d54d5a5b:

    # "若想加入玩家交流群，可在任一平台私信，或加我微信时留言：江湖人士。"
    "To join the player community, send a direct message on any platform, or add me on WeChat with the note: jianghu traveler."

# game/script.rpy:5242
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_dac204b2:

    # "今日只是开庵镇一隅，明日便可能牵动整座凰龙府。"
    "Today is only one corner of Kaian Town; tomorrow may set all of Huanglongfu in motion."

# game/script.rpy:5244
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_d970562d:

    # "江湖尚小，仍需诸位添柴。"
    "The jianghu is still small and needs everyone to add fuel to its fire."

# game/script.rpy:5246
translate english s021_fengleiguan_seal_order_ba0cb2c7:

    # "有缘同路，凰龙府再会。"
    "If our paths are fated to meet, we will meet again in Huanglongfu."

